window.FWN_BLACK_TECH_INTERNET_CAFE_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_BLACK_TECH_INTERNET_CAFE_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":701,"title":"Chapter 701 - Nothing Seemed Wrong?!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“You poisoned it!” Elder Sewell was so furious. I was healing you diligently and almost worked myself to death, but you are saying that I poisoned the milk?","You kept asking for milk from all directions; how can I give milk to all of you at once?!","“What do we do now...?” The souls looked sulky in the graveyard.","“What can we do... run back and recover our corpses!”","– Ten minutes later –","“Milk! More milk!”","“How come I can’t feel the healing effects at all!”","“Where’s the milk?! Are you healing us?!”","“...”","The five souls gathered in the graveyard again.","“... What do we do now?” The rogue felt like crying.","“This healing... was almost non-existent!” the dwarf warrior complained.","“I...” the rogue asked tentatively, “My game time is almost up. Should we stop now and try again next time?”","The moment he said it, he quitted from the group and got offline in one breath!","“...”","Only four souls were left standing in the graveyard.","“It suddenly occurred to me...” Adolf said immediately, “I still have things to do. I will get offline now. Let’s continue next time!”","[Grand Mage Adolf left the party.]","“This...” Dwarf Elder Sauk felt like today obviously wasn’t his lucky day. “It seems that we can’t do it now. Let’s continue next time...”","[Sauk Stonehammer left the party.]","[Dwarf Raff left the party.]","Elder Sewell was at a loss for words.","She was frustrated with confusion. Is my milk really poisonous.","Different from the previous games, World of Warcraft had separate interfaces for chatting. The players could open the game interface and check the messages in different channels including the World Channel and local channels.","“Players needed for Scarlet Monastery. Anyone can come!” At this moment, Elder Sewell saw someone post this message in the channel for making parties.","“!!??” Elder Sewell froze. “Anyone can come?!”","...","The quest of Mythology of Titans in World of Warcraft.","Before the disaster struck Lordaeron, there was a place in Tirisfal Glades where many books were stored – the library of the old monastery. It was said that the Mythology of Titans was in this library.","This old monastery was Scarlet Monastery.","Besides the Mythology of Titans, there were many other books in the monastery including Beginnings of the Undead Threat. These books would be of great help for Mr. Fang to complete the information about the background of World of Warcraft in the official novel and the official website.","“No one answered my party invitation from my Horde character... I’ll try the Alliance character...” Mr. Fang posted the invitation again, “Scarlet Monastery! Anyone can come!”","[Grand Mage Adolf requests to join the party.]","[Sauk Stonehammer requests to join the party.]","[Dwarf Raff requests to join the party.]","[Sewell requests to join the party.]","The group was full instantly.","Dumbfounded, Mr. Fang looked at the screen and thought, There are so many people from the Alliance?","He was even more astonished that there was a nanny and a tank in the team!","He didn’t even have to look for a nanny now!","“My goodness...”","“This guy has many ultimate blue rare items!”","“Luxury items...”","The moment he entered the party, he heard these people gasping and talking to themselves.","Then...","“Elder Sewell?!” Adolf’s face turned stiff.","“Adolf, didn’t you say that you had things to do?” Elder Sewell frowned, finding that things were not as simple as they seemed.","Adolf didn’t know what to say.","[Leader...] In the private chat channel, Mr. Fang suddenly received a message, [Can we... change the nanny?]","“Change the nanny? Why?” Mr. Fang was puzzled. “Druids can heal.”","“This milk is poisonous!”","“...”","Elder Sewell was sizing up the night elf with the ID of [Midnight Pig Butcher 2].","How come he looks quite familiar...","[How come they all say that your milk is poisonous?] Elder Sewell suddenly received this private message.","[What?!] Elder Sewell was furious. [Who are they talking about?! Whose milk is poisonous?]","[Did you forget to switch to restoration talent specialization? Which spells did you use to heal?]","“Ah?” Elder Sewell thought for a second. [Rejuvenation. What are restoration talents?]","“You use Rejuvenation when the HP is not too low. Otherwise, use Healing Touch. Switch to the second page of the talent specializations (The system version had dual talent specializations) and find Restoration Talent, Mark of the Wild, Healing Touch, and...”","“Oh...” Elder Sewell followed Fang Qi’s instructions and clicked on the options in confusion. “What do these things mean? Why should I do this?”","“I don’t have time to explain them right now. You just have to follow my orders,” Mr. Fang said, “The newbie didn’t know how to use the healing talent specialization. The problem is solved now. Let’s enter.”","“Oh...”","“Really?” Adolf and others who had been killed several times by the ‘healing’ looked doubtful.","“Of course. Follow my orders, and you’ll pass. Come on and enter the instance.” With that said, Fang Qi entered the instance.","“We...?”","“Enter!” Elder Sauk said, “Judging from his items, I think he might be a master player!”","Soon, the others entered the instance.","“Main Tank, take position and block the way!”","“Nanny, cast healing spells!”","“Missed two. Mage, Frost Nova!”","“...”","This time, the situation was many times better than before! The members in the front line fought with ease, and all the mobs bypassing them were cleared.","“That was easy!”","“The healing is effective now!”","“Awesome!”","Looking at the corpses on the ground and their own people who were almost intact, they exclaimed in surprise.","Meanwhile, watching her teammates’ wounds healing at a visible speed, Elder Sewell was also thrilled. This experience was totally different from the previous one!","“This life energy... is so powerful!”","Now, I can heal! Elder Sewell thought happily. I will see who dares to say that my milk is poisonous!","It must be noted that these healing spells could be learned. Besides, the druid class seemed to be custom-made for elves since their ideology, code of conduct, and even spells fit those of the elves perfectly.","I’m surprised that they have such powerful healing spells! They are as powerful as Holy Light!","Right now, Elder Sewell’s mind was full of thoughts of mastering these spells and bringing them back to the Elf Clan.","“See? I was just unfamiliar with the spells!” Elder Sewell said proudly.","“... Huh, I see.” Adolf finally nodded in agreement.","“I didn’t know druids healed like this...?” Elder Sauk was still puzzled but acknowledged her skills.","The party soon came to the first boss, Houndmaster Loksey.","Mr. Fang said, “Let me explain how to fight this boss. It’s not difficult as long as we control the three dogs.”","Houndmaster Loksey was a small boss with ordinary power, but the three dogs were bothers.","The mage could turn one of the three dogs into a sheep and the druid could put one to sleep with the spell named Hibernate. Then, they could focus fire on the last one. It was an easy task.","Therefore, Fang Qi said, “Do you see the dogs? Mage, turn one to a sheep. Druid, sleep. And the rest of us focus fire and kill the last one.”","“Understand?” Mr. Fang asked.","“Sleep...?” Elder Sewell froze with some confusion. “I guess...”","“Go!” Mr. Fang dashed forward, and his flashing dagger hit the vital part of the boss with lightning speed.","Meanwhile, Polymorph: Sheep had turned a fierce hound into a harmless little sheep.","At this moment, Elder Sewell still didn’t move.","“Sleep!” Mr. Fang reminded her.","“Oh! Okay!” Having not encountered any danger along the way, Elder Sewell was much more confident.","He’s really a master player... with his casual instructions, we’ve improved so much!","Without hesitation, Elder Sewell lay down on the ground.","After waiting for a long while for the Hibernate spell which didn’t come, Mr. Fang looked back and saw this scene. “???”","He shouted in shock, “What are you doing?!”","“Sleeping.”","“Didn’t you tell me to sleep?”","Lying on the ground, Elder Sewell said in confusion as nothing seemed wrong to her."]},{"number":702,"title":"Chapter 702 - Arise, My Champion! Is It Too Late to Change My Faith to Holy Light?!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“What’s wrong?” The dwarf Raff looked at Elder Sewell in bafflement. “The operation looks good to me... does it need a special skill?”","Mr. Fang covered his face with his palms and said, “I meant putting that dog to sleep with the Hibernation Spell. Didn’t you guys learn some common terms before raiding an instance...”","“!!” Elder Sewell almost passed out in fury. “I was wondering about your strange command! I thought this mystical realm of the Blizzard Workshop had come up with something miraculous!”","“You could have asked me if you found it strange...”","“You just told me not to ask questions since you didn’t have time to explain...” Elder Sewell was frustrated.","Mr. Fang was at a loss for words.","“Forget it. Let’s do it again. Nanny, use the Hibernate spell to put one dog to sleep.”","“The spells in the real world have different names in the games.” Mr. Fang could only explain some basic terms. Usually, few people would explain these common terms to new players.","The players wouldn’t spend much effort to use or understand the formal names of the common skills or effects of different classes. Instead, they would give them vivid nicknames which had gradually become gaming terms.","These terms were vivid and easy to understand for old players, making directing a raid simple and efficient. But for new players who had just begun to understand all kinds of new information in the games, it was difficult to make the connection.","Right now, only a few big groups could take on an instance like Scarlet Monastery. “I’ll do a livestream and teach the beginners then.”","Since most players in the old shops had played games such as Diablo and could do raids by themselves after reading some guides, Mr. Fang put the livestream in the new shop.","“Ugh...?” Having just gotten offline, Dicas saw the big screen in the lounge area suddenly lighting up.","“Is the shop owner going to do a Spiritual Spell Visual Projection?” The mages accompanying her looked up at the big screen curiously.","Some orcs who had just entered the shop also looked over.","“He’s also doing Scarlet Monastery?!” Dicas froze.","As time went on, she had learned a lot while doing raids with old players and was no longer a newbie who knew nothing.","“Um... This name... Isn’t he the player who shouted outside the Scarlet Monastery that anyone could join his party?” one nearby player said.","“Anyone?” Many players froze.","After all, this was the most difficult instance so far in the game.","At this moment, Mr. Fang had begun the raid. As mentioned before, Houndmaster Loksey was indeed a small boss. With the assistance of Polymorph: Sheep and Hibernate spell, it was an easy raid since the members all had great strength and high-level combat skills in the real world.","The boss in the library was Arcanist Doan. Different from the original game, the boss in the system version could cast all the mage spells on that level, including Presence of Mind, Polymorph: Sheep, Blink, Frost Nova, and Arcane Explosion.","Of course, the only good news was that as a mage, this boss didn’t have a tough physical body as other classes and didn’t have as much HP.","“We can’t use a tank to take all the damage of this boss all the time,” Mr. Fang explained, “It can blink, which makes it impossible for warriors to hold it off. But it has lower resistance to some controls when it blinks. If we have the right conditions, we can attack it in the instant that it makes a move...","“For example, the rogue can use Gouge.”","The moment he said it, a light flashed as the boss cast Blink, but Fang Qi’s dagger heavily struck out almost at the same time.","The boss blinked and flew out. But when it flew before the druid, it fell into a controlled state!","“My goodness!”","“We can actually do this?!”","Not only the audience, but the members of the party froze at the scene as well.","“What are you waiting for? Quickly dish out damage!”","“If the tank makes a mistake, the players in the backline must fend themselves,” Mr. Fang added, “For example, the mage can blink out to survive, and the druid can change into a bear. You must react very quickly.”","Obviously, the thick-skinned bear was hard to be instantly killed, which meant that the team could still fight it out if all teammates came up in time and helped.","“I got it...” Understanding dawned on many players.","...","Led by Mr. Fang, the party made it narrowly.","“They... are actually doing the last zone now?!”","“How come it feels like... this instance isn’t too difficult...”","At this time, Mr. Fang led the four members to the last zone of the whole instance. It was a grand and magnificent cathedral, the end of this instance.","“As mentioned before, we must clear the mobs before we meet the boss. Otherwise, the boss would summon them over while we fight. Fighting from both ends will only lead to a team wipe-out.”","“Is that so...”","“So many Scarlet Crusaders...”","The battle was fierce and dangerous, but Fang Qi still gradually led his party to the boss.","The paladin dressed in blood-red armor was Mograine, the commander and leader of Scarlet Crusaders.","Some rumors said that he had taken the power and controlled the Scarlet Crusaders by killing his father.","There were also other rumors saying that Mograine killed his father since the latter didn’t approve of his love toward someone.","The old man demanded his son to strictly abide by the ancient creeds for the paladins and treat ladies with respect and good manners. Paladins had the duty to protect ladies but didn’t have the right to possess them because emotions and lust would weaken the paladins’ will to fight.","The paladins followed very strict creeds and ancient virtues of humility, honor, valor, sacrifice, mercy, faith, honesty, and justice.","This was why not many players changed to these classes such as paladin and priest despite the classes’ abilities with Holy Light and resurrection.","Not all players could abide by these creeds, nor could Mograine. Of course, the real reason was probably the temptation from demons.","Finally, he became a traitor detested by everyone.","“This boss is easy too,” Mr. Fang continued explaining.","“...”","“In your eyes, every boss is easy! Who isn’t?” Dicas’s face turned dark.","Obviously, the new players had some issues in cooperation. Under Mr. Fang’s command, it took them a long time to make Mograine fall down.","“They passed just like that!?”","Many players started breathing heavily.","It doesn’t seem to be very difficult...","However, at this moment, everyone saw a figure dashed out from the back of the cathedral.","It was a female priest dressed in a blood-colored priest robe.","“Arise! My champion!”","“At your side, milady!” Bathed in golden holy light, the last boss resurrected under everyone’s gaze.","“What’s happening?!” The audience froze.","The boss that the players had worked hard to kill just resurrected with full HP?!","In the quest of Tome of Divinity and in the recovery of corpses in the instances, the resurrection spells could only be cast in an absolutely quiet environment, which was a very strict requirement.","But at this moment, they saw resurrection being properly used in a battlefield!","Just imagine the scenario: a powerful enemy finally fell at your feet after a hard fight. While you were in your most fatigued and relaxed state, you suddenly heard someone yell, “Arise, my champion”, and then the powerful enemy you had just killed stood up intact, bathing in holy light. What would you feel then?!","Isn’t this just a livestream teaching session for beginners?!"]},{"number":703,"title":"Chapter 703 - The Avengers, and A New Round of Mental Strength Cultivation","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“It’s said that... people vanished from a few more towns in the Orc Kingdom lately...?”","Not only the orcs players in the shop, but Mercenary Crete who had just entered the shop had heard about the news.","“It seems like the border area of our homeland isn’t peaceful lately...” Mr. Dirk was also talking about it with his audience.","“Have they found out what had happened?”","“It seems like not yet.”","...","In the endless void, a huge shadow seemed to be spreading in silence.","Hovering in the dark void, it emitted death and horror that could swallow everything.","As if summoned by something, it got closer and closer to the huge continent.","Sitting in the high and dark void, its huge eye looked down and monitored everything that was happening in the world.","...","“Ms. Dicas, do you think there really are gods in the world?”","“What are you talking about? Those miracles and catastrophes were not fake, and the ruins of those catastrophes can still be seen in some nations.”","“You’re right.”","On the screen, Mr. Fang’s livestream teaching session for beginners was approaching the end.","“Now, you’re facing two bosses. But still, you must attack and kill these mobs with well-organized moves. You need to kill the priest first before handling the paladin,” Mr. Fang said.","High Inquisitor Sally Whitemane was a powerful priestess and accompanied Commander Mograine as his lover. She had a more powerful resurrection spell than the one that players had.","The players were not strangers to resurrection since they had seen it in Diablo 2. The lords of Hell in Diablo had been killed many times, but their souls still remained in the world.","Likewise, the resurrection spells of World of Warcraft could pull back the players’ souls, repair their bodies, and bring them back to life.","It was well known that the conditions required for the resurrection spell that the players had learned were very strict. Even though the paladins and priests in the game were extremely devoted and faithful by default, they could only cast the spell in an extremely quiet environment without any disturbance.","If the players were attacked during the casting process, the spell would be interrupted.","However, Whitemane only needed to put the players to sleep for a little while and then quickly cast the resurrection spell.","“We must kill this priestess first,” Mr. Fang said, “Otherwise, you’ll face a paladin who can’t be killed.”","Of course, it wasn’t easy to kill the priestess who stood behind and was protected by a powerful and fierce paladin.","If the enemies had a mage with them, they could form a team of warrior, mage, and priestess to battle the players since paladins could count as half a warrior.","Their current partnership of warrior and priestess was still a combination very hard to defeat.","“So, we need a nimble class which can bypass the paladin. Meanwhile, our tank must hold off the enemies on the frontline.”","In fact, this was more like a PVP instead of PVE.","It was how it felt like when five low-level, poorly-equipped players fought with two high-level, well-equipped players with special abilities.","It must be noted that in the system version of World of Warcraft, Mograine would flee with Whitemane’s corpse after they were defeated. Only when someone took back the fallen Ashbringer from Mograine’s father, Old Mograine, who had been resurrected as one of the powerful Four Horsemen under the Lich King, could Mograine be finally killed.","Of course, that wouldn’t happen for a long time.","With the boss fleeing, the players looted in a different way compared to the original version. After Fang Qi and his party defeated their enemies, a loot chest appeared in the center of the cathedral. [Loot gathered after searching the cathedral.]","“Aegis of the Scarlet Commander?”","“The attributes are so good...”","“With such a shield, the tank will be unrivaled!”","The equipment triggered waves of exclamations. Of course, Mr. Fang backed out of that conversation since his purpose was teaching the new players some basic knowledge and terms in the game.","...","Female Knight Helen of the Golden Griffin Knight Legion came to the shop very late today; she didn’t play the game through the night yesterday, but her face looked haggard.","Lately, she always dreamed of some strange and weird things, which gave her an inexplicable feeling.","Fear could erode and eat away one’s will like a horrifying plague.","At this moment, an invisible plague seemed to be spreading in the crowds silently.","– In the distant Silver Moon Forest of the Elf Clan –","Several elders of the Elf Clan gathered on the bank of the mirror-like lake.","“Do you sense... the force of horror in the darkness...?” The silver-haired and silver-bearded old elf murmured, “It’s getting stronger each day. Fear... can erode people’s will, and darkness will swallow their remaining consciousness... Eventually, they will become the puppets of fear...”","“We must find the followers of those shadows as soon as possible,” another elder said, “We can’t let it continue! Otherwise, we’ll completely lose all power to resist them when they arrive!”","...","“Ahh-!” In the new shop, a shrill scream sounded. Helen seemed to have bumped into someone and then jumped away like a startled rabbit.","“What’s wrong with you? You scared me...” Mr. Fang looked at her disapprovingly.","“No... nothing.” Her voice was as quiet as the buzzing of a mosquito’s wings. “I’ll go and get online.”","“Am I so scary...” He did nothing but send this girl flying with a sneeze before.","At this moment, Fang Qi seemed to feel a tiny but extremely creepy force invading his brain.","Mr. Fang shivered, but this force seemed to have done no harm to him and soon disappeared.","At this moment, Fang Qi suddenly received a new prompt.","[With the number of players in the new shop reaching 5,000, a special movie will be activated in the new shop.]","[You have obtained the right to release the special movie, The Avengers, in the new shop, and you can also choose to release it in the old shops at the same time.]","[New Task: A New Round of Mental Strength Cultivation","Task Objective: As a shop owner, you must have a tougher mind than the customers. Please enter the game cultivation room for special training until the task is finished.","Task Reward: Outlast: Virtual Reality Remake","Task Description: After training in this game, our mental fortitude will be even more powerful]","Although the system had once released Silent Hill which could also toughen one’s mental strength, the bigger feature of that game was to remove inner demons and patch up the holes in people’s minds.","Obviously, this game was a bit different.","“Outlast...?” Mr. Fang glanced at the System Interface, and his expression turned dark. “Your aim is not to strengthen my mind but to shatter it, right?”","Words appeared on the System Interface, [A product of the System.]"]},{"number":704,"title":"Chapter 704 - The new crisis of the players","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“St. Dulan.” In the group of holy palaces that were as magnificent as the palaces of gods in the Radiance Light Godly Nation, the Gods’ Peak sitting in the highest position was rumored to be a palace where true gods lived.","Perhaps no one had ever seen the true gods, but the citizens of Radiant Light Godly Nation had always believed in them.","A woman dressed in a holy and pure-white long robe seemed to have walked out of a painting and was floating in the endless void. Her skin was as smooth as crystal and her facial features were exquisite and gorgeous.","Her body emitted a layer of faint crystal white lights, and her feet that were as beautiful as jade seemed to leave radiant light prints on the ground with each step she took.","“The centennial Gods’ Banquet will be held in midsummer of next year,” the voice said coldly.","“The time for the Gods’ Banquet comes again...” St. Dulan said emotionally, “I remember that Princess Your Highness has solely taken the Holy Seat for several banquets consecutively. It’s an honor that has never been heard before.”","The woman shook her head coldly and said, “I’ve been absent from it for a long time now.”","“Now, you must be sitting on the Judgement Seat...?” St. Dulan asked cautiously.","It was probably one of the positions closest to the gods in the whole continent.","The Gods’ Banquet was a gala held in the Nora Continent, and it only invited followers of gods.","In the banquet, only godly and immortal spells could be used, which was said to be the agreement among the gods in ancient times.","It was said that the winners of the gala would not only get the chance to show the people in the world their devotion to their gods; they would also win the favors from the gods they believed in. They could even enjoy the banquet blessed by the gods. It was a rare opportunity for all the cultivators who studied godly and immortal spells.","The participants could be followers of any god.","Of course, this banquet was usually used to test the devotion of the followers in the younger generation.","St. Dulan looked very humble as if the projected image of this woman had a higher position than him.","“Farewell, Princess Your Highness.” He didn’t look up until the white projected image gradually disappeared.","“Mr. Dulan.” At this moment, a large, middle-aged man with a wide forehead and wide cheeks walked to stand before St. Dulan respectfully.","Dulan nodded and said, “The Gods’ Banquet will begin soon. I need to select some elite young people from the Godly Palace.”","“Yes.” The middle-aged man said, “My lord, about kicking out the outlanders...”","St. Dulan gave him a long look and said, “Sir Peable, you seem to have some ideas? Tell me your thoughts.”","“To kick them out, we must find their weaknesses. Just as the East Continent people say, know your enemy as well as you know yourself...” Peable was Dulan’s most trusted and most competent subordinate, and it was rumored that he would become Dulan’s successor in the near future.","“Go on.” St. Dulan nodded his encouragement.","“We have found some information about this shop and its customers.” He handed the documents to St. Dulan.","“The Golden Griffin Knight Legion in Canglan City of the Morning Light Empire was absent from work for one day due to them playing World of Warcraft through the night...?”","“The Morning Light Land Knight Legion of the Orc Kingdom neglected a kingdom leader while they talked about World of Warcraft with magic letters when they were on duty...”","“Alchemy Master Hebrew secretly read the guides of professional skills in World of Warcraft while he was practicing alchemy in the Alchemist Union of Christen Kingdom, causing very negative consequences...? His behavior infuriated the high-level officials of the union...?”","He continued reading, “Aslan Royal Magic Workshop already forbids its mages and alchemists from talking about anything related to World of Warcraft during work. However, these people watched the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection named Mr. Fang’s Livestream Teaching Session for Beginners? And they severely delayed the creation process of some very important alchemy items.”","“Elder Sewell of the Elf Clan seems to have neglected her duties as an elder for a long time because of the mystical realm named World of Warcraft?”","“...”","“Yes, My Lord!” Peable said loudly, “I think the so-called Origins Internet Club and the mystical realm named World of Warcraft have affected people’s normal life and work like poison. People even secretly watched the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection during work time right under the nose of their superiors. It’s horrible! Besides, its influence even extended to the aristocrats in the distant Orc Kingdom.”","“We can take use of it and ask the owners of the workshops, union presidents, kings, and leaders to ban everything about this mystical realm.","“Otherwise, the workshops will go bankrupt, and the kingdoms will decline and go corrupt sooner or later!","“Of course, I don’t think it’s proper for us to interfere, but with such solid evidence against the shop, we can ask the empires to issue new policies together and make it hard for the customers of the Origins Internet Club to continue their visits to the shop. Before long, no one will take such huge risks and enter the shop run by these damn people from the East Continent.”","“Of course, when they lose their jobs, I don’t think they can afford to enter that place,” Peable laughed while saying.","“Eh-hum...” St. Dulan nodded and said, “Do as you see fit. If you have questions, I’m always here for you.”","“Don’t worry, My Lord,” Peable sneered, “I’m not a clown like Luther.”","...","“Ah... Achoo!” Mr. Fang exited from the game and did a big stretch before sneezing for no reason.","“Lately, I have a feeling that some people are talking about me...” Mr. Fang rubbed his nose and thought for a moment. Then, he gave up this futile effort after being unable to come up with an explanation. “Maybe some pretty girls miss my handsome face even though I seldom go out...”","The System was at a loss for words, but it wanted to strongly detest what the ordinary-looking Mr. Fang had said. It seemed like he had no idea of what was going on.","Obviously, without any acute senses, the players in the shop didn’t realize that danger was getting close to them.","As time went on, many players had passed all the instances of Scarlet Monastery.","Even Commander Elven, who had probably joined a party due to some friendly deals, had luckily got the much-coveted Deadman’s Hand, one of the few purple epic items in World of Warcraft.","“I’ve graduated from Scarlet Monastery...” Lounging in his computer chair, Commander Elven looked idle.","“Commander...” At this moment, a paladin of the Golden Griffin Knight Legion got close to him and said, “Now that you’ve gotten such good equipment, should we go to Southshore and kill the despicable Horde people who keep ambushing our Alliance people who are doing quests?”","“Good idea!” Commander Elven’s eyes lit up."]},{"number":705,"title":"Chapter 705 - Unrivaled addon Hearthstone?!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","At this moment, Mr. Dirk sat with a group of orcs.","Clearly, some of them were new players who had just joined the game.","“Roar! Tremble for my recklessness! Cheer! Shout for your heroes! I entrust you with my back, my beloved friends. Our shield never falls, and our will never vanquishes. Remember the lost fighters for ever while we chug down the spring of victory...” An orc with a tiger head who had just finished class quests shouted out the class declaration.","Feeling harassed, a group of people glared at him at a loss for words.","“For the Horde! For the Horde!” An orc with a lion head sat before his computer and roared with his eyes glued on the official novel, Rise of the Horde, on the screen.","“If you howl again, I’ll kick you guys out!” Hearing the howls, Mr. Fang singled them out with a dark expression.","“Rise of the Horde is such a touching story...!” The lion-man rubbed his teary eyes apologetically, “I’ll be quiet next time!”","The moment Mr. Fang left, the group of orcs yelled, “Wuaaa-! Rise of the Horde is such a sad and grand story!”","They banged their fists on the desks!","With a dark expression, Mr. Fang turned his head instantly.","“Ugh...” The noises stopped immediately.","...","At this moment, the paladins had set out for Southshore.","“For light and justice!”","“May the Holy Light be with you!”","“Let’s see if our Alliance people are being threatened by those damn Horde people.”","“Protecting the weak is the duty of the paladins!” Commander Elven shouted.","...","Hillsbrad Foothills were located south of the Alterac Mountains and northwest of the Arathi Highlands. To its south was the ocean.","Southshore was the biggest settlement in Hillsbrad.","At this moment, the Smirk Face Emoji player had created another mage character and was doing quests at the moment.","“This...” It glanced at the list of quests. “It seems like it wants me to release a lich?”","“Southshore graveyard...” The mage player with the ID ‘Almighty Demon God’ followed the map and came to the position as instructed by the quest.","“This must be the place...”","In the Southshore, several guards stared at him from a distance with glints in their eyes.","– Ten seconds later –","“You’re dead; do you want to release your soul to the nearest graveyard?”","“What happened?!’ The Smirk Face Emoji player froze when it saw a few guards dashing out from somewhere.","“Again...”","– Ten minutes later –","“You’re dead; do you want to release your soul to the nearest graveyard?”","“!!?”","“You dare to mess with me!? Your days are numbered!” In the Half City Shop, the black cloud hovering in the air turned darker as it yelled in his livestream chat, “Anyone in here?”","Black Demon replied, [Yeah, what’s up?]","“I was blocked by some NPCs while I was doing a quest. Bad luck!”","“Where?!”","“I’ll come!”","“I’m coming!”","– Ten minutes later –","“Southshore is under attack!”","[Local Defense: Southshore is under attack!]","...","“Here come the Horde people!” Commander Elven’s eyes brightened. Then, the knights of the Golden Griffin Knight Legion set out valiantly.","In the Southshore graveyard, about four mages and warlocks were drawing away the guards of Southshore.","“Hahahaha! I will finish the quest soon. Thank you, guys!” The small mage who was about level 30 walked up happily, ready to hand in the quest.","Suddenly, he saw a golden flash.","“Hammer of Judgement!”","“Seal of Righteousness!”","“Seal of Command!”","“Sacrifice!”","“Exorcism!”","“May the Holy Light be with you!”","“Ahh-!” With a shrill scream, Almighty Demon God dropped to the ground instantly. Inside the Half City Shop, the Smirk Face Emoji slammed its fists on the desk furiously.","“How come you’re dead again?!” Other players looked over in bafflement.","They watched as more than ten paladins spread out valiantly in one line while riding horses.","“May the Holy Light be with you!”","“Die!”","“Accept the judgement of justice!”","“F*ck-!”","“Ahh! How come there are so many people!”","“Frost Nova!”","“Run! Run! Run!”","“How come they have horses?!” The Horde people were green with envy since horses were very valuable and expensive in this era.","For paladins, they would be given a small horse when they reached level 40.","“Hahahaha!” Commander Elven and the other golden griffin knights laughed wildly. “Stupid Horde people! I’ll see if you dare to sneak-attack Southshore again?!”","“We’re the Golden Griffin Knight Legion!”","“We’ll protect the peace of Southshore forever!”","Lying on the ground, Black Demon’s face turned stiff. “You just wait!”","“They dare to mess with our Black Demon Guild?!” Lying on the ground with a dark expression, Black Demon was furious.","“What’s he babbling about?” The golden griffin knights exchanged a look and didn’t know what was going on. After all, the players in the Alliance didn’t understand the language of the Horde.","“Today, I’ll smash your damn dog heads!” Black Demon yelled.","“Call as many as you can! For the Holy Light and justice!”","Suddenly, Commander Elven felt great pressure coming from behind him.","He looked back and saw hundreds of Horde players gathering outside of Southshore, looking like a black mountain and a black sea.","“How come there are so many people?!” The paladins of the Golden Griffin Knight Legion turned pale instantly.","“What now? You still want to block us?!”","Commander Elven didn’t understand their words but could roughly guess what they were saying at this moment.","“We didn’t know that you had so many people-!”","Hundreds of people instantly surrounded the golden griffin knights.","“Commander... what do we do?” A golden griffin knight swallowed saliva with difficulty as he watched the big crowd gather before him.","“You dare to block my quest!” A Smirk Face Emoji player’s expression was dark in fury. “Today, you can’t get away even if you have wings!”","“Retreat!” Commander Elven yelled.","Silently, the knights each took out a stone engraved with a rune.","Then, a streak of pale light rose around them.","“What are they doing?!” Black Demon yelled in surprise.","“You dare to cast hearthstones in front of us?! Interrupt them! Interrupt them all!”","Bang! Bang! Bang!","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The Smirk Face Emoji player led hundreds of players to launch wild attacks on the paladins.","The paladins didn’t move a muscle.","Bang! Bang! Bang!","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Their eyes almost popped out when they saw that the paladins were still intact while using the hearthstones!","Swoosh.","All the paladins vanished.","...","“Ahhhyaaa–!” The Smirk Face Emoji almost spewed blood as he saw that they fled using this method!","“I’m furious! Furious!”","How could they do this?!","Black Demon was also stupefied with rage. “Today, I’ll smash every Alliance player’s head!”","“Charge into Southshore and kill everyone for me!” He was about to go crazy."]},{"number":706,"title":"Chapter 706 - An Evil God’s Whispers","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The huge world that World of Warcraft presented to the players in the game contained abundant and complicated information, but its theme wasn’t hard to understand.","By now, many players had formed an initial understanding of the whole world and the series of events in it.","On the land of Durotar, the Horde led by Thrall built campsites here and continued to enlarge the troops. In the official novel, Rise of the Horde, they invited creatures such as the undead, orcs, taurens, and trolls to join them.","On the other side, the Alliance led by the human kingdom, Stormwind City, had begun to form an alliance with different races such as the elf race and dwarf race.","While the hidden conspiracies slowly spread on the land, the dangers left from ancient times still threatened the safety of the Alliance and the Horde.","However, after the retreat of the Burning Legion, it was clear that their biggest enemy was each other.","In Southshore which was heavily guarded by Alliance guards, all players received an ear-piercing prompt, [Southshore is under attack!]","“Southshore is under attack!”","“What’s wrong?!”","“What happened?!”","There were many Alliance players doing quests in Southshore, including Mercenary Crete and his mercenary group.","The mercenaries didn’t have stable game time everyday, but Mercenary Crete had already reached higher than level 30. He had quite a few eye-catching blue rare items looted from Scarlet Monastery. “It’s annoying that I didn’t encounter any Horde players in the wilderness. Yesterday, I made about 7 honorable kills.”","“Yesterday, I killed one Horde player who was over level 40.” The mage named Lily, Crete’s friend and one of the first customers of the new shop, said proudly, “These Horde people are all noobs!”","“Look! What’s that?!” A nearby rogue suddenly pointed at a spot outside Southshore.","A large group of Horde players swarmed into the town like tigers released from cages.","The group of players who were a little over level 30 but were still half-new to the game didn’t have time to react.","Charge!","Shadow Bolt!","Lightning Bolt!","Backstab!","“...”","They all dropped to the ground.","“What’s that?!”","“My goodness! So many Horde people...”","Without warning, the entirety of Southshore was swallowed by magic spells and sword and saber energies.","“Butcher! Butcher them all! Today, crush the heads of these damn Alliance people!” Soon, Southshore was littered with corpses of Alliance players, and many undead, tauren, and orc players danced on these corpses smugly.","“Hahahaha! I killed over a dozen!”","“I feel like my prestige rank is about to increase!” In the Half City Shop, a black cloud hovering in the air laughed wildly while wearing a virtual reality headset.","...","“We new players can’t do quests now.” The big white deer had been playing a new druid character who belonged to the Alliance, enjoying itself by turning into a cat or bear. However, the moment it entered the game today, it was struck to the ground by all kinds of magic spells. Now, it was lying on the ground with tears in its eyes. “We need masters to help us. There are so many Horde people!”","Then, she received the party invite from Elven.","She received a party invite from Big Sword Crete.","She received...","“I’ll summon my brothers from the Mercenary Union!”","“They dare to bully newbies of our Alliance. Shame on them!”","They pulled out the fraction channel on the game interface. [Brothers! The Horde butchered our Southshore and even our newbies! Can we tolerate this atrocity?! Brothers with hot blood enter the group! Let’s kick out these pieces of garbage!]","[Sell Myself to Play WOW requests to join the group.]","[Lich in Make-up requests to join the group.]","[...requests to join the group.]","Instantly, group requests flooded the screen.","In World of Warcraft, the players got all the information about the races and classes and even details of each faction. They could even earn gold coins with the professional skills in the game to pay for the cost of playing the game. They felt as if it was an alternative universe that they lived in.","Yes, they lived here, performing alchemy, opening shops, cooking food, and making machinery. They could find almost anything that they wanted to do in this world. There was more than just battling in this world.","This was why players had a strong sense of ownership and honor. For example, the paladins had sworn to protect the weak with their swords and shields, so they couldn’t sit back and watch at this moment.","Similarly, the druids had once made the promise to their beloved forests, “We’ll shatter all barriers with sharp teeth and claws while roaring. Maybe years later, I can return to this place and enjoy eternal peace while leaning on the Tree of Life.”","Now facing the invasion of their biggest enemy faction, the Horde, how could they back off?","Therefore, even the players from different guilds began to organize themselves indignantly.","They worked together all by themselves without needing orders from above.","They felt as if this was their duty and honor.","“Brothers of the Alliance, enter the group and counterattack the invasion of Southshore!” A hoarse roar resonated in the whole faction.","...","On this continent, humans were respectful toward the gods. It would be better described as fear, a fear for the great power of the unknown existence that ruled over all species.","The innate fear that the lower-level creatures had toward the higher-level existences had been engraved in their bones.","This fear couldn’t be changed overnight.","...","Different from the bustle in World of Warcraft, some spots in the shop were quite peaceful.","Not everyone was involved in the big fight. For example, Elder Sewell, a peace-loving elf, never read messages in the faction’s chat channel.","At this moment, she was searching for useful minerals in Duskwood.","Suddenly, she saw a message jumping out from that QQ in the bottom-right corner of her screen.","“Trailer for The Avengers? What’s this?!” Elder Sewell froze.,","Then, she casually clicked it open.","“Humans... were made to be ruled...” A blood-colored setting sun shined lights on the tall buildings that had a totally different architectural style, and the voice that sounded like that of an evil god whispered at her ears.","The movie recreated by the system made everything as real as it could be. It even made the voices in the movie sound so real, let alone the power level in it.","A horrifying force swept across the whole city, knocking down buildings and setting all the cars on fire.","“Ya?!” Elder Sewell almost jumped up from her seat.","“What’s this?!”","“Ugh? Elder... What are you watching?” The elves beside her looked over.","“It seems...” Elder Sewell calmed herself down. “It seems to be a story about an evil god’s invasion of Earth and the people’s resistance to the invasion...”","“Ha? An evil god?! Can humans resist gods?!” another elf said in surprise."]},{"number":707,"title":"Chapter 707 - It Was Too Scary for Elves; I Think This Should Be a Terrifying Disaster Movie","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Ugh... Elder, how did you know that there is this trailer for the new movie ‘The Avengers’?” Elf Girl Sala also looked over.","“You can go use this... QQ!” Elder Sewell said cheerfully, “When the trailer of the new movie came out, a prompt just popped up. It’s really useful!”","“There is something this useful?!” Elf Girl Sala blinked her big eyes. “Where did you find it? Show me!”","Mr. Fang had just walked past them, and he said to the System while putting his hands on his forehead “Awesome.”","Proud and lofty, the System didn’t reply.","...","“Ya! The shop has free stuff!” Elf Girl Sala was delighted. “I thought the shop owner charges money for everything! Now, I see that he’s a nice guy!”","Then, she activated QQ free of charge.","Sure enough, she received a recommendation, Trailer of ‘The Avengers.’","“Ugh?” Sala clicked on it immediately. They had heard about the movie ‘Resident Evil 2′ in the shop but hadn’t watched it.","“Ugh...? This city looks similar to the one shown in Resident Evil...” Sala recognized the similarity since it was a style different from any city on the continents she knew.","“What is Resident Evil?” Elder Sewell looked puzzled. “What’s that?”","“It is the first mystical realm in this shop,” Sala said, “I watched Ms. Helen play it before; it looked quite interesting.”","“I’ll watch the trailer of The Avengers first,” she continued, “I heard that it’s a type of mystical realm that... um... we can’t control, just like the images left by the ancient elves in the Elf Royal Palace.”","“Be careful!” Elf Elder Sewell warned, “Be careful of the voice of that evil god; and his words are full of temptation and degeneration.”","“I’m being careful... Elder,” Elf Girl Sala whispered.","Then, she watched the trailer with great caution as if even a tiny sound would alert an extremely horrifying existence.","In the city full of skyscrapers built with reinforced concrete and steel, seeming to be able to reach the sky, soldiers walked around with great caution as if they were watching out for a demon.","Different from the original movie, the system version recreated each detail to correspond to the characters’ backgrounds and abilities.","For example, the characters’ looks.","When the black-clothed figure who was carrying a scepter looked up, people saw his wicked face and abyss-like deep eyes. Even one glance at him would make people shiver with an inexplicable fear.","For another example, the viewers could feel the bone-deep despair of the humans who were fleeing from the catastrophe even from the screen.","“We get ready.” Sala watched as the people in the trailer finally blew the trumpet for the counterattack.","“There was an idea to bring together a group of remarkable people; when we needed them, they could fight the battles that we never could.”","“I think this movie will be great!” Pleasantly surprised, Sala grabbed Elder Sewell’s arm and said, “This must be a great legendary story full of sorrows and great deeds!”","“What are you watching?” Obviously, Sala’s loud voice alerted other elves near them.","“We’re watching the trailer of ‘The Avengers’!” Excited, Sala recommended it to the other elves. “In the movie, a horrifying evil god is trying to rule the humans.”","“You can’t imagine how scary that evil god is!” Elder Sewell said, “If you see him, you will freak out!”","“Evil god...? A god that is evil?” Rowling, a member of the Snow Pigeon Team, almost shivered when she heard it. “How... how can such a horrifying creature exist in the world?!”","They had seen the gods in the ‘East Continent’ when they played the Legend of the Sword and Fairy, but those gods were fair and abided by rules.","But now, there is an evil god?!","She jumped to one side like a startled rabbit and said, “I... I don’t want to watch it!”","“Ah...” Captain Lance lamented, “This must be a great story just like the one depicted in the epic legends... No... I even have a feeling that it’s greater than the epic legends since their enemy is a god!”","“What are you guys talking about?! What god?!” Hearing the ever-louder voices, the players who didn’t join the defense battle in Southshore looked over.","“The Avengers!” Captain Lance said in a loud voice, “You’ll know how horrifying that evil god is after you watch it!”","“Ahhh-!” Beside them, Rowling almost jumped up with fear. “Please don’t mention it again!”","She looked so frightened as if the evil god could raze the whole Elf Clan to the ground with one wave of his hand.","After all, there were such existences in this world.","They were especially afraid because...","“That evil god is so scary! He has a voice that can lure people to fall into an abyss. He has a chilly and creepy look... and demon-like horns...” Hearing Sala’s words, the elves who listened with perked-up ears screamed and almost shed tears of fear.","Is there really such a horrifying evil god?!","“I think this must be a horrifying catastrophe,” one elf commented, “I think we will watch how the humans on this ‘Earth’ flee from the catastrophe!”","“Can we really watch this movie?!” some elves exclaimed.","“Can these people defeat this evil god?!”","“I won’t watch it if they can’t do it!” The elves were truly freaked out!","...","When the players died in World of Warcraft, they had only two options. One was to resurrect in the camp with resurrection sickness and couldn’t do anything when the negative buff was there, and the other was to run to their corpses and revive there with little HP to be killed again by the players who were guarding the corpses.","While these elves talked about the trailer of ‘The Avengers’, the situation in the battleground of Southshore changed again.","The mercenary players in the new shop didn’t have masters with top-tier equipment, but they had the advantage of numbers.","In the whole shop, the biggest group was the mercenaries. Since they were playing the game on and off, some of them hadn’t reached level 30 yet, but they all rushed over from the nearby towns.","With almost 1,000 players gathering in Southshore, this place was crammed."]},{"number":708,"title":"Chapter 708 - Heaven Is on the Left, and the Warriors Turn to the Right","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","[TL Note: A popular saying in the Chinese WOW community. It emphasizes that warriors sacrifices themselves for the greater good.]","“Battle!”","“For the Horde!”","Bedlam broke out in Southshore.","Countless corpses and endless blood of the Alliance players and the Horde players formed a wave of red and black shadows in this small border town under the light of the setting sun.","“Wayaaa... Don’t chase me! Look at the dying paladin! Why don’t you chase him?!” In the Yuanyang City Shop, a big white deer sitting in its computer chair cried desperately while controlling its little druid character to flee wildly on the screen.","“For the Alliance Hahaha! This Horde player was killed by the guard! Hahahaha! I’ll die from laughing!” it suddenly laughed heartily.","“Little Bell!” A clear voice came from behind. “My leave for experience is granted! Do you want to go to the new shop with me and have fun?”","“Yes! Yes! Yes!” Bright glints flashed in the pair of black-crystal-like deer eyes. “I want to see the cute elves! I wonder if the orcs are as dull as the taurens?”","It immediately put down the virtual reality headset.","On the battlefield, the Alliance and the Horde players were still fighting fiercely.","“Hahaha... I feel like I will soon be promoted! My prestige rank will level up!”","“Me too!”","“Frostbolt!”","“Presence of Mind!”","“Bladestorm!”","On the screens, humans, dwarves, orcs, and elves fought fiercely with each other in a state of great chaos.","At this moment, Mr. Fang was leveling up with some of the members of his Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild. Of course, despite its overbearing name, this guild had a peace-loving principle and mainly engaged in leisure activities, and the idle members chatted each day in the guild in a friendly and harmonious atmosphere.","[Boss!]","Mr. Fang was surprised to see this message from Jiang Xiaoyue.","[You promised to take me to see the elves!😠]","[Oh... Did I?] Mr. Fang was having a practice battle in Orgrimmar and had just obliterated an orc warrior. He thought for a second and replied, [Oh, I seemed to have said something like that...]","[What do you mean by seem like it!?] Jiang Xiaoyue was so angry that she wanted to bite him. [Did you forget?!]","Mr. Fang’s face stiffened since he had put all his time in the game in the past few days and indeed forgotten it.","[Ah... This... absolutely not!] Mr. Fang looked as sincere as he could. [I’ve been busy with work lately and didn’t have time! That’s all!]","[Then, when do you have time?! Humph!]","[I have time now!]","[Okay! I’ll forgive you this time! Today, I want to go and see elves with Little Bell!]","[No problem!] After all, Mr. Fang had the duty to promote harmony among the players from different shops. [Are you in the shop? I’ll come over now.]","...","Mr. Fang went upstairs. On the way to the staff dorms, there was a giant hollow golden gate that was engraved with myterious patterns.","He knocked on the gate.","“Ugh? No response?”","Meanwhile, in the Half City Shop.","A black cloud hovered before a computer close to the counter. In the Horde battle command channel in Half City Shop, a player with the ID ‘Almighty Demon God’ was standing before the microphone stand. “Clear them all! Clear all the Alliance players in this area! Follow me! Do you see them over there? Are the Alliance people still standing there like morons? Wipe them out! Wipe them out for me!”","Its voice was passionate while messages popped up in QQ like crazy.","It switched out of the game and replied, [Who is it? Don’t bother me! I’m commanding the battle!]","Seeing this, Mr. Fang directly kicked the gate.","At this moment, the orcs heard a soul-wrenching howl in the Horde’s battle command channel.","“Wipe them out for me! Wipe... Ao! Aoooo!”","Almighty Demon God suddenly said, “I... I have some urgent business...!”","“Ao! Ahh!”","It got offline immediately as if its butt was on fire.","Black Demon said, “F*ck! How can we go on without the commander!”","“Let’s stop it here! Stop!”","“Let’s go! Let’s get out of here!”","“Why don’t you command it? Old Black?” some cultivators asked.","“Can’t do it. I’ve got to get offline in less than one hour.”","...","“What’s happening?” At this moment in the new Canglan City Shop, an orc with a lion head looked around in puzzlement.","After the guild members left, the number of Horde players dropped sharply, leaving only a large group of independent players who moved like headless flies now that they didn’t have many people to follow.","Meanwhile, about 2,000 Alliance players swarmed toward them like the black waves of an ocean.","“How come they are all gone?! Where are they?!” The orcs who had just resurrected watched as large groups of Alliance players swarmed up while the Horde players scrambled to flee.","“Go! Let’s kill some more!”","Charge!","Bladestorm!","In less than ten seconds, they all fell to the ground.","Like black waves, the Alliance players swarmed into Tarren Mill in the north.","A few new players who were about level 20 had just arrived and only got a glimpse of this Horde camp when the waves almost instantly engulfed them.","Seeing the cruelly trampled Tarren Mill, the orcs’ eyes turned red.","Coming back after resurrection, the Horde players saw more than 1,000 Alliance players swarming over like groups of locusts.","They also saw the corpses of the new Horde players on the ground.","A few orcs directly raised their long sabers and axes before charging over.","“For the... Horde!”","Then, they were engulfed instantly.","At this time, in World of Warcraft, each death came with high equipment repair costs. However, these orcs spared no thoughts to it and came back again.","Soon, several orcs appeared on the horizon, and they fell again.","For some people, this was only a virtual world, and they didn’t take things happening in here seriously after seeing many ups and downs.","But for some other people, the world meant much more to them.","It could be said that they were naïve and reckless, but they had put their feelings into this world and formed a sense of honor for this place.","Again, the Horde players charged into the Horde camp which had become empty after the slaughter.","“How come these people aren’t escaping?”","“Are they stupid?”","“F*ck! I killed this orc instantly with one saber strike!”","“Their equipment should all be damaged...”","“I guess they can’t afford to repair the equipment. Maybe they won’t return?” Some Alliance players murmured to themselves.","The orcs fell again and again. Each time they fell, they got up again and charged. It felt as if they knew that this was meaningless like a mantis trying to stop a car, they wanted to contribute their efforts.","“Our Horde can’t defeat them!” an orc lamented and howled.","“Again... charge again!”","Upon entering the class, these orc warriors took the oath.","Heaven is on the left, and the warriors turn to the right. These orc warriors felt as if they were empowered by a fearless strength.","They charged! And they fell again.","In World of Warcraft, the detestable enemies sometimes had admirable qualities as well, regardless if they were naivety or recklessness.","One Alliance warrior bowed to the orcs since he understood their feelings as a warrior.","The warriors had no regard for their lives while they charged into the battle.","“Let’s go.” Many Alliance players started to cast their hearthstones."]},{"number":709,"title":"Chapter 709 - Onlookers of the big white deer","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Soon, the next morning came.","Jiang Xiaoyue set off quite early with Little Bell.","As they did everyday, the elves came to the shop in the early morning, eager to find out more about ‘The Avengers.’ On the way, they talked about the events that took place in World of Warcraft yesterday.","When they reached the door, they quickly moved back immediately. “Is it the right place?”","They saw a loli with exquisite facial features sitting at the counter with a big white deer?!","Where’s the shop owner?!","“Sir, some people are sneaking glances at us by the door. Are they trying to steal something?” The sharp-eyed Jiang Xiaoyue pointed at the door and yelled.","“Ah?” Mr. Fang stood up and saw a large group of elves walking in.","“Ya! They... they are elves?!” Jiang Xiaoyue exclaimed, and her big round eyes widened. “How come there are so many?!”","“Ya! What do I see?!” The big white deer rubbed its eyes with its front hooves incredulously. “I see many elves too! Their ears are pointy!”","“Ugh... I seem to see a talking deer...” Elf Girl Sala suspected that her eyes were playing tricks on her. “This deer can talk?!”","“Of course! Of course!” Little Bell yelled excitedly.","“Eh...” The elves’ eyes brightened. “Sir, is this an orc of the Deer Clan? I’ve never seen a white one before.”","“Orcs are green-skinned, right? There’re no white orcs.” They watched as the deer walked from behind the counter.","“Yaa-!” Instantly, the elves shrieked. “It’s indeed a deer!”","“Sir, where did you capture such a deer! I want one too...”","“Nonsense! This must be a holy beast! Only holy beasts can talk!”","The elves surrounded the deer, looking at it up and down and poking it frequently.","“Ahahahaha! What are you doing! It’s itchy! It’s itchy!” The deer almost fell to the ground as if it was having a stroke.","“My goodness!” A thought occurred to Sala. “Is it a demon from the legends?!”","“What do you mean from the legends?” Little Bell brushed the dust off its body and asked with its baby voice.","“I’m from the Demon Clan!” Little Bell introduced itself, “This is our princess, Xiaoyue Her Highness!”","“Sir, are they elves?” Jiang Xiaoyue asked in a low voice.","“Princess Your Highness...” The elves obviously hadn’t seen real demons before. “Do you mean this little girl is also a...?”","“Do you have Liu Mengli in your world?!” The elves widened their eyes as if they were trying to see if this little girl would change into another form soon.” Do you live in the demon realm?”","“Oh! I’m not from the Tapir Clan!” Jiang Xiaoyue explained, “The demon realm is an imaginary world in the Legend of Sword and Fairy.”","With great curiosity, she looked at the elves in amazement. “How come you’re all white-skinned? Are there dark elves among you?”","“We don’t have dark elves! Don’t be misled by the owner’s game in the shop!” Sala said angrily with her hands on her hips.","We don’t have that many kinds among us!","“Ugh-!” At this moment, Helen, Commander Elven, and other golden griffin knights walked into the shop.","They exclaimed in surprise, “Ms. Sala, did this deer just talk?! Did I see it wrong?”","“Hello, guys!” Little Bell greeted them friendly.","“Ahhh-!”","“Are my eyes playing tricks on me?!”","“May the Holy Light be with me! This isn’t real!”","“How come the deer can talk?!”","At this moment, an orc with a head that looked like that of a Shiba Inu walked into the shop. He was wearing a red scarf, looking dominant.","“Today, I’ll continue the broadcast of World of War...” With one foot over the threshold, he suddenly froze on the spot.","“Look... is that deer talking?!”","The audience watching Mr. Dirk’s Spiritual Spell Visual Projection quickly wrote down comments on the magic letter.","[Is this a mutated member of the Deer Clan?!]","[I’ve never seen a white deer-headed person before... maybe our eyes are playing tricks on us?]","[I feel like it’s a real deer...]","“My goodness!” Mr. Dirk joined them. “What’s going on?!”","“Eh? Are there our own kinds on this continent?” Little Bell stared at the dog-head man curiously.","“This is an orc!” Elves hurried to explain, “This cute little white deer is from the Demon Clan! Liu Mengli’s clan in the Legend of Sword and Fairy.”","Of course, they were still amazed while doing the introduction, thinking, Damn... how come there are really such creatures in the world?!","“Unbelievable!” Sala exclaimed.","Mr. Fang patted his forehead and said earnestly, “I think you guys are unbelievable too.”","“How come we are unbelievable!” Elder Sewell glared at Mr. Fang.","You are slighting us elves!","We are all doing good with ourselves. How can you say that we’re unbelievable?! Is there any place in the world that doesn’t have elves?!","While they were arguing, some assassins came into the shop.","“Why are you all standing here?”","“Ms. Elina, quickly come and look!” Sala beckoned at her excitedly, “The Demon Clan does exist in the world!”","Soon, a big group of people surrounded the deer in the new shop; they kept staring at it and forgot about getting online.","While Jiang Xiaoyue and the deer went over to make instant noodles, the elves and orcs followed them and watched.","“Can your Princess Xiaoyue turn into a tapir?”","“I already told you that I’m not in the same clan as Mengli!”","“Aren’t you all demons?”","“...”","When Jiang Xiaoyue and the deer finished their instant noodles and began drinking milk tea, the elves and orcs were still staring at them.","“Do you think... the deer was transformed from a druid?”","“Druids don’t have the spell to change into a deer!” Elder Sewell said.","“Then, we can’t change into deer and play with it then?”","“Oh!” Elf Girl Sala finally found a new topic. “Have you watched the trailer for ‘The Avengers’? The pop-up on QQ!”","“Do you want to watch it together with us when it’s released?” Rowling, another female elf of the Snow Pigeon Team, said, “That evil god is so scary. I’ll freak out if I watch it by myself!”","“This must be a terrifying movie!” Sala agreed.","“The trailer said that we can watch the movie tomorrow, right?” Sala said warmly, “Watch it with us, and you won’t be frightened!”","Jiang Xiaoyue was still studying this group of elves and orcs, trying to see if the orcs had just put on headgears that looked like dog heads and if the elves had glued those pointy ears to their heads.","She snapped back after watching them for a while. “The shop owner has a tour bus; should we watch it together tomorrow?”","Sitting on the couch beside her, the big white deer was slurping down instant noodles."]},{"number":710,"title":"Chapter 710 - A Group Tour to the Lake?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The curious and friendly elves found that this race was miraculous since they could change their formations.","It seemed like both parties wished they could capture each other to do some careful research to understand more about the miraculous races and clans.","Finally, the elves said, “Do you want to group with us and play World of Warcraft? Are you in the Alliance or the Horde?”","“Are you a part of the Horde?!” A few orcs joined in the conversation eagerly. “We have the fiercest orc warriors! Roar!”","“We have Horde characters!” After all, many demons were playing as races such as the tauren and trolls on the side of the Horde, thinking that these characters had more demon-like features. Therefore, Jiang Xiaoyue had also set up a Horde account.","Lately, she was still playing as a night elf on her small account.","It was because she had chosen Tauren as her main account.","If she played as a member of the undead race, it would be a little bit better. In the system version, if the players had natural good looks, they only needed to make minor adjustments and look as if they had Queen Sylvanas’ skin.","Therefore, the elves didn’t feel uncomfortable choosing the undead race.","However, the taurens... looked a bit too coarse.","“You are Horde players...?” The elves playing as members of the Alliance with Elder Sewell looked disappointed.","“We have both! We have both!” Jiang Xiaoyue said, “Some of my friends chose the Alliance, so we created characters on both sides.”","“Can we do that?!”","“We can play together then?”","Obviously, many of the new players didn’t know about ‘alt accounts’.","“Have you been to the beautiful and tranquil Lakeshire?” Obviously, the elves were fans of natural scenery and preferred viewing beautiful environment to doing instances and leveling up. “You must visit the night elves’ Ashenvale. The view is breathtaking, especially in the evening when the moonlight shines on the clear river!”","“Yes. There are also trees that can move freely on their own!” another elf introduced, “Some of them can even talk!”","“Ugh?” Jiang Xiaoyue asked in surprise, “Don’t you have such ancient trees in your own clan?”","“We’re not night elves...”","“Um... You aren’t...?”","“Of course not! Look at our skin! It’s not as dark as that of the night elves!”","“Okay.” The group chatted animatedly and introduced themselves. When they got online, a large group of people stood behind Xiaoyue and Little Bell.","The players who came late such as Dicas and other high-level mages of the Royal Magic Union were puzzled when they entered the shop.","“Why are you guys all standing here...” Then, a scream came, “Oh?! How come there is a deer here playing games!”","Then the elves, orcs, and assassins enjoyed their astonishment and told them that the deer came from the ‘Demon Clan’ of the ‘East Continent’.","“I feel like I’m dreaming...”","“Yeah. I always thought that this race was imaginary...”","Even dwarves kept glancing this way while they played games.","They had never seen people from the ‘Demon Clan’ before!","...","“Sir! Why don’t you take Xiaoyue and Little Bell for a tour in the city?”","“Right! I think you can take them to see the Red Lake and the Maple Forest by the lake. It’s autumn, the most beautiful time to see these places!”","“You can also stand on the top of Canglan Castle and see the whole Canglan City in one glance!” Elf Girl Sala and the knights tossed out suggestions eagerly.","“Ya! Boss...” Jiang Xiaoyue was a bit shy at their enthusiasm. “They are so passionate...”","“Boss! Can we... go out and have fun?” Obviously, Jiang Xiaoyue was more reserved here than back in her home where she was reckless.","“This...” Mr. Fang was still considering the proposal.","“Let’s hit the road!”","“I’m sure the shop owner will agree, right?!”","“Sir, will you come with us? Today, we can take a boat and row to the Central Island in the lake!”","Before Mr. Fang could tell Jiang Xiaoyue if they were going on or, he was dragged out of the shop by others.","“Little Xin’er! You guys keep on eye on the shop for me, and I’ll be back later!”","“...”","“Anyone else wants to come with us?”","“Me! Me! Me...” Hearing this invitation, the big group of orcs and assassins who were watching them all eagerly came out.","Almost 100 people gathered on the street in front of the shop. The passersby who didn’t know their tour plan thought that they were doing window-shopping together...","“My goodness... what’s happening?!”","“Look at the deer in the front!”","“The deer seems to be talking?!”","“Are my eyes playing tricks on me?!”","The residents of Canglan City all froze at this scene!","It was incredible!","“What’s happening up there?! Why are you following them?!”","“There’s a talking deer up front!”","“Really?!”","“It seemed to come out from the... Origins Internet Club!”","“There are many orcs and many elves!”","“That one looks like Grand Mage Adolf! How come he’s here too!?”","“How come I feel like I saw that Grand Mage Merlin...”","A figure dressed in a mage’s robe immediately went deeper in the crowd. How come I feel like I have been discovered?","...","[Sir! We heard that you’re taking Xiaoyue and Little Bell for an outing?!] In the group chat in QQ, Su Tianji in Jiuhua City, Ning Bi in Half City, and Zong Wu and Gu Tingyun in Yuanyang City all emerged with questions.","[Why don’t you put it on the livestream?!]","Tang Yu said, [Sir, you can’t enjoy the sight of elves every day by yourself! Put them on the livestream so that we can see them too! We’ve never seen elves before!]","Yue Bai added, [I agree, I agree! (Group picture of Xiaoyue and some elves). Look, even Xiaoyue sent us pictures!]","“Okay! Okay! I’ll livestream after I ask for their permission.” Mr. Fang felt harassed that he had to livestream while he went for an outing!","Snap!","In the shops, the big screens in the lounge areas suddenly lit up.","“The shop owner is livestreaming again?”","“I wonder what we’ll watch this time.”","Soon, large groups of audience gathered before the screens.","Yue Bai, Tang Yu, other disciples of Heavenly Academy, Fairy Qing Yun who was wearing a big pair of sunglasses, and even the janitors all sat down on the couches.","On the screens, Elf Girl Sala and other elves of the Snow Pigeon Team stood in one row. “Sir, they can see us now?”","“Greetings to people in the other shops! Hello!” The elves waved.","Behind them, some orcs poked out their animal heads.","“What are these?!”","“Does World of Warcraft have orcs like these?! Are they new races...?”","“They are not night elves! A new elf race appeared?!”","“Look! Xiaoyue is with them!”","“They are at... the new shop!”","“Ahh-! I see real elves!”","“Look! A dog-headed man is catching fish in the lake!” Su Tianji exclaimed.","When others looked over, the dog-headed man was swimming back to the bank with two fish dangling from his mouth. “Today, I’ll treat you the roasted fish of orcs!”","He was very hospitable.","Exclamations erupted among the audiences in the shops.","It was about 6 o’clock in the evening. Under the fiery evening clouds in the late autumn sky, maple leaves flew down on the banks of the lake. While the orcs roasted fish on the bank, some knights were rowing a boat toward the center of the lake.","“Yohahahaha! It’s so fun!” The big white deer stood on the bow and spread its front hooves to enjoy the warm breeze on the lake.","Then, its two hooves slipped.","“Waya–!”","Splash! The big white deer fell into the lake.","“Ugh...?” Everyone in the area froze.","“Ahya! Help the deer! Help me!”"]},{"number":711,"title":"Chapter 711 - Is This a Horror Movie?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The sun was setting gradually.","The aroma of roasted fish permeated the air around the bank of the lake.","A few golden griffin knights pulled out the drowning big white deer from the lake.","When they returned to the shop, it was very late.","...","Mercenaries such as Big Sword Crete were enjoying the attention from the city’s aristocrats and the civilians. “Crete! Can you tell us where the talking deer came from?”","“Crete! How come there were so many elves a moment ago?!”","“I heard some servants talking about something named ‘The Avengers’ and a battle against an evil god?! My goodness! Are they gathering together to deal with an evil god?” Some noble ladies who liked reading fantasy novels about knights sent servants to ask about the movie.","Obviously, the outing of the large group of elves and orcs with the ‘talking big white deer’ caused a great disturbance in the whole city.","In this empire, people could also do other stuff besides learning combat techniques or practicing magic spells. The members with moderate talents in the big families would be sent to learn how to manage the family business.","These types of fantasy stories circulating in the Nora Continent were quite popular among aristocrats, including the noble ladies who were just mentioned.","Of course, the people who were most eager about it were the peace-loving elves.","“Oh right. Can you tell us about... um... The Avengers that you were talking about?” The orcs asked while they walked back to their inn.","“That’s a trailer of a new movie in the shop,” The elves happily introduced the orcs to the movie. “It’s a story about an extremely horrifying evil god trying to rule humans...”","...","– On the other side –","“Mr. Adolf, do you think that there’s really an evil god who is trying to rule the humans in ‘The Avengers’?” Dwarf Elder Sauk asked while they walked to a street in the distance.","“I heard from the elves who have watched the trailer that the evil god is extremely scary. I think that the elves would never lie!” Adolf said gravely.","“Oh... Then, it will be a horror movie...” The dwarf elder sighed.","“It’s said that people can feel the great power of that... evil god by watching the trailer, and it’s a level of power that we can never withstand!”","Bam! Bam! Bam!","It was midnight, and Elder Sewell was still awake when she heard someone knocking on her door.","“Elder, are you asleep?!” Outside the door, Elf Girl Sala asked in a low voice, “May I enter?”","“Come in.”","A small head poked in.","“Elder... I can’t sleep...","“Do you think there is really such an evil god... that would turn us to ashes with one wave of his hand?” After all, in the legends, such existences were all powerful and capable of many great deeds.","...","– The morning of the next day –","Today was the day that ‘The Avengers’ would be released.","Shakily, the elves, dwarves, and orcs sat before their computers with curiosity for the unknown.","“Are we really going to watch this extremely scary horror movie?!” an orc asked with a shiver.","“We orcs are the bravest beings!” another orc said shakily, “If the elves dare to watch it, why can’t we?!”","“I heard that the cute little white deer of the Demon Clan is also brave enough to watch it!” another orc said loudly.","“We brave orcs surely... are not frightened!”","They all activated the movie and began to watch ‘The Avengers’ which seemed to be a ‘super horror movie’.","After hearing the exaggerated descriptions from the elves, they had to encourage themselves for the movie.","Meanwhile, others such as Dwarf Elder Sauk and Elf Elder Sewell had also begun watching the movie.","In fact, many elves even boarded Mr. Fang’s tour bus.","“So many people... we should be fine... right?” Some elves were still uneasy. “We elves are the bravest beings and are not afraid of this evil god!”","“Ha-! Ya-!” Sala and other elf girls dashed onto Mr. Fang’s tour bus with battle shouts as if they were trying to say, “We elves are fearless!”","Some customers from the old shops were also on Mr. Fang’s tour bus, including Su Tianji, members of the Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild, and students of Heavenly Academy.","Although they had seen these elves and orcs yesterday, they still stared at the latter in amazement.","Seeing the elves who had pointy ears and orcs who had lion heads or tiger heads, Demonic Woman Ning Bi suddenly felt like she looked quite normal compared with these people.","Soon, the movie began.","“The Tesseract has awakened...” Before the viewers was a mass of icy-blue flames wrapped by a square crystal cube. Even though they were looking at it from the side, the viewers vaguely felt the deep and horrifying energy inside it.","The gloomy and evil voice slowly sounded from the darkness, “A human world. They would wield its power... but our ally knows its workings as they never will.”","“He is ready to lead... And our force, our Chitauri, will follow.” In the gloomy dark space, countless weirdly-dressed gloomy monster soldiers put on their armor while the deep voice continued, “The world will be his. The universe yours.”","“And the humans, what can they do but burn?”","“Ya-!” The elves let out a series of screams, “Are they all evil gods?!”","“There’re more than one-!”","According to legends that were passed down from ancient times, they could do nothing but wait for their death if such an evil god decided to attack them!","“The humans here are not powerful at all!” Sala said, “Look at their commander! He doesn’t even have the presence of a level 1 warrior! He’s just an ordinary person!”","“They are finished! This will be a horrifying catastrophe of the biggest scale!”","“Do you think the humans on this ‘Earth’ will be wiped out?” one elf asked.","It was scary even just thinking about it!","The system version of the movie didn’t only make viewers feel like they were in the world. Furthermore, the great power of the characters would be showcased in many ways, including the god-like presences, glances, and the horrifyingly huge force which could destroy all viewers with only a tiny part of it.","Apart from all these, the most horrifying was the ability of easily controlling people’s minds at will. Just imagine how horrifying it would be if your body and mind no longer belong to you!","“Wu... I don’t want to watch it...” Rowling, the elf girl standing beside Sala, almost wept.","The other elves were not faring any better. Their screams resonated in the tour group, and some elf girls even huddled together."]},{"number":712,"title":"Chapter 712 - Something Doesn’t Feel Right","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Not only elves and orcs, but dwarves, human mages, assassins, and knights were also watching the new movie. They didn’t quite understand what the movie was about, but they believed that all the products in this shop had top quality!","Therefore, the people watching ‘The Avengers’ in the new shop included not only old players but many new customers.","“Is this the movie that was said to have an evil god in it?” In the new shop, there were some noble young ladies who loved knight stories. One of them had wine-colored curly hair and was dressed in an aristocratic long dress. The badge she wore on her chest showed that she wasn’t an ordinary noble lady since the stars rising from clouds engraved on the badge could be only seen among the royal members of the Morning Light Empire.","The young men and women sitting around her were obviously also high-ranked.","This was their first visit here. Yesterday, they heard everyone talking about the movie. Today, driven by curiosity, they each bought a membership and activated ‘The Avengers’.","Now, they were watching Loki make his appearance.","“Ahh-!” They instantly shrieked.","They were so frightened by the scene that they almost wet their pants!","Different from the players in the old shops, the newbies who had never watched such movies before almost went crazy!","Just imagine the scenario in which a mortal stood before a real evil god who could frighten them with a tiny bit of his presence.","The system had perfected each detail in the movie.","According to the legends in this world, the gods were so scary that they could turn humans into ashes with a wave of their hands.","“This evil god...!?”","“Ahh-! Ahh-!” The talentless aristocrats who knew nothing but watching knights screamed as soon as they saw this ‘evil god’.","Even some orcs swallowed their saliva with difficulty.","The plot of ‘The Avengers’ was quite simple. After the Evil God Loki took the Tesseract with force, the SHIELD organization planned to gather the superheroes to handle this mess.","Although it was simple, this plot made the story easy to understand for the new customers who had never watched such movies before.","Soon, the heroes made their appearances.","“This woman looks like an ordinary person...” The audience watched and commented on Black Widow.","“But she’s pretty...” one orc with a lion head commented.","But...","What is the use of beauty when fighting against an evil god?","Then, they saw the second superhero.","“This guy is also an ordinary person...” The audience scrutinized the Hulk, who was in his human form.","“How come I don’t sense any special abilities from them...?!”","“He is even afraid of an handgun!” Sala who had watched Resident Evil felt like she was going to die. “This is the least powerful weapon!”","“This Iron Man... looks to be an ordinary person too...” Naively, the elves looked at Iron Man, who was in a strange armor suit.","“Ugh?! His feet are spitting fire!?” The elves, orcs, and aristocrats watched in puzzlement as Iron Man shot into the sky above an extremely prosperous city like a shooting star.","Under the nightly sky, the neon lights in the city flashed like starry lights, which were dizzying for the audience who were not familiar with this style of tall buildings.","“The night view of this city is breathtaking...” Despite their fear for the evil god, the elves, fans of natural beauty, still enjoyed the night view.","Then, they saw Captain America.","“This Captain America doesn’t look powerful either!” one orc commented with a muffled voice, “Can these humans defeat this evil god in a battle?”","Then, the viewers turned back to watching the evil god as he teleported and used all kinds of destructive spells that had been upgraded to a godly level by the System. They were impressed by his calm and unique air as if he had everything under control.","A set of weirdly-shaped armor appeared on Loki’s body, and he stepped out with casual steps as if he was walking in a park, but the people around him were so frightened that they scrambled to flee.","Obviously, in the system version of the movie, the audience could better sense the horrifying godly pressure. Without a fuss, all humans before him kneeled while shaking.","They submitted to the terrifying power of this evil god.","All viewers could feel this horrifying pressure.","This... can humans really battle with such an existence?!","“Has this evil god recovered his godly power?!”","“I feel like he’s getting stronger...”","“Is not this simpler?” The audience in the new shop stood in the crowd as they watched Loki make his proud speech. “Is this not your natural state? It’s the unspoken truth of humanity, that you crave subjugation. In the end, you’ll always kneel.”","Finally, an old man stood up shakily and said, “Not to men like you.”","Loki sneered. “Look to your elder, people.”","The scepter in Loki’s hand condensed a destructive pale-blue light. “Let him be an example.”","Then, the destructive light shot out like a bright blue beam of death!","“Ahhyaa...!”","“He’ll die! He is going to die!”","The less brave elves and humans covered their heads with their arms when seeing this scary evil god.","Boom!","“Ugh?” A timid elf removed her fingers from her eyes and saw the blue light being bounced back.","Loki dropped to the ground and was silent for a long while.","Captain America stood before the old man with a small round shield in his hand.","Then, a rocket-like light beam flew down from the sky. Two blinding light beams with great energy from the nuclear reactor shot from the center of two hands.","“Make your move.” When the ‘horrifying’ evil god tried to move again, Iron Man stood before him.","“Yeah-!?","“Eh-?!”","“Ahh-?!”","“What’s happening?!”","“Isn’t he an evil god?!”","The audience who had been frozen in fear looked baffled. “How come this plot feels fishy...?”","This Captain America doesn’t look powerful, but what’s the trick with his...shield?!","That Iron Man looks no different from an ordinary soldier apart from his metal armor... But... what were the light beams that instantly knocked down the evil god?","“I don’t like it...” In the movie, Captain America opened his mouth and spoke.","“What? Rock of Ages giving up so easily?”","...","“Is this a scheme...” Hearing their conversation, the audience became uneasy again. “I also feel like... things can’t be this simple!”","They had seen the calmness of Loki, as if he had everything under control even though he was captured by these humans.","It seemed like everything was going as he had planned, and humans didn’t have any power to resist the slow corrosion. This feeling even suffocated the orcs and dwarves, let alone the elves.","“This evil god must have given himself up on purpose, right?!” Elder Sewell stared at the scene before her and commented. “This evil god is so cunning... I feel like he’s brewing some horrifying scheme!”"]},{"number":713,"title":"Chapter 713 - I Thought I’d Wet My Pants in Fear, But I Ended Up Laughing like a Pig?!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“It must be!” Dwarf Elder Sauk had somehow joined the tour group, and he added, “Oh... This must be the most cunning, evil, and powerful god that I’ve ever seen!”","“Look... even after he was captured by Thor, who is as powerful as him, he looks as if he had everything under control,” Adolf said with a nod, “He must have a plan; or he just has no regard for these humans who are extremely weak in his eyes!”","As the movie went on, the Evil God Loki, who had been captured by Thor and the others, was put into a specially-made cell by SHIELD.","The specially-made glass around the cell couldn’t be broken by any ordinary person, not even Loki who had obviously lost his strength again.","However, everyone saw that Loki’s power went beyond his physical strength. Like a born demon, his words could always lure and bewitch people.","Even without using any force, he seemed to be able to lure anyone who had contact with him to work for him.","For example, he was now luring Black Widow to step into his trap with words.","At this moment, everyone in Mr. Fang’s tour group was watching the scene.","“Is this love...?” In the cell, Loki’s voice full of sins and degeneration sounded, luring Black Widow to open her heart and tell him her past.","“Oh... this horrifying evil god has control over someone important to her... so despicable!” Watching this scene, the elves felt even more frightened.","“Pathetic... you serve liars and killers... do you think you can wipe out all your sins?”","The evil god’s voice grew even more vicious, “I won’t touch Barton. Not until I make him kill you! Slowly. Intimately. In every way he knows you fear! And when he’ll wake just long enough to see his good work, and when he screams, I’ll split his skull!”","“...” The words turned the atmosphere more and more suffocating.","“It’s finished...”","“I feel like this woman is going to break!”","At this moment, the pretty woman dressed in black body-fitting clothes said, “Thank you for your cooperation. I know your plan now.”","Loki who was in the cell was at a loss for words.","“Ugh?! What’s happening?!”","Of course, this small incident didn’t affect the main course.","“Oh... Look at this evil god; how come he still looks so confident?” Dwarf Elder Sauk exclaimed.","“My goodness... he got out! He actually got out!”","“What do I see?! He activated the horrifying Tesseract! Will the world come to its end?!”","The pale-blue light beam shot into the sky and opened a huge portal in space. From being captured to escaping to activating the Tesseract, this evil god seemed to have everything in his control.","Countless spaceships from the alien dimension flew out of the pitch-black space, shooting out destructive light beams and turning everything that they touched into ashes!","Instantly, the buildings in the city were turned into shambles!","“This evil god is so calm...”","“Will the humans in this world be destroyed?”","The horrifyingly huge metal beasts also crawled out from the wormhole in space.","A wiggle of their giant, mountain-like bodies could knock down all the high buildings around them!","“He’s chasing after Black Widow! My goodness!”","At this moment, Hawkeye Barton, another superhero, shot an arrow at Loki.","It was dead-on accurate! Loki couldn’t dodge it.","However, in the next moment, the powerful evil god caught the arrow in his hand!","He looked down overbearingly with a smile of great self-confidence.","“Oh... I think this evil god is indeed powerful...” Elder Sewell said in shock.","Boom!","The head of the arrow exploded, sending Loki flying.","He was dazed by the explosion.","“...”","It was absolutely silent.","After a while...","“Hahahaha...!” Wild Laughter filled the whole internet café while a few orcs dropped to the ground with merriment.","“Enough!” After breaking through the window and falling into a tall building, Loki looked at the Hulk who had chased him into the building, and this evil god now had a distorted expression.","“Enough! You are, all of you are beneath me! I am a god, you dull creatures, and I will not be bullied...”","“Is the evil god going to use his true power now?!” Some noble ladies exclaimed.","After all, in the stories of knights, the evil antagonists would always show their hidden cards after a temporary defeat.","Then, they saw the green giant with unthinkable strength grabbing onto Loki’s legs.","Then, he smashed Loki against the floor repeatedly like a bat. Boom! Boom! Boom! Crack! Crack! Crack!","He glanced at Loki, saw that the latter was still alive, and swung again.","Loki slowly snapped back...","He lay on the floor in a daze. “...”","All of the audience were at a loss for words.","After a long while, they finally understood what happened and burst into laughter. “Hahaha...”","The orcs slammed their fists on the floor. “Hahahaha...”","“Ahhahaha...Oink-!?” Elder Sewell suddenly covered her mouth.","“???” People seemed to hear a snorting sound from a pig.","“!!??” Everyone looked over.","“Not me! Not me!” Elder Sewell’s pretty face darkened. “I didn’t... laugh. Hahaha!”","We thought we’d watch a super horrifying evil god and were prepared to be terrified! But you forced us to end up laughing like pigs?!","Are you sure you’re not kidding me?!","“Ah...?” Mr. Fang looked at the elves in confusion. “I’m showing you a comedy! Seeing you work hard playing games everyday, I decided to give you some entertainment and relaxation! Isn’t it great?”","“Ha?!” The elves and orcs all froze.","We thought we were watching a horror movie!","You ruined our view of this world!","Elf Girl Sala felt like her belly hurt since she laughed so much, and she rushed over and swung her little fists at Mr. Fang.","How can we look at evil gods with proper fear after watching this?!","At this moment, the real battle had just begun.","As mentioned before, Loki opened a spatial portal with the Tesseract. On the other side of the portal was an extremely huge spaceship floating in the endless space full of radiant stars, and the ship hovered in the space above Earth like a giant shadow."]},{"number":714,"title":"Chapter 714 - A Simple Story About Heroes","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","In the city which was gradually turning into ruin, viewers looked up and saw giant warships flying out from the huge hole in the sky.","Even the soldiers of the lowest rank used the horrifying laser weapons which could pierce an entire skyscraper with blue light beams.","The chitauri claimed that they were part of the ‘immune system of the universe’ with the job of destroying chaos and free will, which made them truly a nightmarish evil legion.","They passed through the portal that was opened by the Tesseract which was taken by Loki, and they rushed into the sky above Earth continuously.","With nimble bodies like fish, their spaceships looked like huge deep-ocean whales that could soar in the sky.","Each of these spaceships was as big as an aircraft carrier.","The most terrifying thing was that these alien spaceships equipped with alien technologies were no longer ordinary spaceships in humans’ imaginations.","The fins of the spaceships cut open skyscrapers as if they were sharp knives cutting through tofu, and their huge tails knocked down countless buildings like dominos.","These weird spaceships looked like machines and lifeforms at the same time, and they turned the city into shambles like spatial giant beasts that were soaring in the sky. Sitting in small flying boats like compact groups of locusts, their soldiers butchered every living being that they saw with destructive laser beams like raindrops in a storm.","The six superheroes stood below the portal.","Obviously, this movie didn’t follow the traditional way of expressing the storyline by putting the heroes at a disadvantage at the beginning.","Instead, the movie showed the heroes’ great powers in a humorous way.","At this moment, the audience was amazed by the humans on this ‘Earth’ subconsciously.","“How come the humans on this ‘Earth’ are so powerful?!” Dwarf Elder Sauk asked loudly.","“There are several of them!” They were amazed by the unthinkable power that Iron Man obtained from the reactor on his chest or Hulk’s pure and horrifying physical strength that was greater than a god’s.","They had thought that Thor, who was a god, should be the main force of the alliance, but now they found that each of the heroes was a main force!","At this moment, the audience saw the heroes gathering again to deal with the present crisis together.","Even the customers in the new shop in Canglan City were thrilled by the movie.","Meanwhile, they began to get extremely curious about the past and backgrounds of these heroes, wondering what had made them so powerful.","At this moment, their fear for the evil god had vanished, and in its place was a combination of fear and curiosity that the modern people felt while they watched horror movies.","“Call it, Cap.”","In the spatial void behind the portal, the mothership that was many times larger than these spaceships stood in the deep darkness, sending more and more spaceships to Earth.","“Alright, listen up! Until we can close that portal up there, we’re going to use containment!”","“Baton, I want you on that roof, eye on everything. Call out patterns and strays.”","“Stark, you got the perimeter. Anything gets more than three blocks out, you turn it back or you turn it to ash!”","After these orders were issued, it was Thor’s turn.","“You got to try and bottleneck that portal! Slow them down!”","As the climax of the movie came, the audience in the other world were enthralled.","“Hulk!”","With a deafening, furious roar, Hulk’s huge body shattered the ground like a huge cannonball. Then, he instantly grabbed the soldiers from one flying ship on the sky. The powerful light beams that these flying ships sent out couldn’t even penetrate the green giant’s skin!","It seemed like nothing could block his huge force. Everything including metal, rocks, and the spaceships carrying the Chitauri army was shattered by his huge iron fists!","Thunderous clouds surged in the sky while many thunderbolts formed a huge destructive net. Many thunderbolts that were as thick as buckets struck on the portal viciously under the control of Thor’s hammer, exploding the huge spaceships that were just passing the portal in the blink of an eye. They turned into waves of fire clouds while many debris of the spaceship fell from the sky like shooting stars!","The thunderous lights and flames in the sky looked like many radiant fireworks.","On the other side, Hawkeye Barton shot out arrows, exploding the spaceships in the sky and turning them into fireballs. The blazing flames and lights shot across the city, making explosive and artistic destruction everywhere.","This was absolutely a great visual feast for the eyes to enjoy!","“Wow!” The elves, dwarves, and knights found that they were completely enthralled by scenes of the war!","“Au! Au!” Holding a big bag of potato chips that she had bought in Qzone, Jiang Xiaoyue stuffed a big handful of potato chips into her mouth while she enjoyed ‘The Avengers’.","Obviously, as a player from one of the old shops, she was calmer than the others but was still fascinated by this novel and humorous movie.","To her surprise, another hand reached into the bag and grabbed a handful of potato chips.","“Xiaoyue, this original flavor isn’t so good. Why didn’t you buy the cucumber flavor?” Mr. Fang said while crunching on the potato chips.","“You are saying that it doesn’t taste good after you finished eating!” Jiang Xiaoyue was mad! You eat my potato chips everyday!","At this moment, the war came to the end.","Although many Chitauri troops that had entered Earth through the portal had been destroyed, the mothership in the void was still sending more spaceships down as if there was an endless supply.","Like black clouds, more and more spaceships surrounded the Hulk and poured light beams onto him.","Even the energy from the reactor couldn’t last for long in such a big-scaled war. Tony Stark (Iron Man) found that his energy was low after destroying several Chitauri army’s spaceships that looked like huge beasts.","At this moment, the military activated the most horrifying weapon.","A white missile flew toward the city with a long tail of exhaust flames like a rocket. It was a nightmare for both the humans and their enemies.","Produced by the technology much more advanced than that in the world where Fang Qi had lived before he traveled through space and time, this nuclear missile had much greater power.","Everyone, both the humans and their enemies, would be destroyed.","Seeing Iron Man getting close to the missile on his own and pushing it to change the trajectory before propelling it to the other side of the portal, the audience seemed to begin to understand what the word ‘hero’ meant.","Perhaps it was a one-way trip, which was a price that an ordinary person couldn’t pay.","From humor, to passion, and then to heroism. Yes, this was a simple story about heroes.","Perhaps it was only a very simple movie about superheroes, but its simplicity had many benefits. At least everyone understood its humor. And while they laughed, they also understood the message the movie tried to convey.","On the other side of the portal, the nuclear fusion turned the whole mothership into an ocean of fire, annihilating it in the void.","“Ya! This Iron Man isn’t dead yet!” The elves were pleasantly surprised while they watched the last scene of the movie."]},{"number":715,"title":"Chapter 715 - Life Skills and Casual Players","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“The evil god isn’t as scary as we thought...” After the movie, the viewers felt like this Evil God Loki was quite entertaining.","“I thought I would be scared senseless by this movie!” Elf Girl Sala put down her virtual reality headset and began to talk about it excitedly with the elves around her.","“Such a weak god. Hahahaha...” A big white deer joined their discussion.","“I feel like the part when he caught the arrow is the most interesting.” A dog-headed man joined them too.","“I wonder if there are more ‘movies’ of this style!” some new customers asked while sitting down beside them.","“Sir!” The elves looked at Mr. Fang expectantly.","“Probably not recently,” Mr. Fang said, “We’ll soon have a new game, but not movies.”","“A game?!”","“What new game?!”","Even the assassins who were playing World of Warcraft in a zone quite far away walked over upon hearing this news.","Having spent only two hours on the movie, the players still had lots of time left today.","While the elves talked about the movie with Jiang Xiaoyue and Little Bell in excitement, others entered the game and began today’s exploration.","...","By now, most of the players had reached levels over 50 in World of Warcraft. Right now, the max level in World of Warcraft was level 60. After reaching the highest level, the players could choose to play different styles, including casual, PVE, or PVP.","During leisure time, the players could go to the battlegrounds and improve their combat techniques, or they could try blacksmithing, enchanting, gathering, or even touring the world.","On the windowsills at the northeast corner of the shop, there were several pots of blue gladiolus orchids, the special plants that could only be found in the Morning Light Empire. The dwarves and mages were sitting at computers near the flowers.","A box of spicy sticks sat on Mage Adolf’s computer desk, and he had eaten more than half of the box while watching the movie.","Without thinking, he stuffed one into his mouth.","“Elder Sauk, come and take a look at this blueprint. Can you create it?” Adolf asked with a scroll of recipes in his hand, “Some of us mages formed a group and looted this while you watched the movie.”","For Dwarf Elder Sauk, even though the artifact-making techniques in the Legend of Sword and Fairy 4 were inspiring, blacksmithing and alchemy were still his specialties.","In World of Warcraft, there were equipment that brought some classes great glories for one generation, and such god-tier equipment could be obtained through blacksmithing.","For example, the recipe for ‘Destiny’ that he was holding.","As everyone knew, reaching the max level was only the beginning in World of Warcraft.","Two max-level players would have a great difference in strength if one of them was well-equipped and the other was poorly-equipped.","As told by its name, Destiny had tremendous power in the blade, and the player with this weapon would feel as if they could control their destiny.","It was the first of the seven weapons in World of Warcraft that had legendary backgrounds.","Elder Sauk instantly widened his eyes.","“My goodness! What’s this?!”","While exclamation sounded, many people nearby also looked over and intensely stared at the purple epic two-handed longsword that could be made by blacksmiths.","“Elder! Can... you make this sword?!” Dwarf Warrior Raff stuck out his hairy head and stared at the screen with envy in his eyes.","“Be patient! I’m... doing the quest for the master blacksmith!” Elder Sauk looked smug. While he was chatting, he put down his virtual reality headset with his mouse cursor hovering on the recipe that he had traded from Adolf. “I’m doing the quest named ‘The Art of the Imbue’. I don’t think anyone in World of Warcraft is faster than me!”","“No...” Dwarf Raff said, “I meant, with this detailed blueprint, can you make it in your blacksmith workshop?”","He meant the workshop in the real world.","“This...” Dwarf Elder Sauk thought for a moment and said, “I’m afraid that I can’t do it until I’ve mastered all the blacksmith skills in this game.”","“In other words, it’s entirely possible?!”","The Art of the Imbue, as was indicated by the name, was to inject magic energy into items.","As a result, the equipment created in World of Warcraft had many powerful magic attributes.","On the other side, Grand Mage Adolf was studying enchanting and alchemy with many other mages.","“Hiss... Look at this healing potion; it can heal wounds in a flash...” Adolf said, “Dicas, I think we must study its creation process.”","Different from Diablo, one could find in complete production methods of things in World of Warcraft due to the existence of professions.","...","In a corner close to the entrance of the shop.","The golden griffin knights obviously didn’t spend much time on discussion after watching ‘The Avengers’.","“Huh?” After chatting with the elves for a while, Helen turned to look at Commander Elven’s screen and found that he had gone to the Eastern Plaguelands.","“Commander, what are you doing here?” Some knights came over and watched him play.","“Yesterday, in the west of the Eastern Plaguelands, I met an old knight who had been exiled for treason because he had saved an orc,” Commander Elven said, “My guts told me that there are some secret stories in this place. I plan to do this quest, and it will give me lots of experience points.”","On his screen was an old paladin named Fordring.","...","In the lounge area, the elves were still talking about ‘The Avengers’ that they had just finished watching.","They were sitting on the couches in the lounge area in a circle.","Elder Sewell was enjoying a mug of Cappuccino casually.","Sitting across from her were a group of orcs who were talking animatedly.","[Ding-dong.] Jiang Xiaoyue’s communication jade made a sound, and she took it out and chatted on it cheerfully.","“You guys all have this thing?! You can use QQ on this thing as well?!”","“This communication jade is an updated version after we studied the cellphones shown in the shop’s games...” Jiang Xiaoyue glanced at the elves. “Don’t you have this? I remember there are cellphones in the new game and the movie Resident Evil...”","“Aren’t they virtual objects?” Elder Sewell said curiously.","“But you can open and study them.”","“Ah-?!”","“We can open and study them?!” Elder Sewell looked astonished. “Then, then... The Avengers...”","Everyone looked over in astonishment.","“Didn’t you know that?” Jiang Xiaoyue looked at her in surprise. “We can do it in all the games and movies.”","“Ya-!”","We always thought they are fake!","Obviously, the elves and mages had always thought that they could only practice combat techniques in the games."]},{"number":716,"title":"Chapter 716 - Don’t Be Fooled by the Trailer; This Must Be a Funny Game!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Sir! Um... what’s the new game?!” On the morning of the next day, the elves who had finally finished their animated discussions about ‘The Avengers’ finally remembered the new game.","“Doesn’t it have a trailer?!”","“Oh. Aren’t you guys going to return to your elf forest?” Mr. Fang looked at the elves who came to the shop to play games every day.","“Elder.” Little Sala glanced at Elder Sewell beside her and asked, “Didn’t you say that you will apply for a teleportation array? Was the application approved?”","“Oh!” Elder Sewell patted her forehead.","“Did you forget it?!” Elf Girl Sala stared at her in suspicion.","“How is that possible!” Elder Sewell rolled her eyes at Sala and said, “Little Girl, don’t doubt your elder. Do you think I’m a forgetful person?!”","Elder Sewell said with great dignity, “It’s not a small issue to build a teleportation array connecting the Elf Clan with another nation! I need to demonstrate many benefits that we can obtain here to the Elder Council. I’ve only collected a small part of the evidence; it’s not enough yet.”","“Then, we must play some more games to get enough evidence?!” Sala asked cheerfully.","“What... what are you talking about?!” Elder Sewell’s pretty face reddened, and then she said solemnly, “I’ve sent a message to the Elder Council, telling them that the elf guard team that came out with me this time would obtain a huge leap in strength when we return. We’re here to do hard cultivation!”","We’ve been working so hard raiding instances and got such a fright from the so-called evil god!","Yes! We’re here for hard cultivation!","This girl is getting so unruly that she dares to tease me, an elder!","Then, Elder Sewell said with a serious expression, “Cultivate hard! Do you understand? You guys will protect Silver Moon Forest in the future!”","“Okay! Got it!”","“That is better.” Satisfied, Elder Sewell turned to look at Mr. Fang and said, “Sir, didn’t you say that there would be a new mystical realm? How about it? Do you have a trailer?”","“Sir, which workshop made it?” In their minds, the ‘East Continent’ had many ‘workshops’ which had made most of the games long ago, and that was why this shop could release new games faster and more frequently than the Dulan Workshop and Lava Workshop.","Of course, it must be noted that Mr. Fang’s shop was popular only in this area and not as well-known as the big workshops in other nations.","After all...","– In the Royal Magic Union of the Morning Light Empire outside Canglan City –","“How come I always hear people sing high praise of the ‘Blizzard Workshop’?” A mage dressed in a black mage’s robe complained, “They keep saying that ‘Blizzard’ is the best in the world! Everything originates from ‘Blizzard’! Seriously?! They brag about it everyday!”","“I was a bit curious about this ‘Blizzard Workshop’.” A blond mage said while shaking his head, “But I’m now tired of hearing their bragging. A bunch of morons! Is Blizzard their daddy or something?”","“Hey! Who are you talking about?”","“Who else? The mages led by Dicas are the most enthusiastic supporters!”","“They even claimed that it is the most realistic and vastest mystical realm...”","...","This was pretty much the current situation.","...","However, the new game clearly wasn’t a product of Blizzard.","“It’s Ubisoft this time,” Mr. Fang said.","“Ubisoft?!” Assassin Elina had just walked into the shop. Hearing the word ‘Ubisoft’, she strode over immediately.","What was Ubisoft? It was their faith!","“Is it a sequel to Assassin’s Creed?!” she asked excitedly.","“It’s not a game in the assassin series.” Mr. Fang shook his head and said, “Today, the trailer was released. You can watch it in the Super Theatre.”","“Then, when will the game be released?” While looking for a seat, Elf Girl Sala asked casually.","“Um...” While his face twitched, Mr. Fang glanced at the task on the System Interface and said, “It’s not decided yet.”","Is my mind very weak?! Why do I need to do special training?!","Mr. Fang looked disdainful.","The System replied, [If the Host thinks he has a tough mind, why not begin the training immediately?]","“No-!” Mr. Fang’s face stiffed.","To calm down his nerves, Mr. Fang went and made himself a bowl of instant noodles.","So... the release date was still undecided.","...","“Ya! Xiaoyue, you guys are early!” Seeing Xiaoyue and Little Bell were already online, the elves immediately sat down in the seats near to them.","“Morning!” Jiang Xiaoyue exited from the virtual reality mode and waved at the elves.","“Xiaoyue, do you want to eat some spicy sticks?” Sala took out a box of spicy sticks with a smile. “I bought a big box today!”","“I do-!” As a foodie, Xiaoyue’s eyes lit up at the mentioning of spicy sticks.","“Then, you must say ‘Sister Sala is the best! I like Sister Sala the most!’”","“Well...” Jiang Xiaoyue blushed.","Standing behind them with a bowl of instant noodles in his hands, Mr. Fang felt awkward, feeling like Xiaoyue would be easily lured away by a spicy stick.","Expressionlessly, Mr. Fang instructed (interrupted) with a bowl of instant noodles in his hands, “You can open Super Theatre, it is the most eye-catching one on the top.”","“Oh-!”","“Sir! Are you sure that Ubisoft didn’t release a new game of Assassin’s Creed?” Elina obviously was still thinking about Assassin’s Creed, and she asked while opening Super Theatre.","“Outlast?” Elina froze.","“What game is this...” Sala asked curiously while she gazed at the screen.","“It’s a survival game,” Mr. Fang explained, “You can see it from the name. It’s about... escaping from a dangerous place.”","Mr. Fang’s explanation was... not even better than no explanation.","“Isn’t it simple?” Elina looked confident. After all, she had escaped from the minions of the Judgement Godly Palace and the places full of traps many times even before she played Assassin’s Creed. “I’m good at this!”","“But... it looks so gloomy!” Little Bell only took one look of the trailer and immediately exited from virtual reality mode, covering its eyes with its hooves.","On the screen was a desolate sand-covered road leading to a nightmarish castle-like building.","As the camera entered the interior of the building, they saw dirty bloodstains in the gloomy ward-like rooms.","The whole space felt suffocating and heavy.","In the darkness, creepy figures would flash past occasionally.","In some places, it was pitch-black, and the players could only see things with the night vision function of the camera.","Through the night vision of the camera, the world on the screen looked grey, which added more gloominess to the place.","“It’s fine,” Sala said, “Don’t be fooled by the trailer! We were frightened by the evil god, but what happened?”","“Humph!” Sala said calmly, “I think this must be a hilarious game!”"]},{"number":717,"title":"Chapter 717 - Of Love and Family","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Many assassin players resonated with what Sala said.","For example, Assassin Harrison began to boast about his survival skills of his earlier life. After all, this game was named ‘Outlast’!","“I once got away from a level 9 master!” Harrison said excitedly.","Although he couldn’t talk about his assassinations of the high-level officials of the Judgement Godly Palace, this man could reveal some of his survival skills. “I always took shelter in the filthy places since I was sure that those lofty people wouldn’t even expect me to hide in those places in their dreams...”","“Hey...!” Beside him, another assassin reached over and covered his mouth.","“Um... Hahaha! Anyway, we excel in this area!” Harrison laughed heartily.","After the reputation of assassins turned from that of a dirty job to a great profession, Harrison began to wonder about the imminent game named Outlast.","Is it possible that these survival skills will also become great abilities?!","Elina rolled her eyes at Harry and then told the elves, “Don’t listen to him. I’m way better in this than him. I’m the best expert in fleeing elegantly from the most dangerous places and angering your enemies during the process!”","“Really?!” Many members of the Snow Pigeon Team were intrigued.","If they could do some homework and get prepared before the release of the game named ‘Outlast’, they might be able to progress quickly after they entered the game, right?","For example, these people had been wondering why New Snow, the girl who usually teamed with them in the game, and the tauren with the ID ‘Young Master Song’ and his buddies were so sharp. Sala was envious of them whenever she watched them play, and she thought that it was necessary to get some training in these skills, so she could show-off her own abilities when they began playing Outlast.","“Should we go outside of the city and have a special training for Outlast this evening after we finish with World of Warcraft?” Sala suggested.","“No problem!” Elina said excitedly, “I will teach you the secret to hiding your presence and magic energy in the body!”","“Me too! I want to learn it too!” A big white deer lifted its front hooves and yelled.","This deer’s teammates always said that it was dumb when they played games together. If it could do some preparation and learn the advanced skill of hiding its presence and magic energy, it felt like it could lord over other players when it began playing Outlast!","...","In a corner not far from them, some golden griffin knights were standing behind their commander and watching him play.","“Isn’t this man just an old farmer? Is he really one of the five paladins of the Knights of the Silver Hand?!” Helen exclaimed while she watched the old man’s self-narration on the screen.","During the first war in World of Warcraft, to fight the invading orcs and deal with the fact that warriors couldn’t heal themselves in battles, Archbishop Alonsus Faol decided to create a new class which combined the abilities of warriors and priests – Paladin. Together with his disciples, he established the Knights of the Silver Hand and entrusted it to one of his apprentices, Uther the Lightbringer. This order later became the famous Silver Hand.","In other words, the Silver Hand was the first paladin order in the world. Naturally, the first five paladins at the beginning of the Silver Hand had special meaning for paladin players.","“Commander... you discovered such a great existence in the suburbs of the Eastern Plaguelands?!” One of the golden griffin knights couldn’t believe his eyes. “Is it real...?”","An insignificant and dejected farmer living reclusively in the Eastern Plaguelands?!","“Commander, how did you find him?!” Helen gasped in a low voice as if she had discovered a new world.","Subconsciously, she felt like the situation wasn’t as simple as it looked.","“I got lost in the spider cave and then... I came here after walking through the cave...” Commander Elven obviously was also puzzled.","“Let’s see what else this paladin needs?!” Impatiently, they wanted to watch how this quest would continue.","In fact, in the world where Fang Qi lived prior to his travel through space and time, players who hadn’t played World of Warcraft would still know Tirion Fordring if they had played a game named Hearthstone.","“Race does not dictate honor, Human.” Helen followed the route that Commander Elven mentioned and found this paladin as well.","“While you remain on my farmstead, I ask that you remember and respect this credo. I have known orcs who have been as honorable as the most noble of knights and humans who have been as vile as the most ruthless of Scourge. But I shall not bore you with tales of my youth! There is much work to be done – if that is what you desire.” Helen soon heard the instruction from this paladin.","Obviously, this was a neutral quest that could be completed by both Alliance and Horde players.","Of course, this man didn’t trust the players at the beginning and didn’t tell them some of the past events until these knights did some favors for this reclusive old man.","The players got the remaining parts of the story from other people. Bit by bit, they finally put together the complete and special event in the past.","“I, Tirion Fordring, was exiled for treason.”","This old man seemed to have returned to the past when he recalled the period where he was young and arrogant. Once, Fordring found a reclusive orc and fought him fiercely. Then, the ruins of a nearby tower collapsed, and Fording, who had been engrossed in the battle, was caught off guard and buried in the debris.","When Fordring woke up, he found himself lying in his own bed, and the captain of his guards told him that the rescue team found him unconscious on the back of his horse a few days ago. Fordring tried to recall what had happened and surprisingly realized that the person who had rescued him from the ruins must have been the orc. After he recovered, Fordring followed the clues in his memory and found the orc named Eitrigg.","The Alliance and Horde had always met each other with weapons, but at this moment, the two heroes appreciated each other and became friends.","But soon, the Alliance found out the orc’s whereabouts. When Fordring got the news, the orc had been brought to the city and was tortured inhumanely.","Of course, Fordring couldn’t stand back and watch, which was why he was sent to the court with the crime of treason.","His wife and previous friends all tried to convince him to place all the blame on the orc.","Of course, this quest included more than listening to this old man’s memories.","The quest’s name was ‘Of Love and Family’.","On one hand, Fordring did it to show respect to this orc with great virtues. On the other hand, he wanted to set an example as a father. He hoped that his seven-year-old son would learn from his noble virtues instead of despicable behaviors."]},{"number":718,"title":"Chapter 718 - Can’t Think of Anything but Fancy Operations? Elves Want to Livestream Their Fierce Fight in Outlast","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Race does not dictate honor. People shouldn’t make quick judgements about people different from them.”","This noble paladin wanted to set an example for his son with his actions and words.","In the days following the trial, Fordring was stripped of the power of the Holy Light. Not wanting his son to know that he was exiled, Fordring lied and said that he had died on the battleground.","Tirion Fordring had only secretly returned to his hometown when his son, Taelan, joined the Order of the Silver Hand. From the distance, he watched his son who had grown into a paladin.","The fallen Prince Arthas betrayed the honor of paladins and disbanded the Order of the Silver Hand after killing Uther. From then on, the Silver Hand was divided into several factions, and the major ones were the Brotherhood of Light, Argent Dawn, and Scarlet Crusade.","Tirion Fordring’s son, Taelan Fordring, had also lost his faith. Disillusioned, he became a puppet of the Scarlet Crusade.","The main character of the quest was a great paladin, but during the quest, the golden griffin knights clearly sensed a father’s deep concern and expectation for his son, which was common in any ordinary family.","Taelan Fordring was a Highlord of the Scarlet Crusade in Hearthglen. From this position by the river, one could see the only road coming out from the Hearthglen. Standing by the river, this old paladin looked at the road from the distance everyday.","At this moment, Commander Elven and other knights of the Golden Griffin Knight Legion who were watching the scene from behind felt something wrenching their hearts.","Senior Fordring begged the players to help him wake up the honor and memories buried deep inside his son.","In quests ‘Of Forgotten Memories’ and ‘Of Lost Honor’, the players must find a toy battle hammer and an old battle flag respectively for Fordring.","Thinking that his father had died, Taelan had buried the toy battle hammer together with his memories about his father. After the death of Uther, the Leader of the Silver Hand, due to Arthas’s betrayal, Taelan thought that the Silver Hand had lost all its honor, which was why he joined the Scarlet Crusade. These two items signified his memories and honor.","The last item was a painting of the happy Fordring Family where Senior Fordring stood with his wife and son.","“For this painting, I must go to...” Commander Elven read the quest introduction. “Stratholme...”","“Ahh-!?” Commander Elven froze.","“Commander... what’s it?”","It was the next day when he came to this stage.","Commander Elven froze for a second and said, “15-people instance... still at raiding stage...”","“Huh...","“I only got half way through the storyline! Can’t you let me finish the quest first?!”","What happened after that? Did Senior Fordring save his son? Can’t you let me get to the end of the story first?!","He almost passed out in a fury.","Immediately, he sent a message to some old teammates such as the Healer Dicas, “Are you going to raid today?”","“No.”","“...”","He was feeling very frustrated.","...","“Sir! When will you release Outlast?!” In the early morning, some elves skipped their way to the counter.","Sala felt like her survival skills had greatly improved after the training.","This time, I can finally show off some fancy skills in the game!","After all, she had learned lots of stuff this time! For example, she learned how to conceal her presence from someone stronger than her, how to suddenly attack when she was cornered by chasing enemies, and how to find an opportunity to grab some important figures as hostages.","She even learned some scouting and searching methods! Feeling well-prepared, she was impatient to try the game, Outlast.","“I hope you guys won’t be startled by my amazing skills! Sala thought smugly.","“It’s not released yet! What’s the hurry?!” Mr. Fang rolled his eyes at her, having never seen anyone so eager to play Outlast.","I’m still dreading the training! You must at least wait until I finish my special training!","“Why not?!” Sala was impatient with waiting. “Tell me the exact date that you’ll release it!”","“I don’t know.”","“Ahh-!” She felt like doing beating Mr. Fang. She was finally ready, but the shop owner just wouldn’t release the game.","I plan to livestream my plays!","“Then, I’ll train for a few more days...” Sala and her companions said huffily.","“Forget it!” Elina said, “Should we go back and do some more practice?","“I just came up with an awesome idea!”","“What idea...?” Sala asked curiously.","“The best survival skill is fighting back!” Elina said excitedly, “Just think, since this game is produced by the Ubisoft Workshop, we can... fight our way through it! Use Musou!”","“Killing all your enemies is the best way to survive!” Elina seemed to be proud of her smart idea. “We’ll stun them by our fierce combat techniques!”","“Good! Good!” The elves almost jumped in joy when they heard this idea!","How come you’re so smart!","“Let’s go! We’ll practice for a few more days before we enter the game and use Musou!” These people were planning to shock everyone!","“Sounds great.” Elf Rowling said cheerfully, “Let’s go and practice. We’ll enter the game together and put our fierce battles on livestream!”","The scene would be magnificent!","Elf girls such as Sala and Rowling could think of nothing but fancy operations.","At this moment, Mr. Fang heard his communication jade making a beep and saw a message from Su Tianji.","[Sir.] Su Tianji sent the emoji of a Husky’s cute face. [I watched the trailer of Outlast and found the monsters in it are not very powerful. Do we really need to flee from such monsters?]","[I’m surprised that you thought of this...?]","[What do you mean by surprised that I thought of this?]","I’m very smart, okay?","Mr. Fang said after taking a moment to organize his thoughts, “Different from all the previous games, this game strips you of all methods of resistance, and the main character is an absolutely average person. Even the main characters in Resident Evil have physical conditions far superior than those of average people, so they are not truly average people. This is a game to cultivate player’s minds and willpowers...”","“Strips of... all methods of resistance?” For some unknown reason, Su Tianji shivered."]},{"number":719,"title":"Chapter 719 - A lecture from “Masters”","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The players in the new shop were doing all kinds of preparations for the imminent release of Outlast and dreaming of doing all kinds of fancy plays.","Cool breezes drifted across White Pigeon Square in the evening. Many people living in Canglan City liked to take a walk here after dinner. They would feed the pigeons or sit on the square, watching free Spiritual Spell Visual Projections; those were all good options.","Occasionally, a couple of bards would play harps on the square, singing ancient poems. When people sometimes put coins in the standing baskets before them, they would smile back friendly.","Some young people seemed to have gotten fatigued from frolicking and sat down on the benches on the square while laughing and chatting in joy.","The two boys and one girl were three young people who regularly played games in Mr. Fang’s shop.","At this moment, these three looked toward the huge and clear visual projection on the square expectantly.","“What’s today’s projection about?”","“I know!” The blond and young Ron said, “Of course, it is the ‘Secrets of Mystical Realms’ which is all the rage recently!”","‘Secrets of Mystical Realms’ was a professional and academic program which focused on the new emerging industry – cultivation mystical realms.","The program ‘Secrets of Mystical Realms’ usually showed the latest information about new mystical realms and talked about some new topics, which was why young people loved it so much.","“It seems like we’re late!” Ron said, “Has it been on for a while now?”","“No. I think today’s Secrets of Mystical Realms started earlier.”","...","“Allow me to introduce again.” In the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection was an exquisitely decorated stage. The male host dressed in a black suit sat across from three people, and the person sitting in the outermost chair was a white-haired mage dressed in a white mage’s robe and a pointy hat.","“This is the most influential and authoritative Master Auth, who is a special advisor of the Crystal Workshop, a workshop on the same level as the Dulan Workshop. He is also a special-level instructor of the Duskcloud Mystical Realm Workshop Academy!”","The mage dressed in the white mage’s robe stood up and waved at the audience.","“Awesome...!” These young people stared at this master with widened eyes.","Sitting beside him was a middle-aged mage dressed in a dark grey mage’s robe with a reagent bottle embroidered on the chest.","“This is Master Lywood, an honorable advisor in the Worldly Alchemist Union, and he has achieved extremely high skills in the field of alchemy!”","At this moment, Mercenary Crete was also watching this Spiritual Spell Visual Projection and saw a stout middle-aged priest dressed in a red robe sit in the innermost seat on the screen. “Isn’t that Peable? That Mr. Peable of the Judgement Godly Palace?”","“What are they talking about?” Beside him, another mercenary had just arrived, and he asked curiously.","“I think they seem to be talking about this Blizzard Workshop?” Crete listened for a while and said, “The fame of World of Warcraft has spread so far out already?”","“The things that Mr. Peable has just mentioned such as negligence at work while watching the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection of World of Warcraft are quite common, so I won’t dive into them again.” On the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection, the mage in the white mage’s robe said while gesturing with his hands, “The purpose that we use mystical realms for is to obtain strength in a more efficient way. However, the mystical realm known as World of Warcraft, which was imported recently from the ‘East Continent’, has become a piece of entertainment. For example, people view the scenery and even tour all over the world in the realm. They have become fans of natural scenery and fans of stories! They are obsessed with the game and have neglected their work.”","At this moment, the elves who were enjoying the scenery in World of Warcraft and the knights of the Golden Griffin Knight Legion who were engrossed in the plot of the quest ‘Of Love and Family’ sneezed repeatedly.","“Huh?” One elf glanced around in confusion. “Who’s talking about us?”","“According to the research that I’ve done in recent years, 99 percent of the people obsessed in entertainment activities can achieve nothing in their lives,” the master named Auth said, “The remaining one percent could only obtain much fewer achievements than they were supposed to have.”","The mage dressed in the white mage’s robe gestured and said, “Obviously, the mystical realms from the East Continent workshops are going in this improper direction and are trying to influence our people with this bad style. I think our people must be wary of it,” Master Auth said with great dignity.","The male host nodded and lowered his eyes to glance at the paper in his hand. “Interestingly, another master has done similar research. About 50,000 people had been surveyed. These people had talents to be warriors or mages but also were frequently engaged in entertainment activities. It was found that only a few hundred out of the 50,000 people have obtained some achievements. The result is very close to that of Master Auth’s research.”","“The issue that Master Auth just mentioned is very severe,” Master Lywood, who had brown curly hair and was dressed in the alchemist’s robe, said with a smile, “But I think we must pay attention to another more severe problem. It exists in the Legend of Sword and Fairy in the agency shop named Origins Internet Club. I wonder if you guys have heard of this mystical realm.”","The others looked baffled, which showed that this mystical realm was obviously not as famous as World of Warcraft.","“In this mystical realm... they say ‘I Control My Destiny and Not the Heavens’. I think it will severely mislead the people who cultivate in this mystical realm. More importantly, this mystical realm is a comprehensive one which consists of skills for people from beginners to level 9 masters, which is why I’m afraid that the young people will turn blindly arrogant after learning this idea.” Master Lywood said with a sarcastic smile, “Besides, I got the news yesterday that they made a god into an evil and funny clown in ‘The Avengers’ which was newly-released. It’s blasphemy!","“The most important thing is that it has no academic ground to do so. As everyone knows, we must base our mystical realms on academic evidence since we use the mystical realms for cultivation. We can’t allow these mystical realms to mislead people who enter them for cultivation!”"]},{"number":720,"title":"Chapter 720 - Playing World of Warcraft Equals to Treason?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Right,” the male host said, “We have gathered comments from many viewers lately, which is why we are taking some time from this program to talk about this issue. Now, let’s see what our audience say about this.”","“Okay.”","Soon, a Spiritual Spell Visual Projection appeared between these masters’ seats. On the visual projection was a big comment wall which looked quite like a magic letter.","“Let’s look at the one on the top,” The host read, “It seems to come from a level 2 mage student from an academy. ‘It’s unbelievable. This Blizzard Workshop is despicable. Ever since my roommate started using the mystical realm created by the Blizzard Workshop, he keeps bragging about it each day, saying that Blizzard is the number 1 in the world, as if our current mystical realms are all garbage. I’m being harassed by him. I just love using the mystical realms of the Crystal Workshop. Why should he mind my business?’”","“Oh! Haha!” The host snickered, “The roommate of this level 2 mage student sure is confident. He is saying that Blizzard is the #1 in the world? This young man is such a boastful person. If you encounter someone like this, you’d better ask your instructor to move you to another dorm room.”","“This is the problem that I’ve mentioned before,” Master Auth said, “The ideas in their mystical realms will turn these kids blindly arrogant. It’s only a new mystical realm workshop, and people are already boasting it and saying that it is the #1 in the world.”","“I admit that this Blizzard Workshop must have a high position in the East Continent, but it needs at least dozens of years to reach a high level in our continent.”","“Okay,” the host said with a nod, “Let’s see the next message.”","“I’m in a lousy mood. I argued with my lover the day before yesterday, and he said that he doesn’t need a lover now that he has his games. Go to hell, World of Warcraft! Go to hell, Blizzard Workshop!”","“Oh! Hoho!” the host said while laughing, “This is indeed a serious issue. But girl, just keep away from these people who can’t appreciate you...”","Before he could finish, he saw the next message. “Today, I played the World of Warcraft with my lover. It was so fun that I just couldn’t stop! I feel like our love deepened during the process.”","“...” The host froze with the sudden urge of burning this couple to death!","“Hahahaha!” The people who were watching the show on the White Pigeon Square burst into laughter.","At this moment, Master Auth immediately continued, “Poor people, they are oblivious to the fact that they have been eroded by this entertainment mystical realm. Did you notice that she used the word ‘play’?”","“Oh! My son doesn’t look right ever since he touched World of Warcraft. Can you imagine? There are many good girls in the academy, but he claims that he wants to marry an orc girl?! He even said that the deer in Origins Internet Club, that agency shop, is super cute! I hope you can help me!”","“Oh! What a poor mother.”","“Let’s read the next message.” The host continued to read, “I’m a shop owner of an agency shop for a middle-size mystical realm workshop in the Morning Light Empire. I’m going crazy lately. The big workshops like the Dulan Workshop and Lava Workshop are fine, but smaller ones such as my shop have been getting less and less business lately! This foreign agency shop has driven us to despair! Our customers say that our mystical realms are not good enough. But my goodness, how can our mystical realm workshop make better products if we can’t make more money?!”","The next message read, “My companions and I have always believed in the God of Radiant Light Judgement. But recently, one of them changed his faith to the Holy Light! My goodness! One of the citizens in our faithful nation changed his faith!”","At this moment, even Peable, who was sitting next to Master Auth, opened his mouth.","Peable said, “I think the other issues are not as severe as the one we’re talking about right now.”","“Right,” Master Auth said, “A master alchemist friend in my workplace once predicted that the foreign workshops’ novel and fun methods of attracting customers would have a huge impact on the small to mid-size mystical realm workshops. The biggest impact is that these workshops might go bankrupt.”","“As everyone knows, many nations provided aid to the mystical realm workshops in their territory. If this situation continues, these nations will lose lots of money.”","“This is a disguised method of weakening their national power.”","“In the faithful nations, the people all have their own ancient faiths,” Peable said, “If they changed their faiths one day, are they still citizens of those nations?”","Master Auth said loudly, “Therefore, playing the so-called World of Warcraft and the Legend of Sword and Fairy is almost an act of treason!”","“Hiss?!”","“Playing World of Warcraft equals to treason?!” The audience on the White Pigeon Square was stupefied!","After listening to their conversation for a while, the audience found that this conclusion sounded logical!?","After the Dulan Workshop’s attempt to enter the Elf Clan, the elves had learned their lesson and would occasionally watch the news about the mystical realms in the human world.","At this moment, an old elf was also watching this program with some middle-aged and old elves.","The silver-haired and silver-bearded old elf suddenly shook, and he blinked as if he was still dazed. “Treason...?!”","One of our elders is taking a team to play this so-called World of Warcraft!! Does it mean...!!??","...","The sun gradually set, and a few returning birds flew across the darkening sky.","The program on the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection at the White Pigeon Square finally ended.","Of course, apart from the White Pigeon Square, there were many other broadcasting spots in other nations.","At this moment, Peable walked out of the recording hall and warmly shook hands with the masters. “Your opinions are very valuable. It was a great decision to invite you guys to this program!”","“Mr. Peable, don’t worry,” Master Auth said, “We are the most professional and authoritative names in this field.”","“Master Auth has studied this area for dozens of years. Before that, he had studied areas related to alchemy,” beside them, Master Lywood said with a smile.","“Master Lywood is not inferior. A while ago, he published the Theory of Gold and Rock which caused a great sensation in the world of alchemy.”","“Hahahahaha...”","...","Meanwhile, the elves and knights in the shop were still oblivious of the comments claiming that playing games in Origins Internet Café was treason.","The elves were standing around the counter with eagerness in their eyes. “Sir! When will Outlast be released?!”","“Um...” Mr. Fang touched his head. “Tomorrow... maybe...”","Mr. Fang had been receiving devilish training from the System on and off, but...","I can only say that I’m doing my best!"]},{"number":721,"title":"Chapter 721 - Welcome to Mount Massive Asylum","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The customers in the old shops such as Zong Wu and Gu Tingyun in the Yuanyang City Shop, Su Tianji and Song Qingfeng in the Jiuhua City Shop, and Ning Bi in the Half City shop also showed great attention to the new game.","Of course, their focus was different from the newbies in the new shop.","In the early morning when Mr. Fang opened the door of the shop, the players of the new shop, including the assassins such as Elina and elves such as Sala, immediately asked upon entering, “Sir, is Outlast released? When would we get to play it?”","Meanwhile, the customers in the old shops sent Mr. Fang messages while they walked to the counter, [Sir, is Outlast released or not? When will the players in the new shop get to play it?]","[I say... why are you guys asking if others are playing the game!?] They were so diligent that they asked Mr. Fang the same question every day.","“...”","...","In the new shop, most of the players were still playing World of Warcraft, but some players were waiting to try new stuff.","After all, there were many leisure players in online games. Now that the earliest players had reached the maximum level, Sala and other players like her just followed her teammates and obtained the first victory in battlegrounds each day before going around to see the scenery. Therefore, these people had lots of time to do stuff.","Naturally, such players wanted to try the new game.","“Outlast...?” Mr. Fang looked more confident today. “It’s released! It’s released today!”","“Really?!” Sala exclaimed.","Mr. Fang knocked on the small blackboard, and Sala followed the direction that his finger pointed and saw the words. [New Game ‘Outlast’. Activation price: 15 magic crystals.]","“Then, can we play it now?” Sala said in pleasant surprise, “Then, I’ll go and activate it right away! Would you please pour a mug of Cappuccino for me?”","“Just play the game. Do you have to have Cappuccino...”","“Why not?! Don’t mind me!” While rolling her eyes at Mr. Fang, Sala looked quite proud. “I just like it!”","“Okay! Okay! Okay!”","Anyway, I’m making money from this.","Mr. Fang wanted to drink Cappuccino as well, so he took the opportunity to pour himself a mug.","At this moment, a group of elves and assassins sat down at the computers close to the windows in excitement. Sala took the mug of Cappuccino from Mr. Fang and sipped it with enjoyment, cheerfully activating the new game with the money deposited in her membership card.","“Nana, would you like to play it with me?” Sala asked Elina who sat across from her.","“It seems like we can’t connect the game?” Elina said while loading the game, “We can play it separately and talk about it when we get some inspirations.”","“Okay!” Sala entered the game cheerfully.","After all, Sala wasn’t even afraid of the evil god. After her experience with ‘The Avengers’, she felt quite confident when she entered Outlast.","Before Sala was a dim and messy room, which was the background when she entered the game. On the screen were options such as [New Game] and [Load Game] drawn in pale lines.","Different from the original game, the system version only offered two difficulty levels after players entered the game. One was [Nightmare] which was the normal difficulty, and the other was [Insane] which was a higher difficulty level.","At the beginning, the word ‘Insane’ was grey, which meant that the players could only choose ‘Nightmare’.","In Insane Mode, the chapters couldn’t be saved before they were completed. Once the players were dead, all the progress would vanish, and they had to start from the beginning.","Naturally, this mode wasn’t open for newbies to try.","In the original game, when the players entered it, the game would introduce the main character and the background in words.","However, the system version was different. After Sala entered the game, she opened her eyes slowly as if she had just woken from a dream in which she had turned into an elf in a world named the Nora Continent and had lived a long time in there. Now that she had woken up from the dream, she remembered that she was, in fact, a journalist named Miles.","Yes, this feeling was so real that Sala got the illusion that the real world was fake, and this game world was real.","Even after the players entered the game, they would still have a blurry sense of surrealism when they recalled things that they had experienced in the real world.","In the game, players even had the illusion that the whole world was materialistic, and the intangible things such as magic spells, essence, and combat techniques were exaggerated products of movies and TV series.","It was because the players’ minds were influenced by the main character.","In the game, Sala opened her eyes slowly and thought, “I’m now... Miles? A journalist? I have a plan to reveal the dark core secrets of that Mount Massive Asylum?”","Shaking her head, Sala finally remembered that this was a virtual reality gaming space and that exiting the game would get her back to the real world.","After she understood the situation, the game finally began.","When she drove to the destination, it was midnight.","Of course, to save game time, the driving part could be skipped. Right now, Sala was driving on the mountainous road near the destination.","The surroundings were pitch-black, as if she was driving in a wildness in midnight.","Even with the headlights on, she could only see a few meters before her. Beyond that was thick darkness.","She continued driving as if she was heading into the endless darkness.","After a long while, she finally saw lights at the end of the mud road.","Yes, in this role-playing game, Sala played as a western journalist who always dreamt of finding a big story.","“Have you guys entered the game yet?” Sala asked while driving.","Since the main character could drive, Sala could do the driving part by following the memories of the character, just as the players did in the offline mode of Grand Theft Auto 5. Since it was night, she drove slowly and thus encountered no accidents.","“I’ve already driven to the asylum now!” Elina said, “But isn’t the game named Outlast? I’ve covered a big distance now and seen no danger at all!”","After driving through the open iron gates outside the hospital, the main character parked the car and walked in curiously with a video camera that was taken out from the car.","It was very dark, and no one seemed to be in the hospital. In the places without lighting, she could only see the surroundings with the night vision of the video camera.","Walking in from the side door, the main character saw all kinds of greeneries along the curving corridor. The high building in front of her looked like a modern-styled castle.","Of course, this was only a relatively old hospital.","“Should we try that livestream?” Sala suggested.","Although the livestream software had just been released in the new shop, with their knowledge of the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection which was popular on this continent, these people knew that they could show off their gameplay more clearly this way."]},{"number":722,"title":"Chapter 722 - How Come You Slid Under the Desk During Your Livestream?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","In the distant mountains of Colorado, Mount Massive Asylum was a psychiatric hospital that had reopened after a long period of desertion. However, after the hospital was reopened, many mysteries and horrifying things were rumored to have happened in it.","The hospital was owned and operated by the multinational corporation Murkoff under the disguise of a charitable organization.","It had been operating in secret. Upon receiving a tip-off from an anonymous source inside his hospital, freelance journalist Miles Upshur came here to disclose the criminal conduct of this company with his video camera. The players were in the role of this brave journalist in the game.","This was the general plot of Outlast.","“Oh! I saw that several new streamers are livestreaming Outlast!” In the Yuanyang City Shop, some players had experienced the horror in Silent Hill. Those who hadn’t played it had heard of this extremely horrifying game from other players.","So, when they found that Outlast was a game of the same kind, they didn’t enter it as soon as it was released.","Instead, they wanted to see if other players played it and planned to watch the livestream of the game first.","Among the students of Heavenly Academy, Mu Qing was one such player.","Soon, many other students such as Yue Bai and Tang Yu also looked over. “Someone’s livestreaming it!?”","“I’ll watch it!”","At this moment, with a bottle of iced red tea in one hand and her communication jade in the other, Su Tianji was sitting on the spiritual ship that was flying toward Jiuhua City.","While sipping iced red tea, she browsed the messages in the communication jade.","“Master! Master!” Holding a communication jade, her disciple Fenghua yelled, “Here! An elf is livestreaming Outlast!”","“There is more than one of them!” The other disciple Yuexin shrieked, “Many elves are livestreaming Outlast!”","“Let me see...!” Su Tianji immediately clicked on her communication jade.","Then, she randomly clicked on one link and saw it was indeed an elf. “This elf looks familiar. I’ll watch her then.”","Besides these people, many other players in the old shops were watching the livestreams too. Sala only livestreamed for a little while and found that there were hundreds of people watching her right now.","“Ya... so many people?”","“As an elf with a sense of justice, I must stop the villains from doing evil things here,” Sala yelled with indignation while controlling the main character to walk deeper into the hospital. “I shall disclose the evil going on in this place. We’ll enter this place and see what’s inside.”","With that said, she walked directly toward the main gate.","After entering through the big iron gates of the walled property, she found that door of the hospital was closed.","“Let’s enter through the door,” Sala explained to her audience as she pushed the door.","Clank! Clank! Clank!","“Is anyone in there?” Sala controlled the main character to push the door, making clanking noises.","Sala pushed so much that her hands went numb. “Ugh...? I can’t push it open.”","She began to pull the door.","Clank! Clank! Clank!","She made huge sounds and she pounded on the door.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Everyone watched as the elf wildly pounded the door of the psychiatric hospital.","“What’s this elf doing here?” The audience were stupefied by the scene.","Oh! I must enter and use Musou! What’s happening?! Let me show off my skills!","Sala had imagined her fancy plans, but she couldn’t even open the door at this moment. She was extremely frustrated at this moment.","“No idea...”","“Now, we know that the main door can’t be open.” Seeming to realize that she had lost her composure due to her impatience to show off her skills, Sala immediately calmed down and said, “Then, we must find an entrance from the side...”","In some areas, this game was similar to Assassin’s Creed; climbing was one of them.","Of course, as an ordinary person, the main character couldn’t climb as well as the main characters in Assassins Creed. The main character here had to grab onto wooden frames on one side of the hospital to assist before being able to climb into the building through a window.","The room behind the window had been lit, but as soon as Sala jumped in, the light flashed twice and turned dark instantly.","Even the audience could see nothing but darkness on the screens.","The main character had sensed the thick darkness and ominous atmosphere that engulfed the whole place when driving here. Now, these negative presences seemed to have intensified.","At this moment, the ominous feeling and suffocating atmosphere were even more obvious.","“Oh... it’s so dark inside...” While sipping iced red tea, Su Tianji watched the livestream, thinking that it was a bit creepy in the building.","Standing in the room, Sala had a totally different feeling. Through the main character’s body, she could feel the darkness pressing on her like a pile of heavy and invisible rocks.","It would be no big deal if Sala imagined such a scenario during the day.","However, standing there at midnight, she felt chills running down her spine and couldn’t help but wonder if something would suddenly jump out from the deep darkness around her.","As an ordinary person, Miles could influence the players with his thoughts and senses.","The suffocating feeling forced Sala to draw in a deep breath. Then, she quickly turned on the video camera and checked the surroundings with the night vision.","Since the surroundings were so dark that one couldn’t see their own fingers without the video camera, the players had to observe the world through the video camera with night view mode.","Through the night view mode, everything was greyish-green like the creepy supernatural scenes in the old movies.","“How come I feel like something is not right...” While holding the video camera, Sala felt her way in the darkness and said to the audience in her livestream room.","But this main character...","His heart rate so fast that Sala could even hear the thumping heartbeats while an excruciating headache attacked her. Sala couldn’t decide if it was a result of the lack of oxygen caused by the high pressure that the main character felt or it was her own problem.","After inhaling deeply, she held her breath and exhaled slowly; she didn’t dare to exhale too fast to make noises.","In this state, she couldn’t use any of her combat strength even if she had it, let alone that she didn’t possess any combat strength at all in the game.","Creak!","Perhaps it was due to wind or other reasons, the narrow window closed by itself. In the silent room, the rattling noises made by the wind blowing on the air duct were especially ear-grating.","With the light coming from the hall through the glass window on the side of the room, Sala finally turned off her video camera.","The only exit for her was the half open door on her right.","“It seems like no one is here...” Sala told the audience and pushed open the door.","“Ahh!” The character on the screen jumped in fright.","A corpse hung before the main character upside down, and the light flashed twice.","Sipping iced red tea, Su Tianji watched the livestream and said, “Hahaha! This elf is so fun to watch. She jumps when she is scared.”","“Hu...” Seeing that it was a corpse, Sala heaved out a breath of relief. “It gave me such a fright!”","“Um...” Hurriedly, she explained to the audience, “This is nothing. Hehehe... let’s move on.”","She hadn’t shown off her skills yet!","Controlling the main character, Sala ventured deeper inside.","Walking down the path through the rooms, she walked to the other side of the corridor. The atmosphere felt even creepier. She seemed to hear someone talk around the corner at the end of the corridor, but when she walked over, no one was there.","The path before her was blocked by a desk and a wooden shelf, but she could squeeze through by walking sideways.","“This game looks simple, ha!” Sala said while slowly squeezing through the crevice between the bookshelf and the desk.","At this moment, she felt that a cold hand grabbed her shoulder!","She turned her head and saw a fat and nightmarishly distorted face.","Before she could have a clear look, her body broke through the window behind her and flew out of it which was several floors high.","“Ahh! Ahhh!” In a flash, Sala exited from virtual reality mode. While putting down her virtual reality headset, she stood up and slipped.","At this moment, most of the players in the internet cafe were all in the games, and a few players were walking past in the corridor with bowls of instant noodles in their hands.","Suddenly, they heard a scream.","Clank! A noise sounded.","Everyone looked over, and they saw an elf getting up from under the desk and looking at the people around her in confusion. Dust was all over her hair and face. “...”","“What... how come you slid under the desk while livestreaming?”"]},{"number":723,"title":"Chapter 723 - Continue the Livestream; I Have Had Special Training on Survival Skills!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Huh? Where’s that elf?” Yue Bai and other students were also watching Sala’s livestream.","Mu Qing ate some potato chips and said, “It seemed like the elf vanished in a flash.”","At this moment, in the camera of the livestream room, they saw a confused elf sticking out her head from below.","“Um... I just slipped! Slipped!” With a red face, Sala returned to her computer chair and explained with great dignity and a please-believe-me look.","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang was chatting in a group chat in QQ with a bowl of instant noodles in his hands.","[I stood behind an elf and watched her play Outlast. I lowered my head to eat noodles, and when I looked up, she had fallen under the desk.]","“Pu!” Su Tianji who was also watching Sala’s livestream almost had a spit-take when this message suddenly popped up. [So dumb and cute. Hahahaha!]","[I was watching it too. Hahahaha (^_^). She was squeezing through a bookshelf when a fat guy jumped her.] Yue Bai also quickly posted a message in the group. [Then, she vanished from the camera. Now I know that she slid under the desk!]","Sala had just snapped back to her senses, and she glanced at the messages in her livestream room.","[Elder Su sent you 666 goose eggs.]","[Young Master Song gifted you 10 ‘Awesome’.]","[Ji Yang of Royal Clan Guild gifted...]","“Huh... So many people sent gifts to me...?” This was Sala’s first livestream, and she felt incredulous.","“Sala, where are you now?” Elina who was sitting across from her asked.","“Someone just threw me down the building. He suddenly appeared while I was squeezing through the crack and couldn’t run away. It scared me!” At this moment, Sala hadn’t re-entered the game yet.","“You were caught off guard by his sudden appearance, right?” Elina said, “You didn’t have any warning.”","However, as an assassin, Elina’s mind was stronger than Sala’s.","“Nana, are you still in the game?” Sala asked in a hurry.","“I am.”","“Really?” Sala replied and wasn’t willing to admit defeat. “Then, I’ll play some more. That guy wasn’t so scary; he just caught me off guard.”","“Right. Don’t be paranoid!” Elina said while playing the game, “I’ll find a good weapon and show you how to fight!”","“Ya! You’re so good!” Sala looked at Elina in surprise.","Since these two sat facing each other, Sala couldn’t see Elina’s screen.","At this moment, on Elina’s screen, she was filming her surroundings with the video camera. “...Huh? It’s a dead end...”","She looked for a long while until she discovered something above her. “So, there is a vent that I can get in to... No one has tried to throw me down yet... I haven’t seen him. All I saw were dead bodies...”","...","– At this moment –","“Nana isn’t afraid at all?” Sala sat straighter. “Okay, we’ll continue the livestream.”","As an elf with the sense of justice, I can’t stop until I reveal all the criminal acts in here!","“Hey! This elf is continuing with her livestream!” The audience continued to watch cheerfully.","...","After entering the game again, Sala felt as if all the bones in her body would dislocate.","However, the main character was lucky that he didn’t die of the fall or even break any bones.","However, the main character’s internal organs had obviously received shocks and damage; he felt dizzy with ringing in his ears and was listless.","A priest suddenly appeared, mumbling something unintelligible. He gave the main character an injection which made the latter feel better.","Of course, one injection couldn’t heal all the injuries caused by the fall from several floors high; his physical conditions were obviously not good.","If you were in your physical prime, you wouldn’t feel very frightened when you ventured into a dangerous place. However, if you almost died from a fall and was greatly weakened by it, it wasn’t hard to imagine how you would feel in such an extremely dangerous place.","This weak feeling, both physically and mentally, also reflected on the player.","Obviously, the main task of the game had changed.","The main character had come here to do an investigation, but now his task was fleeing from this place.","At this moment, Sala felt like her body was as heavy as lead. “How can I continue the game like this?!”","She wanted to quit from the game!","The game was totally different from what she had imagined. She was not only an ordinary person but was severely injured. How can I use Musou in such a state?!","In such a state, even a legendary saint level master would probably be knocked down by an ordinary person with a club.","The most important thing was that Sala’s head felt dizzy while her body felt numb. She would feel better if she was in a healthy state; at least she would know what to do and would have the energy to dodge and attack.","But now...","“I feel like I had the ability to fight that monster before I fell.” While panting, Sala opened her mouth and explained, “In fact, I’m not so faint-hearted. You guys must trust me. Before I fell, I had the ability to fight that monster.”","But now...","“Let’s see how I can get out of this place...” Obviously, this hospital was fully enclosed. Now that she fell from upstairs, she lost her chance to go back the way she came.","In the enclosed lobby and rooms, only a few places had lights and got rid of darkness. However, the areas around the dimly-lit places were still pitch-black, looking even darker due to the effects of the lights.","Walking through the corridor on one side of the lobby, Sala saw bloodstains everywhere and even headless corpses.","“This one... must be dead?” Sala swallowed with difficulty, feeling dizzy due to her poor physical conditions. “It can’t get up again, right?”","While sipping iced red tea, Su Tianji posted a bullet comment, [This kind of game released by this shop is all scary.]","Tang Yu said, [I think this elf is faint-hearted... I just saw another elf whose bolder than her.]","“Hey!” Sala was displeased at this bullet comment and demanded while slamming her hand on the desk, “I’m not afraid! It was just an accident!”","The message says that I’m faint-hearted and another elf is brave?!","That’s unbearable!","I must redeem myself! Otherwise, the players in the old shops will laugh at me!","While holding her breath, Sala tiptoed into the pitch-black room and tried to find some clues, continuing with the game.","“In a while, I’ll show you how I get away from this place. This Outlast is just an escape game!”","Although the safest escape is killing all the enemies, but my physical conditions don’t allow me to do that. But still, I have had special trainings on survival skills!"]},{"number":724,"title":"Chapter 724 - A Large Group of Haters Are Arriving on the Battleground","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","In the early stage of Outlast, there were no supernatural phenomenons, but people in this place were all mentally-ill patients who had been tortured so hard that they were almost no longer humans. In other words, they were ‘monsters’.","Due to the failure of the experiments, these people’s appearances and thinking process all became different from ordinary people.","If you didn’t know that they were humans, you would think that they were monsters to begin with.","It would be best not to be caught by them. If you were caught by them, you might end up worse than in a supernatural phenomenon; you could never imagine what an unhinged half-human, half-monster being would do to you.","In the Yuanyang City Shop, the students were watching this elf’s livestream while eating potato chips.","On the screen, Sala bent down and sneaked into a control room.","[So lame.] Mu Qing crunched on potato chips and posted a bullet comment.","“I feel like she’s making herself into a ball and rolling forward.” Tang Yu and other students enjoyed this livestream very much.","On the screen, Sala’s ears perked up like those of a rabbit while she glanced around the room.","Seeing no danger, Sala said, “This must be the place, right?”","Then, she heaved a sigh of relief.","Next, Sala began to use the computer in the document room. Since the main character knew how to use computers, she had no problems logging into the computer and began unlocking the main gate.","“After I open the gate in this control room, I can get out, right? It feels so simple!” Sala said while she operated the computer.","At this moment, a creepy figure suddenly appeared on the surveillance monitor beside the computer.","“Ah-!” Her hand shook, and the mouse flew out of her hand.","Sala looked at the surveillance monitor and saw that the priest who had appeared after the main character fell from upstairs pulled down the power switch with a cracking sound.","The entire control room was instantly plunged into darkness. Meanwhile, the voice of the fat demon-like monster sounded outside the door.","In total darkness, Sala could tell that the footsteps were slowly moving toward this room.","There was no exit except for the door. Sala had nowhere else to go; she was trapped!","“Ah-!” Sala screamed inside, getting anxious in the room as she quickly walked around.","[There’s a locker behind you!]","[Hide in the locker!]","[Hahahaha! This elf is so afraid!]","[Hahahaha...]","[I think she’ll faint in fear!]","Enjoying the livestream, Su Tianji posted bullet comments and sipped iced red tea. Obviously, it wasn’t scary to experience the game through the screen.","“Master, do you think this elf will be caught?” Fenghua asked.","While the monster-like man broke down the door and entered the room, Sala instantly slipped into the locker behind her.","Through the slit on the locker and with the aid of the dim light outside the control room, Sala watched as the fat man searched the room and roared in a low voice, “You were here, right?”","Then, Sala saw the monster walking toward the locker that she was hiding in.","Clank! The locker next to the one that she was hiding in was opened.","This monster didn’t seem to find anything. Then, Sala heard a series of faint footsteps; it seemed like this man was walking toward her locker.","A drop of cold sweat slid down Sala’s face when she heard the footsteps getting closer.","[How about bursting out of the locker?] Someone tentatively suggested with a bullet comment.","[Right! Right! Right! If you burst out now, you will certainly catch him off guard!] The students in Yuanyang City Shop who were crunching away potato chips immediately posted bullet comments.","“Then, I will go out now...”","“I really mean it...”","Clank! Sala pushed open the door of the locker.","“Ahhhh-!” Then, she raced out as if her pants were on fire.","This elf was so fast that even the fat man who was about to open the locker door froze with his hand reaching out.","“Ahhhh-!” She vanished in a flash.","[My goodness...]","[Can this journalist run this fast...?!] The audience froze after seeing that.","...","While the audience enjoyed the livestream, something was happening in an alchemy room on the other side of the world.","Exquisite statues were placed around the alchemy room, and promotional posters of Forgotten Forest, the mystical realm made by the Crystal Workshop, were hung on the wall.","[It’s annoying...] Words jumped on the magic letter. [Lately, more and more people are beginning to sing high praise of Blizzard. I’m angry whenever I hear them bragging about the so-called Blizzard Workshop.]","[I’m furious. Yesterday, I bought a mystical realm made by the Crystal Workshop and was looked down by a player of World of Warcraft. What’s wrong with the mystical realm made by the Crystal Workshop? World of Warcraft has a complete world which seems endless; why would I want such a big mystical realm anyway?] – From Mage Delli of Stars Magic Union.","[How come their mystical realms are so good... Some players of the Legend of Sword and Fairy brag about it everyday in front of me. I can’t argue with them; all I can do say that they have a servile attitude to foreign things.]","[They even boast that it’s the origin of the world! Anyway, I trash talk Blizzard Workshop, Softstar Workshop, and Ubisoft Workshop everyday day since I feel annoyed whenever I see people using their mystical realms. Damn it! When I praised the new mystical realm of the Dulan Workshop last time, someone immediately rebutted me with the alleged Dulan Workshop’s failure in Silver Moon Forest. I was so furious! However, I just can’t argue with them; everything I say sounds weak.]","At this moment, a mage commented, [Didn’t you watch the last episode of Secrets of Mystical Realms? Master Auth and Master Lywood both expressed their opinions in the show, saying that the Legend of Sword and Fairy beautifies stealing since one of the female characters is a big thief. They even proved how playing World of Warcraft and the Legend of Sword and Fairy equals to treason!]","[What?!]","[Playing these games equals to treason?!] The mage who had been lounging on a recliner immediately bolted up as if he had just been given a shot of stimulant. He commented excitedly, [Well said! When did they say that? I want to watch it.]","[These are the conclusions that those masters made after thorough investigation and research.] The mage who previous commented replied.","Soon, many more messages appeared on the magic letter.","[Keep away from these mystical realms; masters issued warnings.]","[I’m astonished. Mystical realms’ quality doesn’t increase with the degree of complexity. Masters said that mystical realms need professionalism.]","[Masters said that using these mystical realms might be treason; let’s see if you’re using them.]","“...”","[My goodness...!] Instantly, these people felt like they stood on the moral high ground.","[Today, I’ll repost them all. Hahahaha! I feel like we are waging a holy war, Comrades!]","[Tell you a secret. I slipped into the magic forum of World of Warcraft, and I’m sure bedlam will break out when I post these messages in the forum.]","[Aren’t you afraid that they will beat you?]","[How can they? They don’t know where I am!]","[The problem is... these claims don’t have any supporting evidence.]","[I don’t care as long as they can give those people who love to brag a blow.]","[Hahahaha! Right! I’ll post them to all the people around me anonymously.] Mage Delli commented, [I know a damn kid near me who plays World of Warcraft and keeps bragging about it in front of me. Today, I’ll send these messages to his dad. Seeing this, I’m sure that his dad will give him a good beating when he brags about Blizzard again... Hahahaha!]","Meanwhile, in the distant Silver Moon Forest.","A silver-haired old elf read these messages and said, “These human masters seem to have solid data and facts...”","“Elder, should we go to the so-called Origins Internet Club with some people and see what Elder Sewell is up to?” Worked up by the word ‘treason’, these elves wanted to check things out with some people as if treason was being committed right now.","“Okay!”."]},{"number":725,"title":"Chapter 725 - Come and Play If You Dare! You Will Be Terrified!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Outside the game, the players might be masters with extremely high cultivation strength and combat abilities.","But in Outlast, the players were ordinary people who had fallen from a high place and had poor physical conditions. Even with great willpower, the best that they could do was fleeing since it was impossible to fight any monsters.","“All my preparations were in vain...” Sala felt like crying in the game. In the darkness, she filmed her surroundings with her video camera, clutching onto it like a precious treasure that her mom gave her.","Trying to survive and escape from so many monsters as an ordinary person who would have great difficulty catching a chicken, Sala felt like she was going crazy.","The most depressing part wasn’t being caught but listening to the footsteps of that fat monster while she hid in the darkness. When it came close to her hideout, her heart would always be in her throat.","Besides, whenever she was about to finish the quest and get out, the priest would always stop her at the critical moment, turning all the efforts to waste. Then, she had to continue her investigation in this extremely creepy place.","Having played for a few hours, Sala wondered, “How come this game is so scary?!”","In the beginning, Sala had marched up to the gate of the hospital without a care and pounded on the gate of the hospital. But now...","She felt like she was going crazy in this game!","At this moment, Sala’s movements seemed to have alerted the deranged inmate who was trapped in a chair. This man’s shouts attracted the attention of all the nearby inmates.","These monsters who had been crazily tortured and mutated in the experiments had stronger physiques than ordinary people.","“Ah-!” Seeing them smashing on the locked doors on both sides of the room and trying to break in, Sala was suffocating with fear.","Sala raced away while screaming.","“Hahahaha! This elf runs so fast.”","Sala thought, I almost died of fright; how can I not run fast?","“Which way should I go...?”","“I guess this way...!” Frantically, Sala pulled open a door and dashed inside.","“Who are you? You’re not one of them, right?” At this moment, an electronic voice came from an unknown source, “If you want to live, come into this small lift”","Sure enough, there was a very small lift which could have been mistaken as a chimney or an air duct if one didn’t look carefully.","Without thinking, Sala got into it.","In the next moment, a large group of deranged inmates knocked down the doors and swarmed in. Sala could even see them rushing toward her location before the lift went up.","With her heart in her throat, Sala thought that she was out of danger when the lift went up.","However, when Sala went up with the lift, a brawny monster swung out a punch and said, “You made the right decision, Sir.”","This monster’s skin on his upper body seemed to have been torn open to reveal bloody flesh, and the lower half of his distorted face was covered by filthy bandages.","“Ahh-!”","When Sala woke up again, she found herself locked in a wheelchair.","At this moment, Sala swiftly put down her virtual reality headset and looked at her screen as the main character got his fingers amputated.","“Ahh-!” Sala felt lucky that she had scrambled to exit the virtual reality mode in time! She was going to go crazy!","Then, without any bandages or any medication, the main character had to continue the rest of the exploration after two of his fingers were amputated.","It had been creepy to watch the two bloody amputated fingers while climbing in the original version of the game. Now in the system version, the players also had to endure everything that the main character felt, including blood loss while they continued the game...","I quit!","Without hesitation, Sala quitted from the game while her pretty face paled. She was thrown into a very bad mood.","The shop owner had been playing games at a nearby computer, and Sala dragged him over and pointed at her screen while saying, “Sir, how can I continue playing this game?!”","...","“F*ck...! This game, Outlast, is thrilling!” The players in the old shops obviously had a different feeling. After all, they had watched it on the screens.","The students of Heavenly Academy and the idle players in the Jiuhua City Shop didn’t play the game but had watched it on livestream for most of the day.","These people even talked about it in the group chat and had heated discussions.","[The elf whom I watched ran so fast. I watched her run all around the place.]","[Which one did you watch? I watched the elf with poisonous milk.] Even Sia of the Ultimate West Realm joined the discussion.","[What elf with poisonous milk?] Ning Bi asked in the group chat.","[Didn’t you see last time... the nanny that Mr. Fang took to raid the Scarlet Monastery?] Sia posted a screenshot.","[Hahahaha! These elves are all funny. I watched the elf who slid down the desk.] Demonic Woman Ning Bi also posted a screenshot.","Not knowing if she should laugh or cry, Yue Bai said, [I wonder if the elves will kill us if they knew...]","Mu Qing chimed in, [But I just can’t stop it. Hahaha...]","At this moment, Sala noticed that messages were popping up in her World of Warcraft group chat. While she read the messages in the group, her eyes instantly widened. “Ugh?!”","[Hey-!?]","[How come you guys even took screenshots?!] Sala wished that she could go over through the internet cable and kill them all, so no one would talk about her humiliating acts.","Everyone turned silent.","“...”","[How come this elf is in the group?!]","Nalan Mingxue replied, [She’s my playmate in the game (Husky’s disdainful face).]","Mr. Fang was standing beside Sala at this moment, and he tried to sooth her. [This is a horror game; it’s unnatural if you’re not scared.]","[I thought it was a comedy game-!] Sala had the sudden urge to kill the shop owner.","How come this shop does things so differently?! I braced myself to watch the so-called evil god and ended up laughing like a pig.","Now in this game, we were prepared to show off our fighting skills against these monsters who have low combat strength, but we ended up wetting our pants due to fear!","I even put the whole process on livestream!","“It’s all your fault!”","He’s a scummy shop owner!","“Um...” Mr. Fang touched his head and replied, “It has nothing to do with me... You guys kept asking me when Outlast would be released; you even trash-talked me as a scummy shop owner every day when I didn’t release this game...”","“It’s your fault! It’s all your fault!” Hearing the shop owner toss their own words back at them, Sala and the other elves were furious.","Hey! Don’t be like this!","Obviously not able to continue the game, many elves around Sala also put down their virtual reality headsets.","“Sir, is this mystic realm designed for people to play?!”","“Why isn’t it...?”","“Come and play if you dare!” The elves glared at Mr. Fang as if they would eat him alive!","Afraid that what they said didn’t hold enough weight, these elves added in a hurry, “Otherwise we won’t come back to the shop to play again! Humph!”","Of course, these elves amended silently, If the scummy shop owner refuses to do it, we’ll still come back and play the games despite the humiliation in the worst-case scenario.","In the other mystic realms, they could fight or flee using their skills. After some practice, they could manage by themselves.","But in this game, they couldn’t even use a sliver of their skills!","Despite their powerful strength and skills, they couldn’t bring any of them into the game; how could they finish the game?!."]},{"number":726,"title":"Chapter 726 - You Use Musou. Instead, You Show Us Hide-And-Seek?!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","When he was in the Jiuhua City Shop, Mr. Fang had played Silent Hill for a while.","Obviously, that game left a deep impression on the veteran players too.","At that time, Mr. Fang gave a moderate show in which he didn’t get lost, but he couldn’t show off any special plays.","In fact, some rumors even said that Mr. Fang was so scared afterwards that he was paralyzed by fear and couldn’t walk.","To get the desired effects, Sala even asked about it secretly in the group chat.","The responses were...","Su Tianji said, [Good idea! This will definitely scare the scummy shop owner senseless!]","Nalan Mingxue replied, [I think it can be done!]","Song Qingfeng chimed in, [Awesome! I like your idea!]","Therefore, these elves were confident with their request.","While staring at Mr. Fang with her big eyes, Sala asked him, “What about it? You’re afraid?”","“Afraid?!” Mr. Fang thought for a moment and said, “It’s just a game. There’s nothing to be afraid of.”","“Ha...?”","Nothing to be afraid of?! We thought so at the beginning of the game too!","“The shop owner must be bluffing,” Sala said in a low voice.","“Yeah. I asked in the group. He played a similar game before and was an average player...” Rowling agreed.","“Some rumors even said that he was paralyzed by fear and couldn’t walk in a while!”","“Humph! He will be scared witless this time!” Sala said.","That’s what he deserves for frightening us!","So many of us elves got scared; that’s despicable.","A group of elves stood behind Mr. Fang and watched him play in a hurry.","In addition...","“I’ll go buy a bag of potato chips,” Rowling said.","“I’ll get a box of spicy sticks!” Sala thought it would be great to eat snacks while watching the shop owner get scared.","“Bring me one box!” Elder Sewell said immediately, “One bag of potato chips too!”","With snacks in their hands, the elves brought over a bench so that they could sit behind Mr. Fang and watch him play. During the process, they contributed to the revenue of the shop.","Influenced by the elves, some assassins and even passersby also bought potato chips or other snacks. Soon, a large group of people stood behind Mr. Fang.","“Someone is playing this game again?”","“He will surely be scared to death...”","Obviously, the shop owner hadn’t come to the part of finger amputation since he had been standing behind Sala and watching the elves play for a long time in the morning.","In the early stage of the game, there were no supernatural phenomenon, but the fat monster was not only extremely strong but had great patience. Regardless of where or how far players had fled, he would catch up sooner or later.","In fact, this monster even waited for the main character in spots that he must pass.","The players would have to directly exit the game if the main character got punched by the monster. If he was caught, he would get his head pulled off his body.","At this moment, Mr. Fang had come to the part before encountering the ‘doctor’ who would amputate his fingers. The main character got upstairs again with great efforts but then was thrown to another zone of the lobby by the sudden explosion of the elevator.","From here, the main character could go to the sewer of the hospital. If he wanted to continue, he needed to open two valves in the sewer.","“Here he comes...” Sala said excitedly, “I was trapped and caught in this room several times!”","Sala ate a spicy stick with great enjoyment.","Mr. Fang ran all the way down the sewer. Hearing someone falling somewhere in front of him, he didn’t spare a glance at it and turned right, dashing into a side tunnel.","Mr. Fang explained while livestreaming, “At this time, we must run. When we run to this valve room, close the door and the valve.”","At this moment, all the players in old shops and the new shop were watching the livestream. Sala said smugly, “You’re trapping yourself inside, right?”","“Hahaha! You dug a grave for yourself.” Sala ate a mouthful of potato chips.","Then, Sala heard Mr. Fang continue to say, “Now, we have only one way out, and the monster is coming from that way. At this moment, we must keep calm since we can still do something here.”","Mr. Fang turned around and saw that there was only one lightbulb in the valve room, and it could only illuminate the area around the valve. The corner further away was pitch-black.","Mr. Fang squatted down in the darkest corner on the right of the entrance.","At this moment, the iron door of the valve room was crashed open.","“What would an ordinary person think right now? They would search for barriers such as lockers and chests which one could hide behind. You must keep calm and think from the opponent’s perspective and do the opposite, hiding in a place that he thinks no one would hide in.” Mr. Fang squatted in the corner and could see the fat man standing a few meters away from him without any barriers between them.","The fat monster looked around and saw darkness in the corner. Then, he walked toward the depths of the room where he thought people might hide in.","Then, Mr. Fang stood up calmly and slipped out the door.","“F*ck?!”","“He didn’t die?!”","The moment that the fat monster moved, Mr. Fang slipped out silently and opened the second valve.","When the fat monster caught up, Mr. Fang slipped into the tunnel on one side of the sewer while he just heard the clanking noises of iron chains.","The sewer area was very big, and most of the place was in the darkness. After dodging the pursuit of the fat monster at the second valve, the main character came to the last zone.","At this place, the monster must be waiting for the main character in a spot ahead of him. It was all dark, and the players couldn’t even see where the monster was.","Mr. Fang said, “In the sewer, we can’t jump around or run. Since you don’t know his whereabouts, and he doesn’t know yours, the person who makes noises will be detected first since you would expose yourself.”","It must be noted that the video camera’s night vision function would emit dim light, which in the system version would also increase the possibility of being detected by the enemy.","Therefore, the players could use it for a quick look at the distance in the darkness, but they would be exposed if they used it near the enemy.","Mr. Fang used the night vision to take a quick look. Sure enough, the fat monster was waiting for him on the path ahead.","Mr. Fang didn’t go up until the monster went to one side to scout.","However, Mr. Fang couldn’t avoid making a sound when he stepped on the metal plate on the bank. Soon, he heard a series of noises closing in toward him as iron chains collided.","In the darkness, Mr. Fang opened the night vision on his video camera, raced to the stairs at the entrance of the sewer, and climbed out.","“F*ck...”","“So easy?!”","The audience felt like they were not watching a horror game.","You’re playing hide-and-seek?!","The audience spoke from the perspective of the fat monster and flooded the scene with bullet comments.","[Fatty: Damn it! I didn’t even see him in the whole game. Am I playing with a ghost?]","[Fatty: The director told me to act with him in the sewer...??? Where is he?]","[Am I still a monster? Can’t you show me some respect?]","[Is this really a horror game?]","[I think this game should change its name to Assassin’s Creed: Hide-and-Seek...]","“Can we play like this...?” Sala and other elves had tears on their faces, thinking, I don’t think you can show us the Musou, but in turn, you are showing us your hide-and-seek skills?!","“I think this is fun...” Su Tianji ate some potato chips, thinking that she might try the game later.","As the game went on, the supernatural phenomenon that was absent in the early stages of the game began to reveal the truth hidden in the story."]},{"number":727,"title":"Chapter 727 - The Daily Life of Haters","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","After watching yesterday’s livestream, the elves entered the shop as soon as it opened the next morning. “Sir, since the shop is open, you can continue playing Outlast now!”","“???” Mr. Fang looked at the elves in bafflement.","It’s early morning, and you guys have nothing to do but watch the livestream?","Helpless, Mr. Fang sat down before a computer and continued the livestream after eating some instant noodles.","“Huh? The shop owner is livestreaming again...?” In the old shops, at least half of the players had new communication jades, so it was more convenient for them to watch livestreams than the players in the new shop.","Some elders of Liuyun Daoist Palace and disciples of the Cloud Ocean Faction began to watch the livestream while having morning tea in the passenger spiritual boats to Jiuhua City.","“Huh... the Livestream is on again!”","Mr. Fang rarely livestreamed; he didn’t even livestream the massive game, World of Warcraft. Therefore, most of the players entered the livestream room and watched.","Meanwhile, on a street in Canglan City.","“Newspaper! Today’s newspaper!” A boy who was about 14 years old waved his arm and yelled on the street.","As an autumn leaf slowly landed on the ground in the morning breeze, this boy suddenly felt the air turning cold and murderous.","“Give me a copy.”","The boy turned his head and saw a group of elves walking in through the city gate.","The leader was a silver-bearded old man who was holding a silver staff with wood whisks.","This old man’s greyish-blue robe looked ordinary but was exquisitely made. On a closer look, one could even see exquisite embroidered leaf patterns which were the unique decorative patterns of the Elf Clan.","“Five copper coins.” The boy handed him today’s newspaper immediately.","Although mages and aristocratic knights communicated with magic letters or visual projections, this cheap and useful communication method was still popular.","“Today’s news is all here!”","One elf elder read the newspaper and said, “Elder, some humans are indeed saying that visiting the so-called Origins Internet Club equals treason. Look, the newspaper says that there are...”","He looked at the number printed on the newspaper and said, “There are hundreds of thousands of humans publicly criticizing the... um... Origins Internet Club.”","“Hurry up! Let’s go to this Origins Internet Club and see if Elder Sewell is in there!”","Although they didn’t believe it too much, the elves must give this issue proper attention!","Meanwhile, in the alchemy room that wasn’t very spacious, the stout mage dressed in a black mage’s robe looked excited while words appeared on the magic letter line after line. He seemed to be in a magic forum focusing on mystical realms.","Then, this mage re-opened a post named ‘Love the Legend of Sword and Fairy’, and under the post was a comment from him. [Are you referring to the mystical realm in which the heroine is a thief?]","[What? The heroine is a thief?]","[This mystical realm named ‘The Legend of Sword and Fairy’ has such an evil theme?]","[Is it true? I was planning to visit that shop and try it...]","“...”","Sure enough, this mage saw many people replying to this comment.","[Yeah. Not only is the heroine a thief, but one of the main characters is a traitor of his faction. Besides, someone tested the so-called artifact-making in the Legend of Sword and Fairy and found that it’s useless!]","[Remember, don’t trust the Legend of Sword and Fairy!]","“Hahahaha!” After replying to many comments, this mage cheerfully opened another article which was posted by himself. [Listing Ten Reasons Not to Play World of Warcraft.]","In the post, the mage quoted many professional comments of some ‘masters’.","Next to his post, there were other posts such as [Don’t Let Garbage Mystical Realms Mislead You in Aesthetics], [Holy Light Spell in World of Warcraft Mystical Realm Was Tested to Be Useless], and [Don’t Be Fooled by It]. These posts almost flooded the whole forum.","As a mage of the Royal Magic Union, Dicas bought a bowl of instant noodles this morning and began browsing this magic forum.","Suddenly, she saw the post titled [The Heroine of the Legend of Sword and Fairy Is a Thief? The Main Character Is a Traitor?!]","Han Lingsha used the proceeds that she took from the tomb to help the poor people! And why are they trashing Yun Tianhe?!","While reading these posts, Dicas replied furiously, [Have you played it? Don’t talk about things you don’t understand!]","How come they are hating on the game so blatantly?!","In the not-too-big alchemy room, the mage heard a beep. “Someone replied?”","Seeing Dicas’s reply, this mage sneered and replied, [Another traitor?]","He first tossed out the accusation without hesitation.","“Ahhya-!” Dicas was enraged when she saw this reply. She almost threw her Cappuccino onto the floor.","Dicas felt like crying in fury. As a member of the Royal Magic Union, she loved her nation, but someone dared to accuse her of treason?!","...","Meanwhile, in the distant Radiant Light Godly Nation.","Dressed in a bright-red priest’s robe, Peeble glanced at the many delicacies on the table and personally put food onto the plates of the masters with a smile. “This idea is excellent...!”","“Hahahaha!” Master Auth smiled and said proudly, “I’m one of the administers of the magic forum named Eye of Mystical Realms.”","“If any heated comments defending Blizzard Workshop and Softstar Workshop appear on it...”","While he spoke, Dicas was organizing words and had written hundreds of words on her magic letter; she was about to post her reply.","When she injected magic energy into the magic letter to begin the transmission process, words appeared on the letter, [Your commenting privilege has been locked.]","“!!!”","“Wayaaaa–!”","In the lounge area of Mr. Fang’s new shop, people saw a female mage wildly slammed her hands on the desk in fury.","How can they do this?!","...","At this moment, Mr. Fang was still livestreaming Outlast.","After the main character got his fingers cut off, the game became more difficult to play.","It was scary to face the bloody hands which were not treated with any medication. Besides, this condition further weakened the main character’s physical state in the game.","Before his fingers were amputated, the main character still had some strength to fight with the deranged monsters, but now he lost all abilities to even struggle.","The main character’s body could even turn cold due to the loss of blood.","It meant that the main character couldn’t last long in this state.","Mr. Fang was still calm in the game, but he began to pant when he spoke due to his poor physical conditions. “When we flee from the deranged doctor, we must close the door behind us since this act will earn us a lot of time.”","Then, Mr. Fang ran to get the keys to the elevator. After all, the elevators in the hospital needed keys to operate. The moment that the main character entered the elevator, the doctor caught up. Obviously, the doctor knew the terrain and anticipated the escape route of the main character.","The main character tried to push the doctor out but obviously was too weak to do that.","When the doctor got half of his body into the elevator, it began to move!","“My goodness!”","“Ahh! Killer elevator! Another killer elevator!” Sala obviously remembered how she had died from the fall in Undercity.","After the doctor died, rain began to pour outside the hospital.","The ominous presence got thicker in the darkness while the whole atmosphere of the game felt even creepier. It felt like something was trying to crawl out from the gloomy darkness."]},{"number":728,"title":"Chapter 728 - The Ending of Outlast (I)","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","If the first half of Outlast was only crazy, then the second half truly turned weird.","After escaping to the courtyard inside the hospital, chilly rain poured on the main character, sending shivers to the elves who were watching from behind. They felt cold just watching it.","There was almost no light outside, and the occasional lightning flashes illuminated the flowerbed in front of the main character.","“Now, we should search the surrounding area,” Mr. Fang said on the livestream, and he soon found a key in the room on his left.","The dim lights in the distance showed that there seemed to be a door.","It looked like the exit from this endless dark abyss.","Mr. Fang ran over, opened the door, and finally got inside before seeing some lights.","However, the lights were limited to the corridors on the outside. When the main character ventured further inside, he was plunged into endless darkness again as if he was swallowed by it.","On the screen, there was nothing but darkness. Fang Qi opened the night vision mode of the video camera and felt his way in the darkness. Faintly, he saw a door on his right.","At this moment, Sala, other elves, and students of Heavenly Academy were still watching the livestream while eating potato chips or spicy sticks.","In the Yuanyang City Shop, Yue Bai, Mu Qing, and other students sat in a circle on the couches and watched it on their communication jades.","At this moment, Gu Tingyun and others walked in from the outside.","On Mr. Fang’s screen, he pushed open the door and entered.","Suddenly, through the night vision of the video camera, Fang Qi saw an extremely creepy figure floating from the depths of the corridor outside the door and coming before him in the blink of an eye!","“Ahhh-!”","The elves who were watching the livestream behind Fang Qi almost huddled together in fear.","Startled, Mu Qing’s hand shook, and she threw out her communication jade.","Gu Tingyun had just pushed the door open and entered the shop at this moment.","Thud!","A communication jade hit his head.","“...”","Mu Qing was at a loss for words.","...","When Mu Qing looked back at the screen...","“Huh? Nothing happened?”","At this moment, she saw that Mr. Fang had walked out from the corridor, climbed up a wall, and moved forward while staying close to the wall.","“Now, we will jump down. Do you hear the sounds of iron chains? Fatty is coming after us. Now, squat down and move forward close to the wall under the cover of the grass; we must not let him see us.” In the system version, everything was more real, which meant that the main character couldn’t even run in his current physical state.","“Do you hear the sounds around the corner?” Mr. Fang continued, “Not able to find us, the monster will wait for us on the only route that we can take since it knows that we must go and find that Priest Martin. Now, we’ll retreat a bit first.”","Priest Martin was the only relatively normal person whom the main character had met in Outlast. On the one hand, he stopped the main character from getting out. On the other hand, he was directing the main character to the truth step by step.","Sure enough, the audience saw the Fatty walking out from the corner.","On the screen, Mr. Fang hid in the grass and aimed his video camera at the Fatty. The fat demon-like monster looked around and didn’t see the main character.","The audience sent funny bullet comments and filled the scene.","[Hahahaha! Awesome!]","[Fatty: Where are you? I’m so afraid...]","[Mr. Fang: I’m observing you discreetly.]","[Fatty: I was sent here to chase after him, but I see no trace of him in the whole game!]","“...”","“Hahaha! The bullet comments are so funny.” The elves almost choked with laughter.","...","The main character continued to explore and finally got to the deepest spot underground through the elevator.","The elevator went down more than ten floors underground when it finally stopped.","At this moment, the gaming environment changed to a tunnel made of white rocks.","Obviously, these were rocks in the depths of the ground.","At the end of the rock tunnel, the audience saw a huge underground laboratory.","The lab in the depths of the ground wasn’t dark; the lights were on. However, there wasn’t even a single living being in it.","There were only corpses in twisted forms, making this place creepier than anywhere else.","Even with the lights on, it looked gloomy and chilly.","The elves held their breath as they watched the main character venture deeper into the lab.","Suddenly, a black shadow flashed past the corner of the tunnel.","Without thinking, Fang Qi controlled the main character to turn and run.","A black shadow ran after the main character at a greater speed.","Through the screen, the audience could hear the main character’s heavy breathing while he ran desperately. It felt like one touch of that shadow would bring extremely horrifying results.","The main character raced all the way back. The moment that he opened the door, he saw a fat demon-like face.","“Ahh-!” The sudden sight startled the audience.","Then, a huge hand caught the main character and threw him down heavily.","At this moment, the screen turned blurry.","Just as this demon-like fat monster was about to attack the main character again, it was suddenly pulled up into the air by an invisible force.","Then, he was viciously thrown onto the wall.","The Fatty’s body, which was hard to injure with sabers or swords, now looked defenseless. The Fatty howled and struggled while it seemed like this monster was lifted by something invisible and thrown onto the wall, ground, and ceiling like a ball.","Finally, this monster’s fat upper body was stuffed into the air duct and was chopped into pieces by the fan blades of the vent in the air duct.","It was extremely hard to imagine how the aluminum alloy vent fan, which could be easily bent by an adult’s punch, had chopped the Fatty’s iron-like body.","The monster didn’t have any ability to resist!","“My goodness!”","“What was that?!”","The elves who were watching from behind screamed.","It wasn’t that these elves had never seen ghosts before, but they had never seen any other ghosts so powerful before!","After the ghost left, the main character found the doctor who was kept alive on a breathing machine.","The answer to why the ghost didn’t kill the main character was revealed. The ghost was an entity with two consciousnesses, and one of which didn’t want to kill the main character. That was why the main character was safe in two of his encounters with the ghost even though the rest of the encounters meant certain death.","“There is a normal living being in this place...?!” The audience watched the scene incredulously.","“He takes care of me...” the doctor said, “He may think I’m his father. Do you know what this symbol represents?”","The doctor pushed his wheelchair to the strange symbol on the wall. “It warns of a nanohazard. nanoscopic machines, technology we have had for decades, but never mastered.”","“Turning the cells of human bodies into nanofactories. It’s the natural function of cells to produce molecules, but through psychosomatic direction, we engineered the precise molecules necessary. Mind over body. It was foolish and wrong to think we could control it. To use madmen to control something so strong.”","Yes, this wasn’t a ghost in the normal sense. It was a horrifying monster combined from technology and some supernatural things."]},{"number":729,"title":"Chapter 729 - The Ending of Outlast (II)","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“We achieved something like this in 1944. Those fascists thought it was spirits...” The doctor continued babbling. He also revealed the method to deal with this ghost.","Since the ghost couldn’t exist separately without a body, it needed a host, which was why it had two consciousnesses.","What the main character needed to do was to shut off the life-support system of its host, Billy.","A simple example would be in the ‘Wind and Cloud’ TV Series. In it, the Sword Saint’s physical body died first when he used Sword 23, and that was why he wasn’t able to kill Xiong Ba.","Now, the main character had to destroy the physical body of this ghost to kill it.","Usually, it wasn’t something that an ordinary man with severe injuries and poor physical conditions could do. However, since the ghost had two consciousnesses, and one of them was willing to help the main character despite its short periods of existence, this task wasn’t impossible to do.","Finally, Fang Qi controlled the main character to dodge the ghost’s attacks and shut down the life-support system of the host. The creepy black shadow pulled the main character up into the air and then threw him onto the ground heavily. During the process, its force was being weakened repeatedly.","In fact, its force was weakened to such a point that it could no longer sustain itself and looked vague.","At this moment, the elves were enjoying the livestream while eating spicy sticks.","Suddenly, the black shadow entered the main character’s body before it disintegrated!","With a shrill, helpless, and desperate scream, the horrifying black shadow entered his body!","After falling from several floors high several times, getting his fingers amputated, and enduring all the pain and fright for so long, this night felt like 100 years to the main character.","Another person might have become crazy long ago.","After this weird thing entered his body, the journalist named Miles was on the verge of mental collapse.","Everything was now meaningless, regardless if his intention was just that he wanted to disclose the criminal acts or that he wanted to dig out a big sensational news story.","The audience could see the main character’s sight becoming blurry on the screen as if his mind was breaking down. He still protected his video camera as if he wanted to bring the results of his hard work, even one bit of it, out to the world.","His sadness and disillusionment made everyone watching this scene sense a chill.","After picking up his video camera, Miles dragged his heavy body toward the gate slowly and painfully. He even fell to the ground several times.","At this moment, everyone watched as Miles finally got to the gate, and then the gate opened by itself. He faced dozens of black gun muzzles.","In between the soldiers, the professor who had told Miles the ‘truth’ was standing there.","Miles, the main character, was peppered by machine gun bullets.","“Why...?!” Hearing the screams through the screen and watching Miles’ eyes slowly close, everyone asked this question subconsciously.","After going through so many trials and tribulations and enduring so much pain, the main character still couldn’t escape death.","The players, who had experienced the horror and hardships in the game alongside the main character, understood his bitterness and resentment.","The truth was now obvious. The whole underground lab and the deranged inmates had been part of an experiment.","The experiment failed, and the ghost killed everyone in the lab. Now that the ghost was dead, the mercenaries who were moved here to deal with the ghost could enter the lab safely.","Of course, the secrets underground couldn’t be disclosed to the public.","“How can it end like this?!” Sala asked loudly.","The other elves who had played this game also had complicated feelings about the ending.","In the darkness, it seemed like only despair was left.","However, the audience seemed to hear another voice rise in the darkness. “My goodness.”","“You have become the host!”","When Miles’s body slowly fell down, a black shadow seemed to have gotten out of the ‘cocoon’ which was Miles’ body and evolved into a butterfly.","“My goodness!”","“What’s that?!”","The elves who were watching screamed again.","The screen dimmed again.","When the horrifying spiritual energy got freed from the restraint of body, gunshots and screams mingled in the darkness.","But this time, the screams came from the enemies.","All the living beings were annihilated.","...","After Mr. Fang finished the game, the elves stood behind him in a daze.","One elf froze with a spicy stick in her hand in mid-air; she forgot to put it into her mouth.","This was obviously a game to test the players’ spirit and will. In the last moment, when the main character’s spirit ascended, the players could feel the massive amount of spiritual energy which was so powerful that it could exist without a body, rule over every living being, and control everyone’s life.","Fang Qi could even feel the sharp growth in his spiritual energy!","No one noticed that Fang Qi’s eyes emitted bright glints that had never been there before, which seemed to be the result of the unusually horrifying spiritual energy.","“It ends like this...?”","“Then, is Miles dead or alive anyway...?”","“Is this entity Miles or the ghost?” Elder Sewell asked after watching the livestream.","“This game looks good...”","“What looks good?” At this moment, an ancient voice sounded from behind Elder Sewell.","“This game,” Elder Sewell said, “Should we continue with the game?”","“What game?” The ancient voice asked again.","“Outlast,” Elder Sewell pointed at the screen and said.","Huh...? This voice sounds so familiar? Elder Sewell furrowed her pretty brows and thought in bafflement.","“Why does this voice sound so familiar?” Captain Lance of the Snow Pigeon Team also asked.","Then, every elf in the area shook, and they turned their heads mechanically.","The elves were so scared that they looked as if they were looking at a ghost.","“First... First Elder!!??”","These elves’ minds turned blank. How come the First Elder is here?","Also, he caught us right in the middle of discussing a game...","Finished! We’re finished this time!","At this moment, it was clear that every customer in the shop noticed the disturbance.","They saw a silver-haired and silver-bearded old elf who was dressed in a pale-grey robe. Despite his old age, he looked dignified and grand while his hair and robe fluttered without wind moving them. He was flanked by elf elders and guards.","The trace of anger hidden in the depths of his deep eyes looked like lava that was moving at the bottom of a volcano. His horrifying presence felt as if a storm was coming, and it slapped toward the people in the area like surging waves, suffocating them all.","This old elf stood there like a holy spirit, and no one could look him directly.","The whole shop instantly fell silent.","We’re dead! We’re dead! The First Elder is going to lose his temper! The elves felt as if they were going crazy; they had never seen the First Elder lose his temper, but...","At this moment, a voice sounded.","Mr. Fang put down his virtual reality headset and asked, “Senior, are you here to get online?”","All the elves stared at Mr. Fang with their eyes wide-open.","!!??"]},{"number":730,"title":"Chapter 730 - The Burning Crusade and the Imminent War","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Senior... Are you here to get online...?!”","Do I look like someone who is here to get online!!??","The First Elder stared at Elder Sewell and the other elves as he said, “What are you doing here?!”","“Playing online,” Elder Sewell said uneasily, “It means using the mystical realms in the shop...”","“What’s so special about the mystical realms in this shop?” another elf elder said with a snort, “They are all humans’ mystical realms. Are they any different?”","“This mystical realm... is different,” Elder Sewell explained.","“How is it different? I’ve experienced all kinds of mystical realms. What new tricks can it have?!”","“This... is really different...” Sala said uneasily, “You’ll know the difference if you try it...”","“Really?” The First Elder looked at these elves suspiciously. Although he had heard about the theory of treason, he knew that it was just an accusation coming from some industries which were negatively affected by this shop.","However, he wondered what magic power these weird mystical realms had and why the elves came to cultivate in the mystical realm shop named Origins Internet Club everyday.","This was what he wanted to find out.","“Humph! Then, I’ll try it. Tell me how to use this mystical realm.” The silver-haired and silver-bearded elder pointed at the computer before him and said.","– Three hours later –","A shout rose in the shop, “I’m dead! Ah!”","Surrounded by a group of elves, an old elf exited from the mystical realm ashen-faced. “Hiss... this one is indeed different.”","“...” His whole face had turned dark.","...","– Three days later –","“First Elder, do you want to play World of Warcraft? This is fun!”","“First Elder, do you want to try the Legend of Sword and Fairy?! The scenery is superb!”","“First Elder, you might want to try Assassin’s Creed...”","Surrounded by a group of elves, the old elf felt dizzy. “You claim that this is fun and that is classic. Which one should I play then!?”","...","– One week later –","The knights of the Golden Griffin Knight Legion finally returned from their raid with the painting which portrayed the happy family of three.","Then, these people continued the quests that followed.","Among all paladin players in World of Warcraft, this reclusive old paladin was a great hero and one of the paladins from the legends. But in this story, he was only an ordinary father. On the one hand, he lived a reclusive life so that his son wouldn’t be burdened with his father who was accused of treason. On the other hand, he silently directed his son to advance on the right path. The story showed an old man’s love for his family.","At the end of the quest, this old man still couldn’t save his son. This old paladin whose Holy Light was stripped from him had to watch his son die among the Scarlet Crusade.","The reminiscent words of the young paladin as he lay in blood still resonated in the ears of the paladin players. “I always dreamed that my father stood proudly beside me and watched me join the Order of Knights. We fought with swarms of Scourge Legion and brought glory to the Alliance and Lordaeron...”","Something in the players’ hearts seemed to be stirred, and they gained a deeper understanding of Holy Light and glory.","This story began to spread to other players of World of Warcraft.","...","As their explorations went on, the players left footprints in Stratholme, Blackrock Depth, and Zul’Gurub...","The players yelled all through the night when they did the first raid of Molten Core, and they wrote the legendary chapter of slaying dragons in Blackwing Lair. Later, both Alliance and Horde players worked together and opened the Gates of Ahn’Qiraj...","Only one team passed the Naxxramas graveyard.","Now, one and a half years had passed since World of Warcraft was released...","Meanwhile, Dungeon Fighter Online was updated to the version with a maximum level of 70, and the players began to venture from Arad Continent to Empryean.","Of course, the most important thing was that many players had made many new friends in the past one and a half years.","...","Under the influence of the Judgement Godly Palace, every major mages’ forum kept trashing the Blizzard Workshop with passion, and some nations even banned games such as World of Warcraft. But still, there were new players entering the games. Meanwhile, since the Orc Kingdom wasn’t influenced by these hate comments and regulations, even though it was far away, the number of orc players rivaled that of human players from the nearby nations.","The Orc Kingdom had a architectural style totally different from that of the human nations. Their buildings looked coarser and full of strength.","The semi-tribe-like cities looked very special, and the city streets were just as prosperous as those human cities.","Rheinster was a powerful level 8 orc warrior. As an orc from the Lion Clan, he had a strong lion-man’s face, a giant body, and a straightforward personality.","He was a veteran player of World of Warcraft. He still remembered how Mr. Fang reprimanded him when he yelled too loudly while watching Rise of the Horde. It felt as if it had just happened yesterday.","As a veteran player in the shop, Rheinster had started using the communication jade which was said to be imported from the ‘East Continent’. While walking with other orcs on the street with this communication jade in hand, he always looked proud when he saw the passersby’s envious glances.","Right now, his communication jade showed a group chat in QQ named [Independent People’s Inn Guild Communication Group]. Since QQ had a translation function, these people could talk to each other without problems.","Ye Xiaoye of the Cloud Ocean Faction said, [Today, we will raid Naxxramas! Get there on time, guys!]","[Got it!]","[Got it!]","[Do you know that in our orc kingdom, playing World of Warcraft is a great honor!] It came from a player with the ID ‘Second Group’s Main Tank Rheinster’.","[I’m envious of you, Uncle Rheinster,] a mage with the ID ‘Lily’ said.","[Here is the latest news! The Burning Crusade – World of Warcraft max level 70! I just got it!] A cultivator with the ID ‘Bailang’ posted a short video in the group.","Obviously, he was a veteran player from the old shop.","[New version? Are we going on raids again?]","[Yeah.] Ye Xiaoye said, [The first group is arranged. Uncle Rheinster, please lead the second group.]","[Ok!] He posted an ‘Ok’ emoji.","“Hahaha! It feels so good to be with these young people! I feel energetic all the time!” Walking on the street in the Orc Kingdom, Rheinster laughed and said to his companions.","At this moment, the ground shook violently.","The land quaked as dark clouds covered the sky!","A black light shot across the air as if it was tearing open the sky.","Countless black birds filled the sky like sun-blocking dark clouds.","In the distant horizon, pitch-black waves swallowed the land and sky like a tsunami.","Also, people seemed to vaguely see meteorites falling to the ground.","Another huge noise sounded.","A communication jade dropped to the ground, still showing the virtual images of the Burning Crusade in which Illidan spread his demon wings and roared before falling into the depths of the abyss that appeared as the ground cracked."]},{"number":731,"title":"Chapter 731 - Small Game Warcraft, and the World’s Nightmare","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","At this moment, all the players in the new shop and the old shops were watching the new cinematics trailer.","By now, even some players in the new shop had begun using the new communication jades produced by Wuwei Daoist Alliance, so they could watch the trailer when they were not in the shop.","A group of elves gathered in the lounge area of the new shop, each with a communication jade in hand.","The sun had just risen, and the radiant lights shined through the morning clouds.","“I... have been prisoned for 10,000 years!” A deep voice sounded as thunder rumbled in the sky.","“I was then expelled from my homeland. Now, you dare to trespass my territory? You are seeking death!”","“Wow...!”","“Who’s this?” The assassins were also watching the trailer. Although they hadn’t seen the entity who just spoke, they felt like this being was lofty and grand after hearing it.","In the next scene, blue-skinned draeneis opened scrolls. The beautiful palace decorated with crystals glittered as if holy lights were flashing inside. This scene signaled that in the new version of the game, the Alliance would have a brand-new race.","Sunlight dyed the distant clouds golden. Under the red maple trees, the beautiful blood elves caressed the mana wyrms that seemed to be a little vague.","“Ya-! Blood elf!” Sala pointed at the elf who was wearing a bright-red priest’s robe in the virtual image and said, “Finally, I can choose blood elf now, right!?”","In the battleground, orc warriors swung their swords fiercely and fell as messy arrows shot them. Behind them, blood elf priests lifted their magic wands, and then Holy Light fell.","Elves almost screamed in elation, “Arise! My warriors!”","“Ahya! The Horde players can choose priest too?!”","...","Above the desolate land, the dark green clouds in the gloomy sky looked as if they would fall at any moment.","A demon sat on the top of a mountain. Then, it slowly stood up, revealing its powerful iron-like body.","“Who is this?!”","“It looks powerful...” Elina exclaimed while she watched this.","Other assassins were also enthralled by this trailer.","“This is Illidan!” Sala looked disdainful. “How come you don’t know it?”","“Ah? What one Egg? How come I don’t know this name?” The assassins looked puzzled. After all, they had also read the official novel and played the game.","How come only you know this name?","[TL Note: In Chinese, Illidan’s pronunciation sounds like ‘one egg’.]","In her communication jade, Sala dug out a screenshot of a small game named Warcraft. “This is a small game in Qzone. Other than Illidan, there are also Sylvanas and Arthas in the game!”","“Huh? We have such a game?!” Looking at the exquisitely-made little figures which were totally different from those in World of Warcraft which was a virtual reality remake, they asked, “Why isn’t it included in World of Warcraft?”","At this moment, Illidan leaped up into the clouds and spread out the demon wings. With the silver moonlight shining on the pitch-black demonic presence, he looked down proudly and said, “You are seeking death!”","“My goodness! This person looks powerful! Tell me how to play Warcraft that you just mentioned? Can we increase cultivation strength in this game too? I want to play it too!” Elina exclaimed.","“Um... it doesn’t increase your cultivation strength,” Sala said in embarrassment.","She was embarrassed to introduce others to a game that wouldn’t increase their cultivation strength.","“I don’t care! I want to play it even if it doesn’t increase my cultivation strength!” Elina waved her hand. “Does it tell us the things that this Illidan did in the past?”","“It does... This Warcraft is very simple.” Surprised that Elina still wanted to play the game without the benefits of increased cultivation strength, Sala immediately explained the small game named Warcraft to her.","“Different from World of Warcraft, Warcraft is played with the mouse... many of the stories are about events in World of Warcraft. But you can play this loading map. We now only have this one map called ‘loading map’ of ‘Midnight Pig Butcher’... this map is made by the shop owner.”","“How come the shop owner loves this kind of names?” Elina heard the name ‘loading map’ and found it to be quite strange.","“Where did you find this kind of stuff...?”","“New Snow told me,” Sala said, “There are many interesting small games in Qzone. There’re cartoon and anime too. I’m MT is super fun. Do you want to watch it?”","[TL Note: I’m MT is a popular Chinese Warcraft cartoon.]","“Oh... she’s one of your friends from the East Continent, right?” Elina asked with sudden understanding.","...","At this moment, the vast sky above the Orc Kingdom was terrifyingly gloomy.","Black ravens covered the sky and let out shrill screams as if they were announcing the arrival of death.","On the horizon, darkness oozed out from the crack in the sky.","The darkness spread out like ocean waves, swallowing the ground while it swarmed in this direction.","The ground tilted as if a huge monster was trying to tear open the ground and crawl out from the depths.","The ground was collapsing and sinking, and the defense magic arrays seemed to be useless.","At first, people only saw dark clouds covering the land. However, the clouds moved at a great speed, and only when they came before the city wall could people see that a horrifying army was inside the dark clouds!","The army was so huge that one couldn’t see the end of it in one glance. There were at least over 100,000 soldiers!","Among them were humans who didn’t belong to the East Continent or the West Continent, and there were also non-humans among them.","These soldiers had different facial features, but they all had one similarity. They all wore the same style of black armor and had cold and blood-thirsty eyes. They...","“They are the Shadow Legion...!? Shadow Legion!” As the ground shattered, the city walls collapsed while booming noises resonated in the sky. Countless ordinary orc soldiers who couldn’t fly fell from the city walls while screaming.","The prosperous orc city was instantly turned into a hell of death!","In this huge city, countless orcs who couldn’t fly were swallowed by cracks in the ground. When the huge earthquake stopped, the whole city was in shambles.","As far as eyes could see, there was not a single spot left intact.","According to legends, wherever this legion went, it would turn the place into scorched land of death. Once people found those planes that were invaded by the Shadow Legion, they only saw blazing sun and white bones buried in yellow sand, which were all the things left in those worlds.","Some people joined the legion due to fear, which was why there were all kinds of races among them, even including saint level human masters.","They were the nightmares of the world!"]},{"number":732,"title":"Chapter 732 - The Players Who Probably Won’t Go Online Again","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","In the desolate city, few people were left alive in the ruins.","“Wu...Wa! Dad! Mom!” A cute small orc with a bull head stood in the middle of the ruins and bawled, looking like a small lonely flower that was growing in the ruins; this flower was so weak that its tender stem would be broken by a gust of wind.","A hurricane appeared in the sky and knocked this small orc down, and his cries got louder.","A huge shadow slowly landed from the sky.","It was a huge demon-like dragon that was over ten meters long, and it had two horns on its head.","Crack!","A huge figure which looked like an iron tower got off from the dragon.","“Cackle...” This figure let out a series of gloomy and cold laughs while it lifted a huge sword.","Then, the sword slashed down heavily!","Boom!","The sword hacked open the ground and left a huge crack, but no blood dripped down.","“Huh...?” This figure looked up and saw a tall lion-man dragging the kid to the side.","“Anyone else alive?” Rheinster asked.","A few soldiers walked over and gathered around him.","Some of Rheinster’s orc companions climbed out of the shambles.","Before them, the 100,000 soldiers of the Shadow Legion looked like an ocean.","Looking at the knight who was riding the huge Shadow Dragon, Rheinster knew what force he was facing. He was facing the legendary existences that had only existed in the ancient prophecies and poems.","All the orcs looked horrified. However, despite their disbelief, they must force themselves to accept the fact before them.","These existences had returned from the legends!","“Shadow Demon Dragon? Death Lord... Dras?”","Beneath the rusty and decayed armor, the pair of eyes that appeared as deep as an abyss seemed to look through the void and into the ancient past. The cold gaze seemed to contain no human emotions.","...","“What’s going on today?” In Jiuhua City Shop, people were missing from not only Independent People’s Inn Guild but many other guilds as well.","Ye Xiaoye had been sending messages with her communication jade.","[Is anyone in the second group online today?]","“The main tank is missing! Several DPS players are not online either. What’s happening?!” Ye Xiaoye glanced at the time. “Didn’t we agree that we will raid at noon?”","At this moment, Ye Xiaoyue saw a message from a player with the ID ‘Professional Healer Paladin Elven’.","I’m not familiar with this guy. What does he want?","Ye Xiaoye remembered that they had added each other as friends when they played together with Royal Clan Guild, but they had never talked to each other.","She immediately clicked on the message and read it.","In the new shop, Commander Elven of the Golden Griffin Knight Legion looked anxious. [I heard that your main tank isn’t online either?]","[Are your people missing too?] Ye Xiaoye frowned.","[We have people missing from three groups.] Commander Elven replied with sweat on his head. [We are all here waiting for them.]","[What’s the situation? How come they are all missing. We agreed on the time...]","...","“Take everyone who can move out of here!” Rheinster roared.","The gaze before them was still cold as if it was telling these stupid orcs that none of them could leave!","“Mr. Rheinser, are your afraid of death?” one orc asked beside him.","“I am. But I have a daughter, and she is of the same age as this boy. She’s not in this city, but I hope that a warrior will bravely stand before her when she’s in a dangerous position as this one.”","Perhaps no one could block such a legion, and they would soon sweep across the whole world. But Rheinster hoped that some people could hold them off, even if it was only for a little while.","“Me too. I have a son,” the orc beside him said in a muffled voice.","Looking at the flood-like legion, the few orcs who survived the initial disaster charged forward instead of escaping.","“Shield wall!” With a ground-shaking roar, these orcs’ shields seemed to form a solid barrier standing before the black flood.","These orcs even saw a large number of enemies in black being sent flying!","Someone once asked them, “Do you want to be a coward for a life time or a hero for only a few seconds?”","Now, these orcs gave the best answer to the question.","They still remembered when they stood before their mentors, raised their arms, and made the oath with confusion yet great solemnity.","“Our shield never falls, and our will never vanquishes. Remember the lost fighters for ever while we chug down the spring of victory.”","“Heaven is on the left, and the warriors turn to the right.”","For one moment, the black flood was interrupted by them!","A horrifying rumbling noises sounded from their shields.","The huge force seemed to be able to send huge dragons flying.","“Roar! Roar!” With their hoarse roars, the last bit of blood was shed.","Meanwhile in the shop, some elves and assassins were watching the new anime called I’m MT.","Upbeat and deep singing sounded with the passionate tune: “My name is MT, and I have an iron-like body. I challenge, I dodge, I defend you with my body!","“Don’t be afraid, I’m still standing...","“Everyone says that tanks are powerful and hold the highest degree honor in the guilds...”","...","“I’m sorry, friends... Perhaps I can never be your main tank again in the future! Roar!”","“For the Orc Kingdom... For the people who we need to defend... For... the Horde...”","Rheinster leaned on his shield while his voice got fainter and fainter as if he had fallen asleep.","Blood flowed down the shield and onto the ground.","Perhaps these orcs were just tired and needed to rest.","The great army swallowed one orc city after another like a tsunami.","A huge catastrophe that no one had imagined swept across the whole Orc Kingdom and then spread toward the neighboring human kingdoms.","Wherever the black flood went, no living being could stand a chance.","“These humans... orcs always think that they are heroes.” Beside the demon dragon, a tall and thin figure said, “In fact, they can’t even take one strike from us. Their acts are insignificant, and no one will remember them after they die.”","This was one of the two figures that had first appeared in the Orc Kingdom. A tiny bit of its presence was as great as that of the horrifying saint level!","“Stupid!”","“Only people who believe in our god can live for eternity.”","“Our god once said that the war among gods is a war of faith. Except for the gods who made it clear that they are staying away from the war, everyone else is pawn...”","“Hehe... They are a bunch of pathetic ants.”","...","From this day on, some players of World and Warcraft never got online again."]},{"number":733,"title":"Chapter 733 - The Oath of Knights","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“How come the warriors in our guild are still offline today?” Sitting before her computer, Helen controlled her character and looked bored. “We agreed to raid...”","“They must be delayed by something,” another member of the Golden Griffin Knight Legion said.","Helen frowned since she felt like these warriors were straightforward people who would never go back on their words.","“Commander...”","“I can’t get through to them either.” Commander Elven seemed to be thinking about something.","“Ms. Helen, do you want to play this Warcraft? The shop owner made a new map named Wind and Cloud. They say it’s super fun!” Sala called on the other side of the shop, “We just need one more player!”","“Coming! Coming!” Helen exited the game and said to others, “Since we don’t have enough people and are waiting, I’ll go and play a round of Warcraft.”","“Uh-huh...” Commander Elven nodded, looking not as casual as usual as if he had something on his mind.","“Huh? Why do you look so absent-minded?” Sala had begun the game with other elves for a while now. Sitting at the computer desk in her Qzone, Helen clicked on her mouse abstractedly.","“I don’t know...” Helen moved the mouse aimlessly. “I feel a bit uneasy... Do you think that something happened to them?”","“...” Sala also felt uneasy, but she tried to soothe Helen, “Don’t worry. Didn’t you say that those warriors in your group are mercenaries in the Orc Kingdom’s Mercenary Union? Perhaps they received an urgent mission.”","“Right!” Helen nodded with force. “The business in the real world is more important.”","Since they came early each day, they liked to sit at computers close to the counter and thus were close to the entrance. Suddenly, they seemed to have felt some disturbance behind them.","They turned their heads and saw that people on the prosperous street outside the shop were swarming toward the direction of the White Pigeon Square.","“What’s happening?!” Helen suddenly froze.","She had never seen people look so anxious and panicky before. Although Mr. Fang’s shop was not in the core area where the high-level aristocrats lived, it was in one of the most prosperous zones in Canglan City.","Even a small aristocrat would be disciplined from youth to be composed and well-mannered, and these people would never scramble to run to a place with crowds in public.","“What the heck is happening?” Helen grew even more anxious.","“Should we follow them and check it out?” Sala suggested.","Before she could finish, some mercenaries had run out of the shop toward the crowds.","“Hurry! Let’s go and see what’s happening!” These people ran out of the shop, followed by the whole Golden Griffin Knight Legion, mages of Royal Magic Union, and other players.","On the White Pigeon Square, many humans in Canglan City gathered here. There were also some dwarves and elves.","“We will be playing an urgent announcement.” On the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection, there was a female mage who was wearing a white robe with a badge of Magic Communication Union pinned on her chest. “According to the latest news from the frontline that the Military Intelligence Department gathered, the Orc Kingdom and neighboring human nations are conquered. The enemies are still unknown for the time being.”","In the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection, the Long-Range Visual Projection Spell turned the visual to the sky above a city in the Orc Kingdom and showed that the previously prosperous city had been turned into a pitch-black scorched land. The cracked land and the ruins on it were a frightening sight.","“Our nation has entered the emergency war preparation status. All residents please get ready for the war that might come at any moment! The war might come at any moment!”","“This is Mountain Rock City!” someone in the crowd exclaimed, “One guy in our guild told us about it...”","The voice got fainter and fainter as if this person suddenly realized something.","Watching the scene on the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection, the knights of the Golden Griffin Knight Legion and many other players here suddenly felt their mind turning blank.","“How can it be...”","Loud discussions erupted in the crowds.","“May luck be with the people who are alive, and may peace be with the dead...”","A noble lady murmured.","However, they were outsiders and wouldn’t understand what this meant to some people here today.","Standing on the square in a daze, Helen felt like her whole body had turned numb while her mind was filled with the images of the warriors in her guild. She remembered that they even generously invited all the members of the guild to drink wheat wine after finishing their first raid.","She had never met some of them in the real world, but after many nights of yelling together and countless wipe-outs, these previous strangers had become comrades who had each other’s back on battlegrounds.","They promised that when they got offline last time...","“Didn’t you guys promise that we will raid together...?”","Helen’s tears gushed out without control.","Carrying a two-handed huge sword on his back, Commander Elven, a sedate middle-aged man, had never looked so bitter before.","His face paled a little as if he couldn’t bear the departure of his friends.","Together, they had conquered terrifying enemies one after another, but he had never imagined that these trusted teammates would fall in such a way.","“Commander...”","Seeing the helpless glances from the other knight in the legion and the lost gazes from other players, for some reason, he heard the oath resonating in his head.","“From now on, I’ll embrace Holy Light with my heart, protect the weak with my sword and shield, and vanquish evil with Holy Light. Humility, honesty, compassion, valor, justice, sacrifice, honor, and spirituality are the eight virtues that I’ll never forget. We’ll not fall as long as people need our protection!”","Perhaps it was only an oath that these paladin players had casually made in the virtual world, and they hadn’t taken it seriously.","But now, Elven suddenly understood that since he had chosen this class and took those words to heart, it meant that he agreed with the code in his mind.","Slowly, Elven drew out the two-handed big sword from his back and pierced this heavy sword that was close to the height of a person into the stone ground before him, making the ground seem like it was as soft as tofu.","“I, Commander Elven of Golden Griffin Knight Legion, here swear!","“If you’re still alive... I swear with the honor of paladin that I will defend you to the last moment...","“If...” Elven paused as if he was bracing himself for the worst possibility.","“Regardless who your enemies are, your enemies are my enemies!","“I’ll battle to the last moment in your place!","“I’m born for honor and die for glory. Like my sword, I’d rather break than bend!”","At this moment, all the paladins yelled hoarsely with red eyes, “I’m born for honor and die for glory. Like my sword, I’d rather break than bend!”"]},{"number":734,"title":"Chapter 734 - New System Task: Holy Light Miracle!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","In the crowds, a group of elves stood together.","As the race with the longest life span and most ancient history, the elves seemed to know something that others didn’t.","“First Elder... do you know something about it?” Looking at the knights who were roaring hoarsely with red eyes, Sala almost cried with them.","Although most of their good friends were from Jiuhua City, a few members of their guilds seemed to be missing.","Thinking of the disaster and the missing players, the players’ hearts sank.","“I heard of rumors about them when I was young...” The silver bearded and silver-haired First Elder of the Elf Clan said in a deep voice, “No one knows where they come from and what their purpose is. In every plane and every world that they went to, they destroyed all the living creatures.”","In the knowledge of people in the Nora Continent, this almost endlessly vast world was surrounded by many planes or worlds, including the smaller ones such as the Elf Royal Palace in Silver Moon Forest and the larger planes such as the Continent of Immortal Relics.","“They battled in plane after plane. Their leader is said to be an existence closest to a god. Only god’s miracles can hold them off.”","“We’ve been searching for the traces that they left in this world with the hope that we can stop them from bringing catastrophe to this world.”","The silver-haired and silver-bearded elf elder who was extremely old sighed, “Still, the inevitable came...”","The name ‘Shadow Legion’ might mean nothing to ordinary mercenaries and aristocrats, but it was a horrifying name for those who had access to the core secrets of the world.","Its most recent pillage caused the demise of the Avil Empire hundreds of years ago.","That empire was once a place full of sunshine, but now it was engulfed in darkness and became the headquarters of the Underground Council. Of course, with the expansion of the Brotherhood, many members of the Underground Council had joined the Brotherhood.","With red eyes, Elina said to the knights in a loud voice, “Please count us in!”","Meanwhile, in the Royal Magic Union in the Morning Light Empire.","Grand Mage Adolf wasn’t watching the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection with others on the square.","However, with his background, he had much more information about the current situation than all other people.","Before him was an ancient-looking magic crystal platform, and a pure and clear magic crystal ball was inlaid on it.","In the flowing magic lights, a layer of white mist appeared in the transparent crystal ball. Then, the mist revealed a scene that looked half-real and half-fantasy.","Countless black ravens soared in the pitch-black sky as if they were declaring death to everything they saw. Then, a huge dragon spread its wings which seemed to be able to block the whole sky.","Suddenly, Adolf shook violently and then spewed out a mouthful of blood!","The gaze in the sky was turning toward the direction of the area in the crystal ball where Adolf was looking at.","A hill-like figure wearing decayed armor was revealed in the endless dark clouds in the sky. It lifted its huge hand, and everything on the ground including the rocks, soil, city walls, and houses was suck up by a horrifying invisible force. Countless debris, houses, trees, and living creatures were lifted into the air by an unrivaled force. Then, the whole city was... shattered!","...","At this moment, in the distant Judgement Godly Palace, all kinds of delicacies were placed on a long desk that was more than ten meters long in the magnificent hall. A middle-aged man dressed in a red priest’s robe picked up some food with his chopsticks and said, “Try this! It’s the meat of a level 8 sea beast, a delicacy that you can’t have in any other place!”","Sitting across from him were Master Auth and Master Lywood, the most popular ‘super masters’ in the mystical realms.","Master Augh put a piece of sea beast meat into his mouth and savored it appreciatively. “The agent shop from the East Continent now has a bad reputation, right?”","“Some people are still defending it. But it’s not important now,” Peable said with a smile, “Now, we’re presented with a rare opportunity. After our guidance in the past year, people are casting more and more doubts on their ‘Holy Light’. This time, if we make good use of the incident with the Shadow Legion, they will become public enemies!”","“Hahahaha! Mr. Peable, this is an excellent idea!” Master Lywood said with a laugh, “I’ll arrange people to direct the public opinions.”","Then, it seemed like he contacted someone.","Dicas was still browsing the magic forum. Her pretty face darkened all the time. [So many haters! Do you guys make a living by trashing Blizzard?!]","This forum was full of comments trashing the ‘Blizzard Workshop’. If anyone defended the ‘Blizzard Workshop’ and other related workshops, they would be tagged as traitors.","[Are you still bragging about Blizzard?! The Orc Kingdom has the most braggers of Blizzard. Where is your Holy Light? Where are your resurrection spells? You all died of bragging?] At this moment, Dicas saw a comment that frustrated her.","“Ahh-!” With red eyes, Dicas was so enraged that she cried as she replied immediately, [Can’t you show some respect to the dead people?]","...","At this moment, probably since he had played the time for too hard and too long, Mr. Fang had fallen asleep at his computer desk, AFKing.","Then, the System suddenly beeped with a prompt.","Mr. Fang didn’t move.","[Beep! Beep!]","“What...?” He continued sleeping.","[Beep! Beep!]","“Don’t bother me!”","“Buzz-!” A sharp whistle sounding like metal grating on glass came to his ears.","“!!??” He instantly woke up.","“What are you doing, System?!” Mr. Fang was puzzled. In his opinion, the System had got lazy in the past year since it seldom talked to him except for releasing some sequels of games such as Assassin’s Creed, but now...","Two simple words appeared on the System Interface: [Issuing Task!]","“???” Nonplussed, Mr. Fang thought, Why are you suddenly issuing a new task when everything is fine?","Is it going to be another new game?! But the Burning Crusade was just released, right?","Mr. Fang glanced at the task.","[New task: Holy Light Miracle","Task Description: Lead the players in the new shop to a glorious victory with Holy Light.","Task Assistance Items: the Symbol of Life* 5; Carrier Rock* 2 (The rock can make the figures whom the host has a synchronization rate of over 10 percent in the cultivation room appear in the real world for five minutes. It’s an item for one-time use.)","Task Reward: Carrier Rock*1]","“The Symbol of Life?” Fang Qi remembered this item well. “This is the special item that the paladins and priests use to resurrect the dwarf when they learn the skill named Redemption, right?”","“Why did you give me this item?!”","And what is this Carrier Rock?!","At this moment, Mr. Fang saw a group of elves, knights and assassins running into the shop with tears in their eyes.","“What’s the matter with you guys...?” Mr. Fang was baffled. “What’s wrong...”","You were all fine and cheerful only yesterday; why do you all look so sad today?"]},{"number":735,"title":"Chapter 735 - The Gathering of Masters","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“You mean you watched the broadcast with the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection on White Pigeon Square and saw that the Orc Kingdom is in trouble? The players over there might be in trouble too?!” Fang Qi’s hands shook, but he quickly covered it.","He would still behave wildly once in a while in the shop, but he had generally acted more maturely than before.","Hearing the fragmented and messy explanations from different people, Fang Qi finally understood the situation.","He realized that this was a real disaster compared with previous incidents.","“Sir, I’ve decided.” With red eyes, Sala said, “We’ll return to our elf forest today to gather our people, and then we’ll go to the frontline...”","“I’ve decided too.” Beside Sala, Assassin Harrison said, “When we played Assassin’s Creed, the master assassins taught us that the assassins’ creed is free will. Now that some people are even deprived of the right to live, how can we have freedom...?”","“I thought that the things in the virtual worlds were far away from our real world, but similar tragedies are taking place right before us,” Elina said, “I’ll return to the ruins of Avil Empire and gather more brothers.”","“Nothing is true; everything is permitted!”","At this moment, Dwarf Elder Sauk also walked up with a group of dwarves. “I never thought that another workshop’s mystical realms would be better than those of the Lava Studio of our Dwarf Clan. But the mystical realm, World of Warcraft, attracted me from the very beginning; I like the hearty dwarves, the delicious alcohol, and every inch of the land in the game.","“Ohoho... I still remember that in one raid, a young paladin was so nervous than he cast Divine Intervention on my hunter pet... In the end, we were wiped out and had to watch that pet boar laugh.” Others all laughed when they heard the old dwarf telling the old story.","It must be noted that it was a precious spell used to protect the priest and other players who had resurrection spells.","After laughing for a while, they felt even sadder.","“Do you know? That paladin resurrected us many times in the mystical realm, but now...” Even the old dwarf was full of sorrow. “He’s a young knight from a neighboring nation of the Orc Kingdom... If... something happened to him, I wish someone could resurrect him...”","Elf Elder Sauk glanced around the people standing in the shop and said, “I’m thankful to World of Warcraft for bringing us together and giving me a chance to make so many friends. But I’m sorry to say that we must leave now.","“We have to leave not only for them but for... our own homeland as well.”","“Sir... they say that our Holy Light is useless!” Dicas had come to the shop to say goodbye to other players as well. After all, as a member of the Royal Magic Union, she wouldn’t have time to continue playing World of Warcraft in this situation.","However, when Dicas saw the atmosphere in the shop and remembered the sneering comments of the mages in the magic forum, she felt even more despondent.","Mr. Fang had a small headache and patted his forehead. “If the situation continues, my shop will lose all business...”","Some elves even ran over and hugged Mr. Fang, as friends of course.","“Farewell! I’m thankful to the mystical realms in the shop for giving us so many beautiful memories!” With tears flowing down her cheeks, Sala waved at Mr. Fang.","“Although the resurrection spells can’t be used... I’m still thankful...”","“Ha? What are you talking about?” Mr. Fang looked at them. “Who said that you can’t use the spells?”","“!!??” All the people looked at Mr. Fang and were stunned.","...","At this moment, the huge army swarmed down south from the Orc Kingdom like a black flood, wiping out several small and middle-sized nations on their way.","The humans on the Nora Continent were divided into two big groups. One group included the Radiant Light Godly Nation and its subordinate faith nation. The other group included the Morning Light Empire and other nation which didn’t require their citizens to believe in a certain god. Of course, some nations of the second group would lean toward the group led by the Judgement Godly Palace.","The high-level officials of each nation obviously acted more swiftly than Mr. Fang who had been oblivious of the situation.","After all, Mr. Fang was only an internet café owner instead of a military officer; his main job was playing games.","This continent had many masters come. They had reached the supreme level 9, and some of the elites had even become legendary ‘saints’.","Under the crushing force of the huge flood transformed by the soldiers of Shadow Legion, the Celine Principality and Lianshan Principality sitting in the inland of the continent became the warzone between human nations and the Shadow Legion.","Masters of the continent gathered there, and so did the elites from different nations.","Some of them had projected their images in St. Heinz’s grand hall. They included World Mage Hematon and Sword Saint Clause.","Of course, some hadn’t appeared in the Judgement Godly Palace. The Nation-Protecting Sword Saint of the Morning Light Empire was one of them, and he came here accompanied by Grand Mage Adolf.","“I don’t think we need to make it a big deal.” In the conference room of Lianshan Principality, the old man dressed in a white sorcerer’s robe without any badges on it was Hematon. “The truth is that we defeated them several times in history.”","“But we paid hefty prices!” Another person said loudly. Dressed in shiny golden armor, the person who spoke was the only saint-level master in Lianshan Principality. “Mr. Hematon, you must know that we had to ask the Radiant Light Godly Nation to create miracles each time when the Shadow Legion attacked us.","“But now...” He slammed his fist on the table and roared in a fury, “They didn’t respond! Didn’t respond at all! Don’t they know the current situation?! They only care about their faith!”","“Mr. Saint Heinz is cultivating in seclusion,” Sword Saint Claus said coldly, “Her Highness the Princess is busy and tied up. She sent me and a portion of the Godly Palace Legion here to help you.”","“Mr. Claus, when did you begin to serve the Radiant Light Godly Nation?!” The man wearing golden armor sneered.","“I’ve sent messages to the Elf Clan and the Dwarf Clan,” Adolf said, “Everyone, I think it’s time for us to put down the grudges between different races.”","Although these people were here to discuss and come up with an answer, it was clear that they were not as friendly to each other as they claimed."]},{"number":736,"title":"Chapter 736 - Internet Café Rescue Mission","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","If people looked to the north of Lianshan Principality, they would find the sky getting gloomier the further north it went.","Shadows engulfed the land as if no sunlight could penetrate them.","In the long history of expeditions, there were many veteran super masters in the Shadow Legion. Among them were seven of the most ancient ultimate masters who were there when the Shadow Legion was created.","One of them was Death Lord Dras who rode the Shadow Demon Dragon. As the most powerful existence among the seven, it had the horrifying power that was rumored to be closest to that of a god, and its mount, the Shadow Demon Dragon, was said to have a strength of the same level.","No one knew where it came from.","Under the seven ultimate existences were super masters from different planes who had chosen to join or follow them due to fear. It wasn’t strange to see true saint-level masters in the legion.","Right now, the huge figure sitting on the Shadow Demon Dragon gazed at the human city before it with cold eyes.","Its gaze was indifferent as if it had seen too many such cities which had eventually been destroyed.","“Thirteen. Are they almost all here?” They seemed to be waiting for something, and they didn’t move.","The hoarse voice came from the tall and thin figure beneath the pitch-black robe, “Do they really think that they can hold us off?”","Under the sky of the distant Lianshan Principality, several figures stood on the city wall which extended for dozens of kilometers while the whole city was in the higjest alert state.","Outside the city walls, a faint magic wall of light began to light up. Then, black cannon muzzles stuck out through the holes in the wall.","“These are the destructive-level magic energy cannons!” The middle-aged knight in golden armor said in a furious voice.","“I heard that these ten huge cannons almost used up all the wealth of Lianshan Principality. I wonder if it’s true,” Sword Saint Claus said, “I guess you’ve moved all the magic energy cannons guarding the royal city to this place, right?”","At the border of Lianshan Principality, the war would break out any minute.","“I still remember that in one past battle, one of the leaders of the Shadow Legion was almost killed by one such magic energy cannon,” World Mage Hematon said; he seemed to be telling some ancient events in their glorious history.","“That is why I’m sure that they are prepared!” The speaker was the Nation-Protecting Sword Saint of the Morning Light Empire; he was a middle-aged man in his forties, and he was dressed in light armor which was convenient for him to move around.","“Our names will be forever recorded in the history book in this war.” Sword Saint Claus put one hand on the city wall while he watched the large troops swarming toward the city.","Meanwhile, in one of the magnificent palaces on the top of high mountains in Radiant Light Godly Nation.","The inside of the palace was covered in countless big, bright, and clear crystals, and a woman lounged on the throne which was carved out of a giant crystal.","Before her were the visuals from the battleground.","...","“What-!?” While the masters argued with each other in Lianshan Principality, exclamations erupted in Mr. Fang’s Origins Internet Club.","“Can we use them?!” In fact, some people could now gradually use Blink, Portal, and some other skills, but... no one had ever mastered resurrection spells. Many people had doubted if the resurrection spells of different classes really existed in the real world.","The spells which could bring people back to life were forbidden skills for humans. They only heard of them in godly miracles and didn’t know if those miracles were just rumors or the truth.","Even though the players regarded the resurrection spells as virtual spells, World of Warcraft still attracted them with its unique charms.","In fact, there were indeed resurrection spells in the storyline of World of Warcraft, but not every paladin or priest could cast them. As miracle-like spells in the category of holy light spells, they had very high casting requirements. As for why most paladin and priest players could cast them, it was because in the game, the players’ game characters were created by the System and could meet these strict requirements.","In the whole history of World of Warcraft, there were only a few cases of miracles of resurrection. The most well-known incidents happened in Scarlet Monastery.","“Sir... you mean...?!”","“Except for the super geniuses, how can one understand it without any assistant items?” A game was just a game, and it must pay attention to the entertainment value while trying to make things look real. However, in the real world, things must operate strictly according to the laws of nature, which was why people couldn’t do anything they wished.","“Then, if we can find the Symbol of Life used to cast Redemption in the game, we can understand it faster?!” Helen exclaimed in astonishment.","“It depends on your talent if you can understand it or not.” After all, the Symbol of Life acted only as guidance and assistance.","“Then...” The knights of the Golden Griffin Knight Legion almost wept in joy. “Then, how can we get the Symbol of Life?”","“As a thank-you gift for your patronage to my shop in the past year, I plan to give out five Symbols of Life,” Mr. Fang said.","Huh? How come it sounds like a promotion activity by a shop on the roadside...?","The people froze for a moment.","“If we can do it... I want to travel to the Orc Kingdom,” Helen of the Golden Griffin Knight Legion suddenly said.","“If we race to the frontline, do we still have the chance to bring them back to life?” Helen grabbed Fang Qi’s arm, looking anxious and uneasy as if she was afraid that Fang Qi would give her a negative answer.","“I’ll go there!” Helen suddenly yelled suddenly, “I’ll go to the Orc Kingdom!”","It seemed like she didn’t care how dangerous that place was.","For the elves who loved life, they wouldn’t want to miss a chance to witness such a miracle in their lifetime.","Besides, the elves never casually made friends. If they did make a friend, they would trust the friend all their life. There was no way that they were going to watch their friend enter a dangerous place without offering help.","Meanwhile, the dwarves were simple and hearty people. Dwarf Elder Sauk said, “If so, we’ll all go with you.”","At this moment, searching for survivors was probably the most important thing on their minds.","At this moment, they suddenly realized that glory wasn’t fame or status but the faith in their hearts.","After all the sorrow and despair that they had experienced, Fang Qi gave them a glimpse of hope. Just like what Dwarf Elder Sauk had said, “They resurrected us countless times in the game; if we can resurrect them once in the real world...”","Even if they could do it only once!","“First Elder...” A few elves looked toward their First Elder imploringly.","Only this most senior elf had a steadiness gained through ages of experiences.","But at this moment, the First Elder didn’t have the heart to refuse this request while looking at the sincerity in the eyes of the elves.","“Then, the rescue mission begins!” Mr. Fang yelled."]},{"number":737,"title":"Chapter 737 - The Secrets from the Ancient Times","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","At the border of the Lianshan Principality, more than half of the masters from all over the Nora Continent gathered.","Yes, perhaps it was the first time in the history of the whole continent that they had gathered together so orderly.","Of course, so many masters of the continent could gather here so fast since they had been prepared for this moment.","Despite the suddenness of the attack, the influential figures on this continent were not completely caught off guard.","There were altogether 13 saint-level masters, including Sword Saint Clause who was sent here by the Radiant Light Godly Nation, the Nation-Protecting Sword Saint of the Morning Light Empire Wilson, and World Mage Hematon.","Nation-Protecting Sword Saint Wilson was a grey-haired middle-aged man with dignity and aristocratic elegance. He was probably the saint-level master living closest to Mr. Fang; Canglan City was in his territory. He would occasionally read and handle official documents in the quiet study room in the castle in Canglan City. As the most talented genius in the Morning Light Empire, he was married into the Hymia Family, which was regarded as a shame on his knightly honor by many people. Therefore, few people knew that the empire’s sword saint had a daughter in the Golden Griffin Knight Legion, a second or even third-tier knight legion.","As the top masters on the whole continent, they seldom paid attention to information about workshops or mystical realms since those things were meaningless on this level.","Standing on the right of these people was a middle-aged man dressed in a dark brown mage’s robe, and his beard was short and unshaven. No one would think that this disheveled middle-aged mage was in fact the current leader of the World Magic Union.","On his right stood a woman dressed in a robe with dark golden patterns. Under the hood of her cloak revealed fiery red lips and an exquisite chin. On her chest of her robe was an exquisite embroidered logo of the Alchemist Union.","Or course, there were also people from places believing in other gods. For example, the Frost Nation believed in the God of Ice of the Bitterwinter Godly Palace. The imposing man dressed in the thick fur coat and holding a scepter inlaid with a precious gem came from this place.","Although they were not as famous as the Judgement Godly Palace, there were still saint-level masters in these places.","Apart from them, there were other people with dignified middle-aged faces or ancient weathered faces. They stood proudly on the city wall, casting deep or proud gazes into the distance while their robes flapped in the wind. They had enough reasons to be proud since each of them was among the ultimate pride of the humans in this world.","They formed the strongest line of defense.","...","These masters had the best magic legions at their command, and they had the most elite knights charging for them while lifting swords high in the air.","...","On the opposite side of them.","In the distant sky, a figure moved closer and closer. Dressed in a black cloak, it looked extremely tall and thin. Inside the cloak, there seemed to be a deep vortex which could suck in people’s souls.","“What did you find?” The existence sitting on the Shadow Demon Dragon finally spoke, and its voice sounded dry and hoarse as if rocks were grating on the ground.","“No.” They seemed to be searching for something and didn’t spare much attention to the ultimate masters among humans who were before them.","...","Meanwhile, in the high broken cliff at Heavenly Abyss Sea in another world.","Cold rain kept falling, and ocean waves surged up and crashed onto the reefs on the shore.","In the chilly rain, a tall figure enveloped in a black robe slowly pulled up the hood which covered his face all-year round.","It revealed a face that seemed to be as dry as that of a zombie, but this man’s face didn’t rot. Instead, it had gradually turned black and began to fill up.","Also, this man’s forehead bulged a little as if demonic horns were growing out.","“Have you confirmed?” He asked.","Behind him was a slim and curvy figure. The hem of the long black silk dress fluttered in the gusts like the waves in the Heavenly Abyss Sea. Her face was white as if there wasn’t a drop of blood in it, but the demonic presence in her body felt more powerful and more contained.","“I’ve confirmed it. The person who possesses the pair of Dao-pupils is now working in Half City...”","“They have a reason to call the Dao-pupils the divinity fragments... what a pity.”","“It’s a pity that we don’t need this pair of pupils now,” the woman said mildly.","They couldn’t afford to have them anyway.","“I meant it is a pity that I have a fine demonic bloodline, but others call me ‘Uncle Black’ and ‘Sea Urchin Warrior’...”","Their faces twitched. “It’s indeed a problem.”","...","Several figures hovered in the dark high sky. The figure standing on the left of the Shadow Demon Dragon had a weird twisted face, which showed that it was definitely not a human.","The huge figure hovering on the right had strange hooves, and its robust body contained a force so terrifying that it couldn’t be suppressed and spilled out uncontrollably. Black storms and lightning flashes could be seen around its body.","Then, the figure sitting on the demon dragon lifted its huge sword and let out a soundless roar.","The sky and the land, even the whole world, seemed to have been plunged into dark shadow.","“Fire!” With a hoarse roar, several horrifying light beams tore open the sky and pulled open the curtain of the war. From the sky and the ground, a black flood crashed onto the protective magic shield around the fortress-like city.","Meanwhile, the ultimate existences on the continent, the Royal Palace of the Elf Clan, the Sky Fortress of the Dwarf Clan, the Radiant Light Godly Nation, and the Judgement Godly Palace were all watching the war closely.","Even some magic forums were flooded with comments about this war.","After all, this wasn’t a war that everyone could participate in.","It was why the discussions on some magic forum were even more heated.","For example, on the biggest magic forum named ‘Eye of Mystical Realms’, there were over 100,000 posts about this war.","[Don’t worry. We have masters to defend us. Even if the sky falls, they will be the first to bear its weight.]","[I’ve moved to the south; I’m sure that the war can’t come this far.]","[Hehe. I’m now in the Radiant Light Godly Nation as a manager of the Crystal Workshop. The Workshop sent me to work in the Capital of Radiant Light Godly Empire. Yesterday, I even visited Master Lywood.] The mage dressed in a mage’s robe with star patterns was active in the discussions while sitting in his alchemy room.","Then, he posted a spiritual spell visual image, showing magnificent buildings in the aristocratic zone. On the wide and clean street, a luxurious carriage drove forward swiftly. [I even saw Her Highness the Princess on an outing.]"]},{"number":738,"title":"Chapter 738 - The Sorrowful Cries of Orcs","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","[I’m envious of you...]","[Big Boss! I admire you!]","On the magic parchment appeared flattery comments from mages all over the world.","[The customers of Blizzard used to brag about how powerful the mystical realm named World of Warcraft is, and how they could learn holy light resurrection spells and go on so-called battlegrounds. But now, I’m afraid that none of them dare to go to the war.] In the messy and dirty alchemy room, the mage dressed in the mage’s robe with embroidered star patterns lounged on his chair and browsed the posts while dissing the players of World of Warcraft.","Meanwhile, Master Auth also posted a comment in the Eye of Mystical Realms. [Blizzard players, you have trained for so long in the mystical realm named World of Warcraft. I want to ask if you are qualified to join the war?]","[My goodness! Master Auth posted a comment in person!]","It immediately received many replies from active users.","[I admire you, Master!]","[We must call out the forum pet Dicas to look at the personal post of Master Auth.]","[What’s a forum pet?]","[It’s a name for people who defend Blizzard Workshop brainlessly and bite people like a dog. Isn’t forum pet a good name for them?]","[Hahahaha...]","[It’s hilarious. A pet dog?]","[Those ‘Origins Fighters’ need to see this too.] Another person commented. [They also boast about their alchemy skills besides their sword techniques and magic spells. It sounds as if everything originates from their shop. It’s the origin of everything in the world.]","[If not, how can it be called Origins Internet Club?]","[How come none of the ‘Origins Fighters’ are replying here? Hahaha!]","Below the post, many people posted [Hahaha] to show their merriment.","At this moment, Master Lywood and Master Auth, who were not combatants, were also watching the war while keeping an eye on the magic forum.","They posted a sarcastic comment. [They probably have gone to resurrect those orcs with their great resurrect spells and have no time to deal with us ‘mortals’.]","The laughter got even louder.","...","“The magic forums are very boisterous lately?”","“Yes, Your Highness.” Even though he was a trusted subordinate of St. Dulan, Peable rarely had a chance to come to this palace. While lifting his eyes cautiously, he only dared to look at the position below the woman’s lower leg while she sat on the crystal throne.","Under the hem of her dress revealed a small portion of her exquisite shoe tips.","“A small workshop from the East Continent brags about the so-called resurrection spells, but I doubt that they have the ability to go on the battleground,” Peable said in a hurry and took a quick glance at the images of the war on the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection.","Of course, aside from this place, in the conference room of the Nations Summit, where high-level officials from different nations were having discussions, people were also watching the war through the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection.","The Elf Clan and Dwarf Clan were also invited to watch the war.","Of course, it was also the best way to supervise the war.","...","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang led his internet cafe rescue group to the Orc Kingdom.","The place before them couldn’t be described as shambles; it was a nightmare.","The bodies of orc warriors scattered on the ground randomly. Some of them still tightly held their weapons, not letting go even after dying. Some were pierced together by one spear or lance, left standing in the ruins like skewers.","Helen who was born and lived in peaceful time and the elves who had lived in the tranquil forest shivered when they saw the horrifying scene. At this moment, they felt like they were staring at Hell.","It was so horrifying that it swallowed everyone here like endless darkness.","It was a real hell.","Perhaps they must do something. Otherwise, this hell would be their fate too!","“First search for any survivors in this area! Everyone, move!” The First Elder of the Elf Clan was obviously calmer, but his words still sounded regretful and heavy. “We probably can’t save all of them, so we must work quickly.”","How great was the power that could bring people back to life? It worked fine in the virtual world, but in the real world, it wasn’t as easy as just pulling someone up from the ground in the game.","It involved energy consumption, faith, spirit, and many other aspects; it was definitely not a spell that one could cast with ease.","If the bodies were decomposed or had only bones left after wild beasts were fed on them, even resurrection spells couldn’t bring them back.","At least, the beginners could never achieve that with their resurrection spells.","...","Meanwhile, on the other side of the Orc Kingdom.","This was a small valley named Jade Valley.","Countless orc corpses were scattered on the ground outside the valley. They wore heavy armor with the crest of a roaring flame lion; these were armor worn by the ‘Roar of Kingdom’ Legion of the Orc Kingdom.","Darkness spread out like a black blanket. On the ground outside the valley, an orc lifted his hand from the pile of corpses, trying to get up. But soon, he was engulfed by the spreading darkness before being eroded and turned into ashes.","The Orc Kingdom was a prosperous and powerful nation, and their king was an ultimate peak saint-level existence. But now, the wounded old orc roared while he was being dragged to retreat by his legion.","Then, countless horrifying black shadows swarmed up like a flood.","“Bladestorm!” A not-very-tall figure charged up like a madman.","“Mr. Dirk!” A wolf-headed general, who was dragging the old orc dressed in the royal robe to retreat, roared hoarsely.","Although Mr. Dirk was only a rogue, he was the most popular person in the nation, and he was well received by the aristocrats and civilians. He was like a national treasure in the Orc Kingdom.","Among the orcs who valued strength, Mr. Dirk was popular not only because of his frequent Spiritual Spell Visual Projection shows.","With a furious roar, Mr. Dirk charged into the horrifying flood like a cannon ball.","Countless sharp blades spun around him, and these terrifying blades seemed to have turned him into a horrifying mincer. Even the elite soldiers of Shadow Legon who had experienced countless battles and killed many beings were knocked down in large groups like wheat before a farmer’s sickles.","Holding the huge double-handed sword, Mr. Dirk hacked around in the crowds like a tornado, cutting down soldiers one after another. All the soldiers on the battleground shivered at the sight of the crazy sword shadow.","“Evacuate with the king!”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Several sharp spears whistled across the darkness and torn open the void like flashes of lightning that represented death, and they created strong winds.","With a furious roar, Mr. Dirk hacked open two sharp spears with his sword that moved like a phantom. However, the third spear pierced his chest.","At the same time, a dark and ominous presence appeared out of the blue and clutched Mr. Dirk’s neck like a pitch-black hand, lifting his whole body into the air.","“Mr. Dirk!” A furious roar sounded as if this orc bit his teeth. “Demon Spirit... Sal.”","“I saw many orcs like you,” a deep voice sounded from an unknow place, “Like morons, they always tried to block us with their little strength and yelled words like ‘For the Horde’. They were hilariously stupid!”","“I hate such ignorant people the most. Don’t they know what fear is?!” The hand smashed Mr. Dirk viciously against the hard face of a mountain, knocking off large pieces of rocks while the sickening and distorted voice snarled, “Why don’t you run?! Why don’t you break down and scramble before running in panic just like everyone else?!","“To deal with people like you, I always pierced them with a long spear like a skewer. You know, they usually don’t die immediately; they groan for a long time...”","“Roar!” A shrill and long howl resonated throughout the entire Jade Valley!"]},{"number":739,"title":"Chapter 739 - Arise!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The sun slowly set on one side of the valley. The blood-red sunlight seemed to put a blood-colored thin carpet on the previously jade-green valley.","“Roar-!” A ferocious roar rose.","“Mr. Dirk!” With a furious roar, the old orc king broke away from the generals who tried to drag him away, and he shouted, “Guys, we have no way out.”","“We’ll only survive a few more days by using the terrain advantage of the valley.” The orc king’s face was concealed by his silver mask, but his ancient voice sounded strong and firm. “Our orc soldiers would rather shed blood on the ground than leave their comrades to hold off the enemies alone and escape on their own!”","“I’d rather die in battle than live in shame!”","“Our strength comes from blood and thunder; our strength will turn into fire of fury and death!”","“We’re... fearless!” The old orc raised his huge sword high, facing the ocean-like Shadow Legion which had sealed up all the exits of the valley.","“We’re fearless!” The rest of the orcs also raised their weapons.","“A bunch of... morons.” With a furious roar, Mr. Dirk somehow struggled out of the hand of shadow.","Instead of retreating, all the orcs charged toward the Shadow Legion before them!","In the green valley, the small group of orcs cut into the shadow like a sharp long knife!","“Combat technique – Concentration of Will.” While holding his huge sword, Mr. Dirk let out a low roar and then thrusted it outward.","An invisible surge of essence rushed out with the huge sword like a cannon ball.","Boom!","The trees in the valley collapsed, and more than ten meters of plants on the ground were razed. The soldiers of Shadow Legion were sent flying for dozens of meters, piling up into a small hill.","Soon, many soldiers swarmed up again in a dense troop.","“War Stomp-!” The bull-headed man beside Mr. Dirk roared in fury and stomped forward with vicious force.","The land cracked and sank before being pushed around. Then, a horrifying shock wave swept across everything with the violent quake of the ground.","Countless soldiers fell, but more swarmed up.","In the sky, the knights of the Shadow Legion riding ferocious huge black birds shot down like meteorites as their long spears stabbed with the vicious downward momentum.","Dozens of knights pierced forward one by one like a black meteor shower!","“Bothersome!” The old orc king raised his huge sword. With a shake of his hand, his huge sword which was thicker than a gate pillar transformed into hundreds of sword shadows!","The sword was only about two meters long, but its blade now looked like a group of mountains that were hundreds of meters high!","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The knights who were still charging in the sky were turned into a blood shower in the blink of an eye!","But at this moment, a weak whistling sound came!","Puchi! A pitch-black long spear from an unknown place shot through the armor and pierced the old orc king’s shoulder!","The old orc stumbled a few steps and barely managed to remain standing by putting his weight on his sword.","Cold sweat slid down his cheeks beneath the mask.","No one could see his face beneath the mask, but it was obvious that his face was twitching in pain.","“Can’t fall; I can’t fall!” Seeing the elite warriors of the Orc Kingdom falling one by one around him, the old orc king’s heart was bleeding.","“You must all die here since you’re a bunch of morons!” The distorted voice said. Black mist condensed in the air and transformed into a pitch-black cloak which revealed only half of the gloomy and distorted face beneath the hood. “Then, I’ll kill your people one by one until they beg for mercy in fear!","“Then, I’ll see if you’re still so brave!”","Then, his long spear shot across the sky with sharp ear-piercing whistles, and more knights dashed down from the sky like many shooting stars.","When the last bit of the sun disappeared, the sky turned even darker.","In the future, these orcs would only have a vague memory of this day.","“That day, we were plunged into darkness and despair; we tried our best to fight but still failed.”","“Our eyelids felt heavier and heavier, and our hands couldn’t hold the swords anymore. Our bodies felt as heavy as lead...”","“From light... to darkness, from darkness... we seemed to see the pale golden dawn light in the distant east.”","“We seemed to hear someone calling out our names.”","“I’m not willing to fall... wouldn’t...”","In the beautiful Jade Valley covered in vibrant green plants, there were only the last few orcs. Some of them stood over countless corpses. They were surrounded by enemies, looking as if they were deep in sleep.","Some leaned on their huge swords and panted heavily as if they couldn’t remain standing any longer.","...","“Kill them!” The gloomy figure hovering in the air said.","At this moment, a voice suddenly yelled, “There are people here!”","Then, a figure landed.","Then, with a white flash, several mages suddenly appeared.","Everyone froze.","Then, herds of soldiers of the Shadow Legion surrounded the invaders.","“Are you here to beg me to release the remaining orcs?” Hovering in the air, the non-human existence gazed at the ordinary-looking young man coldly.","Mr. Fang’s face darkened.","“Do you know who we are?!”","“I don’t need to know who you are,” Mr. Fang said.","“Huh?” Hovering in the air, the figure, that emitted a presence more powerful than that of a demon, froze again.","“You guys affected the business of my shop.”","“Hahahaha!” Demon Spirit Sal laughed wildly. “I thought you would say that you’re here to avenge them. What business in your shop? Are you nuts?”","“It seems like you overestimated yourself.” Even Helen, the earliest customer of the shop, hadn’t seen Mr. Fang’s face so dark and cold before. “We don’t hold grudge against each other; I don’t need to avenge anyone.”","“Aren’t you angry that I killed them? Aren’t you here to save them?” The figure concealed in the black cloak stuck out a withered claw, and it asked in a cold voice as it pointed its claw at Fang Qi.","“Yes.”","“Can we... really do it?” On the other side, paladins and priest players such as Commander Elven, Helen, and Dicas walked up and stood before the orcs. Each of them had a Symbol of Life in their hands.","“What are you doing?” Sal finally looked suspicious.","“Redemption!”","“!!??” Either from incomprehension or stupefaction, that existence didn’t attack. Instead, it watched as the Symbols of Light released the force of Holy Light.","The warm light felt like the morning sun in the bitter cold winter.","“Arise!”","Demon Spirit Sal and all the soldiers of Shadow Legion saw beam after beam of golden light fell from the sky.","Then, they saw the most unforgettable, astonishing, and incredible scene in their lives.","The orcs who had stopped breathing long ago suddenly moved their eyelids.","Bathed in the golden lights, they looked as if they were woken up from sleep. With a shiver, they all slowly got up.","Then, the fatal wounds in their bodies began to heal with visible speed.","“How can it...be?!” Almost everyone let out horrified shouted.","They had been killed; how can they come back to life?!","This went beyond their understanding!","Even the caster of Redemption such as Helen and Dicas widened their eyes and covered their mouths in astonishment. The elves, who had braced themselves for this scene, still froze at the scene.","Then, tears uncontrollably gushed out of these people’s eyes as they were touched with heart-felt gratitude. At this moment, they acutely felt the greatness of life.","Seeing the orcs’ confused looks, pure smiles appeared on the faces of these paladins and priests.","From now on, they embarked on a holy path without any regrets.","In the green valley which had been dyed blood-red by mountains of corpses, the butchers of Shadow Legion had never seen such heart-felt smiles.","Standing in the Orc Kingdom which had been turned into ruins of destruction, these people had tears in their eyes since they found people they could resurrect one after another.","...","“How can it be?!”","“How can it be?! How could they come back to life?!”","“Kill... kill them all!” After a long while of silence, mad roars suddenly rose in the valley."]},{"number":740,"title":"Chapter 740 - Holy Light Is with Us; The Horn for Counterattack!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Seeing the scene before it, Demon Spirit Sal felt foggy in the brain. Having lived for many years, fought countless battles, and saw all kinds of opponents, it had never seen a scene like this before.","It had never encountered such a weird situation.","It knew that some existences had stronger life energy and couldn’t be killed with usual methods, but these people had been completely dead for a while!","These bodies had run out of all their energy, and their vitality couldn’t be any weaker! It was almost negative!","However, Demon Spirit Sal saw these orcs standing up again with all their injuries healed.","The most shocking was that the fiercest god of war of the Orc Kingdom also stood up.","The elites of the kingdom guard team around the old king also stood up one after another!","“Although I don’t know what happened...” The old orc king did some stretching. “I’m grateful toward you.”","“If we can return alive, you will be the most honored friends of our Orc Kingdom!” The old orc bowed to the newcomers, and the others followed.","“Kill! Kill them for me!” Demon Spirit Sal finally snapped back to its senses. In and out of the valley, there were still about 10,000 elite soldiers of the Shadow Legion. At its order, the soldiers swept over from the sky and the ground!","In the small valley, the knights, priests, elves, and about ten orcs who had just been resurrected were instantly surrounded.","“What if you are resurrected?!” The horrifying demon spirit was obviously enraged. “You’re surrounded. Since we killed you once, we can kill you the second time, the third time... the tenth time and the 100th time!”","“I think we’re in trouble again, my friends.” The old orc looked grim as he watched the Shadow Legion swarming up to them in herds,","“No, old king.” Mr. Dirk also bowed to their saviors. “I think it’s them who are in trouble.”","He pointed at the Shadow Legion that had surrounded them and said.","“You’re right!” The others laughed.","“I think you don’t understand your situation.” Mr. Fang looked at the ghost-like demon spirit in the sky and said, “It’s you who is surrounded.”","“Wha... What?!” This demon spirit flew up into the high sky and saw the white-robed figures walking out of the mist one after another and standing on the tall cliff on the top of the mountain on the east of the valley. They were dressed in white assassin’s robes and stood in one row, looking like magnificent eagles that were ready to soar up into the high sky!","On the other side, the sounds of firearms resonated in the sky. Many dwarf troops appeared on the mountain on the west, ready to fight!","On the top of the mountain in the south stood an ancient elf who was holding a wooden staff, and behind him stood countless elite elves.","At the northern entrance of the valley, a blonde young man took the lead in the charge. He was Big Sword Crete, and he was followed by mercenaries from all kinds of mercenary groups in the Mercenary Union!","Although the new shop’s business progressed slowly, the continent was rich and had a large population. Right now, there were about 10,000 dwarves, elves, and humans at the valley.","This number didn’t include the large number of orcs who couldn’t participate in the battle and some of the mages and elite knights on the other battleground.","“I’m sorry, but it’s you who are surrounded.” Commander Elven walked over and said, “Mr. Sal.”","“The counterattack begins, brothers!” This furious roar resonated like a horn that signified the counterattack. At this moment, dwarves, elves, assassins, mercenaries, knights, and sorcerers swarmed up from all directions.","Paladins and orc warriors charged before others. The holy flames of Consecration blazed on the ground beneath their feet while the lights of Judgement fell.","Demon Spirit Sal hated these paladins the most. These orcs already dead, but it was these paladins who had resurrected the dead orcs.","“You can resurrect, right?” Under the cloak, its face turned chilly. “Then, I’ll kill you first!”","The darkness spread out behind Demon Spirit Sal like sky-blocking wings. Then, everyone saw a black shadow tearing open the sky and shooting toward Commander Elven of the Golden Griffin Knight Legon.","“Commander!”","In exclamations of alarm, Commander Elven reacted quickly and positioned his shield before him. However, the force was too big for a knight of his cultivation strength to block. With a crisp sound, the huge shield that was as tall as one man was instantly pierced, and a horrifying bloody hole appeared in his chest. In fact, not only him, but the soldiers of the Shadow Legion, the trees, and the cliff behind him were all pierced.","Commander Elven stumbled two steps and sat down listlessly with his mouth full of blood; it seemed like this strike had drawn out all his strength.","For a moment, Demon Spirit Sal seemed surprised that this little knight wasn’t killed by his strike. Then, he attacked again!","Before everyone else could react, the second strike came.","With this speed and force, no one could come to Elven’s rescue in such a short time on such a chaotic battleground.","Demon Spirit Sal smiled cunningly. “Resurrection spell? I’ll see if you can resurrect yourself!”","The lightning-like black light beam shot across the sky and created thunderous howls, looking as if it would swallow Elven whole!","“Commander!”","“Commander Elven!”","How could the people that were only level 7 or level 8 rescue him from a saint-level master?","The masters who had enough strength to save Elven were too far away.","“It’s done!” Demon Spirit Sal sneered smugly.","But in the next moment...","It suddenly heard a roar. “Divine Shield!”","A faint holy light engulfed Elven while the lightning-like shadow crashed onto the Divine Shield formed by Holy Light and... shattered!","Then, Demon Spirit Sal saw that the knight sat on the ground and moved slowly like an old man due to his severe injuries. The knight condensed whitish-gold light between his hands and guided it to his wound.","“Demonic Energy Piercer!” Demon Spirit Sal roared furiously and shot out another streak of black light.","“Holy Light! Holy Light! Holy Light ...” Engulfed in the Divine Shield, the paladin concentrated on casting the spell named Holy Light, paying no attention to the storm outside.","His wound healed with visible speed.","About ten second later, Elven’s wound completely healed. Looking at Sal who had launched over 100 Magic Energy Piercers in ten seconds and lowered the ground by several meters, Commander Elven said solemnly, “The Holy Light is with me!”","...","“Roar-!” Sal went crazy.","When it roared wildly in undisguised fury, a huge sword hacked at it with sky-piercing force.","“Your opponent is me!” The old orc king roared.","Boom!","A huge fireball crashed down like a meteorite, sending this horrifying demon spirit flying.","“And me.” The First Elder of the Elf Clan flew up from behind.","“I think you should consider how to flee.” The old orc grinned. “You’re finished, black-faced monster!”"]},{"number":741,"title":"Chapter 741 - Embrace the Fear in You Heart!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“You seem to have overestimated yourselves.” As a saint-level master, Sal wouldn’t be easily defeated even though it had to fight two opponents at the same time.","Demon Spirit Sal glanced around and saw that the elves, dwarves, and humans indeed outnumbered them, but the difference in numbers wasn’t too big.","“It’s been a long time since our last battle, so perhaps you’ve forgotten the combat force of the Shadow Legion,” Sal said with a snicker, “You dare to fight us with this messy and mismatched army?! What do you think you can do to me?”","The soldiers of the Shadow Legion were all veteran fighters who could each fight ten enemies at the same time.","In the busiest times, the soldiers of the Shadow Legion fought several wars in one year and had toughened themselves in countless battles of blood and fire!","The old orc king who didn’t know much turned grim, but the First Elder of the Elf Clan smiled as he said, “I’m afraid you’ll be disappointed!”","At this moment, Mr. Dirk and the others thought, We go on the battlegrounds each day! We began fighting in small-scaled battlegrounds such as Warsong Gulch ever since we were at level 10 and have since then battled in all kinds of large battlegrounds at maximum level. We fought in dozens of battlegrounds each day when we tried to level up prestige ranks. We’ve trained like this for more than one year now. Do you think you’re better than us?","On the battleground, the bunch of commanders in the game when players fought on battlegrounds in World of Warcraft began to issue orders and shouted wildly, “Warriors! Shield Wall! Push up!”","“Keep some protection paladins here to protect the nannies!”","“Mages! Throw Blizzards at the crowds of enemies!”","Magic spells, storms, blood, and thunder swept across the battlefield. Sal found that instead of subduing the ‘messy and mismatched’ army, its soldiers were shrinking in formations under pressure until they were forced to gather together in the center of the valley.","“How can it be?!” Sal roared, and it was answered by a huge fireball which crashed down at him like a meteorite.","Boom!","Boulders fell from the mountains, and fire blazed like the burning sun.","Before the dust settled, a forceful gust shot toward Demon Spirit Sal’s face as a huge sword crashed toward him. The powerful wind that the sword strike created pressed down the ground by several meters!","Boom!","The sky and the ground shook violently. Dodging and escaping almost instantly, a black figure shot up into the sky at a speed so fast that it was impossible to follow its movements with naked eyes.","In pursuit, two figures flew across the battleground like two lightning flashes. Then, mountains collapsed as boulders fell, and the ground cracked.","Demon Spirit Sal saw an opportunity to fight back. Black clouds gathered in the sky while countless lightning bolts poured down like a waterfall. Under the thunderclouds, that figure looked like a demonic god!","“I’ll show you what war magic looks like!”","“Counterspell!” The white-bearded and white-haired old elf chanted lightly and waved his magic staff.","A magic light flashed, and the black clouds in the sky scattered as the thunder instantly turned mute!","“If I can’t interrupt that, then all my efforts in the raids this year are wasted!” The old elf said majestically.","“Puchi-!” While spewing a mouthful of black blood, Sal felt a strange magic energy forcefully interrupting his spell!","Its face twisted in fury.","What the heck was that?!","Before it could think, the huge sword swept across its waist, even cutting the ocean-like black clouds behind him that weren’t fully scattered into two halves.","If Demon Spirit Sal hadn’t ducked in time, the sword would have cut it into two halves as well!","Fighting two peak saint-level masters at the same time, Demon Spirit Sal was at a complete disadvantage.","“How can it be...?!” These people’s combat strength went beyond its expectation. After all, it had consumed lots of energy and effort to kill the old orc king.","Now that the orc king was resurrected, Demon Spirit Sal’s remaining energy was obviously not enough to deal with the old orc. Besides, it was shocked by its opponent’s strange spells, which were simple but very effective.","“Retreat!” In this instant, all it could think of was this word.","As an ultimate master, Demon Spirit Sal carried out its thought in one breath. Hovering in the sky, it inhaled deeply, and the big cloak that covered its body bulged into a huge black ball.","Even from the distance, people could feel the destructive energy that it contained.","“No!” The First Elder of the Elf Clan immediately waved his staff, and a tremendous force shot out from his staff and transformed into a huge water barrier, engulfing everyone in the area.","In the next moment, the destructive energy erupted like a volcano and swept across the sky and the land, turning everything that it touched, including the trees, soil, and the soldiers of the Shadow Legion, into dust!","Even the pale blue water barrier shook under its force and eventually collapsed.","A black shadow instantly fled to the distance at a speed undetectable by the naked eyes.","...","After clearing the remaining forces of the Shadow Legion, the orcs, dwarves, and elves looked a bit disappointed.","“It got away.”","“It can’t get away.” Looking at the direction that Demon Spirit Sal fled, Mr. Fang said casually.","“Huh? Sir, you got an idea?!” Some elves walked up to him and stared at him as if he was Doraemon.","...","Meanwhile, on the other battleground.","The figure riding on the Shadow Demon Dragon still hovered high in the sky.","It looked as if it was a demonic god dominating over the whole battleground.","...","Nations Summit was a grand palace. The ultimate masters projected their images in the elegant rooms on the top level of the palace, and in the center of the hall was the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection showing the whole battleground.","A group of people were watching it avidly.","The battle was entering a fierce stage, and the humans had obviously obtained the upper hand.","“Elf Queen, Your Majesty.” Dressed in a spotless white sorcerer’s robe, St. Dulan said with a smile, “If your elves don’t come now, this war will soon come to an end under the leadership of our Judgement Godly Palace.”","“After that, history will always remember our great achievement,” Saint Dulan laughed.","“Huh?” From the lofty throne, a pair of beautiful eyes looked down.","She thought, I sent a large group of elves to help them. How come I don’t see any of them?","The dwarf king also felt puzzled, thinking, I sent a large group of dwarves to the war as well...","...","Meanwhile, in the magic forum ‘Eye of Mystical Realms’.","[According to the latest news, many masters have gathered at the border of Lianshan Principality and formed an iron defense line. The Shadow Legion can’t break it. We’re winning!] This news was posted by Master Auth.","Cheers erupted in the forum, and the commenters almost knelt and called him Daddy.","Meanwhile, they didn’t forget to trash the silent ‘Blizzard Braggers’ and ‘Origins Fighters’.","[Too bad. The Blizzard braggers lost their chance.]","[I guess they are being delayed by the many corpses on their way. After all, they must show off their resurrection spells.]","[Blizzard braggers are still on their way. Hahahaha!]","[Sword Saint Claus would say, “You’re not needed here; go and do some logistic work.”]","[Hahaha! Blizzard braggers can only do logistic work?]","[Don’t take it seriously. Anyway, the resurrection spells are not real, and what can they help with in terms of logistics?]","“...”","...","At this moment, the Death Lord who hadn’t moved a muscle cracked a cold smile under his helmet. “How are the Seeds of Nightmare?”","Beside it, the slim and thin figure slightly nodded.","It looked at the fierce battle on the battleground like a god who could dictate everyone’s life and death. “Embrace the fear in your heart!”"]},{"number":742,"title":"Chapter 742 - A sudden change for the worse!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Ever since she began playing World of Warcraft, Helen had felt a nightmarish power growing inside of her. She was troubled by nightmares every night, and those weird and creepy scenes in her dreams woke her up, making her too afraid to sleep.","However, after Sala recommended Outlast to her, Helen began to change...","Previously, it had been hard to sleep, and now she just didn’t dare to close her eyes. Whenever she remembered that the fat demon-like man who chased her around throughout the game was finally turned into meat paste by the supernatural existence that worked above the laws of nature, she would shiver involuntarily.","The scarier thing was that the supernatural existence had crawled into her body!","As for the previous nightmares...","For some reason, Helen felt that the power which caused nightmares seemed to be stirring in her body again, but...","She felt like the supernatural existence inside her could instantly slam the creepy things in her nightmares into meat pies, and she thought, Are those things really scary?","While shaking her head, Helen murmured, “Forget it... I still feel like Outlast is more frightening...”","Now, she felt that she could punch any horrifying monster which had scared her senseless before; she was now very tough.","“I feel like I’m becoming a tomboy?” Helen patted her cheeks and followed the others to continue the rescue mission.","...","Although the Symbol of Life in the game could only be used once, the items re-created by the System were all top-quality. Obviously, the items that Mr. Fang gave these players were truly top-level objects.","The tremendous life energy contained in these Symbols of Life could be used more than once.","After the paladins and priests resurrected many people, the energy in these items still hadn’t run out.","The people who could use the Symbols of Life must have the talent to learn Redemption or Resurrection, and there weren’t many people who could do that. Otherwise, there wouldn’t be so many people who couldn’t be resurrected in the later story of World of Warcraft.","The rescue team walked through the desolate ruins and searched for orcs and humans whom they could resurrect.","During the process, these people received blessings and gratitude from countless people and witnessed the joy of coming back to life after death.","Usually, the corpses of masters were relatively intact while the civilians, farmers, and other ordinary people couldn’t be resurrected even with the godly items such as these Symbols of Life.","At such moments, these people would be struck by deep sorrow and could do nothing but give their sincere blessings.","“May the Holy Light be with you.” Helen prayed for them, wishing more than ever that such catastrophes wouldn’t come again.","Luckily, this horrifying legion didn’t have the time to go to each city and village in the Orc Kingdom, so the rescue team only needed to follow the Shadow Legion’s footprints and search city by city.","“Rheinster... My friends from the Independent People’s Inn Guild asked me to find an orc named Rheinster...” Sala searched around anxiously.","“Do they know what happened here?” Helen asked.","“No... I haven’t had the heart to tell them the truth...”","“Many people have asked me to figure out the situation with these orcs,” Commander Elven said, “Don’t tell them yet.”","More than anyone else, Elven knew how it felt to have a good friend die. While they searched around anxiously, he knew how impatient and anxious that the players in the distant ‘East Continent’ were feeling right now.","“Wait until we resurrect them all.” Today, everyone got so busy that they wished they could split themselves into groups of ten so that they could do more work.","Even Mr. Fang closed his new shop when he came out.","Mr. Fang’s shop was located in the busy zone of the city, and many people passed it each day. Glass, the knight captain and the senior priest of the Canglan City branch of Judgment Godly Palace suddenly saw a group of people pointing in the direction of Origins Internet Club.","[What’s happening?]","[The Origins Internet Club is closed?]","Glass casually posted the news on the magic forum. [Origins Internet Club seems to have shut down. It’s closed for the whole day.]","[It’s shut down?!]","[It’s the end of the ‘Blizzard Braggers’. Hahaha!]","Countless Blizzard haters spread the news and rejoiced the downfall of the shop.","In the Radiant Light Godly Nation, Master Lywood, Master Auth, and even Peable laughed when they saw this news.","“An achievement! This time, we’ve obtained a great achievement!” Peable’s voice shook in excitement. “Go check and see if the news is true.”","...","Meanwhile, at the border of Lianshan Principality.","The battle between human elites and the soldiers of the Shadow Legion was a conflict of blood and fire. Large groups of soldiers of the Shadow Legion and human soldiers fell, and then more swarmed up.","Even the ultimate saint-level masters, the strongest beings on the continent, could find enemies who matched their strength among the enemies. The horrifying energy releasing from the battleground exploded in the sky again and again, even piercing and shattering the thick clouds and leaving shocking marks in the sky.","None of these masters noticed, or perhaps didn’t have time to notice, that an invisible fear silently spread across the battleground.","It seemed that the seeds that were once planted in the depths of people’s hearts had rooted and began to sprout.","Like a plague, the fear spread in everyone’s mind as if an extremely horrifying thing tried to crawl out from the bottom of their hearts.","Darkness. These people seemed to see endless darkness in which the countless creepy things that had once appeared in their nightmares now took shape before their eyes.","“No...”","While shouts of fear sounded, one of the humans suddenly dropped his weapon and fled.","After the first deserter, there were the second and the third.","In fact, while some were still hesitating and struggling, they were executed by the enemies.","“What’s happening?!” Grand Mage Adolf was casting spells when he noticed the weird state of a mage beside hm.","Then, as if he had turned crazy, this mage shot out a heaven-burning fire cloud. Caught off guard, his comrades were caught in the fire and fell from the sky while screaming.","“How can it be?!” In the Nations Summit, the projected images all stood up and watched the scene incredulously.","The invisible fear was still spreading. The situation made a sudden change for the worse.","Gradually, the sky above the city was engulfed by this horrifying fear which spread among the crowds in silence, turning fighters to crazy people one after another.","The city that was full of lively people was instantly turned into a ghost realm!"]},{"number":743,"title":"Chapter 743 - The Darkest Moment!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Godly spells! Use godly spells!” Sword Saint Claus sent by the Radiant Light Godly Nation finally noticed the weird situation and roared.","But when he looked at the godly spell mage group of the Judgement Godly Palace, he saw a horrifying scene.","All the godly spell mages looked dazed with contracted pupils as if they had been plunged into an ocean of fear and were experiencing some extremely scary stuff.","Some of them attacked their comrades like crazy people and didn’t stop even though the latter had turned into corpses.","“Do you really think that this poorly mixed army can hold us off?” At this moment, the tall and thin figure standing beside the Shadow Demon Dragon finally said, “A bunch of morons. We let you think that you were in a stalemate with us to lower your guard. We only did that to take down your godly spell mages!”","Like an invisible nuclear bomb, it swept across the whole battleground. The shadows in the sky spread across the sky above the city, plunging the clear sky into chilliness and darkness.","In the Nations Summit, St. Dulan’s face turned livid at this scene!","Meanwhile, all the saint-level masters sensed that their enemies turn fiercer at an instant.","Although the saint-level masters were not influenced by the sense of fear as the average warriors and mages were, the situation on the battleground had instantly turned worse. The soldiers of the Shadow Legion killed their way into their enemies, encountering almost no resistance. Except a few who were still struggling, the 100,000 elite warriors would probably all die on this horrifying battleground if no one could change this situation.","A streak of black light suddenly shot across the sky.","Warm blood gushed out and dyed the sky red instantly.","The saint-level warrior dressed in golden armor was the ultimate master and the King of Lianshan Principality. He had an ugly and shocking wound in his waist.","[TL Note: Although principalities are only ruled by princes and don’t have kings, we decided to stick to the author’s original words for better context.]","“Where are you looking at?!” Before him was a humanoid monster with a horrifying look. Blood was dripping down from the blade of the huge sickle in his hand.","The monster lifted the sickle and lightly licked the blood on the blade, as if it was savoring rich wine.","In the sky, a tremendous and terrifying energy gathered on the horizon and then transformed into a human figure; it was St. Dulan.","It was the solid figure image through Spiritual Spell Visual Projection, and this figure contained at least 30 percent of his power.","With a wave of his hand, a layer of mystical light spread out. Under the illumination of the light, the dense terrifying atmosphere finally dissipated a little. However, when the lights dimmed, the atmosphere of fear began to gather again!","Anyway, the warriors who had gone crazy due to fear finally regained some senses.","Pursued by the Shadow Legion, countless soldiers fled at all costs, and only less than half were left.","The previously arrogant human elites scrambled to run as if they were scared witless.","Then, the saint-leveled masters began to retreat while fighting.","Under the wild counterattack of the Shadow Legion, some of them were wounded!","“Retreat!” St. Dulan’s projected figure said in a deep voice.","“Retreat! Retreat now!” Sword Saint Claus yelled.","At this moment, the figure sitting on the Shadow Demon Dragon in the sky finally moved.","The huge saber engulfed in blazing flames slashed out and seemed to cut a huge crack in the sky.","A few saint-level masters were the targets. Just as they were about to block it, they were sent flying by a horrifying force.","Some saint-level masters with relatively low cultivation strength instantly spewed out blood.","Rain began to fall from the sky which was turning even gloomier.","Rain water washed the blood on the ground, forming bright red creeks and running through streets and lanes in the city.","“They... just fell like this?!”","“We... just lost like this?”","The previously arrogant faces turned silent and looked lost while they watched this scene.","They were the strongest and ultimate masters in the world.","They had even thought of battling to the death in glory but had never imagined that they would fail so miserably.","“Retreat... Retreat?! Retreat!”","For them, it seemed like the war ended before it truly began.","“Retreat?” The monster with a human upper body and hooves slowly landed from the sky under the support of horrifying lightning bolts and hurricanes, and it descended before everyone.","It said in a deep and weird voice, “We wouldn’t have wasted so much time and energy if we didn’t want to gather all of you here for destruction! We wouldn’t have to waste time and find each one of you one by one.”","Each word it said seemed to shake the surrounding space, and the vast and uncontrollable energy that it emitted transformed into hurricanes and even tore open the space.","With a wave of its hand, a thick lightning arc crashed onto St. Dulan’s Spiritual Spell Visual Projection which instantly shattered into debris of energy.","In the conference hall of Nations Summit, the unshaven evil face of the humanoid creature with hooves filled the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection. The dwarves, elves, and ultimate human masters were all watching this scene.","It looked up at the high sky which seemed to have been plunged into horrifying darkness. It seemed like a giant existence had blocked all the sunlight in the sky.","“Damn it! We can’t project figures into this area!”","“What are they doing?!”","“No! We can’t retreat!” At this moment, the middle-aged man dressed in golden armor, who was also the King of Lianshan Principality and the only saint-level master of this middle-sized nation, yelled, “We can’t retreat!”","The south of this city was a plain that one couldn’t see the end of with one glance, which meant if this city was lost, the Shadow Legion could swarm into the nation without any resistance. If that happened, the entire Lianshan Principality and its people would be finished!","“We can’t retreat!” This man roared hoarsely, but no one seemed to hear him while they continued to retreat.","“No-!” With a desperate hoarse roar, he watched in helplessness as the Shadow Legion shattered the city walls, buildings, and everything else in the city. It mercilessly crushed everything before dashing toward the center of the principality.","He seemed to see another human kingdom falling before the Shadow Legion.","It was a nation built with numerous generations of effort.","“We can’t retreat!” He grabbed the arm of Sword Saint Claus who was sent here by the Radiant Light Godly Nation.","Claus shrugged off his hand coldly.","“You’re crazy, Mr. Leidon.”","The slightly bald middle-aged man looked around with a cold gaze, feeling like his heart was bleeding.","When the saint-level masters left one by one, the heroic-looking young man couldn’t bear it anymore. This young man’s features looked quite like those of the Lord of Lianshan Principality, and his armor was covered in cuts. He raised his blade and charged back into the enemies.","With furious roars, his chest was pierced by many spears and blades.","“Ahh-!” The middle-aged king who was also the only saint-level master of Lianshan Principality finally charged back. “I know that a small nation like ours is insignificant.”","“Despite all this, only I can’t retreat!” Like a maniac, he charged forward and shouted, “This is my land! If I must die, I need to die on this land!”","“I’ll show you that even a small nation has its dignity!” This man waved his giant sword, and he blocked many spears, swords, and other weapons while warm blood sprayed up into the pitch-black sky.","At this moment, Wilson suddenly stopped his steps. “Perhaps you’re right.”","A pitch-black sickle tore open the sky, and the Nation-Protecting Sword Saint of the Morning Light Empire suddenly vanished on the spot. When he appeared again, he accurately blocked the deadly sickle.","“If everyone sits back and watches like this, I’m afraid that no one will help us when we need help!” he shouted.","Hearing his words, some of the other saint-level masters hesitated and finally stopped their steps.","“A bunch of morons!” Several saint-level masters including Sword Saint Claus left swiftly with their troops.","Without the Radiant Light Godly Nation, the most powerful ally, this was possibly the darkest moment in these people’s lives."]},{"number":744,"title":"Chapter 744 - The Horn Is Blowing!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Get in formation! Turn and fight! Turn and fight!”","“There is an ancient relic in the southwest of the city!” Leidon said, “The defensive magic array which is now in repair over there could be of some use! There’re many old-fashioned war weapons too!”","“It would be better than our current situation!” he added.","“I’ve requested reinforcements from my empire!” Nation-Protecting Sword Saint Wilson of the Morning Light Empire said, “If we can hold on until the reinforcements arrive, we might still have hope!”","The remaining humans led the Shadow Legion to the ancient Changlin Hill Relic in the southwest of the city, reorganized, and formed new formations. With fierce tiger-and-dragon-like roars and shouts on the battleground, the Shadow Legion fought with the human army once more, but the latter could obtain almost no advantage except for the useful terrain and some outdated war weapons!","“Don’t retreat!” King Leidon lifted his huge sword. His nation wasn’t very powerful. But facing the enemies that had forced even the powerful nations to flee, they knew they had no right to retreat.","He glanced around the soldiers who looked uncertain, lost, and desperate.","He felt those feelings too, but he couldn’t show any on his face. “Behind us are our families, friends, and our loved ones. Think about what would become of them if we retreat!”","“Your prince, my most excellent son, has just died in battle. Perhaps I’ll die in battle today as well, but I’d rather die standing on the city wall at the border of our Lianshan Principality than survive by fleeing in shame!”","Seeing the hesitation on the faces of the soldiers of the Morning Light Empire, Wilson yelled, “If we retreated today, just imagine when they come to the gate of our nation and we must face them alone, can we still retreat?!”","“I can’t guarantee that you will live, but I need you right now.”","“Get in formation!”","The remaining saint-level masters from the neighboring nation also roared. In the sky, the Sky Knight Legion formed a long array, looking like a huge soaring eagle spreading out its wings.","On the ground, the warriors advanced forward while holding shields before them. As the array of the ancient relic in the southwest lit up with pale blue lights, countless flames and frosts exploded among the enemies.","The warriors stood in one line and formed a great iron wall!","Behind the warriors, the mage group slowly flew into the sky.","“Firestone Meteorite, 500 yards ahead.” Grand Mage Adolf squinted his turbid eyes as he looked at the sky worriedly.","Like a black flood, the Shadow Legion viciously crashed at the iron defense line while the few remaining saint-level masters fiercely fought the enemies. They were surrounded by large groups of flying knights and monsters. Meanwhile, the saint-level masters of the Shadow Legion just stood and watched, intending to deplete their opponents’ spirit and energy.","Darkness in the sky engulfed the whole city and everyone’s heart. Like a heavy boulder, it almost suffocated everyone under it.","The retreat of the Radiant Light Godly Nation meant that the Lianshan Principality was deserted. Now, they could only rely on themselves to protect their land, people, and nation.","To live or to die; it would be determined by Heaven.","...","At this moment, Mr. Fang led his internet cafe rescue team to the north and finally reached the place where the Shadow Legion made its first attack.","They saw the lion-man leaning on the huge shield that was as tall as one man. Beside him, some orc warriors supported their bodies with huge swords or huge hammers, not willing to retreat one step even in the last moment of their lives.","They might be insignificant, but they had formed the first line of defense of the Orc Kingdom.","A streak of warm Holy Light fell from the sky, and the lion-man was woken up as if he was in a sweet dream.","At this moment, except for the elves, dwarves, and humans, there gathered a large number of orcs.","The old orc king lifted his weapon and shouted, “Peers, it’s time to fight back!”","“Sir, say something.” While they advanced south toward the Shadow Legion by following its track, the knights, elves, and orcs walked with Mr. Fang in the center.","“Um...” Mr. Fang looked embarrassed. This isn’t my strong suit...","He slightly thought for a moment...","...","The reinforcements from the neighboring empires and kingdoms rushed to the rescue. Despite the fresh blood joining the battle, the battleground at the border of the Lianshan Principality consumed the human forces continuously like a huge millstone.","Looking at the large flocks of huge black birds circling in the sky and the cold-blooded soldiers of the Shadow Legion who seemed fearless, these people had never felt so desperate before.","Like flames, once it was ignited, despair spread out quickly.","“St. Dulan,” A priest reported in a low voice, “Sword Saint Claus has retreated safely with the godly spell mage group, but some nations didn’t retreat.”","At the Nations Summit, St. Dulan looked at the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection before him calmly and said, “This time, we indeed underestimated them. As everyone can see, I gave them the chance to retreat, but they gave it up. Now, let’s talk about how to build a new defense line. I think we must put out 100 percent of our forces this time to deal with this crisis.”","The representatives from the Elf Clan and the Dwarf Clan frowned. The dwarf who was wearing a crown stood up and said, “Forgive me for my bluntness, but I think we must re-consider if we should form an alliance with people who deserted their allies.”","“People with great ambition don’t concern themselves with trifling matters.” St. Dulan stood up from his seat and said, “On our side, we have St. Heinz who can listen to the gods’ words, and we also have Isabella Her Highness whose strength has surpassed all the people in the world.”","Dressed in a pale golden long dress and wearing a silver-colored crown, the woman with eyes that were as bright as stars nodded slightly at his words.","“One must understand the situation and know when to retreat. Otherwise...” St. Dulan pointed at the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection which showed great casualties of human soldiers and the desperate howling of the remaining ones.","“Ahh-!” On the battleground, the middle-aged man’s golden armor had been dyed red by blood. Beside him were piles of corpses of the soldiers of the Shadow Legion soldiers and human warriors.","His hand that grasped onto the sword shook slightly while the huge wound in his shoulder numbed half of his body.","He turned his head and looked at Wilson who was also covered in blood.","“Don’t ask me why.” Wilson looked reminiscent. “Do you remember the Sword Saint of the Hymia Family?”","He closed his eye slightly and said, “She was my wife; she died on the same battlefield.”","His sword was different from others. Slim and exquisite, it seemed to be a decorative sword used by some aristocrat. “I don’t want to retreat again... Heehaaa–!”","Unleashing the last bit of energy in his body, he charged at the huge shadow in the sky.","Then, blood sprayed into the sky and dyed it red.","“You overestimate yourself.” The demonic-god-like figure staying in the high sky looked indifferent.","“Humans are just bugs that tremble and beg for mercy at the feet of gods,” the tall and thin figure said.","...","“Do you want to form an alliance with them?” St. Dulan laughed.","“...”","“Chirk-!” Suddenly, they heard a shrill yell and saw Demon Spirit Sal flying over like a ghost.","Suddenly, everyone saw a shocking scene. A weird bolt of saber energy appeared at where Demon Spirit Sal was!","After the saber energy flashed by, the demonic-god-like’s body slowly split into two halve after a long while.","Exclamations erupted at the Nations Summit. “What’s happening?!”","Dimension Slash!","The data strings that were flowing in Fang Qi’s eyes gradually dimmed while he withdrew the sword. Then, the people who had been waiting for Mr. Fang to speak finally saw him open his mouth. His gaze seemed to see through time and space and rested on the distant blue planet that he could never return to.","“May...” Fang Qi opened his mouth and said in silence. When we face despair, may our past youth and passion form your hardest shield.","“May... the Holy Light be with you.”","“Wuu–!” With a deep sound of the horn, these people dashed toward the center of the battlefield, howling like a pack of wolves."]},{"number":745,"title":"Chapter 745 - Miracle!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“At that moment, I understood that people call us supreme saint-level masters not because we are powerful. Instead, they look up to us and call us ‘saints’ because we far surpass people who are weaker than us. When we face existences stronger than us, we would also feel weak, desperate, and lose composure like an average person. The so-called saints are just a joke for ignorant people.”","“Because we’re still mortals and thus weak people.”","Despair filled the battleground. Perhaps godly miracles would be sent from the supreme Gods’ Peak on the continent and drive out these horrifying monsters, but it had nothing to do with these people now.","With shaky arms, Sword Saint Wilson put his weight on the sword and struggled up.","This man who had always looked aristocratically elegant was now disheveled with ugly wounds all over his body. “But we’re the ultimate masters already...”","This man slashed out the blade and created several radiant blood flowers in the air. The slim sword which looked like a decoration for aristocrats could still unleash horrifying power in his hand.","The remaining forces and the generals from different nations charged again and again but were plunged into greater despair each time.","However, the despair vanished when the newly arrived Demon Spirit was cut into two halves.","That act seemed to be a... declaration of war.","Yes, a declaration of war.","Wilson couldn’t imagine who on this continent dared to declare war by killing a commander of the Shadow Legion.","Not only he, but the remaining commanders of the Shadow Legion were stupefied by this scene as well.","Everyone in the conference hall of the Nations Summit was also staring at the scene dumbfoundedly.","Who the heck did it!?","Suddenly, they heard booming sounds of hooves striking the ground from the distant. A group of people gradually appeared on the distant horizon.","There were orcs with different features, stout dwarves, well-equipped elves, and a group of people wearing robes with pointy hoods, looking like neither mages nor warriors.","The most eye-catching one was the young man in the front of the group. Instead of riding on a flying mount, he stood on his sword but moved faster than any flying magic beasts.","“Huh-! Those seem to be my elves?!” In the conference hall, the pair of eyes that were as beautiful as the Mirror Lake in the Silver Moon Forest widened when watching the scene in the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection.","“I seem to see Elder Sauk!” Sitting in the seat that belonged to the Dwarf Clan, the stout and imposing dwarf dressed in a coat made of magic beast fur said.","“Forgive me for being blunt,” St. Dulan said, “if I were you, I would summon them back immediately. If they are trying to attempt a rescue now, they would certainly die.”","At this moment, the most magnificent figure who had been sitting on the Demon Shadow Dragon and supervising the battle like a demonic god also saw the weird disturbance on the other side of the battleground.","But... since the human alliance didn’t have the support of the Radiant Light Godly Nation and had almost collapsed, the Shadow Legion had enough energy and force to turn around and deal with these overconfident newcomers.","“What do they want to do?!” At this moment, the saint-level masters who had retreated from the battleground were also in the meeting that was discussing the creation of a new defense line.","Sword Saint Claus said with a snort, “They didn’t come until this moment; are they here to seek deaths?”","Obviously, he was resentful that these people hadn’t come earlier.","Meanwhile, he thought, Do you think your randomly mixed army can achieve the result that so many saint-level masters couldn’t manage?! Are you trying to insult me?!","“To be honest,” World Mage Hematon said with a smile, “I have no intention to belittle these elves and dwarves, but according to the previous situation, I feel like they can’t last more than five minutes.”","“...”","At this moment, the dwarf king and the elf queen had similar thoughts.","What on earth are you doing here?","At this moment, the two armies were about to battle.","“Shield Wall!” A shout suddenly came from the sky. Right now, Mr. Fang became the commander since he was the only person who could temporarily order the orcs, elves, and dwarves for the time being.","Different from the light shield that would light up above the players’ heads in the original version of the game, the thick ‘essence’ in their body traveled into the shields in their hands and transformed them into dazzling huge shields that were as hard as a wall and extremely eye-piercing.","Then, the audience saw something so unimaginable that they suspected their eyes were playing tricks on them.","Boom...!","Blocked by the thick and huge shields which looked like a huge wall, the Shadow Legion that looked like an unstoppable flood suddenly paused as if they encountered a big dam!","“Blizzard! Blizzard!”","With the chanting of the mages in the backline, the air began to become dense, and the temperature lowered to zero, swiftly condensing the moisture in the air. The rain clouds in the sky quickly condensed into thick ice pallets which shot down with the acceleration of gravity and crashed onto the crowds of Shadow Legion like meteorites.","Then, the orc warriors charged forward like ferocious tigers that were released from cages. They hacked their huge hammers and axes toward their enemies with heaven-splitting fury.","“How can it be...?!” These people weren’t defeated within five minutes as expected. Instead, the audience actually saw that this ‘randomly mixed’ army had obtained the upper hand!","And... how come there are so many orcs?!","Wasn’t the Orc Kingdom destroyed?!","Seeing this scene, the human alliance army who had been plunged into a death battle seemed to see a glimpse of hope in the darkness of despair.","“Comrades! Pump up your spirit!” Sword Saint Wilson shouted, “I don’t know who’s helping us, but it’s undoubtedly a strong army! Pick yourselves up and show people our strength!”","“Follow me closely! Let’s kill our way out!”","“Attack!” After the moment of despair, they finally saw hope. With inexplicable excitement, they fought their way out fiercely.","However, it was very hard to fight to the other side of the battleground. They might die before they could achieve this feat.","Obviously, Mr. Fang noticed the situation on this side.","“Healers follow up! Kill your way over!”","Like a sharp arrow, this army shot into the enemy’s heart.","However, when they merged with the remaining human alliance army, St. Dulan said with a sneer, “Is this commander a pig?”","If they fought with the previous formation, they might have a chance. But now, they had disrupted their own formation?!","Now, Fang Qi led all the people into the enemies who outnumbered them!","“He’s indeed only a young man.”","“Moron!”","At this moment, even the figure of the Shadow Legion who was in the high sky revealed a cruel smile. “I’ll take his head.”","“Ah...” Mr. Fang nodded.","Suddenly, everyone saw a scene that they could never forget for the rest of their lives. The dark clouds in the sky seemed to be pierced by a strong light. A figure seemed to walk out from the light beam while Holy Light sprinkled onto the ground, driving out all catastrophes and hardships!","It was unbelievable! The figures stood up from the ground one after another as if all their fatigue and pain had evaporated.","In this instant, the generals and soldiers of the human alliance army had the unconscious urge to kneel and worship. It was a stunning sensation coming from the bottom of their hearts!","Seeing this scene that was like a godly miracle, everyone in the Nations Summit stood up instantly in astonishment!","They had never felt so shocked before!"]},{"number":746,"title":"Chapter 746 - For the Alliance!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“What’s that?!” Even the loftiest saint-level masters sitting at the Nations Summit couldn’t hide the shaking in their voices.","It was probably the first time in their lives that they couldn’t control their emotions, or in other words, couldn’t keep the emotions from showing on their faces.","Even the commanders of the Shadow Legion stared at the scene intently.","They had never imagined that such a scene would appear on this battleground!","“What happened?!” World Mage Hematon looked at St. Dulan in horror and asked, “What did they do?!”","He looked as if he didn’t believe his eyes. With widened eyes, he looked at the scene in the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection again to make sure he had seen it correctly.","At this moment, the fallen soldiers in the human alliance had almost all stood up, joining the few comrades who had remained standing. In a short time, they formed a huge army of iron strength!","In the bright light, people finally saw that it was a majestic paladin who lifted a battle hammer in one hand and held a thick libram in the other hand. Standing in the holy light, he looked like a grand god. “My name is Uther Lightbringer!”","“Godly miracle-! This is a godly miracle-!” Awe and reverence rose in the hearts of all the soldiers of the human alliance when they saw the great miracle.","“My goodness!” Seeing the old knight with the grey brown hair and the symbol of Silver Hand, the Alliance players all exclaimed. This legendary figure only appeared in World of Warcraft as an optional character and didn’t show his true form in World of Warcraft, but his legendary stories circulated in every corner of the Alliance!","Like Tirion Fordring, he was also one of the first five paladins and leader of the Knights of the Silver Hand. He was also Arthas’s mentor.","With the title of Lightbringer, he was the person closest to the God of Light in the legendary stories circulating in the Alliance!","“Just a human... you’re bluffing!” In the sky above the Shadow Legion, the ultimate existence waved its huge sword and said, “Everyone, charge!”","Not only the soldiers of the Shadow Legion on the ground, but also the countless monsters soaring in the sky swarmed over while roaring, as if they intended to swallow the humans, dwarves, and elves who were surrounded by them.","Uther patted the griffin that he was riding on, and it flapped its wings and soared up into the high sky. Although characters in World of Warcraft usually rode warhorses, people also traveled around riding griffins and flying mounts in the game. Therefore, it was normal for characters to ride griffins.","“We’re blessed by Holy Light. All darkness will evaporate!”","Although they were still puzzled about the situation, countless Alliance players were thrilled to see the legendary hero. While lifting their weapons high in the air, they yelled, “For the Alliance-!”","“For the Alliance-!” More and more people joined the roar which became louder and louder.","Even the soldiers of the Lianshan Principality and King Leidon were influenced by the contagious atmosphere and yelled with them.","These local people realized that this great miracle would save them and their principality!","The soldiers and generals of the Morning Light Empire and other kingdoms also joined the chant. The loud shouts of tens of thousands of people resonated across the whole battleground and shook the sky and the ground.","Facing the Shadow Legion which had almost butchered all of them, these soldiers seemed to have gotten rid of their previous fear when they charged forward.","The two armies collided with each other, and it seemed like two huge ocean waves began to fight fiercely.","Blood sprayed into the sky and on the ground while countless soldiers fell in the fierce battle.","“Druids! Tranquility!” Seeing this scene, Elder Sewell yelled and led a large group of elf druids into the battleground.","The dark sky was suddenly opened by many whitish-silver light beams.","Whitish-silver lights of moon and life spread swiftly from the elves to the battleground around them.","Like nectar, the lights sprinkled onto the ground.","The soldiers on the frontline who had fallen due to severe injuries stood up again with full strength.","The troops from the principalities, kingdoms, and empires had never seen such a sight before!","They exclaimed and leaped up in elation, “I’m alive again! I’m alive again-!”","Then, they charged forward one after another.","Soon, even the main force of the Shadow Legion was torn into several parts under the tireless charges of the alliance soldiers.","The previously overbearing great Shadow Legion seemed to be on the verge of collapse.","At this moment, the beautiful elf queen was sitting on the throne of the Elf Clan and stared at the battleground with glints of joy and surprise. “Huh...? When did our Elf Clan become so powerful?!”","They weren’t even this strong last year...","A few elders took these elves for a trip; how come they returned with such great power?","In the Nations Summit, St. Dulan looked at the elf queen coldly and said, “Your Majesty, your elf army didn’t show such trump cards until the troops of our Radiant Light Godly Nation retreated. What’s your scheme?!”","Coldness appeared on the face that was as pure as the moonlight in the Sliver Moon Forest, and her voice was cold and seemed to contain the loneliness of 1,000 years of solitude while she said mildly, “St. Dulan, I knew nothing about it. Besides, when the war began, you didn’t count our Elf Clan in your plan. Now that you retreated without consulting us, you have the face to blame us?”","“...” St. Dulan’s face instantly turned livid.","He said with a snort, “The Shadow Legion is not easy to deal with. I hope you guys use your reasoning and summon back your people. With the Elf Clan’s power in spells, our alliance will surely defeat the Shadow Legion together!”","“St. Dulan.” The dignified dwarf king pointed at the scene on the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection and said, “Although I don’t know who this Uther Lightbringer is, do you really think that they will lose?”","At this moment, everyone here saw countless phantoms of the Holy Light Battle Hammer transforming into a destructive storm around Uther in the sky through the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection. Struck by this storm, countless soldiers of the Shadow Legion fell from the sky like dumplings that were being tossed into a pot of boiling water!","“Divine Storm! Divine Storm!” Countless Alliance players yelled in pleasant surprise.","This was a high-level ability from the Burning Crusade, an expansion to World of Warcraft, and paladins could only learn it once they reached level 70!"]},{"number":747,"title":"Chapter 747 - A Hard Battle!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Release Blood Lust!”","As the tall and thin figure chanted the incantation, a layer of dark red clouds gradually engulfed the battleground.","This spell seemed to contain an unknown demonic energy which brought blood-red glints into the eyes of the soldiers of the Shadow Legion.","Their eyes were full of bloodthirst and madness, looking more fearless than the stimulated alliance army of the Nora Continent.","Their attacks seemed to contain a cursed power which shot toward the knights of the Golden Griffin Knight Legion who were charging at the front. With an exclamation, Helen was cut by a saber and instantly felt an invisible force drawing out strength from her body. Then, she stumbled and almost fell. She looked at her opponent and found that the latter had become more energetic than before.","The Shadow Legion which had been at the disadvantage for a while now fought back and began to obtain the upper hand.","“Look!” St. Dulan said loudly, “The Shadow Legion isn’t so easy to deal with. To be blunt, I think the arrogance and heroism of some individuals and clans can only lead to defeat and destruction.”","“...” Everyone looked grim. Their army wasn’t weak, but their enemy was even stronger with seemly endless abilities. They didn’t even know what percentage of power their enemy had unleashed.","The unknown was the most frightening thing.","Watching the Shadow Legion’s counterattack, even the elf queen and the dwarf king felt uneasy.","After all, wars weren’t games. Allowing their troops to stay on the battleground would risk their lives.","Seeing the hesitation on these people’s faces, St. Dulan smiled and thought, Victory only belongs to us! How can this randomly-mixed army obtain the victory?!","But at this moment, they heard exclamations again from the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection.","In the sky, the ferocious and unrivaled old paladin had cleared all the soldiers of the Shadow Legion around him. No enemy dared to linger near him; otherwise, they would be swallowed by the storm of holy and pure lights!","At this moment, this old paladin seemed to notice the situation happening on the ground.","He lifted the Libram, and holy light beams shined down at his summon. This time, the light beams fell on the Shadow Legion.","When the soldiers of the Shadow Legion was shined on by the light, the bloodthirsty light in their eyes dimmed and disappeared, and they returned to their original state in a very short time as if their ferocious bloodthirsty state had never existed.","“What’s this?!” Not only the people at the Nations Summit, but the commanders of the Shadow Legion watched the scene in astonishment as well.","They had never heard that the bloodthirsty state could be reversed!","The figure sitting on the Shadow Demon Dragon looked at the spell caster beside him.","“I didn’t withdraw the spell!” The tall and thin mage had chilly glints in its gloomy eyes. “Damn it! They even have a way to disrupt our spells by force!”","“Mass Dispel! I read the introduction on the official website. This is Mass Dispel!” All the people cheered. It was another ability that only priest players over level 70 could use! Before Uther became a paladin, he was a priest.","Eager to play this newer version, the Burning Crusade, which had many powerful abilities, a large group of people surrounded Mr. Fang and said, “Sir, can we all learn such abilities?”","“Of course, you can!” Mr. Fang said with conviction.","“This ability can be learned...?!” The warriors and mages of the alliance army overheard it and asked, “Can we learn it too?!”","– In the hall where St. Dulan sat –","Clank!","A loud noise sounded. St. Dulan slammed his fist on the table before him, making the teacup on the table jump up.","With a dark expression, he calmed himself down and projected his figure into the Nations Summit again. “Sorry, I was away for a little while.”","He stared at the situation on the battleground intently, not believing that the Shadow Legion would be defeated due to this small setback.","Sure enough, they made the next move.","Master of Energy Neth was a creature with a human body and hooves, and it had horrifying elemental energy around its body. It was said that it was a member of an ancient race that had gone extinct long ago on the Nora Continent.","These creatures excelled in the use of elements in nature. Despite their excellent innate talents, no one had heard of their existence in this world.","However, this creature now appeared in the world as the Deputy Commander of the Shadow Legion.","No one knew what this legion’s purpose was, but everyone knew that they only brought shadows, destruction, and death.","Master of Energy Neth turned its gaze to the sky and chanted some words that were light as wind. It seemed like this creature was summoning something.","A deep and strange long murmur suddenly sounded from the dark clouds covering the sky.","Huge shadows extended their way down from the clouds, looking like huge beasts hiding in the deep ocean in ancient times. Their flat and wide bodies flapped like huge wings while the blazing flames they spat crashed down like destructive meteorites.","Coming from the extremely high sky, the fireballs didn’t look so big from the distant ground. But gradually, the fireballs got closer, and the booming noises that they created were as loud as thunder. Looking up, the blazing fire was destructive enough to smash half of the alliance soldiers into meat pies or burn them into ashes.","The giant fireballs fell toward the iron-like defense line formed by many orc warriors who were the hardest shield standing before the mages and priests.","“Careful!” Sword Saint Wilson and other saint-level masters were veteran fighters and knew the value of the orcs who formed the frontline more than others. After dumping his current opponent at the risk of severe injuries, Wilson stabbed his slim sword at the huge meteorite like a lightning flash.","Boom!","One meteorite exploded, then the second, the third...","Having experienced the desperate moments, these human masters obviously knew the meaning of this war more than anyone else.","Boom! Boom...!","With the explosions in the sky, countless debris fell from the sky like a shower. Some of the debris was still several meters wide.","The boulders that crashing onto the ground exploded and shot out a shower of flames. The orc warriors only had time to raise their big shields when a huge airwave knocked them into the air. Instantly, howls and screams filled the battleground!","When the warriors on the frontline who defended the mages and priests with their bodies struggled up again, they looked up and saw another horrifying shower of flames falling from the sky like shooting stars!"]},{"number":748,"title":"Chapter 748 - For the Horde!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","At this moment, a trace of helplessness and despair appeared in these warriors’ eyes.","Even the saint-level masters looked powerless when their opponents charged at them one by one.","This was a sense of powerlessness that they had never felt before. Even though their army had grown even more powerful than they could have imagined, the horrifying Shadow Legion had again and again shattered their dream of victory with overwhelming force.","The orcs had fallen and then got up again and again, but they still couldn’t defeat their enemies. The horrifying power of this legion that they faced went beyond their imagination!","In the Nations Summit, most of the audience found their hearts rise and fall with the changes of the situation on the battleground.","The process of this war was so thrilling that even the elf queen felt uneasy despite the miraculous resurrection spells possessed by the alliance army.","Under such destructive strikes, the elf queen even wondered if the alliance army on the battleground would be destroyed altogether in the next moment, and the old paladin might not be able to save so many people after he used all his energy, which would lead to the collapse of the whole war.","The elf queen even considered if she should enter the war herself.","But it would mean that the whole clan had come to the final moment.","Fang Qi obviously noticed this situation as well.","“It’s time...”","Suddenly, pitch-black lights tore open the sky with sharp whistling sounds!","Boom! Boom-!","Radiant firelights burst out in the sky; it seemed like almost all the meteorite-like fireballs exploded in the high sky.","St. Dulan who had felt relieved now stared at the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection before him intently.","“Who?!”","“Who is it?!”","These people walked up to the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection, not wanting to miss any details.","Subconsciously, the orc warriors under the meteorites and some human warriors and knights looked up and saw the debris in the sky falling down rapidly like light beams, burning into ashes before they could reach the ground.","A black figure leaped up into the sky like a sharp arrow. She drew her bow to the fullest, and then a arrow transformed into a black rainbow, shooting across the sky!","Even standing on the ground, the people could feel the suffocating and powerful force in the high sky as the rainbow-like black arrow exploded on the huge beast in the sky with vicious force.","Shrill howls instantly resonated in the high sky.","Meanwhile, a sharp and ear-piercing whistle seemed to drop an acoustic nuke on the battleground, sweeping across the entire area with its power!","The orcs looked up and saw a figure covered by a dark red cloak. She had a bony but beautiful face, dark grey skin, and long, pointy, and slim ears.","Endless dark energy that was more horrifying than the shadows swept out with this sharp wail.","“Wail of The Banshee! Sylvanas! Queen Sylvanas!” a Horde orc player shouted.","In the other world, these players had fought many days and nights for her but had never imagined that the figure who they had been fighting for would come and lead them in a battle in the real world one day.","Seeing the legendary heroine of the Horde fighting alongside them shoulder to shoulder, warmth surged up in the players’ hearts while they were astonished. An orc picked up a battle flag from the ground and lifted it high. With the bright flag flapping on the fierce battleground, he shouted, “For the Horde-!”","“For the Horde-!” The orcs in the Horde struggled up from the ground and charged at the Shadow Legion with their big shields and huge axes again.","“Healing Totem, follow up! Orc Brothers, charge with me!” Mr. Dirk shouted, “For Queen Sylvanas!”","“For Queen Sylvanas!” Sala and other elves of the Horde hurried after them, wishing that the people before them could move faster so that they could see Queen Sylvanas more clearly!","Instantly, others followed the charge.","Meanwhile, the soldiers and monsters of the Shadow Legion were still stunned by the Wail of the Banshee, and they were hacked down by the wild orcs and other melee warriors.","A bigger wound was torn through the Shadow Legion. At this moment, Sylvanas flew to the high sky. Her dark arrows containing cursed power afflicted unimaginable damage in the huge beasts. With shrill howling, they all fell to the ground.","“Is this... an elf?!” all the audience looked toward the elf queen beside them.","“!!??” At this moment, the elf queen stared at the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection with widened eyes.","I don’t know either. How come this elf doesn’t look like us...?","Our elves don’t have such dark skin... or such long ears.","What’s happening!? She was stupefied by the scene.","This elf doesn’t look like one of us!","Of course, the elf queen couldn’t reveal these thoughts to others. She looked as cold as before when she said, “Lately, I’ve concentrated my mind to the teachings of the Elf God and had no time to mind the clan business. The First Elder took some elders and elves on a trip and seemed to have brought back many unthinkable things. You may ask the First Elder after the war ends.”","Then, she wondered, There are elves other than us in this world?! Impossible!","Obviously, others had the same thought. Even Queen Isabella who had been silently sitting on her seat cast a quick glance at the elf queen and then looked at the new elf in the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection. After that, she glanced at the elf queen again and then back to the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection...","How come this elf’s skin color doesn’t look right...?!","With this thought, she continued to watch the war.","At this moment, arrows shot down like cannon balls from the sky. Struck by the horrifying energy arrows, countless soldiers and monsters of the Shadow Legion both in the sky and on the ground were sent flying together with everything around them.","When Sylvanas turned into a banshee, her arrows with silvermoon magic power had changed into arrows of death. According to the legends, the people who were killed by this kind of arrowhead would become her death slave. Even a scratch from the arrowhead would rot the wound continuously, and no medicine could heal such a wound.","Then, everyone saw the soldiers of the Shadow Legion who had been touched by the dark energy on the arrows die while their flesh rotted. Meanwhile, their skeletons rose from their corpses!","This was an ability in Warcraft. In the system version, the characters could use all spells and abilities that they have learned in the prequels, so their abilities were from both Warcraft and World of Warcraft and had been readjusted and balanced.","The soldiers of the Shadow Legion stood up from death again and then hacked at their former comrades without any emotions.","At this moment, even the Shadow Legion which knew nothing but killing seemed to feel an emotion named fear in their hearts!","Finally, the entire Shadow Legion began to collapse!"]},{"number":749,"title":"Chapter 749 - Risking the Honor of a Main Tank!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Although the dark minions created by black arrows had a maximum limit, they acted as the meat shield in the frontline, effectively blocking the charges from the Shadow Legion. Meanwhile, the dark minions were not weak and gradually encroached on the Shadow Legion.","For the players who had alt accounts in the Alliance and the Horde, they were familiar with these skeletons.","Perhaps they played as skeletons themselves in the game. After all, the orcs and assassins had nothing against these skeletons and usually played with this type of teammates, so they fought together with this big army of skeletons.","Mage Lily who had played the Legend of Mir 2 lifted her hand and summoned a small fragile skeleton from the ground.","“Huh? Hehehehe...” She released this skeleton into the big army of skeletons.","“What’s this?! Where the heck did this elf come from?!” The people who were watching the war were all ultimate figures from different clans and had naturally seen all kinds of ghosts, demons, and weird creatures.","However, none of them had seen anyone who could instantly transform the enemies into their minions!","How come this dark-skinned elf is so powerful?!","St. Dulan stared at the elf queen intently and asked, “Your Majesty Kellybel, don’t you think you should explain it to us?”","Elf Queen Kellybel’s gaze was as cold as moonlight. “Mr Dulan, if I have to explain every time when a creature resembling an elf appears...”","She pointed at Uther in the Spiritual Spell Projection and said, “Perhaps you must explain where this Uther who uses light spells comes from.”","“...” St. Dulan was speechless.","“Enough.” At this moment, Queen Isabella said, “This Uther and the Holy Light that he uses has nothing to do with us.”","The problem was...","She looked at the sun in the sky and wondered, Doesn’t the light that the God of Radiant Light uses come from the suns as the legend claim? Then, where does this holy light come from?!","She looked up at the two suns in the sky, but the two suns emitted the same kind of sunlight. Is there another kind of light?!","Meanwhile, others remained frowning, including people like World Mage Hematon, who didn’t belong to any force, whether it was other human nations, or the dwarf clan and elf clan.","At this moment, they saw the Shadow Legion’s most powerful figures including the ultimate Death Lord Dras.","Aside from the Death Lord, the other leaders in the legion hadn’t shown much of their powers as well.","Master of Energy Neth had just shown a small part of its power and brought great troubles to the alliance army. They wondered what trump cards the Shadow Legion hadn’t shown yet.","Under their grim gazes, the Alliance and Horde players had gathered together. And with the human alliance army, they tore open the Shadow Legion’s formation fearlessly and valiantly.","But still, the commanders of the Shadow Legion sat calmly in the sky. They looked surprised but not ruffled.","Then, the mage beside Dras chanted in a low voice, and the horrifying Seeds of Nightmare were activated again.","An invisible fear began to spread again on the battleground.","At the Nations Summit, some people including elves and dwarves looked grimmer.","Regardless if St. Dulan’s order of retreat was right or wrong, they knew that not everyone could force them to retreat.","From this perspective, it proved the great power of the Shadow Legion.","After all, they didn’t possess godly spells and godly miracles. The Elf God hadn’t realized any godly miracles for a long time, and the elves hadn’t sensed that existence for a long while. The situation was the same with the Dwarf Clan. Without any possibility to use true godly spells, the alliance of elves, dwarves, and orcs would be at their wits end in such a situation.","“I already tried to dissuade you.” St. Dulan obviously had also noticed that this spell was the trigger for the alliance army’s previous turn for worse. “The godly spells of this big scale require godly power from the God of Radiant Light to activate. I can’t activate the spell a second time today.”","At this moment, the viewers were very uneasy. In fact, they had never been so uneasy before. They had the urge to go to the battleground themselves even though they knew that their participation wouldn’t change anything.","However, at this moment they saw the orcs, elves, and human alliance army passing straight through the zone filled with that horrifying power!","As if they had lost their sense of fear, they continued to hack and slash down soldiers of the Shadow Legion. Except for some disturbances among soldiers of the alliance army who were at the back, the players of Origins Internet Club who charged in the front didn’t show any reaction to the spell!","“How can it be?!” St. Dulan stared at the scene with widened eyes.","Ineffective?!","The spell that the Shadow Legion especially concocted for them was ineffective?!","At this moment, Master of Energy Neth cast a more horrifying war magic spell. In the dark sky, countless thunderbolts zigzagged and then turned into a huge sun-like lightning ball under the thunderclouds.","Boom! Boom!","Countless lightning beams in twisted-snake-like forms swept across the ground. In the horrifying lightning storm, even thick-skinned and shielded warriors were knocked flying by these horrifying lightning snakes. The smell of burned flesh filled the battleground!","At this moment, Uther had rushed to Master of Energy Neth. While raising his battle hammer high, he yelled, “Peace is our loftiest ideal. But to realize it, everyone must fight for it!”","A melodious holy song seemed to come from the sky, and angelic holy light floated down and spread out giant wings of light. The holy light fell like a shower of radiant golden lights!","Countless warriors who had been severely wounded in the battle were recovering at a horrifyingly fast speed instead of a visible speed!","Lightning bolts had burned their bodies into charcoal, but in the next moment, they recovered their full health. The destruction speed of the lightning bolts was not as fast as their recovery speed.","Divine Hymn!","“Glory belongs to the Alliance!” Riding on griffins, a group of knights and warriors raised their huge swords and followed Uther closely, killing their way to the middle of the sky. Master of Energy Neth blocked them like a natural barrier.","The fierce battle on the ground was still going on, but this most elite group consisted of the dwarves and human warriors who rode all kinds of flying mounts charged at the frontline with their shields.","“Raff!” Dwarf Elder Sauk shouted.","The dwarf who had been wiped out many times in Mr. Fang’s raiding party charged at the horrifying master whose power far surpassed that of humans.","He risked the honor of a main tank!"]},{"number":750,"title":"Chapter 750 - Saint-Slaying Battle!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Level 9? Level 8?” Master of Energy Neth looked at the two warriors who charged at it with shields in their hands disdainfully.","Their strengths were high in the eyes of the average people, but Neth was an existence who looked down on average saint-level masters, let alone level 8 and level 9 warriors.","The conference hall of the Nations Summit got noisy since the audience couldn’t believe that these two level 8 and level 9 warriors dared to charge at such an existence.","In the next moment, Dwarf Raff and the other dwarf warrior held up their huge shields and slashed their double-bladed axes at Neth’s middle section with vicious forces.","However, before the blades touched Neth’s body, a horrifying energy current swept out like a storm!","The huge and violent presence sent the surrounding warriors flying when they were barely able to scramble and block it.","Faint magic shield lights lit up on the huge shields, and the tremendous energy was weakened greatly when it passed the huge shields.","The ranged teammates behind them were not affected at all.","Meanwhile, several pure holy light beams fell on the dying defense warriors who then recovered quickly and charged again.","Then, another light shield fell on their heads and spread all over their bodies.","The priests’ spell, Holy World: Shield, gave them more powerful protection. Meanwhile, crisp gunfire came.","Elder Sauk lifted his magic firearm and fired. The bullet that was engulfed in magic lights instantly exploded on Neth.","A faint light barrier protected it from all the damages that might have been inflicted by the explosion. When it was about to fight back with a sneer, ice pallets, blazing flames, lightning flashes, arrows, and all kinds of magic lights crashed toward it in waves.","Now, it wanted to retreat but saw the warriors with huge shields standing on its routes of exit.","Master of Energy Neth could feel that regardless of which direction he took, he would receive the most efficient blockage and stormy attacks.","In the previous raids in instances, the players had to deal with enemies with great strength and high levels of intelligence, such as the Lich Lord Kel’Thuzad and the Old God C’thun.","Although the dwarves had just reached the second stage of the raid against C’thun and hadn’t cleared all stages yet, they still had to be perfect in every detail from equipment, abilities, and even positions.","Otherwise, the players would be wiped out for a whole year in the first stage when they encountered the death ray which would kill them with one touch.","They had been reckless warriors who could only tank damage with shields when they first did the raid in Scarlet Monastery led by Mr. Fang. But now, they had become the top-level master players who were perfect with every detail!","At this moment, even Master of Energy Neth was struck by the illusion that it was facing not a few warriors but a wall or a cell with four iron walls!","“You are seeking die!” Master of Energy Neth gathered tremendous energy again and aimed it at the mages and priests in the back of the group.","This energy was too huge for mortals to block and might turn anyone it touched into ash.","Yes, as the most powerful spell caster among the saint-level masters, Master of Energy Neth could turn an area 1,000 kilometer away into a scorched land without moving its feet.","Its spell abilities were obviously greater than those of Demon Spirit Sal. When it cast the spell, the violent energy between the sky and the land not only gathered above the heads of mages and priests, but it transformed into a destructive hurricane of energy around it.","No spells, including counterspells, could break this protective shield formed by the horrifyingly huge energy and hurt Neth.","“Unleash! Unleash the full force!” At this moment, the commander was the First Elder of the Elf Clan. As a saint-level master, his strength wasn’t as strong as his opponent, but his judgement was much more acute than the average saint-level masters.","Of course, the level 8 and level 9 existences had a greater execution ability than average people.","Countless lights of black, white, red, and blue crashed down like a meteor shower. With about 100 mages above level 8 casting spells, the horrifying magic lights could almost wipe out anything before them.","Besides, First Elder Hyru, a saint-level master, joined the attack as well.","Neth’s casting speed was very fast, but the Elf Clan’s First Elder and all the mages’ spells were instantly cast, and they were even faster!","The condensed protective shield was broken in a short time, and then...","“Shield Bash!”","“Counterspell!”","“Shadow’s Fury!”","“Hammer of Justice!”","Neth’s face paled a little, and the horrifying force in the sky began to scatter after losing the energy source!","The spell casting failed!","Then, countless spells poured toward it wildly.","After releasing the last Divine Hymn, Uther scattered like dissipating golden lights.","Obviously, the character whom Mr. Fang materialized with the help of the Carrier Rock had reached the time limit.","If Uther were still here, Neth would be very cautious. But now...","The ‘mages’ in the back can heal injuries and cast all kinds of spells without worrying about being attacked...!","If I can wipe out the mages who can heal injuries and attack from the distance, I’ll see how you can fight me! Neth tore open a pitch-black crack in space and vanished in it. When it appeared in the next instant, it stood among the priests and druids in the back of the group.","Seeing this scene, even the people at the distant Nations Summit exclaimed. Like a tiger in a herd of sheep, it created lightning bolts and flames from its hands and reached for a young mage with its claws.","Seeing this frightening scene, almost everyone’s hearts were in their throats!","The audience had seen how it tore open space with its claws, so they knew what damages its claws could inflict if the strike hit.","Swoosh!","A white light flashed.","Blink!","As if he had practiced it countless times, Mage Merlin appeared dozens of meters away in the blink of an eye. Meanwhile, he pointed his staff lightly and shot a huge fireball at Neth as if it was a cannonball.","Even though Neth didn’t understand how Merlin had dodged its attack, its claw reached for Priest Dicas who stood nearby without a pause.","Its real target was Dicas!","But two light beams fell on Dicas almost simultaneously.","[Hand of Protection]!","[Holy Word: Shield]!","Crack!","Immediately, a shocking pitch-black crack appeared in the place that its hand touched. But in the next instant, it was horrified to find that its claws didn’t break the thin shield. The Hand of Protection was immune to all physical damage and thus couldn’t be broken by any physical attacks from saint-level masters.","This attack could scare any average saint-level masters, but these people calmly handled it as if it was nothing unusual.","At this moment, the audience at the Nations Summit and the Death Lord sitting in the high sky began to realize that these level 8 and level 9 figures, who were like cannon fodder in the eyes of the saint-level masters, were not here under reckless impulse. Instead, they came here to butcher the saint-level master!"]},{"number":751,"title":"Chapter 751 - Charge! For Victory and Glory!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Without moving a muscle to try to dodge that attack, Dicas was still casting healing spells for her teammates calmly.","After the magic force broke Dicas’s shield, she was sent flying by the strike but almost didn’t receive a trace of physical damage.","This elite team had demonstrated excellent coordination and total trust among teammates in a short time.","If her teammate couldn’t cast Hand of Protection in time, Dicas would certainly have been shattered by that horrifying strike!","When Dicas was sent flying, a streak of light of life fell on her head. Elder Sewell healed Dicas’ injuries almost immediately.","“Charge!” warriors yelled and pushed up again.","“Watch out for its teleport!” Dwarf Raff shouted.","As a main tank, the biggest insult was letting a boss slip into the backline of the group.","“Is this tactic useless on this guy?” The dwarf king obviously understood these people’s tactics. The dwarves were planning to restrain Neth’s movements while the people in the back could cast spells without interruption.","But this tactic could only be used in a perfect situation. After all, how could a powerful existence that could tear open space and leave through the void be restrained by a few clumsy warriors?","“Stupid!” Sword Saint Claus said with a snort, “Does he think that his opponent is a moron?”","How could they continue this strategy after witnessing their enemy’s ability to tear open space? It would be fine if they didn’t know, but now...","“It seems like they are at their wits end.” At this moment, one saint-level mage who had retreated with the Radiant Light Godly Nation said, “It is a shame that I thought they were very powerful.”","Even the elf queen frowned, wondering how they could block a peak saint-level master with ease.","At this moment, Dwarf Raff removed the defense formation and smashed his heavy shield toward his opponent’s head with a vicious force!","Shield Slam!","Revenge!","Sunder Armor!","Strikes crashed down at Master of Energy Neth one after another!","Clank!","An ax hacked down.","“Dodge? Don’t you dare to take one ax strike from your granddaddy?”","“Hiding in your turtle shell? Do you still call yourself a hero? Fight back! Come on! Fight back!”","“A saint-level master doesn’t dare to fight a mere level 9 warrior head-on?”","Boom! Boom! Boom!","In the whistling sounds created by the huge swinging hammer, everyone saw this dwarf suddenly change into another combat style, calling out and mocking the enemy without holding back.","...","Clank!","A huge energy ball crashed down, and Dwarf Raff casually blocked it by raising his shield. Then, he stuck out half of his face from behind his huge shield and said, “Hey! Do it again!”","Boom!","Another huge lightning ball crashed down.","“DPS! Full DPS!” First Elder Hyru shouted.","The audience at the Nations Summit looked at each other in stupefaction. “!!??”","Some elves wiped the sweat off their foreheads and looked at the horrifyingly gloomy face of Master of Energy Neth. “Taunt is not effective on Old God C’thun, but it seems to be effective on this one...!?”","“Hey! Come on! DPS!”","Even some melee elves charged at Neth. Sword lights and magic spell lights crashed onto Neth like rain drops in a violent storm. Even a powerful existence like Neth couldn’t block the forceful attacks from the level 8 and level masters with its physical body, let alone that these attacks were forceful.","On the battleground, the alliance army was still fighting under the command of Mr. Fang.","Meanwhile, the elite team also seemed to be obtaining the upper hand in the saint-slaying battle.","The warriors seemed to have formed a defense line like an iron wall.","However, something unexpected happened at this moment!","A horrifying crack suddenly opened across the whole sky! Pitch-black lightning bolts poured down like a storm, instantly swallowing the frontline warriors and knights. Then, countless black-python-like lightning bolts struck the mages and healers in the backline.","This strike caught everyone by surprise. Screams and groans were overpowered by the thunder and pitch-black lightning bolts.","Except for a few mages who got away with Blink and some lucky ranged paladins who had cast Invulnerability, the others all fell from the sky like blocks of charcoal!","Almost instantly, the joy for the imminent victory on the faces of the warriors and mages from different races turned into horror!","Looking at their expressions, Neth looked very satisfied.","With mocking anger on its chilly face, it sneered and said, “Do you think you can affect me with these small tricks?!","“Don’t underestimate me!”","The elite team that had consisted of dozens of people only had about ten of them remain standing!","Everyone’s mind turned blank.","Wars were not games!","“We encountered this clumsy trick 1,000 years ago when we conquered another plane.” While Neth spoke, it moved silently behind one figure as if it had teleported and stabbed its palm that was as sharp as a sword toward this figure’s chest!","“Sala!”","Puchi!","Blood sprayed all over the area.","“What...?!” Sala turned around in a daze, and she saw a figure standing before her.","Seeing other people looking at him in surprise, Lance looked down at his chest.","Blood flowed down his chest.","“Captain!” Sala, Rowling, and other teammates who had the lowest cultivation strengths in the team screamed in horror.","In the game, they could pull the dead teammates up and redo the instance again. But in the real world?","The horrifying demon before them would never give them a chance to save their teammate!","The sedate elf captain smiled with difficulty and comforted them, “In a raid... death is inevitable.”","“Even if we’re wiped out, we already obtained the hard-earned information. We have the second and third groups to continue the raid. Even if they are all wiped out, we still have the Orc Kingdom Guild, Mercenary Guild, and Mage Guild! We’ll prevail!”","“You’re dead!” With a distorted expression, Neth broke his head viciously and dumped Lance’s body from the sky like a broken sack.","“For victory and glory!” Taking use of the Invulnerability time, Captain Elven led some paladins and charged at Neth like crazy.","“Second Group of Silver Moon Forest!” First Elder Hyru of the Elf Clan lifted his staff, and a large group of elves instantly charged forward.","Ten minutes later, many elves fell from the sky.","“Second Group of Black Stone Castle!” While a furious roar sounded, another team charged forward.","These people were fearless and charged forward one after another with the sole purpose of victory.","“For victory and glory! Charge!”"]},{"number":752,"title":"Chapter 752 - Epic Victory! but... the Shop Owner Got Kidnapped?!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“How can our Orc Kingdom stay out of it!?” Rheinster lifted his shield and charged forward with many orcs. “The Second Group of the Independent People’s Inn and Orc Kingdom is here to join the fight!”","With the battle on the main battleground leaning favorably further toward the alliance army, more and more big elite groups marched toward the last battleground.","They even combined the groups and formed a super battle group consisting of hundreds of people. More fighters filled the gaps whenever some teammates fell.","“Shield Wall!”","“Invulnerability! Block its attacks with Invulnerability!”","At this moment, even Neth, the Master of Energy, who was a pinnacle stage saint-level master, looked afraid while its strong body was covered in ugly wounds.","Neth looked furious that it was forced into a corner by a group of ants!","“Destructive Thunder!”","“Have a taste of death!” Black lightning bolts rose in the sky without warning.","But this time, Neth felt a chilly sensation coming at its back.","Gouge!","Harrison appeared behind Neth from thin air.","“Die!” Elina suddenly appeared before Neth and kicked it while it was trying to dodge Gouge!","“Roar-!” With a shrill scream, Neth was instantly swallowed by lights created by spells!","At this moment, Death Lord Dras had cold godly lights flashing in its eyes. “Do it.”","The mage beside it immediately waved its staff, releasing a pitch-black spiritual light shield which gradually engulfed Neth.","But just before the light shield closed, Neth heard a horrifying and whistling sound.","Swoosh!","The staff was instantly pierced by a pitch-black arrow.","Then, like a lightning flash, a figure shot into the energy light shield that was about to close.","Boom! Boom!","Several explosions sounded, and the entire black shield exploded, shattering half of Neth’s upper body!","Sylvanas lifted her long bow and let out a hoarse roar, “For the Horde!”","“For the Horde!”","“For Queen Sylvanas!”","In the endless, ocean-like roars, many orcs, elves, and humans of the Horde charged forward. Finally, the horrifying enemy fell from the sky listlessly.","The Alliance players exchanged a look and shrugged while shouting, “For the Alliance!”","All these people gathered together, and it seemed like no one could stop their charge toward victory. Even the powerful Shadow Legion had to run in defeat, and Master of Energy Neth had to die.","At this moment, everyone including the audience at the Nations Summit realized that this was an unrivaled army!","Other than the strongest commanders, the Shadow Legion had many masters.","However, they saw that on the other battleground, the army commanded by that young man not only defeated the Shadow Legion but killed many powerful existences who had been enslaved by the Shadow Legion or had joined the Shadow Legion due to fear.","Many questions lingered in the minds of people at the Nations Summit, wondering how this randomly-mixed army from different races could defeat the Shadow Legion with only small casualties on their side?","Besides, where did this elf queen come from?! Elf Queen Kellybel stared at the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection dumbfoundedly.","How come this one is also a queen?!","When the war ends, I have to summon the elders and ask them about it!","She was furious that her elves had found another queen!","“Your Majesty Kellybel,” St. Dulan said with a faint smile, “It seems like some political conflicts are about to happen in your clan.”","“This is the internal business of our Elf Clan, and it has nothing to do with you.” Elf Queen Kellybel said coldly, “Besides, our Elf Clan are not like you guys who would use dirty tricks to control people’s minds.”","“...” St. Dulan’s face instantly turned dark.","Indeed, the elves were proud of their freedom and peace, and they were wild and sincere, not willing to betray others. In fact, the Elf Queen was not their absolute ruler, but rather acted as a guide and leader.","...","On the battleground, only a handful of top-level masters of the Shadow Legion remained standing. Fighting fiercely, they defended the Death Lord.","“Die!” Nation-Protecting Sword Saint Wilson of the Morning Light Empire slashed out his thin sword which condensed into many sharp sword energies, piercing the chest of the saint-level master of the Shadow Legion in front of him as if he was piercing a piece of thin paper.","Meanwhile, Leidon hacked down with his huge sword and chopped several pinnacle stage level 9 masters into two halves.","“We’re winning!” he roared hoarsely.","He saw the dawn of victory. “People of Lianshan Principality, follow me and attack!”","“Attack!”","The old orc king raised his huge sword high and instantly sent two saint-level masters before him flying. “For the people of our kingdom who died tragically! For victory and glory!”","“Roar!”","Seeing this scene, the viewers at the Nations Summit were stunned.","Even St. Dulan, with clenched fists and a livid face, had to admit that this was absolutely the holiest and epic moment in the history of Nora Continent. Led by only a late-stage saint-level master, the fearless level 8 and level 9 warriors and mages charged tirelessly again and again and defeated Master of Energy Neth, one of the main commanders of the Shadow Legion who had destroyed many planes.","Even the Death Lord couldn’t save Neth!","At this moment, the alliance army surrounded the last remaining masters of the Shadow Legion, ready for the last battle.","“All the warriors, rush up!” Mr. Fang shouted, “Don’t be afraid! Victory belongs to us!”","At this moment, the Death Lord and the mage beside him, Master of Sorrow Mark, exchanged a look.","“Huh...” Suddenly, Mr. Fang felt like he was weightless as he was lifted into mid-air.","Then, a mass of pitch-black thick fog engulfed him.","Master of Sorrow Mark, the mage standing beside the Death Lord, shouted, “Do you see this? If you want him alive, stay here. I know you can resurrect people, but if I take out his soul and sacrifice it to our god, do you think you can still resurrect him?!”","“Full retreat!”","Under the incredulous gazes from the Nations Summit, the Shadow Demon Dragon flapped its wings and flew toward the distant mountains in the north with all the remaining members of the Shadow Legion!","They actually... retreated!","But at the second thought, it wasn’t so surprising. After all, Mr. Fang’s force wasn’t the only force in this world.","Even if these remaining masters of the Shadow Legion managed to defeat the alliance army with heavy casualties, they would still be doomed since they wouldn’t be able to get out of this world anymore.","“Ahhh-! The shop owner got kidnapped!” Seeing the Shadow Demon Dragon flying toward the distance, the elves, dwarves, and orcs instantly started to shout.","At the Nations Summit, Princess Isabella sighed lightly and said, “He’s a good commander. Unfortunately, his strength is too weak.”","“He’s lower than level 8.” World Mage Hematon said, “He won’t survive at the Death Lord’s hands.”","Princess Isabella sighed and said, “You’ll always be remembered for your sacrifice for the humans of the Nora Continent.”"]},{"number":753,"title":"Chapter 753 - Astonishing Turn of Events!","paragraphs":["Chapter 753 Astonishing Turn of Events!","“Follow them! Hurry!”","“The priests and paladins who can resurrect people stay here.” First Elder Hyru of the Elf Clan said, “Everybody else, come with me!”","They weren’t pay too much attention at that moment, and the shop owner got kidnapped?!","If the Shadow Legion captured someone else, not everyone would be worried. However, they kidnaped Mr. Fang. This was outrageous to these people!","When these people were about to chase, a pitch-black shadow suddenly appeared in the sky before them. In the blink of an eye, it got close to them, and they saw that it was a black flame sword energy which ran from the distant horizon across the sky, spanning above several small human nations.","Seeing the huge destructive black-moon-like sword energy, some people were worried that this sword strike might even turn them and the Lianshan Principality behind them into ashes!","Shouts and roars of fury erupted in the crowds. All the saint-level masters including First Elder Hyru of the Elf Clan had to unleash their full force.","“Presence of Mind!”","“Sword Essence Strike!”","“Meteor Storm!”","These people used their most powerful spells and combat techniques regardless if they had learned them by themselves or from the games.","The huge black sword energy looked like a horrifying tsunami while countless light beams, big or small, dim or bright, shot into it, creating up small waves. Meanwhile, about ten saint-level masters of the alliance army also poured their attacks into the sword essence like crazy.","The huge sword energy was gradually weakened until only a puff of black mist was left. During the process, the huge impact force left by the sword energy had knocked down many alliance soldiers.","When the people settled down, the Shadow Demon Dragon had disappeared at the horizon in the northern sky.","“So powerful...!” At the Nations Summit, even Sword Saint Claus paled at the scene.","Even World Mage Hematon who had always been proud and even arrogant gasped involuntarily. “Is this the Death Lord’s true strength?”","It was hard to imagine the strength that could hold off the entire alliance army with one sword slash!","On the other side, Princess Isabella, who was called the ‘Light of the Godly Nation’ and was rumored to have a strength greater than the supreme King of Radiant Light Godly Nation, walked out of her palace. The chilly, knife-like, icy wind on the lofty mountain blew at her pale golden hem of her dress while her eyes that were as cold as snow looked into the distant north from the peak of the snow mountain.","“Hurry! Follow them!” At the Nations Summit, the masters of different races, including the ones from the Judgement Godly Palace, still watched the situation on the battleground through the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection. Impatiently, they ordered the mages who were responsible for the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection to move the visuals and follow the scene.","In this world, there were many spiritual spells that could monitor distant places and create projected visuals. The one used at the Nations Summit was the most advanced surveillance spell – Eye of Supervision.","A streak of invisible spiritual energy gathered in the sky like an invisible eye.","“Don’t get too close,” St. Dulan immediately warned.","For a moment, some of these masters had thought of joining the rescue mission. But considering the fact that they were still in the distant Silver Moon Forest and Dwarf Kingdom and couldn’t get there in time, they settled down and continued to watch at the Nations Summit.","While the winding mountains, rivers, and forest quickly passed below him, Mr. Fang suddenly received a message from the System. Right now, he was reading the message on the System Interface.","[Beep! Holy Light Miracle is completed.]","Mr. Fang glanced at the task list.","[New task: Holy Light Miracle","Task Description: Lead the players in the new shop toa glorious victory with Holy Light.","Task Assistance Items: the Symbol of Life* 0/5; Carrier Rock” 0/2 (used)","Task Reward: Carrier Rock*1]","[Do you want to claim the task reward now?]","“Ves,”","The previous two Carrier Rocks were items for the task, but this one was for himself.","This was another powerful trump card.","After receiving the new task reward, Mr. Fang saw two other prompts. One was about the release time of the expansion of War of Warcraft, the Burning Crusade, and the other was about a new game.","Mr. Fang, was about to read the messages when the sky around him suddenly lit up.","A huge black vortex hovered in the sky above the endless snow mountains, and it sucked in countless winds and snowflakes like a fathomless black hole.","“We should leave now.” The black-cloaked, tall, and thin Mage Mark, the Master of Sorrow, looked at the sky and seemed to notice that people were watching them. However, it seemed like this mage didn’t pay much attention to it. “How do we deal with this man?”","The young man who looked to be in his twenties was looking around at the surroundings.","“Should we sacrifice him?” Master of Sorrow Mark sounded gloomy and cold as if it was the Death God issuing a sentence. “Our god will find this guy interesting.”","“Finished!” Elf Queen Kellybel’s beautiful face looked sad that the commander who had led the alliance army to a great and glorious victory would die in this place in such a way.","“Oh...! This is really a hero’s eulogy,” the Dwarf King said with a heavy sigh.","However, a trace of undetectable pleasure flashed across St. Dulan’s face","Look! This is the price!","“Maybe only Princess Her Highness can save him, but it’s too late now,” World Mage Hematon said.","Right now, these people already saw that the figure sitting tall on the Shadow Demon Dragon hacking down his demonic sword that was engulfed in blazing black flames!","After witnessing the horrifying power of the previous sword slash, these people could sense the horrifying strength contained in the sword even through the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection.","This sword would probably shatter Fang Qi and also destroy the mountain that Fang Qi was standing on!","In the Dwarf Kingdom, the king slammed his fist on the stone table before him and shattered it.","At this moment, even the masters, who had retreated from the battleground but still possessed some sense of honor, clenched their fists unconsciously.","However, St. Dulan’s lips curved up slightly.","Boom!","With an earth-shaking noise, horrifying air waves swept away the surrounding snow like a storm; it seemed like a nuclear bomb exploded on the snow mountain.","Next, everyone saw something unbelievable. The ground that Fang Qi stood on was intact!","An arm sheathed in a black gauntlet had caught the black demonic sword!","Below the huge blade was a figure who had silverish-white hair and was wearing a red windbreaker.","“You kidnapped me and even want to kill me?” a voice sounded casually, “That’s not nice.”","“This voice and tone!!?” St. Dulan, Sword Saint Claus, and World Mage Hematon exchanged a look when they heard the voice and tone that they would remember until the end of their lives!","Is this heure. .. the most powerful hidden boss from the Continent of Immortal Relic?!"]},{"number":754,"title":"Chapter 754 - Mr. Fang Got Seen Through?!","paragraphs":["“What’s happening?!” Sword Saint Claus and the others looked horrified.","In the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection, the previous level 7 young man now seemed to have changed into another person under the black sword that was engulfed with blazing flames.","This person had a tough body, and the vast amount of blinding platinum energy was so full that it seemed like it was leaking out from his chest. Also, the red windbreaker seemed to have grown into his body like scales, the orange glints flashed in his eyes behind the crimson mask.","“This... this?!” Even the arrogant World Mage Hematon was so astonished that he was at a loss for words.","Elf Queen Kellybel covered her wide-open mouth with her snow-white and slender hand; her chin almost hit the ground.","At this moment, Dwarf King Saladin’s eyes almost popped out of their sockets.","“What’s this?” As the second-in-command of the Judgement Godly Palace, St. Dulan asked in a chilly voice.","If players in the Continent of Immortal Relic were here, they would recognize that this figure was the demonified Dante from Devil May Cry!","At this moment, everyone who was staring at the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection at the Nations Summit saw a black figure appearing behind Fang Qi.","One edge of the black cloak flew up in the howling gusts, revealing the demonic and distorted face of the Master of Sorrow Mark under the hood.","A black sickle that contained endless hatred and furious roars of dead spirits slashed at Fang Qi’s neck silently.","Containing an extremely inauspicious presence, this blade seemed to be able to harvest people’s souls. Without question, anyone who was struck by this blade wouldn’t be able to enter the next life cycle.","Ding!","However, in the next instant, a crisp noise sounded; it seemed like two pieces of metal collided. Fang Qi’s other hand sheathed in another gauntlet blocked the attack steadily.","It looked as if this strike was an attack from an average person!","The second strike came less than one second after the first one, and everything happened in a flash. On the vast snow mountain, the Death Lord and the Master of Sorrow, two ultimate masters, fought against one opponent but couldn’t put a scratch on the latter!","“Did you see it clearly?!” World Mage Hematon tightly gripped his staff.","“A special energy formed a huge energy impulse on the surface of his body when the strikes touched him. The attacks were countered, and the energy got absorbed...” Princess Isabella stared at the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection intently while she explained, “This all happened in the instant when the attacks made contact with his body.”","Sword Saint Claus swallowed his saliva with difficulty while a drop of cold sweat slid to the ground.","Is this something that a human can achieve?!","The Death Lord and the Master of Sorrow’s faces instantly turned stiff and cold.","These two retreated, and the remaining saint-level masters of the Shadow Legion charged at Fang Qi, trying to overwhelm him with powerful attacks and not giving him the chance to breathe.","Figures transformed into pitch-black shadows one by one while their weapons struck down like black lightning bolts.","Then, the viewers at the Nations Summit saw this figure before them flashing strangely like a ghost.","All the attacks narrowly missed him!","Sword Saint Claus rubbed his eyes subconsciously, afraid that he saw it wrong.","“How could it be?!”","“What the heck just happened?!”","“Did they miss the target?” Sword Saint Claus said while different expressions flashed on his face.","“Using extremely high speed, he shifted his body and dodged all the attacks at the last moment before they touched his body...!” Princess Isabella tightened her grip on the armrests of her throne, and she didn’t notice that she had shattered the exquisite crystal-like armrests into dust.","Before the first wave of attacks finished, another way of attacks appeared. The few remaining mages gathered tremendous magic energy before them, and it looked to be able to destroy anything and shot toward Fang Qi like a cannon ball.","“Let’s see how you dodge that!”","Suddenly, they saw a blinding white light beam shooting out from the destructive magic light!","It let out an ear-grating metal sound!","Death Lord Dras only had time to hold its huge sword before its body to block.","Boom!","The audience stared at the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection without blinking. They weren’t sure when, but the powerful mages and warriors of the Shadow Legion all lost half of their bodies before instantly dropping to the ground.","Even the powerful Dras was instantly sent flying! Deadly silence permeated the space.","It was silent both in the place where Fang Qi stood and at the Nations Summit.","How could such a person exist in the world?!","Even though only a few elites are left in the Shadow Legion, he had handled all of them by himself? Is he... really a human?!","At this moment, only Fang Qi’s voice could be heard. “You want to kill your hostage after the failed kidnap attempt?”","“!!??” Hearing his voice, St. Dulan, World Mage Hematon, and Sword Saint Claus exchange a look of alarm.","They had a faint feeling that they had heard of this voice and tone somewhere before!","While they were thinking, the last few beginning stage saint-level warriors charged at Fang Qi.","The battle was not over yet.","A huge dark purple sword suddenly appeared in Fang Qi’s hands. The sword was heavy, and it had a weird vertical eye on the ridge of the sword.","At this moment, everyone was astonished to find that he seemed to cast out another figure.","The moment that these enemies were about ten meters from Fang Qi – Tombstone","Triangle!","[TL Note: Tombstone Triangle is a high-level skill of the Soul Bender in Dungeon Fighter Online.]","Three ancient dark-purple tombstones with inscriptions on them suddenly fell from the sky, and a strange dark-purple array spread around the warriors’ feet.","A chilly and desolate sensation from the ancient times engulfed them.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The purple shadow energy instantly swallowed everything it touched!","Hum-!","In the thick dust, the audience saw Fang Qi suddenly making a move of drawing his saber.","With a deep sword cry, a sword beam swept across the whole space with a whistling sound.","The distant mountain peak was instantly chopped off, and a flat ground appeared!","Thud!","Thud!","A series of noises resonated in the area, and it sounded like many things dropped to the ground. Everyone except the Death Lord and the Master of Sorrow dropped onto the battleground when Fang Qi returned to his previous state.","Only a mere ten seconds had passed since the battle began!","At the Nations Summit, St. Dulan and others had a strange horrifying expression flashing across their faces while they watched the young man, who appeared to be lower than level 8, on the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection!","“Is he from the East Continent...? The East Continent... has such a master?!” At the Nations Summit, a saint-level master gasped.","Meanwhile, the people who had watched the battle at the Continent of Immortal Relic in St. Heinz’s palace suddenly shivered.","The East Continent...!? “Is it him?!”","“The synchronization time has reached the limit...” Mr. Fang looked at his synchronization time and then at the Death Lord and the Master of Sorrow while deeply inhaling.","He had never synchronized with several characters repeatedly before.","“Has he reached the limit?” With chilliness in his eyes, St. Dulan thought that he had seen through this young man’s tricks.","If things were as he had expected, then this young man’s abilities were not too high.","Meanwhile, the Death Lord and the Master of Sorrow also seemed to see it.","“What a pity,” the Death Lord said in a cold voice as he walked out from the shambles created by the distant collapsed mountain.","“No wonder you didn’t attack during the whole war. You were just bluffing.” The Master of Sorrow’s face became even more twisted. “You are just an ant! You even made me afraid a moment ago. Do you know what crime you’ve committed?!","“When I catch you, I’ll slowly burn your soul in the Flames of Pain for 1,000, no, 10,000 years. You’ll forever feel the pain of your burning soul.”","“Uh-um.” Mr. Fang inhaled deeply and lit a cigarette.","On the System Interface, it showed the godly weapon fragment – Kusanagi Sword.","[Synchronization Character: Orochi]"]},{"number":755,"title":"Chapter 755 - The Dark Desperation Move – Soul Destruction!","paragraphs":["It must be noted that since Dungeon Fighter Online had released the expansion with the new level cap levels, many new level 70 abilities appeared. For example, the Tombstone Triangle that Fang Qi had just used a moment ago was such a skill.","On the distant snow peaks of Arth Mountains to the northeast of the Orc Kingdom, destructive sword beams razed everything they touched to the ground. Several saint-level masters lay on the ground. Some of them could no longer get up while others were still struggling to stand.","Obviously, the Master of Sorrow didn’t give them the chance.","In its eyes, even these saint-level masters were just pawns that it could use however it wanted.","It didn’t spare much attention to Fang Qi either.","Since this kid wants to resist, then I will show him what real power looked like.","“Do you know? Almost no creatures in this world can reach the level of gods, but I’m infinitely close to a god,” it cackled coldly while it looked at the remaining saint-level masters of the Shadow Legion. Then, it lifted one of its withered hands from its wide mage’s robe, summoning the remaining strength and life energy from these masters of the Shadow Legion, alive or dead. The strength and energy floated from their bodies and gathered in its palm like streaks of black smoke.","The presence of the Master of Sorrow gradually grew and seemed to level up again.","After that, it looked at the young man before it with satisfaction and arrogance.","However, it suddenly found that the young man who it thought had reached his limit slowly rose into mid-air.","It seemed like the omnipresent gravity of the world had no effect on him.","Still, this wasn’t the most astonishing part to the Master of Sorrow. After all, some powerful saint-level masters could do that as well.","But the next scene riveted its eyes!","A bright blue light beam shot up into the sky with the force erupting from Fang Qi’s body like a volcano.","At this moment, it looked as if another soul had woken up in Fang Qi’s body.","The golden snake pupils, the gaze that ignored everything in the world, and the... horrifying and suffocating pressure.","It seemed like Fang Qi was between time and space and would fade into a deeper dimension at any moment.","He emitted a sun-like presence. There was no light around him, but people felt that the two suns in the sky all dimmed before him in this instant.","Having just absorbed the energy and hovering in the air with a staff, the Master of Sorrow instantly froze on spot.","“!!??”","“This... this ? ” At the Nations Summit, Elf Queen Kellybel couldn’t close her mouth through the process.","The others also didn’t dare to blink their eyes, afraid that they might miss a tiny detail.","Isn’t this person lower than level 8?! How could he look like this?!","“Who the heck is he?!” St. Dulan tightened his grip on his staff and stared at the unthinkable existence in the screen who had white hair, golden eyes, and horrifying presence.","“What...the heck are you?!” The Master of Sorrow had been through many battles and lived for many years, and it felt that all kinds of emotions that ordinary creatures would have already vanished from its body, making it closer to becoming a legendary god.","Even after watching the destruction of several worlds, Mark didn’t feel any emotional disturbance.","However, at this moment, it felt more emotional disturbances than those combined in the past countless years!","“Have a taste of destruction!” Master of Sorrow Mark waved its staff, and the space before it slowly shattered and revealed a chilly black space which was filled with horrifying storms, frightening thunder, and lightning flashes.","As its spell continued, a huge vortex suddenly appeared in the shattered space. The storm, thunder, and lightning flashes in the void were gathered and compressed in the vortex until they were condensed into a black ball full of horrifying void storms in the center of the vortex.","Finally, it was condensed into a crack that only one person could pass.","“Void Thunderstorm!”","A greyish-blue light flashed with a sharp ear-grating noise. Like a huge cannon, it shot out a streak of destructive fire.","The horrifying energy contained in the blacklight tore open the space again and left pitch-black cracks in it.","“Void energy! It’s void energy!” World Mage Hematon exclaimed, “I’m astonished that they have begun to master the void energy!”","“Regardless of how powerful this kid is, he can’t block it, right?” Sword Saint Claus said in a cold voice.","Then, he froze. “What’s he doing!?”","He discovered that Fang Qi stood where he was without any intention to dodge.","Then, they saw a blue light flashing before Fang Qi! The black light beam suddenly turned and reversed! Boom!","When the dust settled, the Master of Sorrow hovering in the air only had half of its body while the other half fell to the ground.","Tick.","Shocked, Sword Saint Claus had sweat all over his forehead while a drop of cold sweat fell to the ground.","“Dead?!” All the viewers looked as if they couldn’t believe their eyes.","The wings of the Shadow Demon Dragon shook. Dras, the leader and the last master of the Shadow Legion, looked as cold as ice.","After lifting the demonic sword with blazing black flames, it struck down with force.","Like a lightning flash, Fang Qi sidestepped and narrowly dodged it.","Almost everyone thought that he was safe.","But suddenly, a chilly presence shot toward him from behind. The strike was so sudden that it was impossible to dodge!","“Cackle...” A gloomy voice sounded beside Fang Qi as a pitch-black figure condensed in the direction that Fang Qi was moving to. It was Master of Sorrow Mark!","Its withered claws reached for Fang Qi’s back, emitting a chilly presence that could even freeze souls. “Thank you for giving me your soul.”","Watching the horrifying sight at the Nations Summit, the lower-stage saint-level masters felt chills running down their spines!","It had been an illusion! In the countless years of its life, Master of Sorrow Mark had turned itself into a creature that was between reality and fantasy. The most powerful ability that it possessed was that it couldn’t be harmed by any regular attacks.","“Ahh!” Seeing this, even Elf Queen Kellybel gasped in surprise. If she encountered this monster and was caught by this surprise attack, she probably would be hit and have had her soul drawn out.","But at this moment, they saw in the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection that Mark’s withered claws grabbed onto thin-air; the white-haired young man had vanished!","In the next moment, they saw the white-haired young man suddenly appearing behind Mark.","He shoved his hand into its chest with a vicious force. “Such a short life...”","The Dark Desperation Move – Soul Destruction!"]},{"number":756,"title":"Chapter 756 - The End of the War","paragraphs":["The blue energy light trapped the pitch-black soul, and then this figure gipped it with one hand!","Darkness, soul and sins... everything seemed to have vanished.","“Roar!” As if it felt Dras’s fury, the Shadow Demon Dragon lifted its head and roared. It flapped its wings, forming horrifying and destructive storms which turned everything they touched into dust!","Orochi, who was synchronized with Fang Qi, lightly lifted his hand.","A pitch-black energy storm pierced through the void, and the huge magnetic field even turned the wind, snow, and rocks around it into dust.","Two forces met each other and created huge booming noises.","Then, with a thunderous explosion, the whole mountain where the two forces met was razed to the ground.","At this moment, the pitch-black demonic sword in Death Lord Dras’s hands burned up with blazing black flames.","Then, the air in the area began to burn.","Crack!","A huge thunderbolt crashed down from the sky.","The sky and the land dimmed. Then, the whole world darkened as if it was swallowed by something.","There was no sunlight, only darkness and chaos.","In the chaos, Death Lord Dras lifted the black flame demonic sword and emitted a presence much more powerful than before!","“Godly power! This must be godly power!” Even St. Dulan lost his composure.","He had been previously surprised by the things that he had never seen and imagined before.","But now, he had a totally different opinion about this war.","What did the appearance of godly power mean? It meant that the god whom the Shadow Legion believed in wasn’t an imaginary being created to unite people’s thoughts and stabilize the army. It meant that the god indeed existed!","Long ago, people had begun to doubt the existence of the God of Battle and Technique whom some aristocrats of the Morning Light Empire worshipped. The Elf Clan’s royal","members hadn’t seen godly miracles for a long time as well, and only the god whom the Judgement Godly Palace believed in had given them greater power and even showed some godly miracles.","That was the truly great godly power.","Without godly power, even the more powerful super master who could defeat St. Dulan or St. Heinz would be rendered powerless if the latter unleashed godly miracles.","Humans couldn’t break through the limit of the saint level. Therefore, those existences were supreme from the perspective of humans.","The godly power was impossible for humans to block regardless of how hard they tried all their lives.","“Life is so lowly and tiny...” The sky and the land seemed to shake at each syllable that Death Lord Dras uttered.","It lifted its huge sword high in the air and said, “I sentence you to death in the name of the Shadow of Void, Hades Urusith!”","The whole sky seemed to turn into a horrifying pitch-black vortex. In the vortex, a tremendous mass of energy fell from the dark sky. The absolute pressure from the upper existence made countless creatures in thousands of miles kneel!","Even the Elf Queen in the distant Silver Moon Forest and the Dwarf King in the remote Dwarf Kingdom could feel this horrifying power.","For Princess Isabella, only a handful of people in this world could battle her without using godly power.","There were only a few of them.","“I thought that I would have another good rival after this war,” she sighed heavily, “What a pity.”","In the crystal-like magnificent palace on the grandest mountain peak of the Radiant Light Godly Nation, Princess Isabella gradually closed her eyes.","“It’s over...”","At this moment, elves, dwarves, and even humans from different nations had the feeling that perhaps in this world, there was a type of darkness that even light couldn’t dispel.","But at this moment, they saw Orochi, who was synchronized with Fang Qi, raise his arms as if he was embracing the morning sun. “Now, return to nothing!”","In the next moment, everyone saw that the endless darkness was pierced from the top as a beam of sunshine shined into it.","Then, the second beam, the third, the fourth...","Like a sieve, the pitch-black sky was pierced by countless blinding white light beams.","Orochi Divine Light!","– At the Nations Summit –","“!!??” Everyone stared at the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection without blinking. Even Princess Isabella opened her eyes abruptly in disbelief.","Hiss... hiss...","The Spiritual Spell Visual Projection at the Nations Summit turned fuzzy as if it was facing interference from a huge amount of energy.","“How come it’s fuzzy?!” Everyone stared at the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection, frustrated that it would break down at such a moment.","Dwarf King Saladin yelled, “Where is the mage group?”","“Let me do it!” While others had only their projected figures here, World Mage Hematon was at the Nations Summit in person. From his staff, a bright blue magic current shot out and entered the crystal disk that was supporting the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection.","At this moment, the whole space was turned blinding white! – In the next moment –","Boom!","The crystal disk in the middle of the conference hall of the Nations Summit exploded, and the screen instantly vanished!","Seeing this, everyone felt like screaming! It broke down at this critical moment!!","Frantically, they glared at World Mage Hematon with murderous spirit in their eyes.","Hematon froze and explained, “No... It wasn’t me... not me!”","Everything seemed to end in this pure white blinding light. However, a will was not vanquished in the light.","“When I... was born, light scattered, the land collapsed, and space shattered. Countless ultimate existences fell one by one.”","“Sensing the deepest fear, I embarked on the journey of searching and destruction!”","“I followed the footprints of the great existences in my search and destroyed every creature related to them.”","“I... have been searching for the power that can make me into a god...”","The huge dark vortex gradually dimmed, and a figure seemed to have leaped into it.","“I... will come back!”","The dark vortex instantly vanished.","The bright blue sky and white snow mountains returned to the previous state.","Except for some collapsed mountain peaks, no one would know that there had been a ground-shaking battle in this place.","Some time later, a large group of elves, dwarves and, human alliance soldiers hurried to this place.","They saw the pale-faced Mr. Fang was stomping on the mountain top while yelling, “Bad deal! A giant loss!”","After glancing at the System Interface, Fang Qi found that the synchronization time that he saved up so far were all used, and only one godly weapon fragment was left.","“Huh? Sir, how come you’re here by yourself?!” Elf Girl Sala hurried over and asked.","Elder Sewell walked up and looked him up and down. Seeing that the shop owner was intact and didn’t require any healing spells, she asked, “Sir, where are they?”","“They were too trash, so I sent them back where they came from with one move,” Mr. Fang answered casually.","“Don’t boast, and we’ll still be friends!” The elves in the front of the group were instantly displeased. While pouting, they almost drew their swords!","We’ve been so worried about you, and you’re in the mood to joke around?!","“Um...” Mr. Fang thought for a long while and said, “They dumped me here and left...”","“That’s more like it!” Sala said.","“Ugh!?” It still didn’t feel right for some people.","“Let’s go!” Mr. Fang stood up. “The Burning Crusade is on a countdown!”","“So soon! We have to rebuild after the war...” Mr. Dirk said immediately.","“It isn’t too soon. It won’t be released for a while.”","“Ahya! Nice!” Elf Girl Sala was thrilled. “Then, we’ll fight the Burning Crusade!”","Instantly, she felt the heavy burden of responsibility on her shoulders.","Wow! How come we’re so powerful?! She was delighted with this thought."]},{"number":757,"title":"Chapter 757 - The restless Blizzard haters","paragraphs":["The war... was over... The night fell silently.","The tomb-like hills on the battleground, the ragged black flags, and broken weapons seemed to tell people how cruel and fierce the war was.","The dried-up blood had soaked into the sets of battle armor and dyed the ground red.","Except for the last trace of red light of the setting sun in the horizon, everything was in endless darkness.","It was silent, and only a few crows flew in the sky.","A few paladins stepped onto this desolate and dejected battleground.","The dead warriors from the Elf Clan, Dwarf Clan, and Orc Kingdom slowly woke up on the desolate battleground under the shining Holy Light. They looked around and shivered involuntarily.","Cautiously, Helen turned over the corpse of a soldier of the Shadow Legion and saw that it looked totally different from a human, an elf, or a dwarf.","Some of these corpses were from races that had been extinct long ago as recorded in the ancient documents.","People wondered what kind of power could gather them into such a strong and fierce army.","“Did you notice that...” Commander Elven looked grim. “All of them died in battle. None of them died while fleeing.”","It seemed like these creatures had no fear toward death. Everyone shivered subconsciously. If it was true...","Without resurrection spells, no one dared to face such an army, let alone defeat them.","They felt fortunate that this nightmarish legion was finally eliminated.","Priests waved their staffs, showering the place with sparkles of golden light. Their faces were filled with smiles and joy of surviving this brutal battle.","They only dared to shout at this moment, “We... won!” “We won!” Helen also lifted her sword and shouted. Gradually, cheers resonated in the area.","At this moment, Mr. Fang returned from the north of the Orc Kingdom with a large group of elves, dwarves, and human warriors.","Before he could react, Mr. Fang was grabbed by the people and tossed high into the sky.","“Oh–!”","“Ahhya–!”","They shouted in joy and enjoyed the beautiful moment.","The scene froze and seemed to have turned into a permanent image.","“Did you take the picture? Did you?” Some elves were holding the new communication jades that they had bought online.","“Let me see! Let me see!” They leaned over and looked.","On the picture, Mr. Fang who was being tossed into the sky had a dejected expression on his face.","– Meanwhile, at the Nations Summit –","“How is it?!” Everyone was intently staring at the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection operated by the group of mages.","“Done! Done!” Covered in sweat, Hematon fiddled with the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection for a long while and finally made the visuals appear again.","“Where are they?” “Did he win?”","“It seems so...”","Even Princess Isabella froze for a long while before she snapped back to her senses.","“He won just like that?!”","What was that power he used?!","Sunlight?!","How come it looked like our power?! What is going on?!","Again, the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection turned to the battleground at the Lianshan Principality.","“Here they are!”","The people at the Nations Summit heard resonant and ocean-like cheers through the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection.","The dwarves and elves all stood up while they watched the people on the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection. “I think this is a victory that everyone should celebrate!”","They were influenced by the joyous atmosphere that they saw. “They are all heroes!”","Only St. Dulan and others from the Judgement Godly Palace were still thinking about the words that they heard from the Continent of Immortal Relic — “A bunch of noobs; don’t ever come again...”","A bunch of noobs... Their faces all turned red.","The situation was that the Judgement Godly Palace had ordered the retreat, and the so-called ‘randomly-mixed army’ won the war.","How could they argue with that?","They felt so choked with frustration that they almost explode.","“Next time, anyone who dares to order retreat will be punished according to the military rules!” Princess Isabella glared at St. Dulan and Sword Saint Claus while slamming her hand on the table in her palace.","Sword Saint Claus’s heart lurched, and he asked in a low voice, “Mr. Dulan, what do we... do now?”","St. Dulan said, “From now on, no one mentions this! Time will erase everything.”","If they remained cool and downplayed it, this event would pass without drawing much attention.","While St. Dulan said that, things were still going on in the magic forum named Eye of Mystical Realms.","[The Blizzard braggers always bragged about how powerful the battles in World of Warcraft Mystical Realm are. Now with such a huge war going on, none of them actually joined the battle?] In his messy alchemy room, the disheveled and stout mage posted a comment cheerfully.","[I think we can make a big issue out of it.] One Blizzard hater suggested under the comment. [We can take this opportunity to launch propaganda against them. Maybe we can destroy the reputation of the Blizzard Workshop.]","[Why do you hate them so much?] A passing aristocrat who had remained neutral couldn’t bear it anymore and replied.","[Another defender? An Origins Fighter?] In the messy alchemy room, Sam, a mage and a bottom-level employee of the Crystal Workshop, scratched his messy hair and inhaled deeply as if he had just received a shot of stimulant. Anyone who dared to utter a different opinion in such a situation would be tagged as an Origins Fighter!","[They just spend their parents’ hard-earned money on such trivial entertainment games that suppress their ambitions. Is there a single player of World of Warcraft who dares to enter the battleground? Several days have passed; do you see any messages saying that they did anything for the war?]","[A couple of days ago, Master Lywood and Master Auth released several posts, saying that we obtained the upper hand in the war under the leadership of the Radiant Light Godly Nation! Warriors of the Radiant Light Godly Nation had received training in the military mystical realms of Dulan Workshop!]","[Just this morning, our Radiant Light Godly Nation reported that the battle is going well, and there’s nothing to be worried about.]","[The users of their mystical realms are probably engrossed in the scenery and entertainment. How can they do anything serious?]","[I guess no one would want them to do even logistics and supporting work.]","[Is there any reason for the trash mystical realms such as World of Warcraft to stay around and mislead more people? It’s a tumor!]","The moment that the passing aristocrat made a comment, a string of replies appeared below it.","Seeing that the passing aristocrat made no replies, Mage Sam was delighted.","[I think we should compile an intelligence report on this issue and post it on every magic forum.] Mage Jian was a loyal fan of the Dulan Workshop and thought that this would be a holy thing to do.","Look! If we destroy the Origins Internet Club and Blizzard Workshop, we would be greatly appreciated.","Perhaps even Princess Her Highness would know about it!","But I don’t need their appreciation. I’m a very humble individual.","Mage Jian thought to himself proudly.","Soon, the Blizzard haters began to take over other magic forums.","With only a few indignant passersby posting some defending comments, the trashing comments were in a landslide on the magic forums.","At this moment, Mage Sam suddenly received a prompt and saw someone replied to his post in the forum. [Sorry, but the regular army that you mentioned fled, and we who can’t even do logistics and support work saved the world.]","“!!??”","[Think before you speak! How can you guys do that?]"]},{"number":758,"title":"Chapter 758 - Operation ‘Heavenly Punishment’; The Doomsday of Haters!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","In the messy alchemy room, Mage Sam immediately replied, [What could you do there? Playing games? What do you think the war is? A child’s play?]","At this moment, Dicas posted a picture under the post.","It was a picture at the end of the war with all the soldiers of the Shadow Legion on the ground and the alliance army standing on the battleground.","Everyone turned silent under the post.","“How can it be?!” In the messy alchemy room, Mage Sam’s face became distorted. “How can it be?! Faked! It must be faked! Yes! It must be faked!”","Immediately, he replied, [You’re not only a traitor but a faker now?]","At this moment, the Orc Kingdom and the neighboring small nations were all busy rebuilding their countries. Grand Mage Adolf spared some time to browse the posts in the forum and saw this comment.","[One more word, and you’ll lose your qualification as a mage. Do you hear me?]","“???” In the alchemy room, Sam lounged on his recliner lazily and chuckled when he read the reply on the magic forum.","At this time, a mage who shared the room with him walked past.","Sam pointed at the post on the magic forum and said, “This moron said that he would cancel my qualification as a mage... that’s hilarious.”","Then, he posted a reply, [If you can, come through the magic network and bite me! If you can’t, just shut up!]","Meanwhile, Grand Mage Adolf put away the magic letter. Some mages walked into the conference room of the Magic Union in the Morning Light Empire. They wore dark golden mage’s robes with a hexagram pattern embroidered on the chest.","Dicas immediately sat straighter.","Among them was a lazy-looking middle-aged mage.","With others flanking him, he obviously had a much higher status than others.","Of course, Adolf knew this man. His name was Willy, and he was one of the top-level mages and the president of the World Magic Union!","Beside him was an old mage whose white beard almost reached his waist. He was the vice president of the World Alchemist Union!","Even Adolf, a level 9 mage, usually didn’t have the opportunity to see these lofty and elusive people.","In the conference room, the Emperor of the Morning Light Empire who had just returned from the battlefield also stood up.","At this moment, these people bowed toward the mages including Adolf and Dicas.","“Thank you for your great contribution,” the middle-aged man said, “To show our appreciation to you who have made such a great contribution to the world and the Magic Union, the World Magic Union has decided to nominate you as candidates for the next Elder Council and award you with special honor badges.”","Adolf shook his head. “Sir, as ‘traitors’ and ‘wastrels engrossed in game’, I’m afraid that we’re not worthy of this special honor.”","“What happened?!” St. Willy’s face instantly darkened.","“In the internal forums of major magic unions, there are many negative and defaming comments.” A younger mage standing behind him said in a low voice, “Led by some mages, the haters would drown any defenders of Blizzard Workshop and users of these mystical realms with negative comments.”","“The situation is the same in the internal forum of the Alchemist Union...”","Soon, Willy and the old alchemist began to browse the magic forums such as Eye of Mystical Realms, and their faces turned livid instantly!","He slammed his palm on the desk before him and shattered it into dust!","...","As one of the earliest players in the new shop, Mage Lily wasn’t a local resident of the Morning Light Empire.","Now, she returned to her home nation, the Reela Empire. Together with other mages who had battled in the war, she was visited by the nation’s magic union led by a saint-level mage and the emperor.","This event was broadcasted in the most famous magic forum in the nation as the special feature of the forum.","Meanwhile, Mage Jian, a loyal fan of the Dulan Workshop in the Reela Empire, had taken over the forums in the nation with a large group of haters.","Posts appeared on the forums one after another.","[Useless. What can the braggers of the Blizzard Workshop do?]","[Don’t let the Blizzard Workshop destroy the future of our people.]","[Masters already confirm that using mystical realms in the Origins Internet Club is treason!]","“...”","“Mr. Lily, Mr. Lance...” an old mage read the names with respect, took out his magic letter, and opened the forum. “I think you guys have heard of the Distant Stars Magic Forum before.”","“I’ve been using it since I first knew about mages,” Mage Lily said happily.","The old mage opened the forum, intending to show them the nation’s most famous magic forum.","Then, he saw...","[Don’t let the Blizzard Workshop destroy the future of our people.]","[Masters already confirm that using mystical realms in the Origins Internet Club is treason!]","“...”","Posts and comments jumped out one by one.","The old mage instantly crumpled the magic letter as his expression turned cold.","“What’s happening?!”","The same scene happened not only in the Morning Light Empire and the Reela Empire but in all the other places in the world as well.","The World Magic Union, Alchemist Union, Mercenary Union, and even the high-level officials in every nation all realized that this was a serious issue.","– At the Nations Union –","No one had expected that the high-level officials from various nations and forces would gather here again.","Even St. Dulan looked livid. He said in his palace, “Didn’t I tell you explicitly to let this thing go down so that everyone will gradually forget about it?”","“Who did it?!”","Some people had caused such a commotion that even all the masters of the world gathered here again just to talk about it!","The projected figure of Saint Dulan had a very dark expression.","“They slandered our heroes and made them suffer for no reason. I promise everyone that these people who did it will be punished for it!”","“According to the information that my people have gathered, Alchemists Auth and Lywood who call themselves masters gave the tag of treason to people who cultivate in the mystical realms in the Origins Internet Club. I don’t know what their purpose is, but this kind of people are an insult to the title of ‘masters’!” Sword Saint Wilson of the Morning Light Empire looked cold.","“Treason?” King Leidon of the Lianshan Principality sneered and said, “If we had more of such ‘traitors’, we wouldn’t have suffered so many losses, and our soldiers wouldn’t have to go through such cruel torture.”","St. Willy stood up and said in a loud voice, “This operation’s codename will be ‘Heavenly Punishment’. Regardless of who they are and where they hide, we’ll catch all these scumbags!”","After some consideration, he realized that it would be hard to catch all of them. He added, “At least we’ll catch all the inciters and leaders of such slander so we can restore our heroes’ honor and reputation! Does anyone have objections?”","Everyone stared at St. Dulan intently. Finally, three empires, various kingdoms, the Dwarf Clan, and the Elf Clan asked together, “Sir, I think your Godly Palace agrees with us, right?”","Clank!","In the hall where St. Dulan sat in, the chair beneath him was instantly shattered to dust.","He didn’t have to disguise his anger in his own palace, but he knew that at this moment, all parties had to drop their grudges and work together on the issue of the Shadow Legion even if they were enemies before. Therefore, St. Dulan suppressed his anger and said, “Of course!”"]},{"number":759,"title":"Chapter 759 - Three-Year Imprisonment at the Least, Execution by Fire at the Highest!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“If no one has objections, we’ll act now!” World Magic Union President St. Willy said solemnly.","“We must act quickly.” Leidon, the King of Lianshan Principality, said in a cold voice, “While our allies fought on the frontline with their lives in danger, these people did such despicable things in their safe homes. If such people exist in my principality, they will be punished severely!”","Since this operation was led by the Magic Union and Alchemist Union and personally carried out by high-level officials from different nations and unions, it was done with ease.","– In the control room of magic forums in the headquarters of the Magic Union –","The huge control room was filled with complicated magic runes, and bright blue energy lights flowed through the runes continuously.","“Greetings, Elders.” The two mage who were guarding this place bowed with respect as several mages walked into the room.","At this moment, St. Willy was staring at the magic forum, the Eye of Mystical Realms.","Meanwhile, in the messy alchemist room, Mage Sam was still posting his comments without restraint.","He sent a message through the magic letter at the same time, [Master Lywood, is it time for you to pay me?]","As a professional hater, Mage Sam was very satisfied that he could trash the Blizzard braggers and Origins Fighters whom he hated while earning a sizable income for it.","At the same time, he had taken this opportunity to organize many ‘comrades’ who would post negative comments about the Blizzard Workshop or Origins Internet Club for as low as five radiant light bronze coins each.","After all, even magic apprentices had access to magic letters. It was a good way to earn some extra money to pay for their tuition, so why wouldn’t they?","Of course, Sam was still the most active hater among them.","At this moment, he was replying to Grand Mage Adolf’s post and putting the whole process on a Spiritual Spell Visual Projection.","He was quite popular and had even attracted many fans.","[Didn’t you say that you’d cancel my qualification as a mage?]","[I’m a high-level mage of the Radiant Light Godly Nation. Where are you from? Talk to me after you can enter the Radiant Light Godly Nation!]","“We located him!” In the headquarters of the Magic Union, an old mage said.","“Pass my order!” Several priests stood before St. Dulan in his palace. “Send the Judgement Knight Legion to catch all of them!”","“Are we really going to...?” a priest asked in a shaky voice.","“We need to do more! Now, we have to defend them!” Dulan looked as if he had swallowed a dead fly when he said that. It felt terrible now that he had to defend his enemies!","However, it must be done since it was no longer an issue of old grudges; it was something big that concerned the bottom line of every race on the whole continent. Obviously, whoever uttered any objections would die, at least for the time being.","– Three minutes later –","In the discussion group of Sam’s Spiritual Spell Visual Projection, someone said, [Hahaha... I think these guys are bursting with anger.]","[It’s nice to see them stomp in fury.]","[Aren’t you afraid that this person will come to the Radiant Light Godly Nation and look for you?] another person said with a laugh.","[Afraid of what?] Sam said with a sneer. [I’m now in Domus City in the Radiant Light Godly Nation. They are welcome to try!]","Bam! Bam! Bam!","At this moment, someone knocked on the door.","“Who is it?” Sam sounded impatient. [I need to go and get the door.]","Suddenly, a large group of knights dressed in golden armor swarmed in and pressed him down on the ground. The leader, a middle-aged knight, said chillingly, “Judgement Knight Legion! We suspect that you maliciously slandered the heroes who fought the Shadow Legion! You must come with us!”","Stunned, Sam’s mind turned completely blank.","The knight leader said coldly, “Note down all the people who have been watching this Spiritual Spell Visual Projection and who have posted comments! They’ll all be tracked down!”","All the people watching the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection were stunned as well.","Sam had never experienced such an incident before. Immediately, a foul odor of urine filled the room.","He was so scared that he wet his pants!","...","While the Orc Kingdom and the neighboring small nations started the reconstruction after the disaster, the Reela Empire, the Morning Light Empire, the Lianshan Principality, and other nations sent out all their elite forces as if they were in another war and caught all the slanderers hidden all over the continent!","The two ‘masters’, Lywood and Auth, were hunted down when they fled.","While they were pulled out with their roots, a huge group named ‘Five Bronze Coins Party’ was also exposed. The members of this group posted each hating comment for five radiant light bronze coins to trash the players of World of Warcraft in the major forums.","It even traced back to Peable of the Judgement Godly Palace.","It was said that Peable was now locked in the Anti-Magic Ice Cell at the bottom of the prison of the Judgement Godly Palace.","The others faced shame and at least three-year imprisonments in their respective nations.","As for Mage Sam who was caught in the Radiant Light Godly Nation, this nation gave him the most severe punishment, execution by fire.","The Radiant Light Godly Nation and the Judgement Godly Palace were more active than the other forces.","As for the two ‘masters’, Auth and Lywood, one of them couldn’t sustain the punishment and died in prison while the other would stay in his cell for a very long time.","...","The White Pigeon Square of Canglan City was broadcasting the feature report of this incident. Also, it did a special interview of the high-level officials from different nations and the heroes who had participated in the war.","“Look! That’s Mr. Fang!” Ron and some other young people exclaimed while sitting on a long bench on the square.","On the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection, Mr. Fang sat casually before the projection with a good-looking female mage beside him.","High-level officials from different nations sat around them.","“Mr. Fang, what are your comments about it? For example, the magic forums made it easier for people to express themselves; should we put some restraint on it?” The female mage asked with a professional smile.","Although Mr. Fang had never done any show through the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection, he wasn’t shy since he had done many livestreams. “I think it is a good thing that the development of magic forums and Spiritual Spell Visual Projection in recent years made it easier for us to express ourselves. You can say whatever you want with these tools.”","“Some people trash-talked major workshops such as the Blizzard Workshop and Softstar Workshop on the forums. What do you think of it, Mr. Fang?” the female mage asked again.","“This...” Mr. Fang replied, “Everyone is entitled to their own opinions. You may think that one thing is good, but others might not think so. It’s why we have forums where everyone can talk about their opinions. During the process, haters are inevitable.”","“Usually, it’s fine to be casual and have fun with some jokes. Even in my own livestream, some haters would like to see me make mistakes,” Mr. Fang continued, “But there are some things and some people that we can’t slander, such as the warriors who fight against invading armies and defend our nations. The freedom of speech doesn’t mean that you can trash anyone and anything maliciously. Otherwise, you’ll be punished.”","“Well said!” The female mage teased him, “Maybe you’ll have a new fan in the future, such as me.”","She ended with a smile. “Thank you again, Mr. Fang!”","...","At this moment, the previous posts could still be seen in the magic forum named the Eye of Mystical Realms.","At this moment, replies appeared under them one by one, [Here are your five bronze coins! Get out!]","Now that the hardships and misunderstanding were in the past, Dicas, who was receiving the highest honor badge, the ‘Morning Light of the Empire’ jointly awarded by the empire and the Magic Union, showed a radiant smile of joy.","The gloomy clouds finally cleared. On the Royal Square of the Morning Light Empire, the morning sunlight shined on the ground after the rain and clouds disappeared.","“Look! A rainbow appeared!” some kids exclaimed on the square."]},{"number":760,"title":"Chapter 760 - The myth in the darkness—Dark Souls!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Let’s return to the time before the warriors returned from the battleground.","[New Task: Myth in the Darkness","Task Target: Host, please improve your skills to a high level","Skill Ranks: Beginner, Elementary-level, Intermediate-level, Advanced-level, Battle Master, Battle Grandmaster, Kingly Master, Godly Master...]","Mr. Fang thought for a moment and felt like this ranking system was similar to those in games.","After remembering the System’s job, he didn’t think it was strange.","Fang Qi saw that there were several levels after godly master, but they were not levels that he should think about right now.","He glanced at his battle skill rank.","[The host’s current battle skill rank: Battle Grandmaster.]","[Task Objective: Increase battle skills to the level of Kingly Master","Task Reward: The Dark Souls series","Task Description: Bro, link the fire?]","After receiving the task, Mr. Fang would play some old games such as Resident Evil 1 and 2 or the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3 to practice his battle skills and push up his limits.","...","Some time had passed since the catastrophe in the Orc Kingdom and the neighboring nations.","With help from caring people, the Orc Kingdom and the neighboring small human nations began to recover from the catastrophe.","Of course, it would take a long time before they could return to their previous prosperity. But after the catastrophe, many people felt relieved.","...","“Hu...” Fang Qi stretched as he looked at Resident Evil 2 on his screen. He had reached the end with a dagger. Besides, he reached Act IV of Diablo 2 in Hell Difficulty and the final dual with Chong Lou in the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3. During the process, he had gradually decreased his use of items in the game.","After he made the achievements one after another, Mr. Fang heard a beep sound from the System.","The task was completed, and the privilege to release Dark Souls 1 was granted.","...","After the Burning Crusade was released, even the new shop witnessed a big growth in the number of new players. Despite the extra folding space that Mr. Fang had previously prepared and wasn’t used, the new shop was now bursting with customers.","The System version series games were usually released according to the sales of the previous game, so the Assassin’s Creed series was still being released one by one.","Besides, since the new expansion of World of Warcraft had just been released, the new players who entered the shop to play World of Warcraft wouldn’t pay attention to other games yet.","At this moment, Mr. Fang sat in his shop...","“Little Sala, the shop released the trailer for a new game today. Don’t you want to watch it?” Mr. Fang tried to lure her to watch it.","“Oh. I’m trying to level up to level 70.” Sala looked at the vast new land before her in excitement. “Wow... Is this the Outland?”","“Look at that person... she has a flying mount!” Helen grabbed Sala’s arm and screamed.","Mr. Fang was at a loss for words.","Then, he looked at Harrison who was sitting nearby.","The middle-aged assassin smiled embarrassedly and said, “My teammates are taking me to do a raid...”","On his screen was the huge Gamesman’s Hall, and he was busy playing chess in the instance, Karazhan.","“...”","Resigned, Fang Qi came to the Yuanyang City Shop. “Xiaoyue...”","“Boss, you are trying to trick me to play another horror game?!” With a pout, Jiang Xiaoyue pointed at the knight standing in darkness on the cover of the trailer and said in displeasure, “I won’t be tricked this time!","“I won’t play this game!”","Beside her, Little Bell covered her eyes and said, “I won’t play horror games again! Never!”","This deer almost died in horror when it tried Outlast after watching Mr. Fang play the game with the hide-and-seek style.","Sitting before the computer, Little Bell continued to control its tauren character and do quests.","You won’t play it? I’ll play it myself...","The good thing was that there was a huge number of players in the shops. On top of that, Mr. Fang was playing the game himself, and a small group of players followed him into the game. Therefore, this game had gradually reached the requirements for the sequels.","By now, some time had passed since the Burning Crusade was released.","Since the big raids took a long time to complete, even some high-level players began to have more free time at hand.","...","[Beep! The sales of Dark Souls 2 reached 1,000. The release of Dark Soul 3 begins. The cinematic trailer of Dark Souls 3 is activated.]","At this moment, Fang Qi finally heard the prompt of the System.","Meanwhile, a dog-headed man had just got online and logged into QQ.","Suddenly, this man saw a recommendation message. On the cover was a knight dressed in ancient armor and engulfed by sparks of fire which looked like the embers after wood was burned into ashes.","“What’s this? Dark Souls 3?”","“I’m surprised!” The dog-headed man widened his eyes. “An actual new game?”","He clicked on it.","Endless darkness appeared on his screen.","The long, cold, and desperation-inducing darkness made the world look as if it was in a chaotic period.","His gaze continuously traveled in the darkness...","“But then there was fire.” As the ancient voice filled with visited sounded by his ears, sparks of flame appeared in the darkness.","“With fire... came disparity.” On the desolate and bleak land that seemed lifeless, a blazing fire burned. “Heat and cold; life and death; and of course... light and dark.”","An ancient presence rushed toward Mr. Dirk as if a long-sealed gate was opened. Following the footsteps of history, he returned to the beginning of the world with the appearance of the first life and the separation of light and dark...","In the silence and desolation at the beginning of the world, the story... began.","The rain poured amidst thunder and lightning bolts. The ocean of clouds swept around like surging waves. The four statues of huge dragons sat in four directions. With deep and strong bell rings, gods rode huge ancient dragons and controlled golden lightning bolts, soaring in the high sky, just as praised by many myths and legends.","In an ancient grand hall covered in ivies and vines, countless white candles of different lengths lit up like stars. Then, dark blood floated up and gathered in one place.","...","A giant skull that had a crown slowly crawled out from the deepest darkness in the bottomless abyss behind the decayed skeleton cup.","...","The pilgrim kneeled before the ancient and huge castle which was built on the high mountain as if it stood on the top of the world.","“I stand here... I’m the Lord of Cinder, and this is my throne...”","“Death will destroy you again and again...”","“Only you...will survive among the accursed ones...”","Words resonated in Mr. Dirk’s ears while he watched the extremely ancient figure who seemed like it could only exist in myths and legends fly down on a huge dragon while the golden lightning light gathered in its hands... The holy thunderbolt was thrown down like the judgment from gods!","The last scene that he watched was a golden lightning tribulation!","Mr. Dirk’s mouth was wide open, but he couldn’t utter a sound the whole time. Then, he suddenly realized at the end of the trailer that...","Even the words such as legend or epic couldn’t begin to describe 0.01 percent of the wonder that he had just watched!","He felt as if his entire brain was trembling.","“This is a myth!” After putting down his virtual reality headset, he roared hoarsely in a trembling voice.","“A myth?! Where?!” The elves twitched their pointy ears...","They instantly swarmed up and stood behind him."]},{"number":761,"title":"Chapter 761 - We Have a Holiday on June 1? Promotion on June 1 and the Release of the New Game","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“What myth?”","Not long ago, many players answered the summons of some caring people and provided aid to the Orc Kingdom and the neighboring nations while dealing with their own businesses in the real world, which was why they had little time to play games.","After they returned, these people found that the Burning Crusade, the new expansion of World of Warcraft, had been released for some time. The elves threw themselves into World of Warcraft all day long to catch up with other players, so they didn’t have time for other stuff.","These people didn’t have time to notice other things until now.","Due to his recent busy work, Mr. Dirk had just returned as well.","At this moment, he pointed at the screen before him and said, “Didn’t you watch it? It’s the trailer for the new game.”","Immediately, he opened the trailer on his computer.","“Wow-!”","“A mystical realm on the myth level?”","Players exclaimed while watching the ancient and grand scenes which revealed the desolation and bleakness at the beginning of the world where everything had just begun growing.","“I wonder how they made this mystical realm...” an elf exclaimed.","“Can we really play such a game...?!”","The mysterious and powerful Blizzard Workshop and Softstar Workshop had shown the greatness of gods in some mystical realms. For example, the Legend of Sword and Fairy showed the gods that seemed to have come from the ‘East Continent’, and World of Warcraft showed the existences that were close to gods or at a godly level.","However, the players had never seen or even heard of a mystical realm that presented a true mythical era.","It was because there were few descriptions about such an era even in legends. It was extremely difficult to make a mystical realm in such a setting.","Which workshop made it?!","How come your workshops are all so awesome?!","...","Except for some special abilities, most abilities in World of Warcraft were easy to learn, which was great for legions and military training.","It was the case at least in the recent versions of the game where the max level cap was level 60 and level 70.","Therefore, for saint-level masters, the abilities were not so alluring as to the average players, unless they decided to change classes and worship Holy Light to learn those resurrection spells.","With so many priests and paladins in World of Warcraft, only a few players had mastered the resurrection spells. Saint-level masters wouldn’t give up their own system just to learn these spells.","Besides, saint-level masters were usually busy. Unlike average players, they didn’t have time to stay in the shop all day long.","Meanwhile, in the Elf Kingdom in Silver Moon Forest.","In the Royal Palace, First Elder Hyru was carefully reading the documents about the Elf Clan’s business from different places. Wearing a pair of round framed glasses made of magic crystals, he looked like an old scholar.","With care, he put stamps on the parchments and placed some of them aside for the Elf Queen to review.","There was still a big pile of documents on the desk waiting for his attention.","At this moment, his communication jade beeped on the desk.","[First Elder... a small reminder. A new mystical realm is just released! A mystical realm of the mythical era! Dark Souls 3!]","The message even had a trailer clip attached.","Hyru instantly stood up. “Mythical Era?!”","He glanced at the documents on the desk...","“This is for me...”","“This is for Her Majesty...","“I will stamp this one first...","“This needs Her Majesty’s attention...”","Messages flooded the small discussion group in QQ for the Elf Clan.","Sala said, [I wonder when Elder Hyru will come.]","[First Elder is very busy lately. I’m afraid he can’t play...]","– In the Elder Chamber –","[This one is for me... No. It’s for Her Majesty.]","[This one is... its better for Her Majesty to take care of it...]","[This one... needs Her Majesty’s attention as well...]","The small pile of parchment on his right-hand side began to grow taller.","“First Elder.” At this moment, Elf Queen Kellybel walked in.","Kellybel looked at the desk and was at a loss for words.","After a pause, First Elder Hyru said expressionlessly, “I... put them in the wrong pile.”","He quickly took them back.","...","Inside the new shop in Canglan City.","With the pace in World of Warcraft slowing down, a group of elves began to talk about the new game.","“Sala, when do you think the game will be released?” The elves sat on the couches in the lounge area in a circle.","“Just for your ears...” Sala waved at the others and told them to lean over. “I heard from Xiaoyue that the shop owner calls this a warm-up. He will select a good date to release it!”","“What date is a good date?” Rowling, another member of the Snow Pigeon Team, asked immediately.","“Xiaoyue said it’s tomorrow!” Sala revealed the news in a low voice, “The shop owner said to Xiaoyue, ‘Tomorrow is a good day. Tomorrow is June 1st and your holiday.’”","[TL Note: June 1st is Children’s Day in China.]","“Huh? Do we have a holiday tomorrow?” The elves were delighted. “At their homeland, June 1st is a holiday for people like us?”","“Right!” Sala said excitedly, “It’s said that all the games in the shop will have discounts tomorrow. The lowest is 30 percent off!”","“If you buy ten games, you’ll get one old game or movie for free!”","“Won’t the shop owner lose lots of money?” Rowling exclaimed, “The stuff sold for 10 magic crystals will sell for only 7 magic crystals, which means that he will lose 3 magic crystals for each of the items he sells?”","“Oh-!” Rowling took out money from her pocket and counted. “Tomorrow, I’ll buy ten!”","At this moment, many people in the Radiant Light Godly Nation, Dulan Workshop, and Crystal Workshop were monitoring the shop closely.","Outside the opened door, some figures were loitering. “Hiss... The shop will lose 3 magic crystals from a mystical realm that originally cost 10 magic crystals... the customers will also get free stuff when buying 10 games!? It means more losses... If 100,000 people come and buy stuff from the shop, isn’t the shop going to go bankrupt...?”","...","– On the next day –","It was June 1st.","The new shop and the old shops were all cleaned up and well decorated. For example, in the old shop in Yuanyang City, Jessica and her companions, who were both official novel translators and janitors, were dressed in thick Disney teddy bear costumes.","“Ahh! How come there are three bears!?” The big white deer laughed upon entering the shop.","“Oh! Look over there!” Jiang Xiaoyue exclaimed when she saw a young man wearing a light helmet and holding a strange-shaped iron-boned umbrella.","“Myriad Manifestation Umbrella?!”","“There! There!” Mu Qing yelled, “Isn’t that Jing Tian’s family?!”","“Wow-! That’s a Pikachu sitting there!” In the new shop in Canglan City, Sala exclaimed with stars in her eyes. “Let’s sit over there!”","“Sir! Sir! Activate it for me! I want to activate ten games!” Rowling read the game list and said, “My goodness?! When were Dark Souls 1 and 2 released?! Activate all three of them for me!”"]},{"number":762,"title":"Chapter 762 - A Group of Newbies Entered the Game","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Elf Queen Kellybel now understood that Sylvanas was only a fictional character in the mystical realm in World of Warcraft.","As the queen of a kingdom that valued freedom, Kellybel didn’t think that she needed to mind the business in a virtual world.","However, as a good leader, Kellybel needed to obtain a deeper understanding of the needs of the citizens in the Elf Kingdom under her leadership.","Meanwhile, she felt guilty that she only found out the key to the victory of the alliance army after the war at the Lianshan Principality.","Therefore, she decided to go and experience it in person.","– Meanwhile, in the Elder Hall where First Elder Hyru lived –","First Elder Hyru straightened his robe and was about to set off.","“First Elder.” Elf Queen Kellybel walked over and asked, “Can you do me a favor?”","“...” First Elder Hyru froze for a second. Remembering the previous incident, he felt guilty and said immediately, “I’ll do my best.”","“Wonderful!” Kellybel took out a big pile of parchment from her storage space and placed them on First Elder Hyru’s desk. “I have more important business to attend to. Thank you very much.”","Then, she left in a hurry.","First Elder Hyru who was ready to set off stared at the desk in a daze and then at the direction that the Elf Queen had taken.","He slumped onto his chair and murmured, “I...”","...","Having stayed in the Elf Royal Palace for a long time, Kellybel thought that her knowledge about the world was outdated.","After all, some things couldn’t be understood by merely reading intelligence reports.","Therefore, she felt it was necessary to know the world better, which was more important than dealing with the tedious documents and was an urgent business for her right now.","“Um... three days are enough.” Before she set off, she had made a good plan for her journey.","“But I can’t let them know about it...” Kellybel changed into exquisite body-fitting leather armor, took off her crown, and pulled her hair up in a neat ponytail. After holstering a long bow and a long sword, she changed her looks slightly with some spells and turned into a heroic-looking elf rogue.","...","Although saint-level masters were rare, this continent was vast with a large population, which meant that the number of saint-level masters was not as little as one might imagine.","After pushing open the door and entering the shop, Kellybel looked around and spotted a few saint-level masters. “Isn’t that St. Wilson...? The Nation-Protecting Sword Saint?”","“Isn’t that St. Leidon from Lianshan Principality...?”","The stout middle-aged man looked elated while he made a list. “Sir, I want these ten games including all of the Dark Souls series.”","“Please activate Dark Souls 3 for me.”","Mr. Fang was busy selling membership cards and activating the new game when a tall and slim female elf walked up. “My name’s Kelly, an elf rogue. Please activate Dark Souls 3 for me too.”","This elf... I didn’t ask your name. How come you sound as if you are afraid that I would mistake you for someone else?","“A new elf?” Mr. Fang took her money and activated the game for her with a puzzled expression.","Kellybel came just in time. It was early morning, and many players of the Jiuhua City Shop, Half City Shop, and Yuanyang City Shop had just begun to try this game.","Accompanied by a hymn-like song, the dark scene before the players looked extremely mysterious and weird. The deep bell toll added an explicable heaviness to the scene.","“Yes, indeed. It is called Lothric.”","“Where the transitory lands of the Lords of Cinder converge.”","“In venturing north, the pilgrims discover the truth of the old words: ‘The fire fades and the lords go without thrones.’ When the link of the fire is threatened, the bell tolls, unearthing the old Lords of Cinders from their graves.”","Even though they didn’t know what the old words were about, the players sensed that this was the beginning of a desolate and weird world where all lifeforms were being born from the simple introduction in the opening cinematics. They could tell that it was totally different from any world they had known about.","One after another, the ancient Lords of Cinder crawled out from their coffins, and big puddles of black wet mud oozed from its decrepit coffin.","“Aldrich, Saint of the Deep.”","In a ruined tomb covered by mist, tall and thin knights wearing unique helmets with sharp horns slowly stood up while leaning on their huge swords.","“Farron’s Undead Legion, the Abyss Watchers.”","The ground quaked violently as a mountain-like figure sat up from an extremely huge stone coffin. Under the hooded chain mail that the giant wore on his head, there was a deep black hole on his face, and a hoarse roar came out from the black hole with a destructive storm.","“And the reclusive lord of the Profaned Capital, Yhorm the Giant.”","“What’s this...?!” This scene had gone beyond every player’s understanding of the world as they saw nothing but destruction and ruins. Even the kings and saints in this world were nightmarish existences.","Elf Queen Kellybel and the other saint-level masters shivered uncontrollably at this scene, wondering, What kind of world is this?","The elves, knights, and some saint-level masters who were watching the opening cinematics put down their virtual reality headsets subconsciously. Looking around, they saw the same grimness and horror on each other’s faces.","“Only, in truth... the Lords will abandon their thrones...” the ancient voice on the screen continued.","“And the Unkindled will rise. Nameless, accursed Undead, unfit even to be cinder. And so it is, that ash seeketh embers.”","After choosing one’s class, the bell tolled. The players controlled their own characters and climbed out of the unnamed ancient stone coffins in a bleak graveyard.","The stone coffins and tablets that were randomly scattered on the ground and the grey lifeless valley filled with grey mist made the world look like a nightmare.","If it was a myth and a legend, then it only existed in a world of nightmares.","It looked even wierder and creepier than a nightmare.","It was the opposite of the beautiful and prosperous land that the players knew about. It was full of darkness and despair, waiting for destruction.","“Undead...?” No, they were not undead since the deep sleep after death was a luxury for them.","They were the nameless, accursed unkindled that were unfit to be Lords of Cinder. After they died, they couldn’t obtain a peaceful deep sleep. Instead, they were resurrected near the fire and continued to die again and again in this nightmarish world until their spirit collapsed and they became hollow corpses without consciousness.","“How come there is such a strange world...” At this moment, Su Tianji had turned on her livestream. With a horrified expression, she controlled her character to walk out cautiously. “This looks scary... I’ll try playing it for a while...”"]},{"number":763,"title":"Chapter 763 - Fight the Boss in novice village for one year? Come and check out the game that has the most value?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The opening cinematics of Dark Souls 3 had a vague introduction, but the plot was easy to understand. The ancient Lords of Cinder woke up from their tombs since they shouldered the duty to rekindle the fire.","However, these Lords of Cinder didn’t want to fulfil their duties. At this moment, the accursed unkindled who couldn’t become Lords of Cinder woke up from deep sleep and came out from the tombs of ashes, following the route that the Lords of Cinder took. They must return these lords to their thrones.","This was the basic storyline of Dark Souls 3.","...","As for the destiny of the Lords of Cinder and why they didn’t want to take the glorious thrones of lords, it was easy to understand when the players saw the words ‘cinder’ and ‘link the fire’. They would have to burn themselves up to rekindle the fire.","The origin of linking the fire could be traced back to the very ancient times (as shown in Dark Souls 1).","Fire brought everything to the world, and the creatures that first discovered fire had gained extremely great power from it. These creatures were the first group of gods in this world.","However, fire would eventually die out, which would mean the end of the world. To stop the invasion of darkness, Gwyn, a Lord of Cinder, the first god who had gained the golden lightning power from the first flame and was the leader of the godly race, chose to burn his powerful soul to maintain the fire.","That was why not everyone could link the fire. Each Lord of Cinder had to be one of the top existences of the world or even... a god.","...","Containing the power of the first flame, these beings were the most powerful existences. Some of them were powerful gods or existences more powerful than gods.","The unkindled ash, as the name indicated, were not strong enough to rekindle the flame, and thus were existences who were as lowly as ash.","These were the characters that the players controlled.","It was why the old words said, “Ash seeketh ember”.","...","Therefore, Dark Souls was totally different from any game that the shop had previously released, either in the world views or the battle styles.","When facing an existence who was countless times more powerful than you, you could only rely on battle skills that could even subdue gods and the moderate growth in strength that you obtained during the process.","The only thing that you could use to help you battle to the end was probably the rusty weapon that you had when you climbed out from the tomb.","You must rely on these things to kill the gods.","...","“Mingxue said that this game is super difficult...” Sala and some elves were talking about the game.","The other newbies in Mr. Fang’s shops obviously hadn’t realized this.","“Difficult?” Leidon and other saint-level masters sitting nearby said in amusement, “I think it might be only difficult for average people.”","We’re saint-level masters, and raiding instances in World of Warcraft was quite easy!","Elf Queen Kellybel also thought, I’m close to the pinnacle stage of saint-level; how can a mystical realm be difficult for me?","“There are grave goods? Gemstones?” Kellybel felt that it was cheating to be given such good items at the beginning of the game. Therefore, she chose to take nothing.","After choosing to be a sorceress, she entered the game.","...","The Cemetery of Ash was located in a desolate valley. Besides the players, there were only a few deserted corpses that lost their mind, which was the inevitable fate for the unkindled.","At this moment, Elf Queen Kellybel was dressed in a slightly dirty white robe with a small round shield in one hand and a slim sword that looked like a décor piece in the other hand. Obviously, elves liked these kinds of swords.","Due to her current low level, she didn’t have magic spells, but elves could cast spells as well as fight in close-range.","Disturbed by her steps, a mindless deserted corpse lunged at her with a snarl.","Kellybel cast the initial sorcery, Soul Arrow, and pierced the corpse’s chest with a streak of pale blue magic light. Then, she killed it with a clean sword slash.","“Simple!” She was still uncomfortable that her strength was reduced to that of an average person.","Putting down her virtual reality headset, she looked around and mumbled, “Who said that this game was difficult?”","“It’s simple in the beginning.” Having finished his instant noodles at the counter, Mr. Fang was walking toward his computer. He glanced at her when passing by and said, “This is the tutorial for new players; it teaches you some basic controls, and there is a boss for new players. It’s simple.”","“Is it so? I have to fight my way to the later stages if I want to challenge something difficult?” Kellybel looked displeased, wondering why she couldn’t directly skip to the more difficult stages...","Anyway, she had to find the easy boss for new players first.","Walking out of the Cemetery of Ash, she saw a narrow mountainous path. The terrain was simple but very dim.","If she didn’t venture to the branch paths, she could easily find the path out of the cemetery. The tall and thick city walls and the huge stone arch gate guarded by a few deserted corpses formed the portal leading to the outside world.","Walking through the gate, Kellybel saw a big round square. In the center of the square was a giant wearing heavy armor which appeared to be made of neither gold nor stone. Right now, this giant was half-kneeling.","Even when half-kneeling, this giant was much taller than her.","It was silent as if it was dead.","However, the black tentacle-like things on its back seemed to be moving.","“Sir, I can go out after defeating this thing, right?” Seeing Mr. Fang sitting not far from her, Kellybel put down her virtual reality headset and called out to him.","“Right! That’s Iudex Gundyr,” Mr. Fang called out.","Many years had passed, but Mr. Fang still remembered the full name of the boss in the tutorial.","“How do I fight it?” Kellybel looked at it. “Should I pull out the sword from its chest?”","After asking that question, she slowly pulled the coiled sword from the giant’s chest with all her strength.","The giant seemed to recover its senses and slowly stood up. Kellybel could see its pitch-black and distorted demonic face and the black and cold eyes behind the grey helmet that seemed to have come from an abyss.","When it lifted the huge halberd that was almost six meters long, the warrior who seemed to have come from the ancient times and had survived many horrifying battles came back to life.","Kellybel’s heart lurched.","Gurdyr was nimbler than she expected and brandished his huge halberd, creating whistling sounds.","Looking down at her slim sword that was as small as a tooth pick, her ragged sorceress’ robe, and the small round shield which had been smashed to an unrecognizable shape, Kellybel was petrified...","With a scream, she ran toward the gate that she walked through but found that it was sealed by magic!","She hammered at the gate wildly!","Gundyr bent its knees a bit and leaped up into the sky like a cannon ball. Then, it struck down its 6-meter-long halberd with vicious force!","Boom!","...","– Ten seconds later –","A cold corpse lay on the ground, and a line of bloody words appeared on Kellybel’s screen: [You died.]","...","-Ten hours later-","Having played games for an entire day, Mr. Fang stretched and stood up to get something to eat.","He glanced at Kellybel’s screen when walking past here. “??? You’re still in the novice village?”","Kellybel was at a loss for words. While gritting her teeth, she turned her head and glared at Mr. Fang with murderous spirit."]},{"number":764,"title":"Chapter 764 - You Think You’re Great After Defeating Gundyr? Everyone Gets a Lessen in the Novice Village","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Is this really a tutorial for beginners?” St. Leidon was feeling dizzy.","On his screen, a figure in ragged knight armor fell and rolled on the ground as the boss chased after him.","At this moment, Gundyr’s upper body expanded and turned into a skinless monster that looked like a dragon or a snake, and its body was covered in black pus.","When it swung its head and tail, more than half of the big arena became a death zone!","With eyes emitting vicious red light, it ravaged its opponent wildly even after the latter was dead, shattering the body and the ground to dust.","You told me that this is a tutorial for beginners?!","At this moment, he had the urge to return to the coffin!","...","By now, most players had reached the limit of playtime for today.","“Is this mystical realm for people to use?” Kellybel was still thinking about how to fight Gundyr when she got offline, wondering if anyone could defeat it.","She thought to herself. After all, I’m a saint-level master. Since I can’t pass it, no one could defeat this boss, right?","At this moment, she heard an exclamation, “My goodness! Someone passed it!”","“What?!” Following the sound, she saw a large group of elves sitting on the couches in the lounge area with some knights from the Golden Griffin Knight Legion. They were watching the livestream from the Continent of Immortal Relic.","“Some of them are super powerful...” Commander Elven exclaimed in astonishment.","“This senior has passed it for a while a now.” Sala pointed at her communication jade and said.","“...” Kellybel almost died of shame and humiliation!","How come some people are so powerful!?","Instantly, she had the feeling that her elves would follow others if she didn’t work hard.","Of course, as the Queen of the Elf Clan, she hoped that these elves would admire her.","-On the next day-","Before Mr. Fang opened the door, he saw an elf standing outside.","How come she is so eager to play? Fang Qi found that this elf came by herself everyday.","“Don’t you have friends to come with you?” Mr. Fang asked while opening the door.","Ignoring him, Kellybel hurried over to a computer.","She looked haughty and had the presence that she was busy and didn’t want to talk.","Since someone passed it, I just don’t believe that I can’t do it!","After all, she had reached the saint-level, which meant that her talent wasn’t poor. After her practice all day long yesterday, she had accumulated some experience. A while later...","After dying many times, the battered character controlled by Kellybel narrowly dodged Gundyr’s swipe with its huge withered claws. She rolled sideways and got close to Gundyr, deciding to head into danger and risk it all for the chance to win!","She thrust out her sword!","“I passed it! I passed it!” she exclaimed while wiping her sweat.","The elves were always alert to all kinds of disturbances in the shop. Sure enough, a group of elves walked over with bowls of instant noodles in their hands.","On the screen, Gundyr’s huge body fell down, and some of the strength in the corpse and soul was drawn out and absorbed by the player, which could be used to increase their stats later on.","Of course, the collected souls could be used as the unique currency in this world to buy items as well.","Meanwhile, the embers in Gundyr’s body gradually lit up in the body of the character that Kellybel controlled. Through the looted ember, the players could increase their max HP.","Kellybel had indeed passed the stage.","“My goodness! How did you pass it?” One elf asked humbly.","“Hahahaha!” Kellybel felt satisfied but remained calm on the surface, acting like she was still engrossed in the game.","“This...” Kellybel earnestly concluded while she continued playing, “This is in fact not difficult.”","Different from other games, this game almost had no shortcuts. The players must completely rely on their own battle skills, combat techniques, and meticulous control of details.","At this moment, the character that Kellybel controlled finally pushed open the huge stone gate that had been sealed for many years behind Gundyr. As a heavy boom noise sounded, she finally saw the world outside the gate.","Walking up along the mountainous path, she saw an ancient stone hall – Firelink Shrine.","When the coiled sword was inserted into the center of the shrine and the bonfire was lit up, the journey for the tutorial would come to an end.","Opposite to the entrance of the Firelink Shrine were five huge thrones under the illumination of randomly placed white candles. These were the thrones for the Lords of Cinder.","A crestfallen warrior sat beside the thrones.","The Firelink Shrine had only an entrance but no exit or any other paths leading to the outside.","“Skills... can you explain it in detail?” Sala asked while watching this strange elf play the game.","Obviously, she had been stuck at Gundyr for a long time now.","“Of course!” Elf Queen Kellybel had been admired and praised by elves all day long before, but she had felt nothing special at the time. But now, she had a great sense of achievement. “Let me find a boss who is more powerful than this one.”","At this moment, many more players walked over and watched her play.","“Someone in our shop passed it too?” Helen asked in surprise.","“Yeah. She might be the first one in our shop!”","A few saint-level masters also looked over.","There was no exit in the Firelink Shrine, and Kellybel came back after walking around it. Of course, the deserted corpses outside were not her targets. She walked up along the path on the left-hand side close to the cliff and saw a person totally different from the deserted corpses.","“This monster looks different. I’ll use it as an example to show you the skills.” After all, she had killed the boss, which meant that she was unrivaled in this ‘novice village’.","“Okay!” The viewers behind her nodded repeatedly.","On the path of the cliff, a thin man wearing ragged clothes walked over with a long saber.","He looked even worse than a beggar.","“Here!” While holding her slim sword, Kellybel explained confidently, “The most important thing about battle skills is that you must control your movements meticulously and understand yourself better. When you can control your movements perfectly, you can deal with any enemies with ease.”","With that said, she stabbed at the opponent when the latter came within her attack range.","Clank!","A saber light flashed, and a muffled noise sounded. Her sword was sent flying. Since she grasped onto her sword tightly, her arms moved back as well. A strange force bounced back all her force, and her whole body turned numb as if she had been smashed by a huge hammer.","Then, she watched as her opponent pierced the saber into her chest!","Words appeared on her screen: [You died.]","Dumbfounded, Kellybel looked at the screen with a dull expression. “...”","Everyone behind her was at a loss for words."]},{"number":765,"title":"Chapter 765 - Who Dares to Call Me an Entertainment Streamer? Watch Me Open the Treasure Chest","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Huh? How come you couldn’t defeat a weak hollow?” The elves watching from behind looked contemptuous. This person was wearing ragged clothes, looking only a bit more powerful than the hollows.","Of course, hollows were weak only in comparison.","They could dodge, sneak-attack, pretend to be dead, and summon other hollows for help. Sometimes, players would be caught by surprise with an arrow in the head. Without questions, these arrows were shot by hollow archers hiding in a corner while the hollow soldiers standing outside diverted the players’ attention.","So, they were weak only in comparison with other enemies in Dark Souls.","“This one looks more powerful than the average hollow. Is it an elite hollow?” The elves standing behind her murmured to each other.","“She was instantly killed by an elite hollow after defeating Gundyr, which means that she must have passed it with luck.”","“Let’s go! I don’t want to watch it anymore,” one elf said.","“I passed it with luck?!” Indignant, Kellybel resurrected and raced to the ‘elite hollow’ again with gritted teeth, determined to kill it today!","“I was careless!” she yelled, “I assure you that I can pass it this time!”","She ran to the thin man who was dressed in ragged clothes and holding a long saber.","“As long as I control my movements well and watch out for his attacks, he can’t hit me.” This time, Kellybel was obviously more cautious.","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang was checking his bag after killing the boss. He glanced at a piece of ragged clothes accidentally and saw two lines in the item description.","[A terribly worn shirt. Men are fond of weaving tales to explain the raggedness of their garb.]","[My sixth sense warned me of danger, and I danced between flurries of blades, unscathed, but alas, my clothes went to tatters.]","...","– One day later –","There was not a single elf watching Kellybel play.","Mr. Fang glanced at her screen when passing by. “How come you’re still in the novice village?”","“...”","“Can’t you keep your mouth shut?!” She almost exploded in anger.","...","Several days later, some saint-level masters gathered in the lounge area of the shop. “Have you passed the tutorial for the beginners?”","“Don’t even mention it... After I defeated Gundyr, I got out just now after being beaten for a whole day by that ‘Sword Master’.”","“I’m in a worse situation!” another saint-level master complained in tears. “I thought that the crestfallen warrior sitting by the thrones of Lords of Cinder was a enemy, and I struck at him twice. Now, I deleted my account and started again...”","“Why?”","“He hunted me down each time I resurrected, again and again...” The saint-level master looked to be on the verge of a mental collapse. “I haven’t been able to defeat it yet...”","“...” They had been tortured mercilessly in the game.","“No!” St. Leidon thought it wasn’t fair that they were tortured alone.","St. Wilson, St. Leidon, and the other saint-level masters exchanged a look in the lounge area and found that they shared the same thought. “We can recommend this mystical realm to other people!”","Instantly, they sat closer in a circle and discussed in low voices. “How about St. Willy?”","St. Willy was the President of the World Magic Union and one of the ultimate figures.","“Mr. Saladin is also good!” Leidon said.","“Yeah!” The others instantly looked at each other and had the tactical understanding.","“How about Ms. Joanna from the Alchemist Union?” They were talking about the mature-looking woman dressed in a fiery-red mage’s robe who also had participated in the war against the Shadow Legion.","“How about St. Hematon?” World Mage Hematon was also called Proud Hematon, which meant that he was a man who took great pride in himself.","“And how about...”","“Hahahaha...” The atmosphere in the lounge area instantly turned from suffocating to cheerful.","...","While the saint-level masters were stuck in the first stage for a long time in the old shop, the players in the old shops obviously fared much better.","At this moment, a dog-headed man was intently watching a livestream on his communication jade while sitting on the sofa.","Sitting nearby, the elves and knights each held a communication jade, and they were also engrossed in livestreams.","The players could teleport from the Bonfire in the Firelink Shrine to the High Wall of Lothric. Only by coming to this grand wall did the players truly walk out of the novice zone.","There were only hollows on the abandoned city walls which were as wide as streets on which four horse-drawn carriages could travel on in parallel. A huge dragon’s corpse was left dried up and weathered on the wall.","Countless hollowed corpses kneeled before the huge dragon, like pilgrims.","Rowling was now watching Su Tianji’s livestream. “How is this streamer?”","“Xiaoyue said that she is an entertainment streamer,” Sala said.","At this moment, Su Tianji was playing the game connected with Nalan Mingxue and some other players.","Dark Souls could be played online. Each player’s game world was like a parallel plane. When a player left a sign on the ground, other players with embers could see the sign and summon the player who had made the sign to their own world in the form of ‘spirits’.","Of course, some NPCs also left signs since the players were not the only ‘unkindled ashes’ in this world.","“It says that she is a technical streamer...” Rowling glanced at the streamer introduction.","At this moment, Su Tianji controlled her game character to cleanly kill the deserted corpses on the high wall with her teammates. Meanwhile, she said, “How come I feel like some people keep saying that I’m an entertainment streamer?”","A row of bullet comments shot up.","[That’s a good assessment.]","[Who said that?]","[Well said!]","“...”","“You bunch of haters! I’m furious!” While brushing back her slightly messy, wind-blown hair, Su Tianji looked forward and saw a huge fire-breathing dragon close to 100 meters long was coiled on the top of the high wall.","Below it, the door to the round tower was locked.","Hollow corpses and pus-covered creatures like Gundyr were everywhere in this abandoned city. Despite the danger and mysteries that seemed to lurk everywhere, people couldn’t help wondering if some treasures were hidden in this place.","The dragon spat out fire and burned most of the monsters on the city wall to ashes!","“Guys, look! Do you think the dragon is guarding some treasures?” Su Tianji’s acute senses seemed to detect something. “Otherwise, it wouldn’t be coiling up there!”","“Here’s the plan. You guys divert the attention of the dragon, and I’ll slip down to the round tower to check it out.” Su Tianji thought that she needed to show-off some of her techniques. Otherwise, people will always think that I’m an entertainment streamer.","Nalan Mingxue gave her a ‘ok’ hand gesture.","Then, she ran down the path beneath the huge dragon. Sure enough, the huge dragon inhaled deeply and then spat fire.","At this moment, Nalan Mingxue had run to the guard tower on the opposite side. The wall of the guard tower was so thick that even dragon fire couldn’t penetrate it.","Meanwhile, Su Tianji slipped into the building under the huge dragon.","“What do you think of my techniques?!” Su Tianji said smugly.","“This streamer seems to have good techniques...” Rowling exclaimed.","Su Tianji opened the iron door and saw an old deserted room. It was messy with some old and used items, which showed that this room had once been used by someone.","At first glance, there seemed to have nothing valuable in it.","Then, she spotted a giant old chest on the first floor below her!","“Oh! There’re indeed treasures!” Su Tianji’s beautiful eyes lit up.","Walking to the chest, she opened it and said smugly, “Am I not awesome? This is called intuition!”","“I’ll see who dares to call me entertainment strea... Wuuu-!”","Before she could finish, the chest opened its huge mouth full of sharp teeth and swallowed her.","The viewers saw Su Tianji’s legs wildly kicking around outside the chest.","“Wu-!”","Then, her legs straightened and turned stiff.","[You died.]"]},{"number":766,"title":"Chapter 766 - The Choice Between Obligation and Destiny, Farron’s Undead Legion","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Have you found treasures?”","Su Tianji was silent.","Bullet comments flooded the screen in her livestream room.","[Thanks to Entertainment Elder for the gift of ‘Awesome’.]","[Thanks to...]","“How did you die? How come so many people are showering you with gifts again?” Nalan Mingxue and the others were stupefied.","“I don’t know.” Su Tianji didn’t know what to say. “You guys come here. When I opened the treasure chest, it turned into a monster!”","“The chest turned into a monster?” After putting down her virtual reality headset, Nalan Mingxue looked over and saw on Su Tianji’s screen that the treasure chest stood up and changed into a pitch-black thin monster with a big tongue dangling out of its mouth. It was wandering in the room right now.","“We’re coming.” Using the same tactic, Nalan Mingxue dodged the huge dragon’s fire and dashed into the room. Then, she heard the monster’s deep snarls.","Then, she went downstairs.","Suddenly, she heard a strong wind howling sound!","Boom!","Nalan Mingxue felt as if her whole body was struck by a meteorite. Even the extremely hard wall behind her was shattered into dust.","Words appeared on her screen. [You died.]","“...” She was stupefied.","Even the viewers in the new shop were dazed.","“How come you’re dead too?” Song Qingfeng, who was still outside, froze.","“I was killed instantly!”","He looked over at Nalan Mingxue’s screen and saw that her whole body was smashed into the wall. “...”","Instantly, they sensed deep malice and a scheme.","“...”","...","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang had just beaten the boss before him to near-death and then put on the helm that resembled the mimic chests.","The description flashed across the item.","[Symbol of Avarice: Head of the avaricious creature that mimics treasure chests. The ancient godly race. The very form of this creature is thought to be a form of brand, a punishment for sin.]","Perhaps affected by the imminent fall of darkness, the dying flame, or the curse of the unkindled, they finally became such monsters after death.","...","Different from other games, in Dark Souls, the players could go through the main storyline without knowing anything except for linking fire. In fact, the players didn’t even need to know why they were doing this.","However, if the players collected the objects, items, and souls, they would get the complete story about the world by piecing together the information and clues that these things provided. These things contained countless heavy and dark stories from the ancient times.","After leaving Firelink Shrine, the players’ mission was to bring back the Lords of Cinder. In the meantime, the players embarked on a journey of exploration of the whole dark world.","Walking down the High Wall of Lothric, one could see a huge abandoned hall where the hard and thick floor had been smashed several feet down into the ground by something. Zong Wu, Gu Tingyun, and others stood in the hall with grim expressions.","A hill-like wild beast wearing thick ice armor roared before them with a huge hammer in its hand. It spat out frost air which instantly swept across the whole hall.","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang returned to the Firelink Shrine and handed a soul to the only remaining Lord of Cinders, Ludleth of Courland, who was a pygmy.","In Dark Souls, the pygmies referred to humans since all the other races were taller than humans)","The soul burned like flames. When it was picked up, there was the item description.","[Vordt was once an Outrider Knight who served under Pontiff Sulyvahn. He served alongside the Dancer of the Boreal Valley until their transformation.]","Soon, it was turned into a ring that had a weird black eye on it.","[Pontiff’s Right Eye: Bewitched ring that Pontiff Sulyvahn bestowed upon his knights. Knights who peer into the black orb are lured into battles of death, transformed into frenzied beasts.]","[No wonder the Pontiff only provides these rings to those dispatched to foreign lands.]","...","That was the general idea of the story.","If the players explored deeper into the world, they would gather more information about the plot little by little.","...","According to the progress of the game, the first Lord of Cinder that they would encounter was Farron’s Undead Legion, the Abyss Watchers...","Next, they would encounter Aldrich, who devoured gods.","Then, the Yhorm the Giant of the Profaned Capital.","Afteward, it was the Prince of Lothric.","The final part was the story of the main character, the nameless person without a past.","Right now, the players had just defeated the first few bosses and were at the stage of the ‘Abyss’ and ‘Farron’s Undead Legion’.","In fact, ever since their encounter with Gundyr, the players began to get in touch with the abyss. The horrifying people covered in pus were the result of the erosion by the abyss.","The power of abyss originated from darkness; it came even earlier than the first flame.","...","At this moment, Sala and other elves were progressing very slowly in the game, but it didn’t stop them from watching livestreams.","They were now sitting on the couches in the lounge area in a circle. “Look at this senior...”","Obviously, they were watching Nalan Hongwu’s livestream.","Nalan Hongwu had obviously played Dark Souls 1 and thus had more advantages over others.","The players walked out of the gate behind the Boreal Valley, flew over Lothric City which was divided into two halves by the broken mountain, and walked through the Crucifixion Woods and down the Road of Sacrifice. Then, they would reach Farron Keep.","This was the frontline of resisting the abyss.","Sala was now watching the livestream in which the crestfallen warrior in Firelink Shrine was telling the information about Farron’s Undead Legion with a mocking and somewhat sad tone.","“Gaining admission to the Legion is a matter of some ceremony. Inside their keep, snuffing out the flames of three altars opens the door to the wolf blood. Sworn by the wolf’s blood to contain the Abyss, the Legion will bury a kingdom at the first sign of exposure.”","...","The initial mission of Farron’s Undead Legion, Watchers of Abyss was monitoring the abyss.","When the bell tolled, they woke up from deep sleep. In confusion, they sensed the restlessness in the Abyss under Farron Keep and chose to perform their initial mission. They crawled out from their tombs and returned to their previous posts.","– On the screen of the livestream-","At this moment, more people walked over and stood behind them, including some newly arrived saint-level masters.","Sala glanced back. “So many people?”","At this moment, Nalan Hongwu controlled his character to push open the gate which had been sealed for many years.","They saw such a scene. Piles of corpses were inside, and the horrid army that could easily destroy a nation now only had a few of its members remaining standing.","The tall captain pierced one of its comrades through the chest with his huge sword, and the corpse slowly fell down.","Then, another one got up with dark eyes that had crimson lights flashing in them.","When you look long into an abyss, the abyss looks into you.","None of them could escape the fate of being eroded by the abyss.","The unkindled resurrected endlessly, and the captain, the only one who had consciousness, had to kill his teammates again and again.","At this moment, he seemed to notice that someone had extinguished flames of three altars and came in through the gate","He slowly turned around. With his huge sword in his right hand pointing forward and his dagger in his left hand resting on his right arm, this man performed the unique greeting gesture of the Undead Legion.","To perform his obligation or accept the destiny to link the fire... all this would be decided by this battle."]},{"number":767,"title":"Chapter 767 - Farron’s Breakdance Crew, Teaching Awkward Dance Online","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“They’d have us seek the Lords of Cinder and return them to their moulding thrones. But we’re talking true legends with the mettle to link the fire. We’re not fit to lick their boots. Don’t you think?”","Just as the crestfallen warrior in the Firelink Shrine said, many nameless people without past or future crawled out from their tombs. One day, they might silently turn into deserted corpses on their way and never regain their senses again.","Death was their eternal companion.","Gundyr, Vordt of the Boreal Valley, the stinky and poisonous swamp in Farron Keep, the omnipresent basilisks that could cast curses and cause instant death, and the most ancient dark wraiths...","All players, regardless if they were newbies or veterans, had to go through hundreds of deaths before they could come before the first Lord of Cinder—Farron’s Undead Legion.","Each battle with an enemy or a boss was a fierce combat.","Obviously, Nalan Hongwu had gone through countless deaths before he came here. This might be the most dangerous experience for him, so he acted extremely cautious.","In fact, the process was so torturous that even Kellybel, a saint-level master, wanted to quit the game at this moment.","After all, they were knocked down on the ground and tortured by all kinds of enemies and bosses each day!","...","Sala and the other elves were even worse. Over 90 percent of them were forced into defeat by Gundyr.","They felt like they might not be able to clear the stage for the rest of their lives.","However, this didn’t stop them from watching others clear stages on livestream.","Meanwhile, the famous streamer Mr. Dirk obviously didn’t want to be a lazy player. After all, everyone was now talking about this new game.","Therefore, he sat on a couch and watched the livestream carefully to get himself familiar with the process, so he wouldn’t be tortured too much when he did his own livestream.","Almost every battle in Dark Souls was a fight against an opponent much stronger than oneself.","At this moment, Nalan Hongwu held his dark sword and performed a military salute at his opponent.","Seeing this scene, the viewers felt that this legion might not be a great lord, but they were definitely a group of competent soldiers.","These beings were admirable regardless of which choice they made, whether they did what they did due to their obligation as soldiers or their destinies as lords. Only Nalan Hongwu, a veteran military man, could relate to their dilemma.","Two swordsmen dressed in the Undead Legion’s unique red capes and helms with pointy horns charged at Nalan Hongwu with strange steps.","They used a moveset associated with the Farron Greatsword.","Different from the two-handed swords that were as thick as a door in Final Fantasy, these huge swords that were nearly two meters long didn’t look heavy. The blades were as thick as an arm, and they could cover a large area around the user while also being very nimble.","The daggers in their left hands could make up for most of their weak spots when they slashed out with the great swords.","The silver sword light covered dozens of meters in one instant like a waterfall. Meanwhile, Nalan Hongwu reacted quickly by clearly rolling out of the attack range. The stones on the ground exploded into debris by this sword strike!","Obviously, Nalan Hongwu made a small mistake in judgement. The slashing blade thrust up heavily toward him again as dust and whistling debris permeated the air!","The swiftness and the perfect control of movements were astonishing!","Even if they were at the same level of strength, it was extremely difficult for Nalan Hongwu to fight such an opponent who was experienced and used excellent sword techniques, not to mention that Nalan Hongwu’s physical strength and speed were inferior to those of his opponent.","At this moment, a sword beam shot across the whole battleground like a shooting star and pierced his arm instantly!","With red lights flashing in his eyes, this figure was a member of the Undead Legion who had been eroded by the abyss and was being resurrected again and again.","As the captain of Farron’s Undead Legion, he had to accept the tragic fate that he must fight his former comrades and pierce their chests with swords. The battle continued.","Since the duel became a chaotic battle of three sides, the pressure on Nalan Hongwu greatly decreased.","Finally, the Abyss Watchers tried to get up but couldn’t. Eventually, he dropped to the ground listlessly.","“He died just like this?” For some reason, the elves only felt deep sorrow instead of the joy of victory for clearing the stage.","Even Nalan Hongwu was silent.","Perhaps these people also hoped that this admirable legion could die with dignity.","At this moment, they saw flames lighting up.","Above the countless silent corpses on the ground, lots of wolf blood flew into mid-air and gathered in one direction.","Flames lit up on the capes and sets of armor.","The sparks of fire illuminated the dark like countless fireflies in the darkness.","A blazing flame instantly shot out from the sword handle and swallowed the body of the sword like a crimson fire pillar.","Supporting his weight with the long sword of flame, the fallen soldier returned.","He slowly got up from the ground, just like when the god valiantly issued a challenge to the abyss and the endless darkness many years ago.","But this time, his eyes had turned blood-red. By now, the darkness from the abyss had devoured the consciousness of all the legion members!","However, this was the true power of a Lord of Cinder.","The real duel had just begun!","Engulfed by blazing flames, the huge sword was waved high in the air, lighting up the dim hall.","“My goodness...!” At this moment, even Kellybel, Leidon, and other saint-level masters were staring at the screen without blinking.","The heated flames seemed to burn up the air as the big sword of flame that was over two meters long was swung, attacking viciously and making it hard for his opponent to even breath.","“My goodness! How did he do this?!” A dog-headed man on the side yelled in astonishment as he watched the member of Farron’s Undead Legion on the screen dodging several of Nalan Hongwu’s sword strikes with extremely weird steps!","Not only the elves, but glints flashed in the eyes of the saint-level masters behind them.","“Ahh-! This sword technique is so cool!” Sala exclaimed.","The battle finally ended after a long time. Then, the viewers watched as Nalan Hongwu went to the Firelink Shrine and traded the soul of Farron’s Undead Legion for a big sword of the same style. As if he had instantly mastered this sword technique, he brandished the sword in Firelink Shrine with weird steps.","“This is the sword technique!” Even St. Leidon who was standing in the back exclaimed, “Can we learn it?!”","“Watch me! The first move is like this...” Sala copied the move while still watching the livestream.","“Watch me! Watch me! These are the next two moves!” The elves copied the moves in the shop with elegant steps.","“No! No! It’s like this!” Beside them, the saint-level masters obviously had better imitation.","“What are you guys doing here?” At this moment, Mr. Fang walked over. “If you want to dance awkwardly, do it outside!”","He mumbled in displeasure, “Really... learning Farron’s Breakdance Crew’s dance moves, and dancing in my shop?”","With more acute hearing than others, Kellybel suddenly froze and paused her ‘dance’. Then, she looked at the elves who were spinning and leaping with sticks they had obtained from somewhere. “...”","“Can’t you keep your mouth shut?!” Kellybel’s face twitched in fury."]},{"number":768,"title":"Chapter 768 - Embarking on the mythical journey, Aldrich, Devourer of Gods!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Then, Kellybel saw the group of elves saying to each other, “Let’s go out; ignore the shop owner.”","The elves all went outside to continue with their spinning and leaping.","Next, Mr. Fang saw the female elf rogue who claimed that her name was Kelly having a hopeless expression on her face.","...","Different from other games, in Dark Souls, the players learned and used battle skills and sword techniques with corresponding weapons. They learned spells through special spell scrolls.","With the talents of the main character, the players could use the corresponding sword technique after they got their hand on the Farron Greatsword.","Although they were all nameless people, as main characters, they still had some talents such as the growth in combat techniques and the use of battle skills and spells mentioned above.","These talents relieved some pressure from the players. Otherwise, they wouldn’t be able to clear the stage all their lives.","...","“Be they lord or legend, the curse shows no mercy. What a sham.” Farron Undead Legion’s swords and armor which contained their power before they died were placed on their throne. Seeing this scene, the crestfallen warrior who had told the main character how to traverse Farron Keep lamented self-mockingly.","Yes, this was the destiny of the Lords of Cinder.","...","It had to be mentioned that all through the game, each battle was a test to the limit for the players.","After watching the livestream, the new players who were level 9 and the saint-level masters began to adjust their state and obtained quite a lot of inspiration.","Also, some of their habits got influenced and changed during the process.","For example, after watching that Nalan Hongwu killed Farron’s Undead Legion with the Dark Sword, the embarrassing dog-headed man felt that the Dark Sword was indeed powerful and even changed the name of his livestream from [Dark Souls 3] to [Dark Sword 3]. Now, he was on [Dark Sword 3 Episode 10].","Meanwhile, the elves were working hard in the game in order to get the ‘Breakdance Greatsword’.","The great sword that contained the sword technique of Farron’s Undead Legion was jokingly called the Breakdance Greatsword by Mr. Fang, but it had great abilities in the game. For example, when the players battled with the nightmarish black knight, they could dodge the opponents’ attacks and counterattack easily with this sword technique and corresponding movements.","Therefore, when you see someone dancing awkwardly in front of you, never underestimate your opponent. Otherwise, you have a very high probability of dying tragically.","However, for the real masters, they could use any weapons they liked as long as they mastered them.","...","When the players returned with the remains of Farron’s Undead Legion and opened the Catacombs of Carthus, which was a nation that had been devoured by the abyss, they embarked on the journey to bring back the remains of the second Lord of Cinder.","The entire second section of the game belonged to Pontiff Sulyvahn.","This might be the most powerful and most terrifying enemy whom the players will encounter so far.","Sulyvahn came from the Painted World of Ariandal, which was a place covered in ice and a shelter for wandering and despairing people from the real world.","That world was full of refugees who had nothing with them.","These people got comfortable in conformity and became eroded by this comfortable lifestyle.","It was why this ambitious young sorcerer didn’t fit in this world.","Therefore, this ambitious sorcerer left the Painted World.","He came to the ruins of the previously prosperous kingdom of giants. The only thing left was the burning Profaned Flame.","[The flame is profaned since its eternal burning violates the natural laws. The flame contains the great power of abyss which can erode people’s minds and trigger evil with its great power.]","[Note: This should be a description found in the game, but I can’t find it anywhere.]","As described by the words on the item, Sulyvahn dug out the ruins of the Profaned Capital by accident.","When Sulyvahn left the Profaned Capital, he was no longer the young man who had just walked out of the Painted World.","His unfading ambition now blazed like the Profaned Flame.","With a greatsword engulfed in the Profaned Flame and the ambition stained by the abyss, he turned his eyes toward Irythyll.","Deduced from some information and clues, Irythyll was probably the Royal City of the ancient the Lord of Cinder Gwyn, Anor Londo.","Undoubtedly, there lived the descendants of Gwyn, including the Sun Princess Gwynevere and her Silver Knights, Dark Sun Gwyndolin and his Dark Moon Blades, and their sister Yorshka.","In the ancient times, Gwyn’s knights and the royal members lived on this land of kings, and it had been one of the most prosperous cities in the world.","Silver Knights guarded the Cathedral, and Smough, one of the four knights of Gwyn, was also stationed here.","However, this great city experienced a great change after Sulyvahn arrived.","No one had expected that this sorcerer who came from a distant place would erode the whole dynasty.","The mysterious illness of Gwyndolin made him lose control over the Blade of the Dark Moon covenant, and the Way of White priests couldn’t escape Sulyvahn’s control. Also, Archdeacon McDonell discovered the Deep Spell, and it helped him release a weird magic from human dregs and erode the priests slowly. Gradually, Sulyvahn’s true intentions began to be revealed.","Irythyll was full of residents who had been turned into enslaved undead, and even worse, wild beasts. Some were even turned into spider-like creatures with skeleton bodies and barely recognizable human faces.","Gwyndolin’s outrider knights also ended tragically. For example, the Dancer of the Boreal Valley was a royal descendant of Irithyll, and so was Vordt of the Boreal Valley who accompanied the dancer all year round.","Eventually, Smough, one of Gwyn’s four knights, and Gwyn’s second son Gwyndolin, had also become food to be devoured.","It was how ‘Aldrich, Devourer of Gods’ got its name.","Stepping into the deep cathedral, the players could see the upper body of Gwyndolin propped up by mud-like lower body.","These were the enemies that the players were going to face: Pontiff Sulyvahn and Aldrich, Devourer of Gods.","Undoubtedly, engaging in a battle with such enemies was like a myth and a legend in itself!","As the game went on, the players went through countless hardships and deaths, traveled through the Catacombs of Carthus, and came to Irithyll. Under the moonlight and looking at the cold city that had once been extremely prosperous and powerful, even the saint-level masters began breathing heavily without them knowing."]},{"number":769,"title":"Chapter 769 - Elves begin to dance awkwardly with Instructor Sulyvahn","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Different from Farron’s Undead Legion, the second Lord of Cinder Aldrich didn’t intend to link the fire. Instead, it hoped that the first flame would die out.","It even foresaw the deep ocean era after the first flame extinguished. In this era, an ocean would swallow the land, and darkness would swallow light.","However, Pontiff Sulyvahn hoped that the Profaned Flame would burn up the whole world.","In short, the former thought that the end would come sooner or later and would rather protect himself, and the latter intended to take the throne with his blazing ambition and conspiracies and finish the last gods, ending the era of fire by allowing darkness to devour the light.","They were waiting for the First Flame to die out and the darkness to fall.","It was impossible to ask them to link the fire.","Besides, they even encouraged more unkindled to join the Church of the Deep and kill the supporters of Firelink.","...","Gradually, Kellybel had also fought her way to Irithyll.","Sitting in a corner alone, she was happily ‘dancing’ with the ‘Breakdance Greatsword’ in her hand against a pontiff knight on the screen.","After killing one with ’embarrassment’, she drew another pontiff knight, enjoying herself very much.","“Dancing awkwardly?” At this moment, a voice came from behind her.","“Hey!” She scrambled to put away the ‘Breakdance Greatsword’ and looked back. Seeing Mr. Fang standing behind her, she blushed and said, “What are you looking at? Go away!”","This person sure is nosey. I’m sitting in the corner, and he is still seeing me.","Mr. Fang’s face twitched. I’m just passing by on my way to the bathroom. How can you blame me?","“Okay! Okay! Take your time with the practice.”","“What do you mean by ‘take your time with the practice’?!” Kellybel flushed in anger. She was the Elf Queen. How could I use such...","She glanced back and saw that Mr. Fang was gone.","She changed to other weapons but died several times. Then, after glancing around and seeing that no one was nearby, she secretly took out the ‘Breakdance Greatsword’ again.","By accident, she attracted the attention of several pontiff knights. With tears on her face, she continued to dance awkwardly among them, wishing that she would die fewer times before she could kill them.","“How come this mystical realm is so difficult?!”","...","At this moment, First Elder Hyru was dozing before a big pile of files. “So tired... when will Her Majesty return...”","...","Finally, Kellybel stood before the church in fatigue. When she pushed open the gate of the church sitting on the highest spot in Irithyll, she regained some of her confidence.","“I just don’t believe I can’t dance...” With a dark expression, she immediately corrected herself, “Pooh! What awkward dance?”","At this moment, a group of elves walked over and exclaimed, “Wow! This elf is also using the Farron Greatsword!”","“Awesome!” A few other elves also came over with stars in their eyes. “You came to this stage already.”","“I just got my hands on the Farron Greatsword. How did you do it?” an elf asked in admiration.","“I say, how come you guys run to every slightest disturbance?” Mr. Fang asked in disdain while passing by.","Why not?! Kellybel bristled. What’s wrong with my elves coming over to watch me play anyway?","She said immediately, “Ignore him. I’m best with this Farron Greatsword. I used the Farron Greatsword to kill High Lord Wolnir. I’m sure that I can easily defeat this pontiff too.”","All the elves looked at her screen expectantly. “Hurry up and beat him!”","Let’s see how well you can dance awkwardly.","“How come there are so many people here?”","Leidon and Wilson also walked up, and so did St. Willy who had just started the game and was being tortured by Gundyr.","In the huge church, Pontiff Sulyvahn stood in the center of the hall silently. He had two big swords in his hands. One was blazing with Profaned Flame, and the other emitted dazzling darkmoon light.","The two streaks of lights, one red and one purple, seemed to have lit up the dim hall.","Pontiff Sulyvahn was tall and thin, and he was wearing a decayed sorcerer’s robe and pontiff hat.","Soon, Kellybel took out Farron Greatsword and began to rotate and leap around him.","With an ear-piercing noise, the big sword engulfed in Profaned Flame torn open the darkness like a sharp arrow and instantly came before Kellybel!","With fast and agile movements, she suddenly bent her body and narrowly dodge the sword strike!","Then, she slashed out her sword horizontally and made Sulyvahn stumble.","“Oh!”","The audience behind her instantly yelled, “Awesome!”","“Hehe! Haha!” Feeling cheerful, she continued to slash and hack. Then, she felt smug, and her character even rolled her eyes at Mr. Fang.","At this moment, black horrid flames rose from Sulyvahn’s body while huge black wings spread out behind him like tree branches. A black shadow with the same shape as Sulyvahn leaped up into the air like a fallen angel!","“Ah!”","The elf who was dancing awkwardly screamed.","She was instantly sent flying by the horrifying black flames.","Then, the darkmoon sword energy shot out from Sulyvahn’s left hand like a laser beam!","Boom! Boom!","Next, the Profaned Greatsword struck down like a meteorite!","Radiant flames rose...","Words appeared on the screen. [You died.]","Kellybel was at a loss for words.","“I was careless. Again!” After getting up at Bonfire, Kellybel wasn’t discouraged.","How can I not kill it with the awkward dance? The Breakdance Greatsword was the No.1 Sword in the world!","[You died...]","“Again!”","[You died...]","“...”","She was beaten witless.","The audience behind her began to talk.","“Let’s go...”","“She is too noob...”","“There’s nothing interesting to watch now...”","“Ah...!” On the verge of tears, she threw the sword down and said, “This sword is garbage!”","It is a shame that I’ve practiced the ‘awkward dance’ every day in secret! Humph!","At this moment, Mr. Fang stood out with great dignity and said, “Don’t call the sword garbage when you can’t use it properly, okay?”","“No one can use this sword to defeat Pontiff!” Kellybel said with greater dignity. “Humph! Breakdance Greatsword!”","Although this sword had the nickname ‘Breakdance Greatsword’, different people could achieve different results with this sword. If it was used by Artorias, it would be a godly weapon. It was also a great weapon in the hands of Farron’s Undead Legion.","It was why Mr. Fang said, “It’s your fault that you made it into a Breakdance Greatsword. Don’t blame other things.”","“Isn’t it just the same sword technique!” Kellybel said in anger, unwilling to accept what Fang Qi had said. “If you can, show me how to use it without dancing awkwardly!”","Seeing Mr. Fang’s hesitation, she was even angrier. “You don’t dare to show it? Then don’t judge me!”","She had the urge to jump up and hit Mr. Fang.","I know you’re good, but with the same sword technique and the same sword, I don’t believe that you can do anything special!","“Um...” Mr. Fang scratched his head and said, “I just don’t want to make you feel too bad.”"]},{"number":770,"title":"Chapter 770 - Getting a lesson from Sulyvahn? Teach him a lesson with parry!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“What?!” Kellybel glared at Mr. Fang with fury in her eyes.","Even I, a pinnacle stage saint-level master, have been defeated!","With a snort, she pointed at the computer and said, “Try it!”","The elves stood behind and watched.","Kellybel stomped her foot in fury that none of the elves spoke for her!","At this moment, Mr. Fang sat down before a computer in the corner.","“You must use the Farron Greatsword!” Kellybel immediately added another condition. After all, she wasn’t stupid, and she was worried that this shop owner might use some lowly tricks to pass the boss.","Mr. Fang changed to the Farron Greatsword.","“My goodness!”","“Astonishing!”","“The shop owner is playing the game?!”","The elves immediately walked over.","Kellybel almost exploded in fury. You guys ran off when I played. How come you are all running over to watch him play?!","With her hands on her waist, Kellybel stood behind Mr. Fang in a huff and glared at the game character who was wearing rags.","“Such ugly clothes!” she commented.","Obviously, Mr. Fang was dressed in the Master’s Attire.","“Huh? The shop owner is playing?” Some saint-level masters walked up too.","“He’s going to use this sword?”","“Can he do it?”","They saw that Mr. Fang had also come to the stage of Pontiff Sulyvahn.","They felt better when they realized that they were not left behind.","Some of them even smiled since they summoned an NPC to help them skip Sulyvahn.","They felt proud now, not knowing that the more they skipped, the more torturous the later stages would be.","“The shop owner will dance awkwardly too?” They talked among themselves in low voices.","“This elf tried it earlier... it’s impossible...”","“He will get a hard lesson.”","With her acute hearing, Kellybel heard the whispers and felt delighted. You dare to try it? I’ll see how you will act once you can’t pull it off.","Mr. Fang spared little attention to the Farron Greatsword. Instead, he weighed the small dagger in his other hand for a while as if he was trying to feel it out. Then, he walked into Pontiff Sulyvahn’s chamber.","The cathedral was very big, and Sulyvahn was in the very depths of it, at least 60 meters from the gate.","The place was deadly silent. Pontiff Sulyvahn silently stood in the center of the hall like a skeleton.","He seemed to be waiting for his enemies.","When Pontiff Sulyvahn and Mr. Fang’s character were only about thirty meters apart, flames lit up on the two big swords. In the blink of an eye, the firelight from the Profaned Greatsword shot across the thirty meters between them and toward Fang Qi like a lightning flash piercing through darkness!","Everyone watched the strike without blinking.","Usually, the players encountering Sulyvahn’s sudden strike for the first time would be caught by surprise. They usually couldn’t dodge and would panic. However, in her previous battles, Kellybel had dodged it with Farron Greatsword.","Right now, Mr. Fang had the Farron Greatsword in his hand, which meant that he should be able to...","“He isn’t moving?!”","The audience suddenly saw Fang Qi staying where he was without moving a muscle!","In fact, he was directly walking toward Sulyvahn one step at a time.","“Is it possible that this guy doesn’t even know how to dance awkwardly?!” Kellybel mumbled to herself.","The moment she said that, Fang Qi lifted his left hand that was holding the dagger instead of the Farron Greatsword in his right hand.","Ding!","The huge sword collided with the dagger, and a series of metal-colliding noises sounded while sparks flew in all directions.","“Is he crazy?!” The audience all exclaimed.","Even a moron knew what would happen when a dagger was used to block a huge sword.","However, the viewers suddenly saw the Profaned Greatsword in Sulyvahn’s hand moving to one side!","Then, it was viciously bounced off!","“This... This is...!!??” Kellybel suddenly remembered that the same thing had happened to her when she dealt with the Sword Master! She had felt as if all her force was bounced back into her body, and she couldn’t muster any strength as if her whole body was instantly crushed.","“This is it!” She stared at the screen with widened eyes.","Sure enough, in the next moment, Kellybel discovered that Sulyvahn was in the same state as she had once been! For an instant, Sulyvahn couldn’t move!","Fang Qi lifted his Farron Greatsword and hacked down with vicious force!","Crack!","This strike left a horrifying wound in Sulyvahn’s body!","Sulyvahn became cautious and didn’t strike out casually.","On the other hand, Fang Qi casually walked in the cathedral while he confronted his opponent.","Like a ghost, Sulyvahn moved around Fang Qi, trying to find a chance to strike.","Like a lightning flash, his sword thrust out from an impossible angle from the side!","“Ah!” This strike caught everyone by surprise. Before they could react, the strike was parried!","The Farron Greatsword hacked down again and almost cut off Sulyvahn’s head from his extremely hard body.","Everyone stared at the screen in a daze. “...”","Is it the Farron Greatsword that you’re using?!","Black blazing flames shot out like the water out of a fountain!","As if he had been anticipating this, Fang Qi moved back and dodged it.","A dark shadow that looked like a dark angel split from Sulyvahn’s body, and the two Profaned Greatswords burned with blazing flames around them as if they would burned up everything in the world!","Flames shot into the ground, and the surging flames forced Fang Qi to retreat a few steps.","At this moment, Mr. Fang explained on the side, “You asked me how to defeat Sulyvahn. Use parry. Who said that you can’t use parry with the Breakdance Greatsword?","“Who’s the first person that taught you how to parry? Do you know Hawkwood, the crestfallen warrior sitting beside the thrones of Lords of Cinder?” Mr. Fang said, “That deserter escaped from the Farron’s Breakdance Crew. How can you say that you know how to use the Breakdance Sword if you can’t parry?”","In the next instant, the pontiff and the phantom struck down with their Profaned Greatswords at the same time!","Mr. Fang slightly shifted to one side and dodged the black shadow’s huge sword which fell like a waterfall of flames. Then, he parried Sulyvahn’s sword with the other hand.","Another heavy sword strike was used!","“So, when you get a lesson from Sulyvahn, give him a lesson back with parry!” Fang Qi said.","“...” Everyone behind him fell silent.","The close-range combat system in Dark Souls was similar to that in Devil May Cry. There weren’t many ranged techniques, but if the players combined the concentrated strength, speed, and skills, the attacks would be horrifying.","Even gods, whose tremendous godly power enabled them to use lethal ranged skills, could be blocked.","Humans who had weaker strength thought of a way to deal with these moves.","Parry was a special skill like the Release in Devil May Cry. The difference was that no humans could possibly master Release, but the parry could be used by humans in real life.","There was parry and spell parry, and the System had perfectly recreated them.","Parry was the skill that the Sword Master used on Kellybel. It could instantly block the attack and use the recoil force to shock the opponent’s body, instantly immobilizing the attacker by afflicting violent shock to the body and the internal organs.","With special shields, the players could also parry spells and ranged attacks, but the effects were not as good.","Of course, parry could only be used when very strict conditions were met. The series of movements must be finished in the instant when the weapons collided. Otherwise, the defender would most likely get hurt.","Perhaps... before being buried, the main character wasn’t weak. The main character in the game could parry with shields that were fitting for parry and could even parry with his arm, which showed that he was proficient with parrying. The players only needed to find the perfect moment to use it. This skill greatly decreased the difficulty level of this battle.","However, defeating Sulyvahn this way...","Do you think I’m a god?! Kellybel screamed silently in her mind."]},{"number":771,"title":"Chapter 771 - The Idle Students Have Difficulty in the Game? Instructor Fang’s Fool’s Tutorial School Is Open for Business!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Except for a few hard-working players, most players were idle.","The situation was especially obvious among the new players in Canglan City.","After all, some games were too difficult for them. For example, in Dark Souls, the skills and combat style were indeed powerful but were also too difficult for them to play.","Even Kellybel and the other saint-level masters were feeling desperate!","Meanwhile in the old shop, Su Tianji and other idle players also wondered how they could manage this kind of gameplay!","They had little success with Release when they played Devil May Cry 3. Now, they were controlling a character whose strength, speed, and reflexes were inferior to that of Dante, but they were required to use the same level of skills as Dante?","While they complained about the difficulty of the game, Mr. Fang had the feeling that some of them were gradually turning into muggles.","In this ‘fish pool’ that Mr. Fang was managing, apart from a few exceptions, most of the fish were idle ones.","Mr. Fang felt very sad and frustrated about this situation.","Perhaps for Mr. Fang, this stuff wasn’t too difficult to learn since he had access to the game cultivation room and was very familiar with these games.","But for the people in this world, they spent most of their time on the growth of strength, and the improvement of skills was just a by-product on the side.","This was the tradition that had been passed down from the ancient times.","After all, if I can knock you down with a brick, why should I spend time on practicing fancy moves?","But for Mr. Fang, he felt bad that the players had a totally different experience and results in the game from his.","Would they claim that I had tricked my customers, right? They would claim that the results that I obtained in the games are just special effects that I secretly put in the game, right?","At this moment...","“Sir... can you explain it to me?” The moment that Mr. Fang put down the virtual reality headset, he saw Kellybel’s frustrated face.","Kellybel had avidly watched as Mr. Fang parried in the game and was eager to learn. But it wasn’t something that she could learn by watching.","Although she was a top-tier master in this world, the shop owner was indeed stronger than her even though he appeared to be younger than her.","Therefore, she felt that she wasn’t lowering herself to ask for help; it was more like being humble. After thinking that through, she didn’t feel ashamed to ask for help.","A light of eagerness for knowledge flashed in her eyes.","At this moment, on the screen of the livestream room.","[Su Tianji gifted Mr. Fang 6666 ‘goose eggs’.]","[Nalan Mingxue gifted Mr. Fang one rocket.]","[St. Wilson gifted Mr. Fang 5 rockets...]","[Luo Piaoling gifted Mr. Fang...]","“...”","“Sir, can you explain it?” The players who had tried Release in Devil May Cry knew how hard this skill was. They couldn’t learn Release since they were humans, but they felt like they might be able to learn this one.","“This...” Mr. Fang looked at the expectant eyes and felt...","It doesn’t seem proper for me not to teach them.","At this moment, he heard a beep from the System which issued another task.","[New Task: Challenger’s Tutorial School (Elementary)","Task Description: Live tutorial for the new game","Task Target: Help the muggle students reach the average (Average: Advanced Level). Help the excellent students reach Master Level","Task Reward: League of Legends]","...","-Meanwhile, on the other side of a distant continent-","Pure white grand palaces dotted the sides of the mountains, and auspicious beasts flew in the clouds while the ethereal tunes resonated in the sky. On the tall mountain gate were written two big words – Heavenly Faction.","In the depths of the clouds behind the square near the mountain gate, two Daoists were sitting in a remote and quiet spot, discussing Dao.","A white-haired, middle-aged man said mildly, “The ancestral master left the true words that ‘Daoists have a limit, but Dao is limitless’. The Dao pursued by cultivators has a limit, so we will never reach the perfect realm above the mortal world like the true gods. However, Dao itself is limitless.”","“‘Immortals are people who understand the laws of the world. If so, you and I can all be called immortals’. Instead of pursuing the Dao that has a limit, we will be better off drinking nectar, taking a deep sleep in the ethereal mountain, and merging myself with the endless Great Dao. Don’t you think so?”","In short, he meant that even if humans could rise above the mortal realm, there was a limit for it. Obviously, this was an unambitious interpretation.","The other was a black-haired man with a wide forehead and a square face, and he was dressed in black clothes. He sat there with a sword on his back, and he said, “The ancestral master’s words mean that we cultivators can break through the limit of Dao one day and reach the endless Great Dao. Senior Brother, I think your understanding is not right!”","This interpretation was more active and ambitious.","-At this moment-","The white-haired middle-aged man seemed to sense something, and a jade slab flew out from his sleeve and revealed an image.","“The array is finally done...” Near the Yuanyang City Shop, two cultivators dressed in messenger’s robes immediately said, “Greetings, two elders!”","“How was it?” The white-haired middle-aged man asked mildly, “Have you found the descendants from our faction in your journey to the Continent of Immortal Relics?”","“Yes. But...”","“But what?” The two elders frowned.","The two messengers, one fat and one thin, took out a communication jade which showed the clips of the Legend of Sword and Fairy, Dungeon Fighter Online, and etc.","“What are these?!” The two elders stared at the images that were showing how people took the control of their own destiny from Heaven and the fierce battle against Almighty Demon Lord Chong Lou...","“These are cultivation mystical realms...” The thin messenger said cautiously, “The people in the West Continent are using them now, but we don’t have them yet...”","“We heard that we can now ask the shop owner and apply to open an ‘internet café’ branch shop in our Continent of the Immortal Village. We are now asking for your approval, elders.”","“Huh?” The two elders exchanged a look...","Then, the two messengers began to talk about the things they had seen on the West Continent.","“We’ll summon the other elders to talk about it.” The two elders looked solemn.","...","At this moment, Mr. Fang was tutoring his students.","“You asked me how to use parry and if there’s a method to practice it. The answer is yes.” At this moment, most players in the Yuanyang City Shop, Half City Shop, Jiuhua City Shop, and the new shop in Canglan City were watching Instructor Fang’s livestream.","“But the regular method is definitely useless.” Mr. Fang demonstrated while he explained, “Since the opponents are stronger and faster than us, we can’t deal with their attacks by relying only on reflexes.”","On the screen, Mr. Fang demonstrated how he tried to parry after the opponent attacked. Soon, his arm was pierced.","“We need to predict their attacks,” Mr. Fang said, “There are all kinds of weapons here. We can analyze each attack of each weapon frame by frame. Sometimes, we can even divide one frame into smaller parts.”","Mr. Fang saved the video of Sulyvahn’s attacks and slowed down the moves, dividing each frame into smaller parts. Then, the movements looked much clearer.","“With the frames divided properly, we can begin to learn. At the beginning, you must memorize them, then you’re good...”","Mr. Fang drank some water and said, “After you memorize them, you would have made the first step in learning. After that, we will be learning how to use the skills creatively according to the situation you’re in...”","Everyone froze. “...”","They almost completely turned into stones."]},{"number":772,"title":"Chapter 772 - The Supreme Lord of the ‘Origins’?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Sir, what about the sorcerers?” In the crowd, a young man lowered his head and sent a bullet comment with his communication jade.","He was Grand Mage Merlin.","Obviously, parrying was used in melee combat. Then, how should sorcerers fight?","“With the sorceries getting so powerful in the later stages, do you still need to ask?” After resetting his properties, Mr. Fang came before Aldrich, Devourer of Gods.","He took out a strange bell from his pocket. Suddenly, golden lightning bolts gathered in his hands and lit up the whole cathedral with bright lights!","The Lightning Spear as pure and holy as sunshine looked like godly fury.","In the instant that the monster, whose upper body was a god and lower body was a pile of mud, began to cast a spell, the Lightning Spear’s light pierced the darkness of the gloomy hall!","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Everyone saw nothing but dazzling golden light.","They saw that the monster was almost dead when it turned into mud and shrank back into the deep ground. “...”","Although the players needed to rely on skills in many places in the game, there were still many powerful spells. For example, the miracle, Sunlight Spear, was one of the best spells of Gwyn Lord of Cinder, the ruler of the whole god race. The golden lightning came from the great power that he had gained from the first flame.","Obviously, Mr. Fang hadn’t killed the boss, so he did it again.","This time, he threw out several huge fire clouds, looking like flame Rasengans.","Everyone saw that the horrifying monster almost died again.","The Bed of Chaos contained the chaotic fire that had once given birth to demons and was one of the most powerful pyromancy.","In Dark Souls, the demons came from the combination of the first flame and chaotic flame instead of the abyss.","“I won’t talk more about sorcerers,” Mr. Fang said, “You guys have already begun the study on crystal magic.”","Crystal magic originated from ancient dragons. In the world of Dark Souls, Gwyn, Lord of Cinder, established a new civilization after overthrowing the rule of ancient dragons.","The ancient dragons were immortals, and their immortal power came from their dragon scales. The crystal magic was born from studying the power of dragon scales.","Dark Souls had a huge setting which was very different from other games. These players had just began understanding things from the perspective of the main character. They needed to study the world hard each day if they wanted to know more about it.","Of course, this didn’t affect their gameplay. For the average players who didn’t plan to venture deeper into the world, they only needed to know that they must drag the Lords of Cinder back to link the fire.","The players watched the livestream attentively and made notes diligently.","At this moment, Mr. Fang suddenly received a message on his communication jade.","He glanced at it and saw that it came from Yuanyang City Shop.","Li Wuya was now managing Yuanyang City Shop. Since he was an elder of Li Family, Mr. Fang was quite happy to leave things to his hands since everything was well managed.","Li Wuya only contacted him to talk about important things.","Mr. Fang glanced at the message. “A branch shop in the Continent of the Immortal Village?”","“Today’s tutorial ends here.” Obviously, Mr. Fang decided to end the livestream for today.","“That’s all for today’s tutorial?” Sala stared at the livestream room, looking unsatisfied.","“Did anyone record it?” Merlin suddenly exclaimed.","He had been too engrossed in the livestream and just thought of this.","“I did! I did!” Sala raised her hand excitedly.","At this moment, she congratulated herself for her forethought and intelligence.","Then, she led others to review Instructor Fang’s lesson today.","...","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang had his communication jade in his hands.","Li Wuya said, [Boss, two cultivators who claim to come from Heavenly Faction of the Continent of Immortal Village applied to open a branch shop in that area. Senior Gu has checked their identities and said that they are indeed related to the great figure who had visited this continent and left behind the cultivation system in Heavenly Academy.]","Of course, Mr. Fang knew about Heavenly Academy which was the school that Xiaoyue and Li Lanruo went to each day. He was very familiar with Gu Tingyun as well.","[Do they have such a history...?] Mr. Fang had been considering the issue of opening more branch shops, but since they would consume lots of resources, he was very cautious with the choice of locations.","After all, Mr. Fang now had the privilege to establish branch shops.","[Continent of the Immortal Village...?]","[It’s the East Continent where you’re from.] Li Wuya explained.","[This should be... fine.] Since now that the West Continent had a shop, there was no reason that he wouldn’t open a shop in the East Continent.","Then, Li Wuya continued, [I told them about the situation here. To avoid unnecessary trouble, they have come up with a good plan and intend to do a full-scale promotion.]","[Promotion ... do we need that?] Mr. Fang replied.","[It’s just a simple introduction.] Li Wuya said as his face froze. [We must do some introduction... Otherwise, the cultivators over there wouldn’t understand our business.]","[You’re right.] Mr. Fang said, [I’ll go over to Yuanyang City shop.]","...","The Continent of the Immortal Village had three immortal factions, four ancient sects, and six blessed cave abodes. As one of the three immortal factions, the Heavenly Faction was absolutely a big organization.","At this moment, in the middle of the great hall of Heavenly Faction, there sat a dignified-looking middle-aged cultivator who was wearing a reddish-brown Daoist robe and a black hairpiece.","On both sides of him sat several sedate, ethereal-looking elders.","The expressions on their faces had never looked so solemn before.","It was silent in the great hall.","“Who would like to go?” At this moment, the faction master spoke.","“I would.” A sedate man who was about 30 years old walked out and stood in the center of the hall.","His clothes showed that his rank wasn’t low.","“This issue... is very important.” The faction master sitting in the center of the great hall stared at the young cultivator with a solemn expression and said, “Gu Song, this is an unprecedented important task. Since you offer to take it, you must do your best. Are you ready to meet that legendary existence?”","“Gulp...”","The cultivator swallowed with difficulty, looking as if he was granted the most important mission in the world.","“Um...” The faction master waved his big sleeve, and a figure appeared. This figure stood with his arms crossed while countless sunlight beams shot down and shattered the faction underneath him.","“The master of ‘Origins’ looks to be merely an Ancestral Warrior but can easily destroy a whole faction. He even defeated the Shadow Legion which almost destroyed the whole West Continent, and he united the continent all by himself! I suspect that he is like those ultimate existences who had gone beyond the Dao... At least, he is a supreme existence.”","“S... Supreme...!” Everyone in the great hall turned grimmer. The cultivator named Gu Song panted slightly while he said, “That’s the most powerful figure in the whole Continent of Immortal Village!”","It was an existence on the same level as the Grand Elder!","“Bring back the information about this supreme master and ‘Origins’, so we can promote ‘Origins’ branch palace before it opens on our continent. It will stun the hooligans and save us unnecessary trouble in the future.” The faction master patted Gu Song on the shoulder. “Are you confident?”","“I’m forever grateful to the faction for my training. I’ll finish the mission at all costs!”","...","At this moment, Mr. Fang stuck his hand into Jiang Xiaoyue’s potato chip bag.","“Huh? Empty?”","“Hey!” a loli yelled, “I only ate a few!”"]},{"number":773,"title":"Chapter 773 - Mr. Fang’s Personal Interview","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Peacon Gu Song!”","“Master!” Seeing the young man who was about 30 years old coming out of the great hall with a grim expression, two disciples dressed in the Heavenly Faction’s disciple robes immediately walked up to him.","One of them wore a green robe and a white hairpiece, and the other was elegantly dressed in a white robe. With radiant glints in their eyes, they obviously were not average people.","“Um...” They looked delighted. “We didn’t expect that things would go so smoothly!”","“You did it!”","“Congratulations!” The two disciples congratulated.","However, Gu Song’s expression changed at this moment. “But... things are not so simple!”","“Ugh...” The disciples froze.","While walking away from the great hall, Gu Song looked grim while a drop of cold sweat slid from his face. “This might be a reincarnated existence who is above the mortal world!”","“At least he’s an existence as powerful as the Grand Elder! It’s said that he’s so merciless that he could destroy a top-tier faction on the continent without blinking an eye.”","The moment he said it, the other two disciples immediately retreated several steps.","“Although the journey to ‘Origins’ is very dangerous, it’s the faction’s test for us,” Gu Song said solemnly, “You’re my best disciples. We must succeed or die!”","“We must succeed or die!”","“Then...” Gu Song glanced at them. “Go and get ready. Be prepared for anything.”","“Yes!”","...","A Breeze brushed the leaves in the forest while moonlight caressed the gurgling creek. On the green mountaintop under the soft moonlight, the white-robed young man said gravely, “Junior Brother, if I can’t make it back... Please take care of Junior Sister Yun Miao for me...”","A green-robed young man lifted his cup and drank alone. “With a bright moon overhead and a gentle breeze in the mountain, we will meet again in our next life!”","Meanwhile in his family’s ancestral shrine, Gu Song looked grim. “I entrust the whole family to you guys...”","...","The three of them braced themselves for everything. On the next day, they set off!","...","– In the Yuanyang City Shop –","It was early in the morning.","As usual, Mr. Fang put a sausage in a bowl of instant noodles and took a box of spicy sticks before sitting down on a couch.","While slurping over the instant noodles, he looked up at the three people solemnly sitting before him. “Huh? You came so soon?”","“...”","Just like the legends said, he appears to be lower than level 8... With great caution, Gu Song looked at the young man before him and thought, He eats noodles just like anyone on the roadside. But... if anyone takes him as an average person, it would be a disaster for them!","“My shop usually doesn’t do promotions,” Mr. Fang said as he ate his instant noodles.","At this moment, more people came over and sat down on the couches with instant noodles.","This aroma...","Is it a test?!","It’s said that some eccentric seniors like to make strange tests... If we can’t resist it...","The three people’s faces instantly fell.","Then, the two disciples looked at Gu Song.","“Deacon Gu Song...”","We can’t be so passive. His face fell. We must be more active!","“In the entire Continent of Immortal Relics, Senior Fang, you’re the most powerful cultivator,” Gu Song said, “We came to visit you with the hope that we can bring back a simple Condensed Visual Spiritual Spell, so we can introduce your deeds to the major factions.”","“Of course...”","Of course, the deeds should not be about battles. Otherwise...","Gu Song added in a hurry, “Just the things in your daily life. I think this will become the new legend in the Continent of Immortal Village!”","“A new legend...” Mr. Fang stuffed a spicy stick into his mouth and considered while chewing on it. Then, his eyes lit up, and he said while standing up, “Good idea!”","...","At this moment, the livestream room was opened.","“The shop owner is doing a tutorial again!” Instantly, people from different shops all came to watch.","Gu Song signaled to the green-robed young man with his eyes.","The disciple immediately took out a spiritual artifact which looked like a bronze mirror and aimed it at Mr. Fang’s livestream room.","A bright light fell, shining on Mr. Fang and his livestream room.","Mr. Fang drank up the noodle soup and dumped the empty bowl into the garbage can. “Burp!”","“Let’s do it!”","Gu Song’s heart lurched at the sound of the burp.","They exchanged a weird look with each other.","How come it doesn’t feel right...?","...","“I’ll do some warm-up first. It has been a long while since I played the King of Fighter last time with Xiaoyue.” Mr. Fang put the King of Fighter on the livestream first.","Then, the viewers saw a loli sitting beside him.","“Before playing games, practicing in the King of Fighter helps you optimize your state,” Mr. Fang said, “It is a good challenge for your reflexes.”","“Sir! Choose your characters!” Beside him, Jiang Xiaoyue became impatient and wanted to begin.","“Three, two, one; begin!”","On the screen in Qzone, Jiang Xiaoyue shook the joystick wildly, “Haya!”","Benimaru who was randomly chosen by Mr. Fang dropped to the ground.","“Wahaha! I’m awesome!”","“Xiaoyue! Awesome!”","“Awesome! Awesome!”","“Mr. Fang is trash!”","“Um... I can only say that your techniques have improved.” Mr. Fang was calm. “It’s no problem. The next character is Iori Yagami that I chose randomly. He will be great. Watch my plays.”","“Kuzu Kaze! Ay, got you!”","“Heavy punch!” On the screen, Mr. Fang’s Iori Yagami caught Jiang Xiaoyue and beat her viciously.","The green-clothed young man holding the bronze-mirror-like spiritual treasure looked horrified and turned his eyes toward Gu Song beseechingly. “...”","“I’ll do it...” Gu Song said immediately, “Can I ask the why you wanted to build this ‘Origins’ Grand Palace in the first place, Senior Fang?”","“Oh...” Mr. Fang said while continuing to play the King of Fighters, “I wasn’t qualified to go to an academy, so I had to do this business...”","“Did you want to do this to surprise them? So that you can say to the academy which refused to take you in, ‘Don’t underestimate others?’”","“Maybe... In fact, I didn’t put much thought in it,” Mr. Fang said while playing the King of Fighters, “Sometimes, I’m happy, and the customers are happy, so I continue to operate the business. Of course, if I didn’t choose to do this, I would have done something else.”","“This little girl is close to you...” Gu Song froze for a moment and then said.","Mr. Fang said, “Oh... I picked her up from the roadside when I saw her standing there all by herself... I pitied her and brought her back...”","“I came because you have buns...!” Jiang Xiaoyue said with a snort.","“You ate so much that no one dared to take you in...” Mr. Fang slapped one palm on his forehead and played with the other hand.","Gu Song exchanged a look with his disciples. “...”","“Master... how come I feel like something is wrong?”","“Then... How about your Daoist mates...” Gu Song asked again, “A super master like you must have many female soulmates... or 3,000 concubines?”","“...” Instantly, the whole livestream room and the whole internet café turned silent.","Everyone looked over."]},{"number":774,"title":"Chapter 774 - Add Some Special Effects","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Everyone in the shop and even the air fell silent.","Is he going to do it now... Gu Song sensed the atmosphere around him in alert and didn’t dare to move a muscle.","Indeed... Is this Senior Fang’s true form...?","“Oh, that...” Mr. Fang stopped playing the King of Fighters and said after a moment of consideration, “In fact, in the past...","“Forget it. I might have them in the future.”","Everyone in the audience froze for a second. “Huh...?”","“That’s it?!”","Gu Song’s whole face twisted while frustration hit him hard. He thought, What kind of an answer is this...","“Do you mean... You don’t have any?!”","Finished... I’m finished... I’m hitting a raw nerve! Gu Song’s heart beat faster and faster, feeling as if it would explode at any minute.","But in the next moment...","No... He looked toward Fang Qi abruptly and thought, Why isn’t he make a move...?","Isn’t he supposed to use...","Divine Light?!","36 Tiangang Sword Array?!","Release?!","Come on! Use one!","Gu Song seemed to be waiting for death.","But still, nothing happened.","“What are you doing?” Fang Qi looked at him curiously.","“Wu-!” Mr. Fang looked back and saw the cultivator from the Continent of the Immortal Village turn pale while blood trickled from the corners of his mouth.","“Ma... Master!” The two disciples hurried over and supported Gu Song with shaky hands so that the latter didn’t fall onto the ground.","“F*ck?!” Mr. Fang stood up from his seat immediately.","“My goodness!” Jiang Xiaoyue exclaimed.","“Someone spewed blood!” Everyone in the internet café scrambled to help.","Mr. Fang yelled immediately, “Elder Wuya! Bring some healing pills! Hurry!”","The two disciples watched the scene dumbfoundedly. “...”","Shakily, the green-robed young man said in a low voice, “Did we...”","“Did we visit the wrong person...?”","“What are you waiting for?” Mr. Fang glared at them.","“Oh...” The white-robed disciple hurried over to help, and Gu Song began to recover.","...","“...” Gu Song’s face fell.","“Can such a recording stun others and establish dominance?”","“We need... the legend from the Continent of Immortal Relics!”","“Is it because he’s in his homeland, so he... is merciful ...to us?”","Gu Song continued to think.","“Senior, can we go to the West Continent?” Gu Song suggested.","“The West Continent...?” Mr. Fang thought about it.","“Hey...” Li Wuya said to Gu Song in a low voice, “Don’t inconvenience the shop owner too much...”","“Sir!” At this moment, Jiang Xiaoyue pulled Mr. Fang’s sleeve. “Take me to the West Continent; I want to play with Sister Sala and others!”","“Don’t you have school?” Mr. Fang said solemnly.","“Hehehe...” At this moment, Gu Tingyu leaned over and said, “Our academy is in the summer break!”","“Pu-!” How come you cultivators have summer break as well?!","With a dark expression, Mr. Fang said to Jiang Xiaoyue, “You can’t play for too long, okay?”","...","– In the Canglan City Shop at the West Continent –","Aren’t they supposed to stand up and greet him with warmth? Gu Song looked around at the customers who showed no response when Mr. Fang walked into the shop. Then, he gave a signal to his two disciples with his eyes. We’ll do some secret investigation and get to the bottom of it!","Gu Song and Mr. Fang walked on the streets in Canglan City.","Meanwhile, the green-robed disciple named Cang Feng returned to the shop.","At this moment, he saw some elves sitting together and enjoying their afternoon tea.","Cang Feng walked over brazenly.","“You are asking me what Mr. Fang’s best at? The greatest at?” Rowling looked baffled.","“Yeah...” Cang Feng said in a hurry, “Isn’t Senior Fang a super master?”","“He’s best at playing games!”","“Dark Souls!”","“Instructor Fang taught us a lot of gaming knowledge! And many battle pithy formulas for fighting all kinds of nameless monsters!” Rowling said.","“Battle...pithy formulas?” Glints flashed in Cang Feng’s eyes. “It’s because of Senior Fang’s guidance with your training in the mystical realms that you could defeat the Shadow Legion, right?”","“Right!”","“Can you tell me about it?”","Immediately, Rowling recited with great familiarity, “Hairy bosses are afraid of fire, and big bosses are afraid of doors...”","“Can I watch you guys train in the mystical realm?” Cang Feng asked.","“Okay!”","Rowling was ‘hacked and tortured’ by Farron’s Undead Legion...","Elder Sewell was ‘hacked and tortured’ by the pontiff...","Kellybel was knocked down on the ground and beaten witless by Aldrich...","They were being tortured mercilessly.","...","Cang Feng watched the elves dumbfoundedly. “...”","...","– Meanwhile, in a restaurant in Canglan City –","“Xiaoyue! Xiaoyue! Try this!”","“And try this too!” Sala forked a snack into Jiang Xiaoyue’s bowl.","“This is delicious too!”","Mr. Fang sat at another desk while resting his chin on his palm.","Gu Song stared at the person before him and then glanced at the warm and cheerful scene beside them. “...”","Could it be that... I was mistaken?","“But...” Gu Song asked cautiously, “Is it true that you defeated the Shadow Legion and destroyed the Nangong Family with a sword?”","“Oh, that...","“Of course, it’s true.”","“...” Gu Song looked Mr. Fang up and down in disbelief.","...","The one-day visit finally ended.","“Did you get any good visuals?” Gu Song asked.","The two disciples were at a loss for words.","They activated the bronze-mirror-like spiritual artifact.","They saw some elves chattered cheerfully, “He’s great at playing games!”","“Battle pithy formula...”","“Hairy bosses are afraid of fire, and big bosses are afraid of doors...”","“...”","“What should we do...” Cang Feng looked at his master in unease.","At this moment, Gu Song’s communication jade lit up.","The faction chief’s voice came from it, “How is your visit with Holiness Fang? We’ll soon discuss the location of the ‘Origins’ branch palace. It all depends on you how we’ll begin this legend.”","“This is one of the rarest and most significant issues in our Heavenly Faction in the last couple hundreds of years!”","“...” Gu Song shivered instantly and replied, “Luckily, we finished our mission!”","Looking crazy as if he had been forced into a corner, he whispered to his two disciples, “Visual Transformation!”","Visual Transformation was an advanced spiritual spell which could change the shapes and visuals recorded in the Condensed Visual Spiritual Spell. Hearing this, the two disciples looked alarmed. “Then, we have to...”","“Just do it!”","“Yes... Yes...”","...","-On the next day-","Sitting on a couch, Mr. Fang murmured to himself while eating instant noodles, “The Heavenly Faction said that they will show a simple introduction about me. It seems to begin today...?”","Then, he took the mirror-like spiritual artifact and fiddled with it. “Does it work this way?”","Swoosh!","Visual appeared in the center of the bronze mirror!","A group of elves walked up to watch it.","[The Supreme Master in the Continent of Immortal Relics and his ‘Origins’ Immortal Palace!]","The eye-catching title seemed to shoot out of the projection!","Gradually, new visuals appeared on the mirror.","In the visual, Mr. Fang and his three visitors pushed open the door and entered the shop in deafening cheers.","“He casually waved at the visitors from all around the world, and the others only dared to sit down when he motioned them to sit down.”","“He is now sitting before me and enjoying the immortal meal which was made with top-grade immortal rice and meat of rare beast and prepared with countless processes – instant noodles and sausage!” Sitting across from the three visiting cultivators, Mr. Fang opened the lid of his bowl of instant noodles, and a dazzling golden immortal light shot into the sky!","“With one glance, he made me feel the chill from Hell!” In the visual, Mr. Fang who was eating instant noodles on the couch before Gu Song almost looked like a demonic god with horns on his head. His chilly eyes emitted death presence."]},{"number":775,"title":"Chapter 775 - Era of Everyone Participating in E-Sports","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","At this moment, the elves who were eating instant noodles behind Mr. Fang glanced at the Mr. Fang in the Condensed Visual Spiritual Spell and then at the Mr. Fang who was watching it on a couch...","“Pu-!” They couldn’t believe their eyes.","“Are they the same person?!”","...","On the other side, this introduction drew huge responses in the East Continent.","“This is the ultimate master in the Continent of Immortal Relic!”","“Origins Immortal Palace will write another glorious chapter in the Continent of the Immortal Village!”","The Heavenly Faction Master watched the end of the visuals with glints in his eyes. Then, he stood up and looked at Gu Song and his two disciples who still had dark circles under their eyes.","“It’s only a few minutes long but successfully created the image of a legendary master!” The Heavenly Faction Master patted Gu Song on the shoulder and said, “Well done! In the future, if any troublemakers want to cause a scene in ‘Origins’, they should consider the consequences of messing with this horrifying supreme master from the Continent of Immortal Relics!”","“Yes...” Gu Song’s face twitched, and he almost spat out white foam. “If there’s nothing here for us, Faction Master, we’ll go back to take some rest...”","This palace master is indeed an idle guy...","We’re damned tired!","...","– In the new shop in Canglan City –","With great dignity, Mr. Fang explained to the elves who were watching from behind, “When they asked me to help make this video, I declined! Then, duang...”","“...!!”","...","At this moment, Mr. Fang received two new tasks.","[New Task: Era of Everyone Participating in E-Sports","Task Target: The popularity of competitive games reaches one million","Task Privilege: All rights related to E-Sports competitions. The rewards will be determined based on the scale and popularity of the competitions","Task Reward: 10-day access to the cultivation room, Big E-Sports Gift Box*? (the number will be determined based on the degree of completeness and the rating for the task)]","[New Task: Opening a New Shop","Task Description: Open a branch shop in the Continent of the Immortal Village (East Continent). Choose the location and purchase a shop. The shop can be managed by employees or the host","Task Reward: TV Series Wind and Cloud 3 and System Remake of the Turbulent Homeland 1-3. Four episodes will be released every Monday and Tuesday]","[TL Note: The Turbulent Homeland is a glove puppetry show from Taiwan. It is made by Pili International Multimedia. The TV series debuted in 1985, and it still continues today.]","...","Since Mr. Fang had to go out on a business trip, he wouldn’t be able to give online tutorials to the idle students.","Of course, when Instructor Fang was away, there were other Instructors with them, such as Instructor Gundyr for newbies and the hot and spicy Instructor Pontiff Sulyvahn, etc. With these strict Instructors and tight schedules of professional courses, the idle students wouldn’t feel lonely when Mr. Fang was away.","Every day, the players were so moved by Instructor Fang’s gift that they cried while learning from these Instructors.","Perhaps this was the best gift that they received on the Children’s Day.","...","“Humans can never escape from it.”","“The world is like a tightly sealed ‘wall’, and we live in ‘Dao’. Therefore, we must follow the Dao of the world.”","At the foot of the main peak in Heavenly Faction, there was a forbidden zone guarded heavily by layers of arrays.","This was the place where the Grand Elder, the supreme master of Heavenly Faction, cultivated in seclusion.","In the deep and quiet cave abode, the Grand Elder was reading an ancient golden scroll carefully.","The content in the golden scroll was obviously written in the ancient language, but he could translate some parts of it. “However, there’s an exception to everything...”","Near the Half City Shop, the Yellow Spring Sea in the ultimate east suddenly boiled up.","The weird Yellow Spring Sea had always been deadly silent. It had never looked like this before.","In the Cultivation Realm, among those who entered, only a few cultivators were still exploring it. They entered a zone with many extremely strange palaces, and they explored around separately.","Suddenly, they looked so horrified as if they had seen something unbelievable.","...","At this moment, in a nameless space in the West Continent.","It was the space where World Mage Hematon had once visited.","Swein slowly opened his eyes, and it seemed like lightning bolts and storms from the endless void were flashing in them. “The ancient continent split apart... many people fought for hundreds, thousands, or maybe even countless years... just for this opportunity akin to a carp leaping over the dragon gate... But now... I sense its existence...”","The top of God’s Peak in the Radiant Light Godly Nation was rumored to be the place closest to the gods. It was the place where St. Heinz cultivated in seclusion.","At this moment, St. Heinz slowly opened his eyes.","“Dulan!”","“I’m here, St. Heinz.” A vague projected figure appeared before him, and St. Dulan bowed to him.","“Did anything big happen while I was absent?” As if he had received word from the gods, St. Heinz looked calm and confident, indifferent to everything happening in the world. He asked mildly, “The incident with Luther is now in the past; I think the other nations have forgotten about it. How about the spread of our faith? Have you made new progress in other nations?”","“Um...” Saint Dulan’s old face turned stiff. “Um...”","“What are you stammering about?!” St. Heinz said in displeasure, “Do you want to surprise me with good news?! Speak now!”","“Um... My Lord...” St. Dulan’s old face almost twisted like a chrysanthemum as he said, “Almost all the branches of our Judgement Godly Palace in other nations have been removed.”","“Except for our Radiant Light Godly Nation, almost no one is worshipping the God of Radiant Light Judgement...”","“What-?!” St. Heinz’s majestic face fell like a landslide as he yelled, “What did you say?! Say it... again!”","“It’s not necessary.” At this moment, Princess Isabela’s voice came from the secret chamber, “As Mr. Dulan said, our Radiant Light Godly Nation is no longer what it was before...”","“...”","St. Heinz’s face turned from twisted to distorted to calm. Finally, he inhaled deeply and said, “I already heard the words from our god. This time, we might have more important work to do than spreading our faith.”","“More important than spreading our religion?” Dulan asked curiously, “What is so important?”","“In the ancient times, the land collapsed, and countless masters fell. Do you know why?” St. Heinz said.","“Why...?”","“Because of an opportunity to become gods!” St. Heinz said as he stood up with his hands clasped behind his back, and unreadable glints flashing in his eyes."]},{"number":776,"title":"Chapter 776 - Asking Mr. Fang to Teach Dao?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Wow... this is your faction?” Surrounded by rolling hills, the green stone bridges connected the high peaks, and white cranes strolled in the clouds that were floating around the mountains and in the deep valleys.","In the depths of the lush forest dotted some pavilions and towers which matched the green and flourishing trees perfectly.","The grand and towering buildings were built in the forest in a certain orderly pattern without ruining the beauty and structure of the mountains.","In fact, Fang Qi had seen many factions where the tall and big palaces destroyed the structure of mountains.","However, this faction before him seemed to truly merge into nature. The winding paths looked serene, but the tranquility couldn’t conceal the great dignity of this ancient faction.","Looked down from the sky, the whole faction was like a huge astrolabe on which all kinds of buildings dotted the mountainous forest like elusive stars.","Compared with the Three Saint Factions, this faction had fewer imposing buildings but had a different sense of aloofness and sereneness.","Only until now did Fang Qi learn that the two messengers who first visited the Yuanyang City Shop were third generation disciples of the Heavenly Faction. The fat one was Ding San, and the thin one was Shi Lei.","The person who came with them was Xiao Yunhe, the white-robed elder who had discussed Dao in the Heavenly Faction with the black-robed Daoist.","But...","Mr. Fang saw a loli walking before him!","What is going on with Jiang Xiaoyue? How did she come with us?!","“Hehehe!” Jiang Xiaoyue made a face at Mr. Fang and said, “I’m an outstanding disciple in the Heavenly Academy, so the elders sent me here to have a friendly visit in the Heavenly Faction which has the same root as our academy!”","Walking beside her, Elder Xiao Yunhe confirmed her words and added, “Some other outstanding disciples of the Heavenly Academy will come here too. In exchange, we’ll send some outstanding disciples to the Heavenly Academy.”","“You even have exchange students?!” Mr. Fang froze.","“That’s the concept...” Xiao Yunhe laughed and said, “You had such programs long ago? I thought our exchange plan is a new idea. Hahaha!”","“Of course...” Mr. Fang said.","...","“Teaching Dao?” They talked with each other while walking toward the depths of the faction.","Mr. Fang froze. “Asking me to teach Dao...?”","“...” The white-robed Elder Xiao Yunhe said respectfully, “I heard that even some saint-level masters in the West Continent call you ‘Instructor Fang’ with respect. With your status, our disciples will be fortunate if you can teach Dao in our Heavenly Faction!”","He continued, “You may give a casual lesson. If I’m being presumptuous, please just forget it.”","“...” Mr. Fang asked, “A casual lesson will do?”","“Of course!”","“Then, I’ll do it...”","“Ugh...!?” Xiao Yunhe stared at Mr. Fang dumbfoundedly.","He agreed just like this?!","...","From the mountain gate, the group walked over a stone bridge and reached the Dao-Teaching Meadow where the new disciples did their morning training.","The disciples who were guarding the faction on the stone bridge bowed at them to greet them. The new disciples and advanced disciples stood in two square formations on Dao-Teaching Meadow and outside of the Dao Pursuit Palace. The new disciples were dressed in grey robes while the advanced disciples wore blue robes.","About 100 disciples were sitting on futons inside Dao Pursuit Palace, and they were dressed in white robes. They were the core disciples of the Heavenly Faction.","A few people sat in front of others, and their cuffs had embroidered auspicious beast patterns. Even though Mr. Fang didn’t understand the division of the disciples in this faction, he could see that these were the most talented or most outstanding young disciples in the whole faction in one glance.","Such a big welcome ceremony...? Mr. Fang looked around and saw many white-robed young men and women sneaking glances at him from the left and the right.","Oh... Mr. Fang was excited. The promotion has produced good effects...","When Mr. Fang glanced at them, the disciples remembered his hellish gaze over instant noodles in the visuals. “...”","“That gaze seems to be able to decide your fate...” Elder Gu Song’s narration was still fresh in their minds.","With a shiver, these disciples all shrugged like rabbits.","Of course, a group of old men walked toward Mr. Fang with big smiles.","“...”","...","They exchanged pleasantries.","...","There were six major disciples, three men and three women, in the Heavenly Faction. They sat at the front of the group.","Behind them were 36 outstanding disciples including Cang Feng and Xu Yingjie, the white-robed disciple of Gu Song.","After Mr. Fang was gone, some girls came together. “Was that Old Demon Fang... Oh, no... Holiness Fang?”","“When he glanced at me, I was suffocated...”","“Horrifying...”","“A master who destroys factions without blinking...”","“He cast a glance at me. Do you think...!!??”","“What are you talking about?” One of the white-robed women in the front walked over.","“Ahh-! Senior Sister Yu Yin!” the girls shrieked.","“Get yourselves ready; we’ll visit Holiness Fang in the afternoon.”","“Why are we going?”","“Can we not go...?”","“Oh! My stomach hurts!”","“I...I...I... experienced qi deviation last night during cultivation...”","“I...” Thud! One girl dropped to the ground stiffly.","“...”","...","Oblivious of the situation, Mr. Fang began to choose the location for the branch shop.","Different from other shops, the Heavenly Faction applied for the opening of this branch shop, so it was easy to obtain.","...","On the other side.","“Are you sure that you don’t want to go and hear Senior Fang’s lesson on Dao?”","“Lesson on Dao?” The girl who had fallen down stood up again. “Do we have the opportunity to hear Dao from a master who is on the Ascendance-level?”","“The... Senior Fang will really give a lesson on Dao?!” another girl asked cautiously.","“Are you going?”","“Yes! Yes!”","“4 PM at Immortal Tune Pavilion; don’t be late.”","...","Meanwhile, one the side of male disciples.","Cang Feng obviously had also heard the news.","“Lesson on Dao...?”","Instantly, the image of Mr. Fang eating instant noodles rose in his mind. “Burp-!”","“Mr. Fang taught us many battle pithy formulas...”","“Hairy bosses are afraid of fire, and big bosses are afraid of doors...” The image in his mind changed to the one in which the elves recited Mr. Fang’s ‘pithy formulas’ with great pride.","“...”"]},{"number":777,"title":"Chapter 777 - The E-Sports Industry that Held Up the World","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","That was... an endless starry sky of immortal beauty.","Vague visuals floated in the starry sky, and it was hard to understand their meanings.","In the Half City Shop, Zou Mo hadn’t had nightmares anymore after he was rescued by Mr. Fang and became an employee in the shop.","But lately, he kept having strange nightmares...","“They... will be imprisoned here forever. Their power can never pierce the endless void. They... can never rise above this world.","“But there are exceptions to everything...”","In his dreams, he seemed to see a figure, but he couldn’t clearly see this person’s face.","Before this figure was blinding golden light.","Then, he seemed to see a cup full of all kinds of horrifying alien bugs. When the lid was lifted, these horrifying existences which had been silent for a long time were disturbed and got restless.","When a pale blue spiritual light fell, he seemed to see countless bugs beginning to devour each other!","However, the scene was not clear and real. In the dreams, things were distorted, and the twisting and the struggling things seemed not to be bugs.","At this moment, a pair of eyes suddenly turned toward Zou Mo.","Instantly, Zou Mo’s hair stood on end.","“Ah!” With a shiver, he instantly woke up at the counter.","“What’s wrong?” Alarmed, Ruan Ning stood up from the seat beside him.","“So... sorry!” Zou Mo said apologetically, “Last... last night, I didn’t sleep well.”","...","Meanwhile, in St. Heinz’s great hall.","“Then... in that ancient war... did anyone truly make that leap forward?” St. Dulan asked in a deep voice.","“In that war, no one made the leap,” St. Heinz said mildly, “Because... that piece of divinity... or the so-called Dao Seed in the East Continent, broke.”","“Bro... broke?!” St. Dulan said in astonishment.","“For people in the East Continent, it needs the combination of the right time, right place, and right people. For us, we need the holy trinity!” St. Heinz explained, “So, we can only wait for another opportunity to arrive.”","...","– At the Heavenly Abyss Sea –","Two figures still stood on the reef on the shore of the Heavenly Abyss Sea.","Violent gales swept across the sea.","Reminiscent glints flashed in their eyes.","“Ascendance to the True Immortal Realm is like... bugs devouring each other.”","“The time is coming... all of the world will fall into chaos... at that time...”","“Perhaps one day, they will destroy themselves this way.”","...","– In the afternoon, at the Immortal Tune Pavilion in the Heavenly Faction –","This ancient and unique pavilion was famous since the ancestral master of the Heavenly Faction had listened to immortal tune and understood Great Dao in this pavilion.","This place was the highest-level Dao-teaching venue in the Heavenly Faction.","It was heard that every person who had the privilege to teach Dao here was at least a senior member with a high position and great power. The Immortal Tune Pavilion was only opened for teaching Dao once in hundreds or even one thousand years.","In the pavilion, the fragrance of rare herbs floated around. The top spiritual scent could refresh people’s mind and help them concentrate with excellent effects. Although Mr. Fang had just decided to give a lecture on impulse, the Heavenly Faction had ordered the disciples to prepare the place with great care ahead of time. Sedately sitting on the futons in the pavilion, they looked as if they had bathed, scented, and even fasted for three days.","Sitting in the front row were the white-robed Elder Xiao Yunhe, the black-robed elder, and a few elders whom Mr. Fang had seen in the great hall.","Behind them were the six most outstanding disciples of the Heavenly Faction. Two of them, one man and one woman, sat in the center.","The white-robed man on the left with a solemn expression was the Elder Senior Disciple Zhuge Qinlong, and he was the most talented young disciple in the Heavenly Faction.","The white-robed tranquil woman sitting on the right was Yu Yin. Although she had entered the faction much later, her talent was on pair with Elder Senior Disciple Zhuge Qinlong.","Then, they saw Mr. Fang walking in from the outside.","When Mr. Fang passed, some female disciples almost had cold sweat popping out.","Cang Feng and some male disciples remembered the special effects in the visuals and also had cold sweat on their foreheads.","“Erm-hem!” He cleared his throat and said, “I didn’t know that I would be invited to give a lesson on Dao, so I’ll make it casual.”","“This opening...??”","“Huh?”","The elders thought, This style doesn’t feel right...?","“The Dao which one can explain is not the unchanging Dao,” Mr. Fang said, “It means that Dao is something that you can understand but not to be talked about. If it’s explained, it’s no longer the permanent Great Dao; it’s only one person’s Dao.”","[TL Note: ‘The Dao which one can explain is not the unchanging Dao’ is the first line in Dao De Jing, a Chinese classic text traditionally credited to the 6th-century BC sage Laozi.]","“Hiss!” The elders sitting in the front row shivered and stared at Mr. Fang dumbfoundedly.","“The Dao which one can explain... is not the unchanging Dao?!” They chewed on Mr. Fang’s words and felt like they were deep and mysterious.","The disciples immediately memorized the words silently.","Then, Mr. Fang changed the direction of the topic. “So, we must put more thought on ourselves.”","“More thought on ourselves?” The white-robed Elder Xiao Yunhe obviously didn’t understand.","“Yes,” Mr. Fang answered, “You’ll never fully understand it, but you can improve yourself continuously. During the process, your understanding of it will become deeper and deeper.”","“Improve myself? Does it mean... that we must cultivate in seclusion every day in the faction?” The black-robed elder asked in bafflement.","“Of course not.” Mr. Fang said, “Have you guys heard about... E-Sports?”","“E-Sports?!” The cultivators of the Heavenly Faction exchanged a look of confusion.","“I’ll tell you a story.” Then, Mr. Fang began to tell them the story about the duel at the top of Hua Mountain and shattering the void.","[TL Note: These refer to classic wuxia novels.]","“This... is E-Sports?” Xiao Yunhe asked curiously.","“No...” Mr. Fang said, “E-Sports is different. E-Sports relies on competitions in the virtual world to do this.”","Then, he talked about E-Sports professional leagues... and all kinds of god-like pro players. He discussed the God-like UZI and Demon King Faker.","“God-like? Demon King?” The elders were truly stunned. “Senior, you mean... we can improve ourselves continuously through E-Sports and eventually become...’god-like’?!”","“But...” Xiao Yunhe shook his head and said, “Ancestral Master said that humans’ strength can never break through the natural limit set for humans.","“Not everyone has such high and unique talents as you, Senior!”","“You’re right.” Mr. Fang spread his hands and said, “Your ancestral master only said that humans’ strength couldn’t do it, and he didn’t say anything about skills and techniques. As the saying goes, ‘skills and techniques reach Dao’. If you don’t do E-Sports, who will?!”","“So...” Xiao Yunhe said in shock, “We... need to do the so-called E-Sports?!”"]},{"number":778,"title":"Chapter 778 - League of Legends – the Glorious Chapter in This World!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","In the endless starry sky, the river of stars spanned across the void like a colorful band, displaying a radiance that people had never seen before.","The vision was a bit blurry but beautiful like a brilliant dream.","The cultivators who had entered the immortal palace in the Cultivation Realm looked glassy-eyed as if they were dreaming.","Each dream was different, but one thing was the same – the sense of extreme pressure.","It felt as if huge mountains from the prehistoric times crushed down on them one after another without stopping.","Standing in between the blurry palace, these cultivators vaguely felt like they were in a huge colosseum, and they seemed to be inside another vast space.","...","Buzz...","With a strange sound, those more than ten ancient swords hanging before the Yuanyang City Shop seemed to emit waves of strange energies.","The ancient swords that were in deep sleep all gradually woke up.","Even the most powerful Sky-Titled Sword revealed a trace of a sharp presence.","It was a presence of gathering strength to be ready for a great war...","Each of the swords had an extremely powerful sword spirit. No one knew what figures could control and use them.","“I feel it... Master’s presence...”","“Master...” The two swords, Qing Shuang and Qing Min, let out a series of sword cries. “Our master had...","“Fallen long ago, right...?”","“This is our... first master!” The Sky-Titled Saint Sword seemed to be talking about their father who created them. “The presence is distant, but I can still feel it...”","...","“Sky One Two! Sky Two Three...” The cultivators who had stumbled into the Cultivation Realm saw a dark-clothed figure chanting in a low voice with a swift glance. Sword energies appeared around this figure one by one like an escort convoy.","Endless godly lights fell before this figure, and the radiant wings slowly spread behind him. Looking like a vague god, the golden-haired figure had a blurry face. “Dugu... Yi... can... rival... gods?”","“Immortal-Hacking Sword Array!” At the black-clothed figure’s command, 108 flying swords instantly formed a horrifying major array. The sky and land seemed to be shattered by this horrifying vortex of sword array and revealed a large stretch of pitch-black void...","...","“Ahh-!” It was early morning when Zou Mo suddenly sat up from his bed.","He seemed to have a nightmare in which terrifying battles occurred one after another.","He saw faces from the East Continent and... the West Continent...","...","Then, he seemed to see the black-clothed figure leaving with his body covered in blood, and half of the swords were destroyed. However, he couldn’t see any living creatures in his vision.","Also, he seemed to see countless masters fall to the ground and die...","He felt like he also heard laughs, some mocking and some disdainful, from the supreme river of stars.","“Tsk! Tsk...”","“Puny monkeys.”","“As lowly as dust...”","...","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang had finished the mission of teaching Dao in the Immortal Tune Pavilion.","The location for the new shop was decided; it was in the Dongxuan Cave Abode not far from the Heavenly Faction.","This was one of the busiest gathering places for cultivators and warriors in the East Continent.","Different from the Continent of Immortal Relics and the West Continent, the biggest gathering places for cultivators in this continent were all built in small worlds.","The Dongxuan Cave Abode was one of them.","This shop was probably bigger than all the old shops combined if you only calculated the external area the shops covered instead of the interior spaces that the System had expanded.","It was originally a huge palace that was as big as a soccer field in the eastern zone, but the System had rebuilt it.","Now, it had modern-styled pure-white walls and huge floor-to-ceiling windows. The black stately gate had a huge word written above it –’Origins’.","Stepping into the shop on the orange hardwood floor, people would see rows of E-Sports computers and comfortable leather chairs. The pure-white radiant lights mingled with blueish-purple created a dream-like atmosphere in the shop.","Different from the other shops, the new shop had compartments for clubs and E-Sports teams.","Of course, the old shops would also be upgraded soon.","At this moment, Mr. Fang received a new task.","[New Task: A Wuxia Game Which Is called Xianxia","Task Target: The number of players in the new shop reaches 100,000","Task Reward: Online Game – Sword Heroes’ Fate 3 System Remake Version]","[TL Note: This is a popular MMORPG, but it seems like another mobile game has the same name in English.]","“Ugh...?” Mr. Fang scratched his head. “Are you kidding me? A journey to the Great Tang Dynasty?”","...","At this moment, the Heavenly Faction’s elders led the most outstanding disciples into the shop.","Mr. Fang even saw the white-haired and white-bearded Grand Elder who was holding a golden scroll sticking his head in and wondering, “Is this the place...?”","Seeing Mr. Fang, he immediately walked over and said, “Daoist Friend Fang!”","“Congratulations...!”","Of course, many other factions also came to congratulate Mr. Fang with gifts. After all, Mr. Fang had an awesome reputation here after those special effects were added to the video.","...","“Senior Fang!” While searching for the new game named ‘E-Sports’, Gu Song looked at Mr. Fang embarrassedly and asked, “Can you tell me where the E-Sports-related mystical realm is?”","“The shop has released the trailer of the new game,” Mr. Fang said.","Meanwhile, the players in the old shops obviously had also found the new stuff.","The knights of the Golden Griffin Knight Legion obviously had suffered for hours in Dark Souls today.","At this moment, they suddenly saw a pop-up window in QQ. “Trailer of the new game?”","“What kind of new game?!” Elven looked at the pop-up window on the screen curiously.","“A new game?!” The elves and assassins obviously had also seen it.","“A trailer too...?”","Immediately, they clicked it open.","Endless flames of war spread out like wildfire on the wasteland, destroying the sky and the land.","In the ancient palace in the distant rift, the summoners gathered.","Countless golden lights fell from the sky. With wings spreading out, an angel in golden armor came as if in answer to the summon.","Before her, the deep darkness gathered and condensed into a demon’s figure.","Lights and shadows gathered and condensed into countless strange faces in the rift.","Figures flashed by while they murmured in the dusk.","“The true power... comes from the tearing inside.”","“Many foes, one strike!” A sword beam tore open the darkness. In the setting sun, the viewers seemed to see the figure swinging the sword.","“Ignorance is fatal!” In the dark mist, a dark shadow faded.","“Now, the curtain is gradually lifted!”","“Face the wind!” The wanderer who was carrying a long saber appeared. When the saber slashed, gusts swept across the space, blocking the sun and the sky!","...","“What’s this...?!”","Everyone watched the scenes full of saber and sword beams as wind blew and fire ignited...","At this moment, it seemed an unknown tinder from somewhere was ignited."]},{"number":779,"title":"Chapter 779 - Turbulent Homeland – the Pinnacle in Warriors’ Dreams!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The Yellow Spring Sea to the east of Half City had always been a forbidden zone for all cultivators in this sea area.","Without any birds flying above it, the turbid yellow sea was deadly silent.","The water that had a rotten-smell surged up in huge waves, and something seemed to wake up slowly on the bottom of the deadly silent sea.","...","The ancient immortal palace in the Cultivation Realm floated up. A pair of icy-cold eyes that had been through many tribulations looked down on the dried-up land. “After so many tribulations, my Heaven-Hiding Saint Realm has declined too...”","Under the invisible force in the lowest level of the immortal palace, the crystal coffins sealed by ice began to open slowly.","...","“Time brings great changes... oceans turn into mulberry fields.” In the Continent of the Immortal Village (East Continent), a straight figure stood on the tallest mountain in a mountain range like an arrogant eagle, and intense sword lights occasionally glinted in his turbid eyes.","Looking at the distant white clouds, the winding rivers, and the rolling mountains, he found the world both strange and familiar.","“Time passes as quickly as a white horse crossing a crevice... I wonder... if the Dugu Sword Tomb at the foot of Heaven-Seeking Peak and the Dugu Family... is still there...”","...","“Tribulation... Destruction! I can smell it...” In the huge fortress built with black rocks to the north of Canglan City, the dwarf craftsmen made up the majority of the population. Right now, they sensed the ominous presence gradually spreading in the air.","...","At the Gods Peak in the Radiant Light Godly Nation stood a dream-like palace made completely with crystals.","Pure golden godly lights flashed in Princess Isabella’s eyes.","Her body floated up as if she was weightless.","If saint-level masters were here, they would be horrified to see that the godly lights were being emitted from the inside of her body.","Although the force was still not complete, it was indeed godly force!","It came from within instead of an outside source, which meant that this force belonged completely to her!","“This time, I’ll give you people a huge surprise!” Her lips curved up while her eyes seemed to pierce through endless time and space and see that ancient battleground.","...","Meanwhile, in Origins Internet Club.","With Instructor Fang’s tutorial, the idle students had obtained great progress.","At the untended graves, St. Leidon had a small round shield in his left hand and a slim and long sword in the right hand.","The huge halberd crashed down viciously like a falling mountain.","However, he blocked it with his shield and diverted his opponent’s force with a streak of strange strength.","Boom!","Parry!","“I did it!”","Standing before Lothric the Younger Prince and the last Lord of Cinder, St. Willy lifted his staff while magic light transformed into a thin barrier of light, blocking all the spells cast by his opponents.","He waved his staff lightly, and countless magic crystals hovered around him like sharp swords. Meanwhile, magic lights transformed into soul arrows and shot out silently!","...","Obviously, the players had begun to master these high-level battle skills and had toughened their minds during the process. Even when facing existences several times more powerful than themselves, they wouldn’t be anxious. They fought these enemies calmly and even turned the tables.","...","Of course, they were still a few steps away from clearing the stage.","...","At this moment, most of the players in the shop had improved their battle skills to a certain level. The players who could calmly fight their way to the later stage of Dark Souls were truly grandmasters.","...","Of course, some players were comparatively dull, such as some elves.","On her screen, Rowling was still fighting Farron’s Breakdance Crew.","She fought with tears on her face; it was a nightmare for a clumsy player like her.","“Ah... I can’t do it...” Rowling was extremely frustrated. “I’ll watch the new TV Series for a while...”","However, her battle skills had improved a lot while she went from being stuck with Gundyr to fighting with Farron’s Undead Legion.","...","At this moment, Mr. Fang glanced at the task list.","[Task: Challenger’s Tutorial School (Elementary)","Task Target: Help the muggle students reach the average (Average: Advanced Level). Help the excellent students reach Master Level","Completeness: (1) 88%, (2) 74%","Task Reward: League of Legends]","Under Instructor Fang’s tireless guidance, the idle and dumb students had made great progress, and the task was almost completed.","...","“Sir! Want to watch the new TV Series?” While he read the system task, Mr. Fang heard this question.","The branch shop in Dongxuan Cave Abode didn’t have many issues for Mr. Fang to handle, so he didn’t stay in the new shop all the time.","At this moment, he was sitting in the Canglan City Shop.","He had sent Li Xin’er and a few other old employees from the Yuanyang City Shop to manage the new shop.","Meanwhile, the Canglan City Shop began to recruit employees.","“Merlin...?” Elder Li Wuya obviously was handling the recruitment of new employees for Mr. Fang.","“Yes!” Mr. Fang posted a message in Mr. Fang’s Group Tour QQ group chat, [Group tour for the new TV Series. The old driver is at the wheel; anyone wants to get onboard?]","[Which one do we watch first?] Nalan Mingxue asked.","[We’ll watch Turbulent Homeland first.]","Su Tianji replied, [Count me in!","Nalan Mingxue chimed in, [Me!]","Jiang Xiaoyue added, [Me! Me! Me!]","“...”","Soon, a big group of people got on board.","...","Meanwhile, in the branch shop at the Dongxuan Cave Abode.","The new customers were mostly disciples and elders of Heavenly Faction.","The rest were cultivators and warriors sent by other factions to congratulate the opening of the shop and some curious passersby.","For now, there were hundreds of customers in the shop.","In the new shop at Dongxuan Cave Abode, the customers were hesitating over the many games and TV Series while talking among themselves, “Which one shall we try first?”","After all, the new shop had all the games and TV Series.","“There are so many...”","“Maybe we can try the new item in the shop,” Elder Xiao Yunhe suggested.","Soon, many people clicked open the Turbulent Homeland.","...","Like Wind and Cloud, this TV Series was initially designed to be in the Wuxia Genre.","Later, due to the increase of power, the series obtained a certain flavor of fantasy and Xianxia but still retained the authentic Wuxia system.","It was why it became a pinnacle for warriors to look up at.","It was also a stunning legend!","At this moment, Nalan Hongwu, Zong Wu, Liang Heihu, and other warriors were also watching the show on Mr. Fang’s tour bus.","The scene before them dimmed...","Then, they found that they were in an ocean of clouds while mountains swiftly moved back beneath their feet. Their gaze went up with the sword-like mountain peak which shot into the high sky.","The mountain peak was so high that it seemed to touch the Heavenly Realm. Thunder and lightning bolts flashed around them.","A person stood at the ultimate peak in the clouds.","“A warrior?” Nalan Hongwu and other warriors including the warriors in the Canglan City Shop widened their eyes at the scene.","Red and black demonic flames rose. Then, a sword was unsheathed, and dancing-snake-like lightning energy engulfed it.","In the darkness, the saber energy transformed into a blinding light. Instantly, even the booming lightning bolts dimmed before this light!","Before this figure was a huge Tai Chi pattern composed of the huge black presence of Yin and white presence of Yang.","The saber energy and the Tai Chi collided while countless streaks of horrifying essence spread out like a primeval storm, instantly knocking down mountains and cracking land!","“Are they also warriors?!”","It must be noted that the human warriors in this world had worked hard for countless years to achieve their current status, but they were still inferior to cultivators.","However, they saw that the horrifying presences released from the two warriors who were battling were great enough to shatter the sky and the land!","Are these two people really warriors?!","They were instantly stunned by these two ultimate figures!","This was the pinnacle stage that warriors had been dreaming about!"]},{"number":780,"title":"Chapter 780 - Learned a New Skill: Reciting Poems","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The story of Turbulent Homeland wasn’t very novel. It was about the Dongying Region’s invasion into the Central Region which triggered an ultimate battle between the pinnacle masters of both sides.","At this moment, no one was aware that a huge catastrophe was brewing invisibly. Qi Tiandi, the World-Creating Demon Emperor of the Demon Realm, the once No.1 Godly Warrior in the Heaven Realm and the god of destruction and rebirth, was scheming with the energy from the Saint Demon Embryo and the Godly State Pillar!","...","It was an ancient story told in a traditional way.","However...","Before them...","Like the Legend of the White Snake, this TV Series obviously also had a theme song. The difference was that this TV Series mostly had theme music at the beginning instead of opening songs.","Figures of great presence flashed before them like shooting stars accompanied by intense drumbeats. Under the blood-colored setting sun, tens of thousands of ships in neat formations set off, carrying countless warriors on a sea journey toward the Central Region.","The Central Region, Dongying Region, and Demon Realm... a huge martial story slowly lifted its curtain.","The chilly lights that were flashing like lightning bolts were exquisite moves. The hands moved with the presence of mountains or tsunamis, and they could shatter the sky and the land – this was a battle between true masters!","At this moment, the viewers just didn’t want the opening song to finish, feeling as if their blood was kindled like fire!","Even the elves screamed silently, This TV Series is so good!","Although they didn’t understand what wuxia was, they screamed, “Wow... this is so cool!”","“Are they the warriors in the East Continent?!” Even the saint-level masters such as St. Willy and St. Leidon couldn’t help gasping in surprise.","“Huh-?” Dugu Xiao, the black-robed elder carrying a sword on his back, watched the opening song and exchanged a look with Elder Xiao Yunhe who sitting beside him.","“Oh! How come these people read poems when they make their appearances!?”","The warriors in the Deserted Sea Realm and Spiritual State all watched the TV Series in amazement.","Before they saw the characters, ethereal tunes came to their ears from the sky.","The elves in the West Continent were even more amazed.","“...”","“This...”","How come these warriors are so cool?!","...","“Is this wuxia too?!” Nalan Hongwu was enthralled by the show. Obviously, only the customers in the old shops could understand it.","“Wuxia? What’s wuxia...?” The saint-level masters in the West Continent asked in clumsy Spirit State Language that they had obviously just learned from the Language Inspiration Spiritual Spell.","Aren’t they a group of powerful warriors?","What is this powerful stuff called Wuxia?!","...","Despite their puzzlement, this group of people sat before the computers and watched the new TV Series in fascination.","...","As mentioned before, the Continent of the Immortal Village had three factions, four sects, and six major cave abodes.","Some of them had a very long history, and some of them had gradually grown in the long years into their current states.","“Everything... declined so much...” A black-clothed figure walked in the desolate valley and plucked a wildflower from the knee-length weeds which were as lush as green jade. In the abundant but turbid spiritual essence, there seemed to be fragments of broken array bases.","He bent down and began to clean up the weeds. Suddenly, he looked up and saw another figure standing at the entrance of the valley.","It was a bookish man, and he appeared to be a gentle teacher at first glance.","His face was sickly pale, and he was so thin that it seemed like he had just recovered from a long-standing illness. It felt like a big wind would knock him down.","If not for the horrifying phenomenon spreading from his feet, anyone would take him as an ordinary person.","His black robe was so dark that it seemed to represent death. The ink-like presence spread out on the ground with each step he took, withering and killing all the lush plants it touched.","...","Not only in the night but during the day, Zou Mo would see extremely weird things from nowhere whenever he closed his eyes.","He seemed to see a black figure. The darkness spreading from him seemed to be able to devour the sky, the land, and the whole world!","“Evil Emperor... Shang Jiuwen...?!”","The darkness seemed to devour him too!","Vaguely, he seemed to be watching the prehistoric time when ultimate masters were everywhere, and shockingly talented figures rose one after another.","That era seemed to be the most glorious and prosperous time in human history!","Then, he saw countless shooting stars fall from the sky. Under the cloud and mist was a wasteland by the ocean.","“Ah-!” He felt like the figures were extremely familiar to him. At this moment, he fell from the high sky too...","...","From the endless void, there seemed to be a cold gaze devoid of any human emotions looking down.","This pair of eyes seemed to be there eternally, gazing at each era like an omnipresent supervisor. Anyone and anything was naked before this pair of eyes as if no secrets could escape from them.","Meanwhile, in the darkness in the void, countless pairs of greedy eyes seemed to be gazing at the world as well.","...","Like surging flames, the blazing desire for battle turned the whole jade-like valley into scorched land.","Such a scene had happened before...","However, in the next moment, even though the desire for battle was still there, the suffocating atmosphere evaporated instantly.","After all, only one person could make another step forward.","One man’s success meant countless deaths. Countless people flourished like flowers in the summer and then withered and died. Tens of thousands of years later, no one would remember their names. Perhaps... this was their fate.","...","“It’s over so soon?!” Although four episodes of the Turbulent Homeland were released, the warriors and cultivators felt like the hour-long episodes were as short as three minutes.","“I feel like the shop owner secretly shortened the time of each episode?” Sala and the other elves stared at Mr. Fang suspiciously.","They checked the length several times but couldn’t find any fault with it. Resigned, they watched them again.","Each of the four episodes had fierce battles, giving them a ton of inspiration.","“A half god, a half saint, and also a half immortal; a full scholar, a full Daoist and a full sage. Tens of thousands of scrolls in the head, excel in pen and sword to support half the world!” In extremely clumsy Spirit State Language (Mandarin), the elves recited the words while shaking their heads.","“I decided!” Sala yelled, “This is my poem slogan!”","As an elf with good taste, she felt satisfied with this elegant and cool slogan.","“This is mine!” Rowling snorted.","Even the elves in the new shop acted like this, let alone the customers in the old shops even though they had only watched the first four episodes.","Obviously, watching these battles gave them a great boost.","“Huh...?”","[Task: Challenger’s Tutorial School (Elementary) – Completed","Task Reward: League of Legends]"]},{"number":781,"title":"Chapter 781 - E-Sports, Here I come!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Sir, as for the E-Sports that you mentioned, when will it be released?” After watching the Turbulent Homeland and Wind and Cloud 3, the players in the branch shop at the Dongxuan Cave Abode were still thrilled. However...","The shop owner had told them that the so-called E-Sports could turn them ‘god-like’ and into ‘demon kings’.","It sounded ridiculous, but...","Even peak saint-level masters like us are scared by the stuff in the shop. At least, none of our artifact masters in the East Continent can make such mystical realms or TV Series.","Maybe...","At this moment, the white-bearded and white-haired Grand Elder of the Heavenly Faction summoned some elders for questioning. Meanwhile, he turned to the last page of the ancient golden scroll.","“But there are exceptions to everything...” This fragmented line of ancient words had been deciphered by him little by little.","It seemed to be a story about an ancient era in which countless masters from the East Continent and the West Continent compete to reach a higher realm...","The last few pages of the golden scroll seemed to have been torn off by someone purposefully as if this person didn’t want many people to know about this secret history.","“It sounds like...” He glanced around and said, “like the sword duel at... the top of Hua Mountain?”","Mr. Fang did say that E-Sports is like this duel at the top of Hua Mountain, right?","The faction master who was dressed in a reddish-brown robe stood beside the Grand Elder and looked at the latter’s ancient face. “Elder... do you think the E-Sports is real or not...?”","Grand Elder Zhuge Qingyun looked at the incomplete scroll with his old eyes.","“Perhaps... it’s real.” The old man was obviously hesitant.","“Are you sure...” As a sensible man, Faction Master Feng Xuehe felt like something wasn’t right, and he wondered, Is the Grand Elder muddled in head due to his old age?","That was why he asked doubtfully.","The white-haired old man glared at Feng Xuehe and reprimanded in a loud voice, “Of course, I’m sure! How can it now be?”","This little b*stard dares to doubt my words?! When I managed the faction, you were still a small baby who was drinking milk somewhere! How dare you!","“Read for yourself!” He threw the golden scroll left by the ancestral master of the faction at the faction master’s face. “Read for yourself!”","“Um...”","“Masters competing...’Sword duel at the top of Hua Mountain’...!?” Widened-eyed, Feng Xuehe stared at the words on the golden scroll that were translated by the Grand Elder.","It is exactly the same as what the shop owner had said!","“Then, the E-Sports can really make us god-like?!” His expression instantly turned serious.","While holding the golden scroll with both hands, he said shakily, “You... you finally deciphered the ancestral master’s golden scroll?!”","“Of course!” Grand Elder Zhuge Qingyun stroked his snow-white beard and said proudly, “It’s well worth my efforts in the last 200 years!”","“Excellent!” Faction Master Feng Xuehe shouted, looking ambitious as he felt that he would embark on a great path leading to immortality just like their ancient ancestors who had stunning talents.","In this era, they would write their own legend!","...","Since the new shop had just opened, Mr. Fang would come and check it occasionally.","It was early morning, and some elders and disciples walked up to him respectfully. “That E-Sports...?”","Mr. Fang pointed at the small blackboard.","On it was written, [Today’s new game: League of Legends.]","[The activation is free.]","“This mystical realm... is free?!” They exchanged a look of astonishment.","“How can it be?!” Xiao Yunhe said in shock.","Did the shop owner say that it can help us become god-like?!","“You can become Ascendance Realm Masters by cultivation.” Mr. Fang rolled his eyes at them. “Do you charge money for that?”","“Um...” Xiao Yunhe’s face turned stiff. “Senior, you’re right.”","...","Meanwhile, in the Canglan City Shop, the elves obviously had also seen this new game. “Free again...?”","“There’s a free mystical realm?!” As a member of the Magic Union, Adolf was also surprised.","“We had discounts last time...” Dicas felt indignant for Mr. Fang and said, “Now, it’s free of charge! The shop owner is so kind!”","“But will the shop go bankrupt if it does business this way?”","“It’s not like that these mystical realms are hard to sell. Instead, they are very popular. But the shop owner still released a free mystical realm!”","The elves were also touched. “The shop owner is so kind-hearted!”","“Yes! He is!” Rowling had bought ten games last time and had a flat wallet now. Therefore, she was so touched that she shed tears. “The shop owner is so considerate of us!”","“Right!” Sala seconded that, “If the new game were expensive, I would have to consider if I should buy it.”","“I’m surprised that it’s free of charge!”","“Cheer for the new game that we can play for free!” The handsome young man dressed in a mage’s robe and standing at the counter was Merlin, the new employee of the shop.","“I think we should celebrate it with a bottle of Coke!”","“Right! I want a bottle of Coke too!”","“One bottle for me! Spicy sticks, too!”","“Let’s go buy some as well!” Rowling suggested, “We were planning to buy the new game. The money we save on the new game is money earned!”","Right now, the door of the shop was wide open.","The spies from the Radiant Light Godly Nation sneaked glances into the shop.","“Origins Internet Club is losing money again...”","“If the situation continues, we’ll win without a fight!”","In the Radiant Light Godly Nation, St. Heinz exchanged a look with St. Dulan as he said with a smile, “Free of charge?”","The previous discounts were big, but they still could earn back the cost.","But free of charge now?!","After all, any growth in strength was not without cost. How could mystical realms that could increase people’s strength and battle skills continue to operate without the support of energy?","Free of charge...?","“Our enemy is powerful, but it’s a pity that he wants to be a selfless saint,” Saint Dulan shook his head and said with a smile, “He’s too much of an idealist and will bring destruction to himself!”","“Maybe...” a red-robed senior priest said with confidence, “We can remove some parts of the restrictions on the residents in the remaining faith nations? So more people will visit their mystical realms and thus accelerate their destruction!”","“Also, the Stand Kingdom... I think we can remove some of the restrictions...”","“But we must work harder to hunt down Grand Mage Merlin.”","“Do it secretly!”","...","Meanwhile, the players in the shops all sat before their computers and turned on the game with Coke or spicy sticks in their hands.","They started the game with the dream of becoming god-like.","“E-Sports, here I am!”"]},{"number":782,"title":"Chapter 782 - Igniting the Flames of War the Summoner’s Rift!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Welcome to Summoner’s Rift.” The elves put on their virtual reality headsets. Different from the original game interface, the summoners in the system version of the game were in a chamber full of magical infrastructure after entering the game.","It seemed to be an ancient summoner’s hall.","“The people on this continent are used to battling ever since the ancient times.”","Magical lights flowed in the area, and the wall with neatly engraved magic runes before them revealed a battered land.","Although it was a virtual scene, it looked very real. It seemed to be the world outside this ancient hall, or it was just telling a story that had happened in this world.","The flames of war spread from the plains to the distant snow mountains. The dark sky was full of shadows from the void.","Purple shooting stars flew across the sky into the distance. When it knocked down half a mountain, the viewers realized that it was a wave blinding magic light.","Flames of war burned up villages and devoured nations. Countless people shed blood on this vast land...","Finally, a huge earthquake and an extremely horrifying magic storm struck.","“People finally realized that the world could no longer stand the damages afflicted by the war of runes.”","“The grand mages in Valoran gathered with countless powerful summoners and reached the agreement to manage conflicts in a controllable and systematic way. Therefore, the League of Legends was founded.”","“All the conflicts would be solved by duels between great champions summoned by summoners with different political opinions on this arena.”","“As more and more summoners and champions joined in, no one was as stupid as to mess with so many powerful existences. Therefore, despite the continuous conflicts between hostile political factions, order returned to the continent.”","...","“The war in this world will exist in this way from now on?” As the queen of the Elf Clan, Kellybel had lived for a long time and knew how horrifying wars could be, and that was why she was amazed by the method. “I didn’t know that wars could take place in this form!”","Wars can be fought in virtual reality?!","After watching the background of the game, the virtual image before them showed two options. One was for beginners who would enter the newbie’s tutorial to learn the basic operations; the other option was entering the game directly.","Since it was a free game, most of the players decided to try it. After their hard experience in Dark Souls 3, they no longer overestimated themselves and watched the tutorial first to understand the basic rules. After that, they chose to play the higher-level PvP mode to battle with other players.","The players in the shop grew steadily.","In the Canglan City Shop alone, there were tens of thousands of players, and that was the number in the early morning instead of peak hours.","Since there was only one server named Ionia in the game right now, and everyone was a beginner, almost everyone instantly got into the game.","...","At this moment, Nalan Mingxue turned on the livestream as she queued for a match.","She even got an elf to queue up for a match together with her.","Of course, QQ voice chat was necessary.","“Oh... I got in!” This was from the private QQ private chat channel named “Elder Su Tianji’s Palace”. Sala and Nalan Mingxue were listed in one small room with Su Tianji, Lan Yan, Xu Zixin, and some visiting elves.","They were all girls.","Meanwhile, people like Nalan Hongwu and An Huwei were also queueing for a match in their respective QQ channels.","“We’re in as well!” In the new shop at Dongxuan Cave Abode, the disciples of the Heavenly Faction were matched up with opponents.","[Prompt: you can choose and summon a champion whom you like. But in Summoner’s Rift, any champion can only unleash part of their strength and stay in a relative balance.]","[Prompt: after your champion die, they will revive at the base after a short time of recovery since you only summon the projected images of the champions with only a percentage of their strength.]","[Prompt: you can locate everyone in the fog of war through the magic map in your hands.]","“...”","After a series of prompts, most players entered the game.","“Xuexue, who do you plan to choose?” Before the players was a simple map listing all kinds of champions and their 3D virtual images.","“What is broken can be reforged!” A valiant female voice sounded in the QQ voice channel, and Nalan Mingxue had chosen a female champion who was holding a huge broken blade.","As with other games, the players could only choose the same-gender champions except for the non-humanoid champions.","“Oh! I was planning to choose this one...!” Since Nalan Mingxue had chosen this character, Sala had to choose another one.","“I’ll choose...this one! The Frost Archer!” We elves excel in archery!","...","“My blade is yours!” In Dongxuan Cave Abode Shop, the black-robed Elder Dugu Xiao’s screen showed a weathered face under goggles.","My E-Sports journey begins!","Start!","With heavy music, they gradually entered the world with their champions’ strengths and souls.","Rows of magic crystals and turrets sat on the vast land majestically, and the lush ocean-like green forests covered the whole valley.","“Lady luck is smiling!”","“The unseen blade is the deadliest!” In the shadows, a pair of long and narrow eyes opened slowly.","“Stand with me, brothers and sisters!” A battle flag was raised high.","“Magic? I’ll show you real magic!” The magic storms from the ancient times flashed with dangerous colors!","“They will receive you like champions.” Blood dyed the land red!","“...”","Voices, either deep, luring, or deadly, rose in their ears!","Behind them, a huge and grand soul slowly woke up from deep sleep. They were summoned here, and they were the greatest champions, the strongest warriors, and the most legendary mages!","They were also... the most powerful weapons!","At this moment, they gathered here.","The sky was lit up while lights shone all over the land.","“Welcome to Summoner’s Rift!”","The war began at this moment."]},{"number":783,"title":"Chapter 783 - Face-Checking a Brush","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","-In the Jiuhua City Shop at Dajin-","At this moment, the employees rotated in shifts in the old shop, so they didn’t have to watch the shop all day long as they had done previously.","When they were not working, they could play online.","As usual, Xiao Yulv stood behind the players and watched them play with a plate of dried fruits from the Wind and Moon Pavilion.","At this moment, he was watching Yu Zhiwei, a female employee of the shop, as she chose her champion.","“This...? How come some characters are grey?” Xiao Yulv pointed at the screen and asked.","“It’s because we can’t choose characters of the opposite gender.” Yu Zhiwei waved her hand as if it was obvious. “You’ve never played games before; you don’t know it.”","“If you can’t choose them, they shouldn’t be here. Why make them grey?” As an expert in game guides, Xiao Yulv intuitively felt like there was something fishy about it.","“How can you say that I don’t know it?!” After all, everyone was making huge progress while Xiao Yulv was the only one who couldn’t play games. He had no choice but to diligently practice the ultimate techniques of at home and had become a master who excelled in every spiritual spell of the Liuyun Daoist Palace.","He knew the games guides thoroughly and could recite them backward. “How can you slander me this way?”","“Hahahaha!” The people around him laughed. “Gongzi Xiao, you want to play online?”","“You...! You guys!” His face turned red, feeling like he would burst.","“Huh?” At this moment, Yu Zhiwei found that she could click on those grey champions of the opposite gender. It was just that she couldn’t lock in her choice.","When she tried to lock in, a prompt popped up, [Your account isn’t a Disciplined Player Account. Please get appraised first.]","“Huh?!”","“Ugh?” Xiao Yulv stared at the screen wide-eyed.","Does it mean I can...?!","[Boss! When can I get to play games?!] While ignoring the people who were still mocking him, he immediately contacted Mr. Fang.","Since Xiao Yulv couldn’t even use QQ, Mr. Fang received a text message from him via the communication jade.","“Oh?” Mr. Fang glanced at his privileges. As new branch shops were opened and the number of players grew, Mr. Fang had gained more and more privileges which were almost the same as those of a real shop owner.","In the page of employee allocation, the previously grey line for issuing tasks to employees had now lit up.","[Xiao Yulv: -5 star employee; can upgrade stars by doing tasks. Zero star equals to an ordinary customer; -4 to -1 stars equal to customers with restricted level","Tasks that can be assigned to employees","Tasks that were fitting for this employee: Walkthrough creation, competition commentary]","Mr. Fang replied, [I’ll assign some tasks to you. If you do them well, I’ll personally remove the ban on you!]","[Really?!]","“Ahh!” With a long roar, a figure in a yellow shirt and a white robe shot up into the clouds. The emotions that were suppressed inside him for a long time now burst out.","“Ahahahahaha!” The figure shot through layer after layer of thick clouds like a cannon ball.","He was elated!","Suddenly, a middle-sized passenger spiritual boat slowly flew out from the clouds.","Boom!","A huge noise came from the sky.","...","[Mr. Fang.] Yu Zhiwei sent a message, [Gongzi Xiao broke one bone in his neck and has applied for leave for a few weeks.]","She posted a screenshot in which half of a man’s body was stuck in the bottom of a spiritual boat.","“Oh...”","...","On the other side of the shop.","The system remake of League of Legends had obviously made many optimized changes on top of the original version.","Situated between Freljord and a remote forest, Summoner’s Rift was one of the few places full of magic power.","It looked just like the scene that flashed in the cinematic trailer and the opening cinematics.","It was in one corner of the lush magic forest.","Wolfs and other wild beasts in the forest were resting in this tranquil spot. There were also all kinds of magic creatures and monsters.","The boundary was sealed by a magic shield. Through the light of the shield at the boundary, the players could see the high mountains and clear sky outside the rift.","Under the blazing sunshine, the jungle off the roads was filled with the ear-grating sounds of insects. Due to the intense magic power, even spiritual energy could only cover a small area in this place.","Therefore, the vast areas of grassland on the paths were changed into dense jungles full of bushes, weeds, and trees.","At this moment, Nalan Mingxue glanced at the Exemplar of Demacia dressed in shiny golden armor who had walked out together with her.","“We shall rest when we are dead!”","With that said, they stepped into the top jungle with great solemnness and didn’t even look back.","They crouched behind the brush.","“Huh...?” At this moment, two people walked out from the opposite direction. One wore heavy armor with a huge axe in his hands, and the other carried a heavy two-handed big sword.","Different from the original version, the players controlled the champions’ projected images, so they didn’t speak the scripted lines. Sometimes, these champions would remind the summoners. Of course, if the champion had a cold personality, they wouldn’t speak more than twice in one match.","Obviously, Riven wasn’t such a champion.","“Defy Noxus and taste your own blood!”","The two people on the red side were charging up with full force under the summoners’ control.","“Choose your own path.” Nalan Mingxue seemed to feel that another soul’s awareness and force were flowing in her body; that voice was reminding her, “A sword mirrors its owner.”","A new force flowed into her body as if she had mastered a special sword technique.","“Broken Wings!” The huge blade with dark green rune energy took her forward, and she flew up in an elegant and pretty arc like a butterfly.","Then, she leaped into the brush nearby.","“Huh?”","“Where’s she?”","As a player who had played Assassin’s Creed, it was possible to instantly disappear from the opponent’s vision into a brush.","The two people exchanged a look.","The Rogue Mage said, “She is alone...?”","The Hand of Noxus replied, “Let’s go and have a look.”","The two players walked into the brush in excitement. “Don’t run! Hehe!”","“What is broken can be reforged!” A huge blade fell from the sky! The huge momentum almost shattered the ground, bouncing the two players into the sky at the same time!","“Demacia!” Almost at the same time, a huge lance thrust out like a fierce dragon!","“First blood!”"]},{"number":784,"title":"Chapter 784 - The Tutorial of the battle between Child Zed and ATM Leblanc","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","[TL Note: These are Chinese terms for trash Zed and Leblanc players. Zed players got the name since many kids who are bad at the game play Zed, and Leblanc players got the name since the bad ones almost go back to the wrong distortion and feed.]","It was quiet on the rift.","It seemed like little had changed due to the loss of the First Blood.","The whole rift was full of a solemn presence.","The blue side that Nalan Mingxue was on had a Leblanc player in the mid lane, and her enemy was a Zed player.","In the most prominent place in Dongxuan Cave Abode Shop sat a white-clothed woman.","With a snow-white face and smooth skin, she looked very proud with a cold expression.","With clothes whiter than snow and a face prettier than jade, she looked like a fairy from Heaven.","At the moment, she was controlling the Deceiver to dodge her opponent’s attacks with focused attention.","This was her first time playing ‘E-Sports’.","Behind her stood a group of average disciples who were learning from her by watching.","“Watch carefully!” One elder urged them from behind. “Watch how your Elder Senior Sister plays E-Sports!”","“Yes!” The disciples behind her were full of excitement and admiration.","“Hiss-! This person is strong!”","“How come he can hit Senior Sister with shurikens...”","She didn’t dare to lower her guard.","As the Elder Senior Sister of Heavenly Faction and one of the most outstanding disciples in the faction, she had personally heard from the elders that this E-Sports could improve her so much that she would become ‘god-like’!","Therefore, she must do her best in each battle.","Meanwhile, she would set a good example to these junior sisters and brothers, so they could learn the essence of E-Sports!","This way, the whole faction could progress!","Controlling the Deceiver, Yu Yin didn’t dare to lower her guard while she fought with the Zed player.","They fought fiercely with shurikens and magic spells.","The magic lights shot out like cannonballs!","Sigil of Silence! (Old version of LeBlanc’s Q ability, which can silence the enemy)","Swoosh!","In a flash, her opponent Zed reacted very swiftly and moved back sideways.","The yellow light flew past his ear!","“Want to hit me?” The Zed had a smug smile on his face.","At this moment, a sigil turned back in the sky, and it crashed onto his back with vicious force!","“Pu-!” The Zed player instantly spewed out a mouthful of blood. The player sitting in a corner in the Half City Shop turned grim.","“So... so strong!”","“This person is indeed a master!”","Magic light flashed, and that figure appeared before him instantly!","The horrifying magic energy exploded instantly in the tiny space. The Zed player tried to move but found that the strength in his body seemed to have been sealed, and he couldn’t use any abilities.","“Terrifying! She sealed the strength in my body while injuring me. This must be an ultimate master! Run!” In a hurry, he rolled on the ground and dashed back wildly with a horrified expression.","With repeated waves of the staff, a chain instantly shot out with a lightning-like magic attack!","The attacks in a battle between masters were cast with lightning speed.","Although two of the three attacks missed, her powerful presence of tanking three consecutive tower shots scared the Zed player witless! He didn’t dare to come up again!","Satisfied, she returned to her lane.","“Elder Senior Sister, you’re so strong!” Behind her, the disciples exclaimed.","“My opponent is also a master!” Yu Yin looked calm and modest. “He looked to be suppressed, but he showed his weakness only to make me lower my guard. As a result, I got hit three times from the tower. He’s a very experienced fighter!”","“Then, what do you do?” one disciple asked anxiously.","“How do we deal with this situation?” Yu Yin took out a bottle of red health potion. “He doesn’t know that I’ve prepared the top-quality health potion. After I take it, my injuries will slowly heal. I’ve bought five bottles of such potion!”","“Senior Sister, you anticipated this?!” The disciples standing behind her said in surprise.","“Well... you forced back a strong enemy but can still keep a cool head. In your first try with the E-Sports, you’re well-prepared with a good strategy, keeping everything in control. Excellent! Excellent!” The white-robed elder in the back clapped his hands and praised.","“Elder, thank you.”","Yu Yin’s attention returned to the game again.","“Look! The enemy has brought health potion too!” Everyone saw that Zed’s injuries were also healing slowly.","“I already said that my opponent is also a master. It seems like he thought of the potions too!” Appreciation appeared in Yu Yin’s eyes, and she got even more thrilled. “I didn’t expect that I would encounter such a great rival so easily in this E-Sports!”","The two rivals fought even more cautiously until they reached level 6 and consumed all five bottles of health potions. At this moment, their murderous spirit rose sharply!","“The final moment comes! It is about time to see who wins!” Yu Yin said.","The average disciples watching from behind her got tense up as well.","Perhaps... this is the true meaning of the sword duel at the top of Hua Mountain.","They wished that they were standing on the battleground themselves!","At this moment, Yu Yin controlled the Deceiver to move.","The move was so fast and blurry that it seemed like teleportation. She appeared before Zed instantly.","However, Zed appeared at where Yu Yin’s Deceiver had been a moment ago.","“The unseen blade is the deadliest!” The player controlling Zed murmured the line that his champion said most often. When the blade slashed out, the shadow that was staying where he had been instantly made the same move.","Boom!","The magic cannonball crashed down with a booming noise.","After throwing out his shurikens, he retreated immediately and dodged the third shot from the turret!","Both opponents were highly tense. Soon, Yu Yin reacted and used Mimic. The Distortion that was as fast as teleportation helped her dodge one attack of his shurikens.","However, her opponent threw the other shuriken at the Deceiver’s landing position as if he had anticipated her next move!","“Hiss-!”","“He anticipated it?!”","“So strong!”","At this moment, both people’s HPs were low, and they ran out of health potion too.","The braver warrior would triumph in a fierce battle. This was the moment to end the battle!","“Fight it out!” As long as her sigil locked onto her opponent, the latter couldn’t escape from her!","It would also seal the opponent’s strength for a little while!","Together with Ethereal Chain, she would undoubtedly kill her opponent!","She launched two magic lights instantly.","However, she saw that her opponent, Zed, vanished!","Death Mark!","Yu Yin found at this horrifying killer seemed to have snuck into her shadow and moved with her like a shadow; she couldn’t get rid of it!","“My goodness!” The disciples standing behind her stared at the scene in a daze. “So strong!”","“Don’t panic!” As the eldest disciple, Yu Yin calmed down immediately. “My Distortion can instantly return me to the previous position; he can’t catch up with me!”","Swoosh! Swoosh!","“Hu...” The moment that she heaved a sigh of relief, she heard a gust with sharp whistling sound coming toward her face","“Careful!”","“He’s still here!”","“Ah-!” While controlling the Deceiver, Yu Yin was startled and then raced toward her base.","“Run!”","Boom!","Zed finally realized that something wasn’t right and immediately retreated.","Boom!","The turret killed the player ‘Saber King’.","The Deceiver had fallen to the ground in her panic. In embarrassment, Yu Yin controlled the Deceiver to get up from the ground. “It’s over finally.”","“You won?!” Applause came from behind her.","“It seems like Senior Sister is stronger after all!”","...","“No! He has help!” At this moment, a glint flashed in the eyes of the elder who was watching from behind.","Suddenly, a figure appeared in a corner!","“Be careful.”","“Elder, don’t worry. I still have Flash!” Yu Yin became tense again. “I can dodge his attack the moment he uses it!”","“Good! You’re well-prepared and can keep calm in the face of danger!”","The opponent was a blind monk whose eyes were covered.","Not able to see, he intuitively kicked at the foot of the wall – Sonic Wave!","A white light wave instantly shot out!","“Flash!” Almost at the same time, Yu Yin used Flash and crashed toward the Sonic Wave that was shooting out from the corner of the wall!","[Prompt: Player ‘Asura’ slain ‘Elder Senior Sister Yu Yin’.]","“???”","“????”","“?????”"]},{"number":785,"title":"Chapter 785 - Take the Ancestral Master to Origins Internet Club!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Due to some reasons in the early years, the East Continent didn’t have as many people and wasn’t as vast of a land as the West Continent, but it was still very big.","Masters from different places gathered in the major factions in the grand blessed cave abodes and famous mountains. As for the average mortals and warriors, they lived in human nations under the rules of big families.","There were also spirits and wild mountain beast demons who lived in the hidden blessed cave abodes.","These factions had deep roots in this land and knew everything happening on this continent.","– In the Xiaoyao Cave Abode –","If the Dongxuan Cave Abode was only a city-like gathering place for cultivators, then the Xiaoyao Cave Abode was absolutely a cultivator nation inside a small world.","Under the leadership of the Abode Master, Lingxu Zi, it had prospered.","“This Heavenly Faction...?” In the Xiaoyao Cave Abode, the spiritual essence gathered like a vortex in the deep and tranquil spiritual mountain that was covered in all kinds of blooming spiritual flowers, and a grand palace hovered in the air in the support of an invisible force. It looked like an immortal abode.","A few ethereal-looking Daoists gathered here.","“Have you found out the information about the so-called Origin Internet Immortal Palace?” In the center sat a Daoist appearing to be in his thirties. Wearing a pale purple Daoist robe and a grand silver dragon headpiece, he looked very elegant.","Although the others had white hair and ancient faces, this purple-robed Daoist emitted a presence that made others sure of his identity; he was the core figure in this group.","“What’s this Heavenly Faction up to anyway?” an old man sitting beside him said in bafflement, “Usually, even if a supreme master built a so-called internet immortal palace named Origins which offers better cultivation results than cultivation rooms, cultivation towers, or some internal mystical realms of factions...”","“How come even their Grand Elder Zhuge Qingyun came out of seclusion?! He even led their elders and disciples to that place in person?”","Even if it is a cultivation mystical realm built by a supreme master, it is still a cultivation mystical realm!","It is used to train disciples! We’ve also sent some disciples to try the mystical realm as well, but...","You’re a peak Ascendance Realm master, which is the top level for cultivators. Why are you going there and cultivating in this mystical realm?","“Even if he becomes the No.1 Master in the world, can he really ascend and become a god?” another old man said in disbelief with widened-eyes and a bristling beard.","At this moment, a middle-aged man walked up in a hurry. “Abode Master! Elders.”","After greeting them, this man said in a low voice, “Our disciples found the key information by accident. Grand Elder Zhuge Qingyun and other elders of the Heavenly Faction are cultivating in a mystical realm named League of Legends in order to become... god-like!”","“What?!” The elder who had been talking froze for a second before saying, “You... say it again!?”","“Become... god-like,” the middle-aged cultivator repeated.","“Ridiculous! The Heavenly Faction has always kept their secrets well. How come you got this information? This critical information!”","“This ...?”","...","– At this moment, in the new shop at the East Continent –","“Elder...” Faction Master Feng Xuehe asked in a low voice, “This is a big issue; shouldn’t we keep it a secret?”","“Xuehe...” Grand Elder Zhuge Qingyun stroked his long beard and said mildly, “First of all, Palace Master Fang has generously told us this method. Do you think he would like us to keep it a secret?”","“Second of all, have you understood the true meaning of the stories that Palace Master Fang told us?”","“Meaning...?” Faction Master Feng Xuehe looked at the Grand Elder curiously.","“No one is perfect.” The Grand Elder’s deep eyes looked out of the shop. “Each step we take improves our minds, physical bodies, cultivation strength, eye sharpness, and spirits... With continuous improvement and constant purification, we’ve come to the Ascendance Realm...”","“You mean...”","“The more imperfections we have, the more improbable that we can stand out from the many ultimate masters!” A glint flashed in Zhuge Qingyun’s eyes that had never been seen before.","“So...” Feng Xuehe concluded, “Only the god-like figures can do that! However, the god-like figure isn’t a title that we give to ourselves; they are people who stand out from countless ultimate masters! Just like Demon King Faker and the God-like UZI that Senior Fang mentioned.”","While saying that, Feng Xuehe felt uncomfortable and thought, How come these names are so strange?","“Right!”","“This...” Feng Xuehe was still uncertain. “Is it believable?”","“I’ve reached the pinnacle stage 1,000 years ago. I’ve diligently pursued this for almost 1,000 years.” A trace of indescribable loss appeared in Zhuge Qingyun’s turbid eyes. “Our ancestors had pursued this for countless years... Only the golden scroll left by the ancestral master records a clue, and it refers to that war long ago...”","“It would be better if we believe that it’s true...”","...","Meanwhile, in the Xiaoyao Cave Abode, Lingxu Zi solemnly stared at the middle-aged cultivator who had just delivered the information. “Li Wu, I know you’re always reliable. How did you acquire this information? Is it true?”","Lingxu Zi’s eyes slightly squinted, feeling uncertain for the first time in his life.","...","In the Xiaoyao Cave Abode, there was an ancient sacrificial shrine, and no one knew when it was built. It had the most concentrated spiritual essence and was very close to the place where Lingxu Zi and his companions were sitting.","The shrine was guarded by layers of arrays which had been left from the ancient times. These arrays were intact since they were maintained each year.","However, no one knew that this ancient and insignificant shrine had a huge ice palace under it.","There was a legend circulating in the Xiaoyao Cave Abode. Their Ancestral Master from the prehistoric time would return and lead them to true ascendance.","Of course, not many people truly believed it.","After all, it had been so long ago. Even peak Ascendance Realm masters would have turned to dust.","However, in the center of the huge ice palace under the shrine, there was an ice coffin completely sealed by 10,000-year-old ice.","Suddenly, a huge noise came from inside the ice coffin!","Even Lingxu Zi felt it distinctively.","Boom!","It was another huge shake!","“What’s happening?!” Lingxu Zi exchanged a look with others.","“It seems to come from underground...” one elder said fearfully.","Lingxu Zi said in a cold voice, “Come with me, and let’s have a look!”","Complicated arrays covered the space under the shrine. Like an underground palace, it extended to the depths of the underground.","In the depths was a huge palace.","“Open it!” Lingxu Zi said calmly.","The ancient palace’s gate which had been sealed for many years was opened.","In the center was a huge ice coffin.","“Ancestral Master!” an ancient voice said shakily, “The lid of the Ancestral Master’s coffin is moving!”","The moment he said it, the coffin lid broke open!","“Ah-!” They had never felt so uneasy and anxious before.","At this moment, a blue-robed white-haired young man who looked to be in his thirties floated up from the coffin.","Everyone, including the elders, was shaking violently.","Only Lingxu Zi’s expression looked a bit better.","After all, such an existence was like a myth for them!","At this moment, this mythical figure appeared before them alive!","“Good! Good! Good! After countless years, I’m surprised that you’ve come to this stage!”","At this moment, all the spiritual essence in the whole spiritual mountain seemed to come toward him. “Have you heard any information about gods or immortals?”","He calculated with his fingers and said, “It’s about time to come out...”","“Yes!” Lingxu Zi immediately remembered the previous conversation.","“Lead the way!” This young man’s eyes seemed to be devoid of any human emotions.","“But... but...”","“But what?!” The young man asked coldly, “I said, lead the way!”","“Yes!” Lingxu Zi gritted his teeth and yelled, “Take Ancestral Master to the Origins Internet Club!”"]},{"number":786,"title":"Chapter 786 - Ancestral Master, That’s Coke...","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Good! Good! Good!” The Xiaoyao Ancestral Master looked to be a young man who was about thirty years old. With his shoulder-length white hair and handsome face, he looked to be a figure walking out from a painting scroll at first glance.","Before him, the spiritual masters and elders trembled in fear.","The young man flew down lightly like a feather as if he was weightless.","The strange thing was that there had been no signs or phenomenon for such a big event.","Except for the spiritual essence that was gathering in the mountain, there wasn’t a special sign.","Everything was silent as if the signs had been suppressed purposefully.","“Don’t be surprised.” With his hands clasped behind his back, the Xiaoyao Ancestral Master walked forward silently, and it seemed like his feet didn’t really touch the ground.","If one looked at the ground carefully, one would see that each of his steps was only millimeters above the ground, and each step had the same distance from the ground.","However, not a particle of dust was disturbed when he walked on the ground.","It seemed like his movements didn’t disturb any particle in the air.","Almost no one in the world could achieve such a control ability!","Behind him, Lingxu Zi and the elders were discussing in fear. “Why did the Ancestral Master come out so suddenly?”","“How come there was no sign at all?” It must be noted that such rare saint-like existences would cause natural phenomena when they made a sudden appearance.","“A while ago, we heard collective singing from auspicious beasts and smelled rare scents all over the mountains... I told you that something huge would happen in our cave abode, but then it coincided with Palace Master Fang’s appearance in our Continent of Immortal Village.”","While slapping his thigh, Lingxu Zi suddenly understood it. “We thought that the signs are for the arrival of Palace Master Fang who is like a sage!”","But it turned out that we were wrong!","“Maybe the signs are for both of them...” another elder said, “Otherwise, the Ancestral Master wouldn’t have come out so suddenly...”","He glanced at the great palace behind him and said in fear, “The Ancestral Master came out from there just to visit Origins Internet Club!”","“Are you sure that... we can find clues in the so-called Origins Internet Club?” Xiaoyao Ancestral Master looked back at them.","“We’re sure!”","“We’re very sure!”","The elders yelled.","The middle-aged man named Li Wu said as if he was asking for a compliment, “Ancestral Master, I heard it with my own ears.”","“The Grand Elder and all the others in Heavenly Faction are determined to have at least have one of them become a god-like figure!”","“Hehe... Hahahaha! A bunch of little guys in the new generations. How can they do that?” The Xiaoyao Ancestral Master said with a sneer, “Listen up!”","While pausing his steps, he said overbearingly as if he was looking down on the whole world, “Even at the time when our cave abode was just established, those few most powerful masters in the world didn’t dare to say this in front of me.”","“God-like figure?”","“Only the most powerful people can rule the world!”","“Ancestral Master, you’re right!” Lingxu Zi said solemnly, “Only the true masters in the world deserve to make that step. If everyone could do it, what is the worth of the title ‘god-like figure’?”","...","Soon, they came to the door of the internet café.","“Origins?” Xiaoyao Ancestral Master shook his head and stepped into the shop.","“Attendant!” Upon entering the shop, Li Wu yelled, “Attendant! I’ll buy...”","He looked back and counted, “One, two, three...eight, nine, ten...","“Get us ten membership cards and ten bottles of Coke!” After saying that, he tossed a bag of top-quality jade crystals, the equivalent of magic crystals in value, onto the counter.","“Okay!” Having managed a new shop before, Li Xin’er had become Mr. Fang’s special new shop manager. Besides, Li Lanruo, who had come over as an exchange student with Jiang Xiaoyue, often helped out in the shop.","“Hua-! Who’s he? He looks so grand!” Before she issued the cards, Li Lanruo looked up and saw a young man dressed in an antique blue robe walking over. With shoulder-length white hair, he had an ancient presence.","“He has a great background,” Li Wu said proudly, “All you need to know is that he has a very high and noble status; he will be a god-like figure in the future!”","“Well done!” While slightly squinting his eyes, Xiaoyao Ancestral Master carefully sensed and found...","I sensed the presence of that godly item from this little girl named Li Lanruo... Even though it’s very vague. His lips curved up. She must have had some contact with that godly item, or something on her once came in contact with it... Even though it is well hidden, the little tricks of juniors in the new generations can’t escape my eyes!","At this moment, Li Wu handed the membership cards to everyone and turned on League of Legends. “Please take a look.”","He lowered his voice slightly and said, “If you want to become a god-like figure, you must do it through this mystical realm in the shop.”","“Mystical realm?” Xiaoyao Ancestral Master thought for a moment and remembered that back in his time, there were ancient and mysterious scrolls containing unimaginable opportunities and fortunes.","Right... this is it! In his mind, everything connected, creating a ripple in his heart that had been as calm as an ancient well.","I’m surprised that I, Xiaoyao Ancestral Master, am the first one to find it! He had only seen a little but could make more connections in his mind. According to his treasure-hunting and cultivation experience before he established the cave abode...","This girl must have the key which can open this mystical realm. In this mystical realm, I can find the location of that godly item!","Pinnacle stage of Ascendance Realm... Then, Xiaoyao Ancestral Master coldly glanced at Grand Elder Zhuge Qingyun who was sitting not far from him. I’m surprised that after so many years, there’s such a powerful master among the new generations.","“Are you here for that path too?” He said coldly, “I will not lose to you, a bunch of little guys in the new generations.”","Grand Elder Zhuge Qingyun seemed to sense something as well. He looked over and said with a mild smile, “You’re a senior, but on this issue, we must see who has the ability do it without backing away.”","“Humph!” With a snort, Xiaoyao Ancestral Master sat before a computer and turned on League of Legends. Then, he opened the cap of the Coke bottle and sipped it gracefully.","Then, he stared at the Coke bottle so intently that his eyeballs almost popped out. After that, he took a big swig.","“Ahh! Good liquor!” He wiped off the residue on his lips and said heartily, “Hahaha! What liquor is this? It feels strong in the mouth and stings like a hot knife in the throat. The color looks like that of Immortal Grape Nectar but has a deeper tint and a richer taste. I’m surprised that there’s such great liquor in the new generations... I haven’t tasted such good liquor for a long time!”","“It’s really good liquor!” Abode Master Lingxu Zi also lifted a bottle of Coke and said in a loud voice, “With this great liquor, I’ll propose a toast to Ancestral Master for his return!”","“To show my respect, I’ll empty it first!” Then, he gulped down the whole bottle.","“A great drinker! A great drinker indeed!”","“Ancestral Master, that’s Coke...”"]},{"number":787,"title":"Chapter 787 - Newbies Are All Monsters","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","In the new shop at the East Continent, every cultivator from the Xiaoyao Cave Abode had a bottle of Coke in their hands.","“Coke?” Xiaoyao Ancestral Master said coldly with the empty Coke bottle in his hand. “This liquor’s name is Coke?”","“It’s not a liquor...” Li Wu immediately explained on the side, “This... this is Coke!”","“It’s not a liquor... it’s Coke?” The cultivators from the Xiaoyao Cave Abode looked at the bottles in their hands curiously. “Then, what is Coke?!”","“Coke is...” Li Wu waved his fingers and thought for a moment. “Um... Coke is... is... Burp!”","“It’s...?” Lingxu Zi and other elders looked at the disciple in puzzlement. “It’s...? Burp?!”","“???” Xiaoyao Ancestral Master looked at Lingxu Zi in bafflement. “Burp?!”","“???” Nonplussed, the elders from the Xiaoyao Cave Abode looked at their Ancestral Master and then...","“Burp!””Burp!””Burp!””Burp~””Burp!”","“Burp!””Burp!””Burp!””Burp~””Burp!”","“Burp!””Burp!””Burp!””Burp~””Burp!”","Horrified, the other customers in the shop stared at the new players who kept burping. “...”","...","“Hu...”","“No... I just couldn’t control myself!” After a long while, Lingxu Zi finally regained his breath.","The few elders also exhaled deeply.","Then, they stared at Li Wu and asked, “What’s wrong with this Coke?!”","“This...” Li Wu had sweat on his forehead. “This... you didn’t drink it right!”","You drained one big bottle in one breath. Of course, you’d burp!","“Is there a special way to drink this Coke?” One elder glared at him and said, “When I drink liquor on the regular, I don’t need a special method to drink it!”","“The common liquor doesn’t need a special method,” Xiaoyao Ancestral Master said, “However, when I drank the Immortal Grape Nectar, I did it in a complicated method. Of course, this Coke has to be drunk in a special way!”","The Xiaoyao Ancestral Master instantly got interested. “Then, tell me how to drink this Coke.”","Li Wu took a straw from the counter and inserted it into the Coke bottle. Then, he sipped it with an intoxicated expression, looking as happy as an immortal.","Li Wu praised exuberantly, “This is the right way to drink Coke.”","Then, he sipped again through the straw and said, “Some people... drinking directly from the bottle... it’s...”","“It’s almost as rude as cows chewing on peonies!”","“I think this beverage shouldn’t be called Coke,” one elder said eagerly, “This should be called Immortal Happy Nectar!”","“Good name!”","“From now on, we’ll call it Immortal Happy Nectar!”","...","Seeing Li Wu sip Coke through the straw, the newcomers understood that they couldn’t drink too much in one sitting and reluctantly turned their eyes from Li Wu’s Coke.","Feeling uneasy under their stares, Li Wu said in a hurry, “Elders, Ancestral Master, there are several other kinds of... Happy Nectars in the shop.”","“There are more?!” They immediately looked at him.","“What Happy Nectars?!”","“...”","One minute later, they each had a bottle of Happy Nectar on their desks and finally started the journey in League of Legends.","“What’s the situation in this mystical realm? Are there any dangers?” The Xiaoyao Ancestral Master asked, “From the few words that I’ve heard about it, I think this mystical realm is very dangerous since we’ll have to put all our spiritual awareness into it!”","Lingxu Zi said, “Li Wu, hurry up and explain the mystical realm to Ancestral Master.”","“Ancestral Master, don’t worry!” Li Wu patted his chest and assured Xiaoyao Ancestral Master, “I’ll first invite Ancestral Master and the elders into my lobby.”","Soon, Lingxu Zi and the elders from Xiaoyao Cave Abode all accepted Li Wu’s invitation and entered his summoner’s lobby.","Li Wu said, “When we fight, the five of us won’t be separated.”","“There’s such a method?” Xiaoyao Ancestral Master laughed and said, “Well done. You’ve already understood the rules of this mystical realm. Does it have a name?”","“This is called Sitting Five in a Row in the Internet Café!” Li Wu explained.","“Good name! Sitting Five in a Row in the Internet Café!” Xiaoyao Ancestral Master sipped the Happy Nectar cheerfully and started the journey of Sitting Five in a Row in the Internet Café.","Since they skipped the tutorial, Xiaoyao Ancestral Master obviously knew nothing about the game, and so did Lingxu Zi and others.","“How do I choose from these options?”","“That’s easy!” Li Wu said, “Ancestral Master, you choose the... Deathsinger. This is awesome!”","“And this... Cryophoenix.”","Then, he explained some basic operations to them.","“Deathsinger?” Xiaoyao Ancestral Master looked this champion in bafflement.","“Karthus is a harbinger of oblivion, zealously devoted to the beauty and clarity of death... Yearning to be one with death, he journeyed to the Shadow Isles and willingly offered himself to the undead. Karthus transformed into the Deathsinger, the only horrifying lich in the world to deliver the blessed gift of annihilation...”","“He’s so powerful? Then, I’ll choose him...”","“Also, these so-called summoner’s abilities...?”","“Teleport! Revive,” Li Wu said, “I saw others use them. This Deathsinger can revive after death. When he has these on, he’s unrivaled!”","[TL Note: This is the old league, so some skills have been reworked.]","“He can revive? And there’s a summoner’s spell to revive?” Xiaoyao Ancestral Master imagined the scene in which the champion was killed and then revived, was killed again and revived again...","His lips curved up. “This is awesome!”","Then, he looked a bit worried. “If this champion is so powerful, isn’t it... unfair to others?”","“It means that no one can defeat me?”","“How about my champion?” Lingxu Zi pointed at his Cryophoenix and asked.","“Such an auspicious bird has great abilities, right?”","“Rebirth!” Li Wu introduced, “This Cryophoenix is very powerful with the ability of rebirth of a phoenix. It can revive after being killed!”","“Do I also have...” Hearing the champion that he chose was also so powerful, Lingxu Zi asked with some excitement, “Can I also bring Teleport and Revive?”","“Or course,” Li Wu said.","“Hahahaha! Good!”","“Then, we want Teleport and Revive as well!” The other elders said immediately.","“This... can be done,” Li Wu said after a moment of consideration.","“Very good!” Lingxu Zi said, “We made the right decision by sending you here to gather information. You prove to be a person with great potential!”","They imagined the scene in which the enemies took great efforts to kill them in battle, but they stood up again. Even if they were killed again, the five of them would revive together and teleport back to the battleground...","Just thinking of such a battle method gave them great excitement!","Three.","Two.","One.","The game began!"]},{"number":788,"title":"Chapter 788 - Secret Technique! Feeding Double Kill!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Well... very good!” Thinking that they had made a good plan to defeat their enemies before they even entered the game, the Xiaoyao Ancestral Master felt very satisfied with the wits of the disciples in the new generations and sipped some more of his Happy Nectar. “People of great achievements are always well-prepared with strategies before making a move.","My Xiaoyao Cave Abode mostly needs people who have an agile mind and can do things with good plans. Lingxu Zi nodded again and said, “Very good.”","At this moment, the game already started.","The projected images of the ten champions from both sides had been teleported to the spawn points.","Although they hadn’t been through the tutorial, with Li Wu’s reminders and explanations, they could handle the basic operations.","Under the summon, the Xiaoyao Ancestral Master controlled the projected image of the Deathsinger. Instantly, he felt like a pair of cold and horrifying eyes were staring at him from behind this projected image.","The being that this pair of eyes belonged to seemed to have the ability to control people’s life and death.","Almost instantly, the fine hair on Xiaoyao Ancestral Master’s body stood on end.","This was the first time that he sensed danger since he woke up!","Even though they were separated by endless space and time, and he knew that they were in different worlds, Xiaoyao Ancestral Master still felt alarmed.","“We must control the projected images of such existences to battle?” With slightly squinted eyes, he was even more convinced despite his little knowledge of this strange ‘mystical realm’.","This is it... Anyone who can build such a grand mystical realm must be related to that godly item in some way.","...","As mentioned before, since the champions were summoned to this rift in the form of projected images, the items that the players bought were in a form similar to projected images to fit with the champions.","Therefore, even if they bought many weapons such as an Infinity Edge, Statikk Shiv, or Last Whisper, the champions could carry them all.","At this moment, every player had bought enough health potions and mana potions. Then...","Li Wu said, “We won’t use the offensive strategy of advancing in three lanes as taught in the tutorial. According to my experience in many matches, I think we can have a better starting position.”","“Really?” Lingxu Zi looked at him meaningfully.","“Yes!” Li Wu said, “The five of us are like five chopsticks. If we fight separately, each of us will be broken easily. But if we advance on one lane and fight together... we can also teleport and revive...”","“The tutorial teaches such a mistaken method?” Lingxu Zi said, “Then, we don’t have to follow it. Li Wu’s right. If the five of us stick together, we won’t be broken easily. We’ll work together and take the giant nexus in the center of their base!”","The Xiaoyao Ancestral Master said, “Since you’ve got a plan, let’s do it accordingly.”","Soon, the five of them appeared in the mid lane as if they owned it.","They were the Rogue Mage, the Cryophoenix, the Deathsinger, the Magus Ascendant, and the Chronokeeper – mage-type champions.","– At this moment, in the new shop at Canglan City –","A dog-headed man controlled the Curator of the Sands and sent it to the outer turret in the mid lane with a vocal command.","On the magic letter for the livestream, the audience complained, [Embarrassing. Are you going to stream Dark Sword or not?]","[You suck in League of Legends too. How many matches have you lost now?]","They saw Mr. Dog-Head who hadn’t activated virtual reality mode cheerfully taking a bite from the fried chicken bites, the most popular take-out food from Wind and Moon Pavilion in Jiuhua City and sipping the Happy Nectar.","Suddenly, he saw something on his screen.","Five fierce men aggressively walked toward the Curator of the Sands under the turret. Startled, he almost dropped his fried chicken bites!","“What’s happening?”","“So many people?!”","He immediately returned to the game, and the viewers saw the dog-headed man in the game hugging the turret while trembling.","“Hahahaha!” Lingxu Zi laughed and said, “Do you see that?”","Before he could finish, he saw the dog-headed man testing the water at the edge and casting E, Spirit Fire, at them.","It was unbearable!","“Outrageous! It’s outrageous!” Lingxu Zi controlled the Cryophoenix to move. With a clear chirp, an ice ball full of magic energy that could freeze the air around it crashed toward the Curator of the Sands like a ghost.","Meanwhile, the Xiaoyao Ancestral Master controlled the Deathsinger to cast Q, Lay Waste, which exploded at his opponent’s feet.","The other champions also used their spells. Instantly, blue and red magic lights flew in arcs and exploded.","Under their attacks, the dog-headed man jumped frantically under the turret.","Obviously, he had been hit many times.","Soon, his HP decreased quickly.","At this moment, the minions had killed the enemy minions and charged forward.","The Xiaoyao Ancestral Master had glints in his eyes. “Since we outnumber our enemy, why don’t we take his head under the turret?”","“Good!” Lingxu Zi agreed cheerfully. “We’ll show him the temperament of masters! He will know what price he must pay for acting recklessly before the five of us!”","“Then, I’ll lead the way!” Li Wu yelled and controlled the Rogue Mage to charge up.","Everyone else followed closely!","People who were watching saw five fierce men chasing after the dog-headed man to the turret.","“Arcanopulse!”","“Flash Frost!”","“Lay Waste!”","The dog-headed man raced frantically under the turret while brandishing his staff wildly, tossing out the skill with his eyes closed. “Rua! Rua! Spirit Fire-!”","“First Blood!”","“Double Kill!” The Xiaoyao Ancestral Master glanced at his stats. Sure enough, he could still cast spells even though he was dead.","“Stay calm! He is dying!”","Then, he cast Lay Waste one after another.","“Ah! Ahh-! Wither!” With tears on his face, the dog-headed man brandished his staff and gulped down health potions.","“Triple Kill!”","“Ahh-! Heal!”","“Quadra Kill”","“Penta Kill!!”","“Hu... Hu...” The dog-headed man lay on the ground and panted heavily. He wasn’t killed yet but was dying of fatigue. If he was in the original game, he would probably only have a few HP left.","At this moment, he saw a scene as horrifying and scary as a nightmare!","Light beams fell from the space above the minions charging in the front – those dead figures were teleported here again!","Five figures stood before the dog-headed man magnificently!","“Hahahaha!” Lingxu Zi laughed and said, “Surprise!”","“Ah-!” The dog-headed man was scared witless. How come there are still so many people!?","Are these people cheating?!","With a wild roar, he raced toward the inner turret.","“Go get him!”","“Don’t run!”","“My goodness! My goodness! Spirit Fire! Ahh-!” The dog-headed man fell to the ground.","-Meanwhile-","“Double Kill!”","“Triple Kill!”","“Hahaha!” Lingxu Zi and the Xiaoyao Ancestral Master were the only two remaining standing on the battleground.","“I think that dog-headed man... is scared witless!”","“Yeah-! He could never guess that it’s useless to kill us. We can revive on the spot!” Victorious, Lingxu Zi exited from the virtual reality mode and sipped his newly-purchased Happy Nectar (Red Tea) before entering the game again. “Now, we’ll fight all the way to their base. I’ll see who dares to block us!”","“Right! Die, revive; die again and revive again to be teleported back...” Xiaoyao Ancestral Master laughed and said, “I think no one has ever seen such a horrifying tactic!”","...","On the other side, the dog-headed man suddenly widened his eyes in horror. “Damn! How come I got so much gold!!??”"]},{"number":789,"title":"Chapter 789 - Power as High as a Great Mountain! Is This...a God-Like Figure?!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“How come I got so much gold? And I leveled up!” The dog-headed man’s dark eyes stared at the shop. “I think I can buy many items! My goodness!”","In the system version of League of Legends, there were also divisions of levels. Each level up would help the projected images of champion obtain more power from the real champion.","While he increased the level of his abilities, he browsed the items in the shop with widened-eyes, feeling a little dizzy.","“Frozen Heart... Increases armor...? I need to increase my defense... maybe I’ll buy this?”","Spirit Visage... increases magic resist... I think magic resist is better... the dog-headed man thought for a moment and remembered that his opponents had kept attacking him with magic spells.","But... is there anything that can both increase my defense and offense? With focused attention, he began to look for items in the shop.","After a short while, the elders from the Xiaoyao Cave Abode had revived one by one and came out.","– Outside the turret in the mid lane –","The five of them stood in one row with the Xiaoyao Ancestral Master in the middle controlling the Deathsinger.","“How come... it’s still not here?” They looked at the forest behind the turret.","“He must be afraid!” The old Daoist controlling the Chronokeeper sneered and said, “Seeing us revive again and again, how can he not be frightened?!”","“Then, should we...” another old Daoist said, “Destroy this turret?”","“It hit me hard and caused a mess!”","“It deserves to be demolished!” the old Daoist controlling the Chronokeeper said with a laugh, “After we demolish these turrets, they will be doomed!”","“Let the minions charge forward first!” After some discussion, they began to push the turret.","But they found that their magic power could only afflict very little damage to these constructions. Since the turret couldn’t dodge, the attacks were very casual. So...","“Have you felt that...?” The Chronokeeper said.","“Felt what?”‘ The Rogue Mage on the side asked in bafflement.","“The spells that these champions use! They are activated, controlled and cast by us through the projected images!” The Cryophoenix said in a loud voice, “I can even feel how it is controlling the ice.”","“Yes!” The Chronokeeper also said, “I can even distinctly feel how he changes the speed of time with the spells... I can even sense how he uses his future spells and mana in the present...”","“I can feel that even though the projected image has only a tiny part of his power, it can do many things unimaginable for average people!”","“You mean...” Xiaoyao Ancestral Master said, “We can learn and mimic these dharma spells?”","“There is more than that,” the elder said, “I think... since we can feel the casting process in person; it’s more effective than learning the pithy formulas from great masters!”","Lingxu Zi looked at the Cryophoenix on his screen. This creature appeared as permanent as ice and could manipulate extremely chilly ice and snow.","Even if he didn’t learn the spells that this creature controlled, he could obtain lots of inspirations in areas such as energy circulation, control of details, and understanding spells.","“Oh...” The old Daoists exchanged a look and stomped their feet while exclaiming, “Shame! What a shame! We lost!”","“We allowed the Heavenly Faction to learn this before us!”","The group of old men looked relaxed while they chatted and attacked the turret. At this moment, a dog-headed man in golden armor strode up heroically from the distance in the mid lane.","“Hey!?” The old men instantly stared at him, “The dog-headed man dares to return?!”","“He has little respect for us!”","“Now, I’ve mastered three spells of this phoenix!” Lingxu Zi said chillingly, “Don’t worry. If he dares to come up, I’ll give him a good lesson!”","“It seems like this man has forgotten the lesson that we taught!” another elder said with a sneer, “We must give him another lesson!”","At this moment, the turret still had half of its HP left after being attacked for a long while.","Giving up on attacking the turret, they walked toward the reckless dog-headed man with fierceness.","Level 3 was enough for him to master all of the Rogue Mage’s spells, other than his ultimate ability (old version).","The elder controlling Ryze, the Rogue Mage, had blue lightning and violent rune energy jumping in his palms, illuminating his tall blue-skinned body. He looked like a master mage who was controlling lightning and thunder.","On the other side, the majestic and tall Cryophoenix spread out its huge wings with the force of a winter storm, almost blocking all the exit routes of the dog-headed man.","In fact, it was what it did. An ice wall rose from the ground, cutting off the dog-headed man’s exit almost instantly!","“Rua! How come there’s such a spell!?” The dog-headed man became frantic!","On the other side, Ryze shot out an energy sphere that looked like a cannon ball, and it shot toward the head of the dog-headed man.","“You?! You still dare to come?!”","“You?! You still...” Before he could release the third spell, the dog-headed man seemed to have an accelerator with him and moved so fast that he left a blurry shadow behind him when he struck forward with his staff.","“Ya-! Haya-!” He brandished the staff wildly.","“Spirit Fire (E)! Wither (W)! Siphoning Strike (Q)!”","The turret also attacked!","“Erhaa-!”","“Pu-!”","A scream sounded.","“Double Kill!”","“???” The Xiaoyao Ancestral Master and other elders behind him immediately stopped.","The elders from the Xiaoyao Cave Abode opened their mouths in fear; their tongues almost sprung out.","“Hurry! Attack now!”","But this dog-headed man moved like a gust of wind and dodged most of the spells. Then, he smashed down the staff again.","“Ah–!” The elder who was playing as the Chronokeeper was knocked down.","“What-?!”","At this moment, the remaining two players felt like the dog-headed man before them...","“It’s not a dog-headed man!” the remaining elder said in horror.","“He faked being weak and hid his strength! We got tricked!” the elder yelled.","“Run...! Quickly Run!” This man looked like a majestic god, the horrifying death god from a distant desert nation!","“How come he runs so fast?!” Obviously, the dog-headed man was much faster than these five people and quickly caught up with them.","“Ahh–!”","“Triple Kill!”","“Quadra Kill!”","The elder playing as the Chronokeeper who had been knocked down slowly raised his head and got up from the ground. While looking at his companions who were already far away, he gasped in confusion. “Hiss-!?”","“Ohyoo... Run! Run!”","Hehehehe...","...","“Was that a god-like figure...?” After returning to their spawn spot, they exchanged a look of deep horror.","“This is... the god-like figure whom they talked about?!”","“His power is as high as a great mountain!”","“It’s... unthinkable! It’s... unrivaled!”","“People enter this mystical realm to become such horrifying existences...?!”","The elders exchanged a look and saw the firm determination in each other’s eyes. We’ll also become such great existences!","...","“Hu...” In the Canglan City Shop, the dog-headed man wiped cold sweat off his forehead and ate a fried chicken bite with great enjoyment.","He glanced at his match history for today – defeat, defeat, defeat, defeat... victory."]},{"number":790,"title":"Chapter 790","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","...","– One day later –","“What’s the damn Sitting Five in a Row in the Internet Café?! We didn’t have a single victory!” Having been defeated all day long, the Xiaoyao Ancestral Master slammed his hand on the desk and stood up.","“You...” He glared at Li Wu in anger. “We were wrong from the first match!”","“When the five of us charged at the turret to kill the dog-headed man, where was your crowd control?! Why didn’t you stun him?!”","Since he had skipped the tutorial for the new players, he didn’t know what class of champions offered crowd control. But after one day of playing, he had obtained lots of knowledge.","“I...?!” Li Wu’s face turned red, and he took a moment to organize his words before saying, “We have five people! I thought that if I went up alone, he wouldn’t run. I could injury him with spells and lower his HP. When he sees you guys coming up and decides to run... I would cast Rune Prison to freeze him!","“In short, I wanted to lure him to us and then freeze him when he tried to run!”","Li Wu stomped his foot and lamented, “But he didn’t run at all!”","How could I know that this player is so tough?! He dares to charge at five champions after seeing all five of us!","“Did he know how powerful we were when we joined hands?!” Li Wu commented, “Reckless! He’s purely a reckless player!”","Th eXiaoyao Ancestral Master froze. “You seem to have a point...”","Then, he glared at the elder playing as the Chronokeeper. “Where were your time spells? They were supposed to slow him down, right?!”","“I cast the spells... I cast Time Warp on Li Wu to increase his speed!” the elder said, “Otherwise, Li Wu’s Ryze wouldn’t be able to get there before us... If he couldn’t get there before us, how could he carry out the plan...”","As a skill, Time Warp could both grant bonus movement speed to allies and slow down enemies.","“...?” Xiaoyao Ancestral Master thought for a moment and found that the latter had a point too.","These two people’s thoughts... although they were still new players, their heads were full of these textbook-like fancy plays. One couldn’t really find fault with them.","The Xiaoyao Ancestral Master turned his furious eyes toward Lingxu Zi who controlled the Cryophoenix.","“As an Ascendance Realm master, how could your key spells miss the target?!” After all, when the Flash Frost of the Cryophoenix exploded, it could stun all the enemies in an area!","But you missed the target...??","“??... I don’t know why my spells missed!”","Strange... how could the dog-headed man dodged my spells...?","– Meanwhile, in the new shop at Canglan City –","“My goodness! Dark Souls?”","“Dark Sword is on livestream?!”","On the dog-headed man’s screen was a huge and horrifyingly distorted demon covered in chaotic flames. Its huge ax hacked down viciously like a shooting star engulfed in blazing flames!","Almost at the same time, the character on the screen seemed to anticipate the move and shifted before his opponent made the move. He dodged this strike narrowly with millimeters to spare!","He wiped off cold sweat and gasped, “Hu... It was a close one...”","...","By now, Mr. Fang’s shop had obviously expanded to a quite large scale.","There were all kinds of players in his shops. For example, while League of Legends attracted many new players, some were still suffering in Dark Souls.","Some players played other games such as Dungeon Fighters Online and World of Warcraft, etc.","So was the situation with the newly released TV Series, the Turbulent Homeland.","Even the elders and disciples from the Heavenly Faction in the new shop on the East Continent would watch the new TV Series whenever new episodes came out.","“My goodness...”","“Has the Turbulent Homeland released new episodes?!”","“The livestream of Turbulent Homeland on the big screen will be updated tonight too!”","In the past, the big screens only showed half of the episodes released each week. Only the paying customers could watch all the episodes.","However, beginning from Turbulent Homeland, the TV Series shown on the big screens had the same progress as the content behind the paywall. The only difference was that... viewers watching the big screens couldn’t obtain the benefits that they could have by watching in the virtual reality mode. It was almost the same as watching from the TV before Fang Qi traveled through space and time.","As mentioned before, the audience had seen Dongying Region’s 10,000 battleships setting off together to invade the Central Region in the previous glance. By now, the grand main force from the Dongying Region had crossed the vast ocean. The Central Region was in a gloomy state before the great storm.","As the war turned fiercer, it now came to the white-hot climax moment.","At this moment, Elder Xiao Yunhe and Elder Dugu Xiao lounged in their chairs before the computers and drank Immortal Happy Nectar with great enjoyment, and Elder Senior Sister Yu Yin, other disciples, and even the elves and knights in the Canglan City Shop were all doing the same. They all turned on today’s new episodes of the Turbulent Homeland.","In the scene before them were eight huge mountain peaks emerging in the clouds; they looked as tall as the pillars supporting the sky and the human world!","Like the most majestic and tallest mountain peaks in the world, they were amazing miracle-like grand peaks. They were the legendary Eight Mountain Pillars.","In the ocean of surging clouds, the eight mountains seemed to stand proudly beyond the sky!","“Taller than 3,000 meters and standing as high as the sky, the Eight Mountain Pillars could be seen in the depths of the ethereal clouds. A martial arts duel that would decide the fate of the Central Region and Dongying Region will take place here!”","The No.1 Master of the Central Region was going to duel with the unrivaled myth-like figure of the Dongying Region! Would it be an unfulfilled heroic ambition or the end of the military god’s unrivaled legend?","“Wow-!?” Everyone stared at the screen with widened eyes. “Can we watch this today?!”","At the foot of the mountains were countless troops with flapping flags, but the greater number were top-level masters from the Central Region and Dongying Region.","At this moment, First Elder Hyru of the Elf Clan finally got some free time and arrived at the shop.","He saw several familiar faces such as the saint-level masters including St. Willy and St. Leidon; they were all watching something with concentration while wearing virtual reality headsets.","“What are you doing?” First Elder Hyru asked in bafflement.","They used to play games here, right? I’ve been absent for a while; how come you’re not playing games anymore?","“Oh. Move away!” St. Leidon said without turning his head. “I’m watching the... Wuxia TV Series!”","“Wuxia TV Series? I only heard of Xianxia... are the Wuxia TV Series good?”","Then, he saw an elf rogue who looked like Queen Kellybel, and she was also watching the TV Series intently while wearing a virtual reality headset.","He recognized her in one glance.","How come you’re watching it too?! To watch this Wuxia TV Series, you didn’t even return to the Elf Royal Palace?!","Elder Hyru sneaked a glance from behind. “The Turbulent Homeland... Episode 21st?”","Should I watch it too?","Immediately, he found a spot and sat down.","Among the surging clouds, the grand mountains shot up into the sky.","Suddenly, everyone saw a light appearing on the horizon!","It looked like a distant shooting star falling from the Ninth Heaven in the universe!","With it came a clear long roar similar to that of a dragon. The sound came before the person!","“The worldly affairs are like a chess match. The universe is mysterious and immeasurable, and even heroes could only laugh and accept their fate!”"]},{"number":791,"title":"Chapter 791 - Immortal Dream","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Then, a light beam that was 30,000 meters long fell on one of the sky pillars of the Eight Mountain Pillars. Like a meteorite, the blazing flames fell from the Ninth Heaven and exploded on the grand mountain peak, pushing away the clouds in the sky!","Meanwhile, another light beam fell from the sky! The purple light triggered thunder and expelled the clouds around the mountain peak in the high sky! The shock waves shot into the sky while the horrifying and unrivaled force instantly razed the whole peak to the ground!","The person who appeared was dressed in a purple robe. When he pulled down his white mask, a pair of furious eyebrows that were as sharp as blades appeared.","The chiseled face looked grand and arrogant. His slightly squinted eyes had a trace of tranquil and sadness in them. “The eight mountains are the pillars, and the one who falls down from the mountains will lose!”","On the mountain top across from him, Yi Yeshu looked solemn as he lifted one of his hands vertically. “The sky and the land are my witnesses; I’ll have no regrets regardless if I die or survive.”","Looking down from the top of the 30,000-meter-tall cliff of the mountain, one could see a vast ocean of clouds.","With their cultivation strength extremely close to the godly realm, they knew each other like their own palms. When their hands collided, one of the eight mountains instantly sank for 300 meters! When they put more strength into their palm strikes, the mountain collapsed to the ground!","The huge mountain that seemed to be supporting the sky cracked open in the middle!","Then, it began to collapse continuously.","Instantly, it felt like the sky was falling while the land was sinking. As the whole mountain collapsed, debris, trees, and dust fell like a waterfall. In the waterfall of rocks, the two opponents continued to fight, using skills at a horrifyingly rapid frequency. The chaotic scene of the collapsing mountain was dizzying to the viewers, but for the two rivals, not a speck of dust could touch their robes.","While they fought, their fists and arms turned blurry, but they moved upward at a great speed against the falling debris!","Seeing this level of control, even Zhuge Qingyun, a pinnacle stage Ascendance Realm master, looked astonished.","Meanwhile, in the new shop at Canglan City, even the saint-level masters were dumbfounded.","This looked to be a power beyond mortals’ limit!","It was hard for them to imagine that a battle between humans could reach such a high level.","...","– Meanwhile –","Mr. Fang had watched this TV Series before, so he wasn’t as eager as the customers.","– In the Wind and Moon Pavilion –","While wearing a pair of big sunglasses, Mr. Fang chose a quiet spot by the window. “I’m starving after playing League of Legends for a whole day...”","“Sir... this is the unique fried chicken bites that our chef made by following your instruction...”","“It’s a rare delicacy when eating it with your iced red tea!”","After all, Mr. Fang was operating an internet café, not a food shop, so he only had breakfast in his shop and ate snacks as his lunch. However, it was evening now.","“What’s going on...? Is it because I played too many games lately...?” Mr. Fang shook his head, feeling like his eyelids were heavy and falling as if he was too fatigued to keep them open.","It seemed like an invisible force was pulling at him.","He seemed to have an extremely long dream. He hadn’t seen such a scene for a long time. It was a battleground that belonged to him.","Yes, a battleground.","Although it was only a virtual battleground, a group of people refused to live a peaceful life like the others. While others turned their focus to classic literature, these people were focused on heroic deeds and hearty revenge of the people in Jianghu. When their peers wrote exams for their future, these people were thrilled by the stories about the sword duel at the top of Hua Mountain and the rivalry between martial arts masters.","[TL Note: Jianghu is the community of martial artists in wuxia stories.]","The ‘fairy tales’ for that generation of people heated their blood.","It was why they were eager to battle on their own battlegrounds, regardless if the battleground was as they had expected or not.","Looking around, Fang Qi found that he was in a tournament arena, and a huge crowd was watching. Countless people stood up and cheered, and the chants rose like huge waves of a tsunami, getting stronger and stronger. On the stage where everyone was looking at, familiar and strange faces passed him while the audience cheered for them. Countless people from all over the world intently stared at the screens before them as if they were witnessing a great victory, and they watched as these people lifted the championship trophy.","When the flag of his country rose on the arena, for some reason, he had an indescribable thrill in his heart.","At that moment, something in the depths of his heart was stirred.","He was different from the people in this world.","It was glory... and it was also a chapter of his own dream.","...","However, they still had something in common.","“This Wuxia TV Series is awesome...” In the Jiuhua City Shop, Half City Shop, Yuanyang City Shop, Canglan City Shop, and the new shop in the East Continent, almost everyone was watching this duel with concentration.","Perhaps these Ascendance Realm and saint-level masters almost had the same level of strength as these figures in the TV Series, but they were deeply fascinated by the godly battle skills and concepts.","When Yi Yeshu fell into a disadvantage, he was able to react on the spot and deciphered the Dongying military god’s great techniques, including ‘Return to Nothing’ which could break every martial art move in the world and ‘Return to Root’ which could absorb every variation of every martial art in the world. The audience sighed in appreciation at his wisdom and determination during the battle and his meticulous control abilities.","When they tensed up, their hearts were in their throats. When they were thrilled, they wanted to shout out loud.","Perhaps the viewers were thrilled and envious since they were watching something that they lacked or had never considered before...","The Ascendance Realm and saint-level masters in the new shops in Canglan City and the East Continent were enthralled by the battle, and they were engrossed while watching it. It was a fascinating battle that they had never seen before!","“Are there any other TV Series or movies of the same genre?” In the Canglan City Shop, the elves who had just finished watching the newly released episodes almost jumped up in amazement.","Their excitement was evident on their faces and in their words, “When can we become such great masters...”","The masters and elders in the new shop at the East Continent felt unsatisfied and watched again.","Then, a group of people ran to the counter and asked, “Do you have other Wuxia TV Series or movies?”","“Yes. The Duel is in the same genre,” Li Lanruo explained.","“Let’s go and watch it...”","Perhaps they still didn’t understand the word ‘Xia’ (Brave and chivalrous people), but they seemed to understand the meaning of ‘Wu’ (martial arts).","In this context, strength perhaps wasn’t the most important factor.","It could be strength but also skills and represented a spirit!","It was a spirit to continuously breakthrough boundaries and thresholds.","...","– Meanwhile –","Fang Qi felt like he was slowly waking up, and he found that he wasn’t in the Wind and Moon Pavilion.","For some reason, he felt like he was no longer in the world he had been in.","He slowly looked up and saw that he was standing inside an extremely grand and spacious ancient immortal palace, and an ocean of surging clouds was outside the gate.","He clearly remembered that he had been eating dinner in the Wind and Moon Pavilion.","He shook his head with force and murmured, “Am I still in a dream...?”","“No need to look!” Fang Qi looked around and saw many blurry figures standing around him in the immortal palace. Then, a clear and cold voice that seemed to come from the Ninth Heaven sounded from the high and radiant golden main chair in the palace.","Instantly, Fang Qi had the feeling that this being was a true immortal and god!","“You can think that you’re in a dream, but don’t think that your body in the mortal world will be fine if you die here.”","“You violated the taboos, Mortal!”","“???” Mr. Fang scratched his head and thought, How can I, the owner of some internet cafes, violate taboos?","Just because I haven’t opened an internet café in your place?"]},{"number":792,"title":"Chapter 792 - The Powerful Enemy in the Dream... Immortal General Fei Peng!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Humans, of course, were not rulers of this world.","The gods living beyond the Ninth Heaven and watching the world with cold eyes were the rulers.","According to the legends, each of the gods was an ultimate existence, and they had a level of energy and spiritual power unimaginable to humans. In the legends, they were immortal existences that lived in the eternal void that was unreachable for humans.","Regardless if the legends were true, they were undoubtedly the most perfect life form that could overpower mortals in every aspect.","“Don’t try my patience, Mortal!” A cold female voice came from the vast Ninth Heaven. The thick and rich spiritual essence in the palace turned into a horrifying gust as if driven by the fury of this existence.","Fang Qi could only hear her voice but couldn’t see her. It felt like she was sitting above the thick clouds of the Ninth Heaven and looking down at him from an absolute lofty angle.","“Seeing your unrivaled talent, I decided to give you a warning. Don’t think that you can do whatever you want arrogantly since you are unrivaled in the mortal world. In our eyes, your most powerful tricks are just insignificant skills that we can use at any time.” While she spoke, an immortal light shot down from the high sky. In the blinding radiant light, a figure solidified and appeared out of the blue!","The dazzling light made people have a hard time opening their eyes. The horrifying force that was above the mortal world instantly swept across the whole palace!","More horrifying was that the omnipresent pressure that seemed to rule over everything in the world made Fang Qi feel like he was at the bottom of a deep ocean, and the horrifying pressure was coming at him from all directions. For an instant, he had a feeling that he would be compressed to dust in the next moment!","“You mortals listen up. I’m the Green Sky Immortal, the Heavenly Supervisor of the Innumerable Immortal Sea.”","“The sun and the moon rise and set, and the seasons changes. Everything in the world is in order, and no disturbances are allowed.”","“Your behavior in the mortal world is a great violation of these rules! If you don’t repent, you’ll bring destruction to yourself!” The voice was as chilly as ice and as grand as immortal lightning bolts above the Ninth Heaven, and it continued, “You are so arrogant as to say that you’d open a shop where the immortals and gods live. How outrageous you are!”","“I can’t open a shop here?” Mr. Fang looked baffled. “Then, what do you usually do? Do you have any entertainment?”","“Reckless!” With an angry reprimand and a wave of her purple sleeve, a purple lightning bolt struck down. The lightning bolt wasn’t thick. Instead, it was as thin as a hair. However, Fang Qi felt a sense of death from all directions when the purple lightning bolt crashed down.","He even felt that if he blocked it with his own strength, and the attacker didn’t intend to go easy on him, his body and soul would be destroyed by this strike!","In the blink of an eye, Fang Qi instantly raised his arms over his head while ugly scales covered his arms.","Boom!","The lightning bolt struck Fang Qi’s arms. Even his extremely tough demon body felt numbed, and he stumbled, almost dropping to the ground.","Meanwhile, a string of red data flashed across Fang QI’s eyes. The synchronization ended!","The consumption at this moment had caused the synchronization to end!","“So powerful!” Facing the existence completely beyond the mortal world, Fang Qi sensed a giant threat in his life for the first time.","In the radiant light, Fang Qi couldn’t clearly see her face, but he could recognize a trace of indifference and coldness as if everything that happened was within reason. “Unorthodox tricks! If it was your own strength, I would be more alert. But one strike from me returned you to your true form.”","“It’s ridiculous. Now, you know how overconfident you were when you said those words? Your tricks in dealing with mortals are child’s play in my eyes! I have no interest in the small trickeries in your shop!”","“Humans have Mortal Dao and gods had Godly Dao. Mortals invade each other’s homes and wage wars nonstop, causing the sky to collapse and the land to crumble. Countless lives were ended. Therefore, the Godly Court issued the decree to ban martial arts, ordering that the mortals can only cultivate essence and destroying all the combat and killing-focused techniques. After that, the world have had peace for many years.”","“I’ll give you one last chance to give up all your shops and explain their background. Then, you can go with me and cultivate in the Innumerable Immortal Sea for 3,000 years. I’ll handle the rest for you.”","“Otherwise, this incident will be reported to the Godly Court, and a godly punishment will be issued. Anyone related will not escape from the tribulation!”","...","Meanwhile, in the new shop at the East Continent.","“Ancestral Master! Ancestral Master!” the elders from Xiaoyao Cave Abode and Abode Master Lingxu Zi walked out from the shop with heart-felt envy. “Can you tell us about your era? What was it like?”","“In my era?” Xiaoyao Ancestral Master pointed at the river of stars in the sky and said with a chuckle, “Do you see the countless stars in the sky? There were as many masters in my era as the stars in the sky.”","“It’s said that before I truly understood Dao, some masters even ascended and became true immortals by cultivating on their own and opening the Heavenly Gate.”","He lamented reminiscently, “That was a truly prosperous era.”","“Then, with your cultivation strength...” Lingxu Zi asked, “You still didn’t reach the realm where you can ascend at anytime?”","“I was not able to ascend. Without the immortal spirit essence to temper the body, I’m a fake immortal. To put it lightly, I’m still at the pinnacle stage of Ascendance Realm.” Xiaoyao Ancestral Master sighed and said, “I don’t know when it began, but the space beyond the sky has been taken by giant waves of tribulation lightning bolts of void, making it difficult to ascend and become true immortals. The people who forced their way up were turned into ashes without exception.”","“Otherwise...” Xiaoyao Ancestral Master thought grimly and said, “A mere Dao Seed wouldn’t be so crazily pursued by the talented ultimate masters in that era.”","“Then, those existences...?” Lingxu Zi felt uneasy and thought, Since Ancestral Master had his way around the limitation of life and lived until now, then have those existences also found ways to...","If it was true, even the thought of it scared him.","“They must have reincarnated.” He looked toward a distant void. While he spoke, Xiaoyao Ancestral Master’s face which was usually as calm as an ancient well had complicated emotions on it. “They pursued Dao all their lives and finally got to the door. However, they ended up dead with the destruction of their Dao. Don’t you think... it’s ridiculous?”","Xiaoyao Ancestral Master frowned slightly. After thousands of years, his mind finally turned serene. The immortal path had been blocked. However, such a Dao Seed appeared. I wonder if it’s just a coincidence or...?","...","– In the Canglan Shop –","After watching the Wuxia TV Series, the knights of the Golden Griffin Knight Legion were thrilled and baffled at the same time. “Don’t people say that these skills are all unorthodox and evil...? How come they are so powerful?”","...","“What a nice ban on martial arts.” At this moment, Fang Qi said with a sneer, “It’s no wonder that they are all so weak. Despite their great strength, they can only utilize a small part of it.”","They are indeed a large group of noob cultivators... Mr. Fang thought to himself while covering his forehead with his palm.","“I guess...” Fang Qi said with a chuckle, “All the people who did the same things as I’ve done were invited here for ‘tea’?”","“They didn’t deserve our attention.”","Mr. Fang shrugged and said, “Sorry. I only have little interests. If you take my only hobby, what’s the meaning of life for me?”","“In fact, in the ancient time in our world, we had similar bans.” Fang Qi seemed to be stating a fact. “They did it to protect their domination.”","Green Sky Immortal’s face turned cold. “Regardless of which god is behind you, your behavior is a blatant challenge to the order of the Godly Court! If you continue with your mistake, the whole world will be your enemy!","“Have you made your decision?” A glassy flame jumped in her palm and then surrounded Fang Qi from all directions; there wasn’t an exit for him!","“I know you as well as my palm. A normal god can’t even block one attack from me.”","“Ah... it seems like the negotiation failed.” Mr. Fang stretched and said casually, “I say...”","“What?” Green Sky Immortal’s pupils slightly contracted while she stared at Fang Qi.","“It’s not me who’s mistaken; it’s the world that’s mistaken.”","“Ugh!??” Green Sky Immortal’s face instantly froze. “What did you say?!”","“Summon!” At this moment, Fang Qi took out a strange rock with his hand. It was the Carrier Rock rewarded to him by the System. It could summon a character that Fang Qi had a synchronization rate over 10 percent with.","At this moment, the rock emitted an extremely radiant light!","“Immortal General — Fei Peng!”"]},{"number":793,"title":"Chapter 793 - The Enemy Is Too Powerful. System, Let’s Surrender?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Pale blue spiritual light condensed while the pale blue light lines flowed before Fang Qi, turning into a tall figure wearing a grey-blue Daoist robe and a silver headpiece.","In his hand was a pale-green longsword. The green light engulfed the sword and was as clear as a pond of water. It was Fei Peng’s godly sword, Demon-Suppressing Sword.","The invisible sword essence seemed to condense and turn into tangible items.","Her cold eyes turned grim, and Green Sky Immortal’s face fell as her body vanished in the blink of an eye as if she had teleported!","In the next moment, Fang Qi’s expression changed abruptly!","Having experienced countless battles in the cultivation room with all kinds of masters far more powerful than himself, he dashed to one side without thinking.","In the next instant, the ground that he had stood on vanished as if some strange force had struck it!","A trickle of cold sweat slid down Fang Qi’s forehead. He had never felt such a huge pressure ever since he entered this world.","“Hehe... stupid mortal!” The clear and cold voice seemed to come down from Ninth Heaven while Green Sky Immortal was nowhere to be seen.","In the huge immortal palace, the pale glassy flames suddenly burned more aggressively!","Like furious dragons, the flames devoured everything around them!","Instantly, a sword gust that could shattered everything slashed over and forced the flames to back off a bit.","“Do you think I’m a stupid mortal?” A cold voice came from the sky. “If the immortal general beside you is here by himself, I might be more cautious. But do you think that he has a chance to leave your side?","“You’re 10,000 years too young to battle with me!” Water vapor rose while the moisture in the air instantly evaporated. Fang Qi felt like the blood in his body began to boil with the rise of the temperature, and his skin was going to be scorched.","In the next moment, Fei Peng slashed his sword at the ceiling of the great palace. The sharp sword energy opened a crack in the immortal palace which even the horrifying immortal flames couldn’t penetrate. Carrying Fang Qi, he shot out like a shooting star!","But in the next moment, fire dragons flew into the sky. Beneath them, two pale fire dragons roared and bit at them like two prehistoric man-eating fierce beasts.","Also, Fang Qi even saw the immortal spiritual essence around them had caught on fire.","Then, the spreading flames were sucked in by the two fire dragons, and they expanded so large that they turned into two huge 3,000-meter-long dragons that were as giant as rolling hills!","With ear-grating wind whistles, a huge tail swung toward Fang Qi!","A chilly light flashed; it was too fast to see!","Almost in the blink of an eye, the huge tail was cut into two halves neatly by the sword!","But with it came a horrifying, hurricane-like hot wind from the sky. Even though Fei Peng had cut the tail of a dragon into two halves, the horrifying heat made Fang Qi feel like his body was going to melt!","He even felt like his mouth and nose would catch fire while he breathed.","The cold voice sounded again. “So weak.”","“You’re just a mortal. With your strength, you dare to issue a challenge to the gods? Do you think that you’re in a dream and can do everything you want?","“If not for you, the immortal general beside you might be able to fight with me.”","“But now, look at your pathetic state. Do you think you are qualified to fight me?”","Before Fang Qi could reply, the other fire dragon lifted its head and let out a soundless roar, and a streak of pale immortal flame shot toward Fang Qi with vicious force!","All the clouds evaporated. In the vast sky, the two fire dragons with blazing glassy white flames chased after him tightly.","“Um... What did you say?” At this moment, Fang Qi said, “I’m 10,000 years too young? Then, how old are you?”","“Huh?” The Green Sky Immortal froze, not knowing why Fang Qi suddenly brought it up.","“You’re an old grandma who is countless years old but still acts like a young girl. Aren’t you ashamed of yourself?","“People say Asia has three evil skills, which are photoshop, plastic surgery, and make-up. Is yours is the fourth evil skill?","“You’re hiding because you’re too ashamed to see people? Are you afraid that your evil skill will be broken in the battle?","“You’re an old woman who is trying to act cute and all?”","“Are you jealous of little girls who are young and cute?”","“...”","“???”","Although she didn’t understand Mr. Fang’s words, she was angered, being called ‘an old woman’!","An indescribable fury instantly rose in her mind. “You are seeking death!”","In the past, every mortal was respectful to her and didn’t dare to speak in a loud voice for fear of offending her. No one dared to speak like this to her!","Her essence condensed into a solid form and almost crushed Fang Qi into pieces!","But in this instant, a sword energy tore through the void.","Meanwhile, the existence who was staying beyond the endless space-time continuum suddenly grunted.","Then, a crack appeared in this dream world, and Fei Peng flew out from the crack immediately while carrying Fang Qi.","“Very good, old woman. But a small distraction is enough... goodbye!”","“!!!”","– In the Wind and Moon Pavilion –","“Sir! Sir!”","A waiter patted Fang Qi in bafflement.","Fang Qi slowly woke up from lying on the table.","“Mr. Fang, you... fell asleep?” the waiter asked worriedly, “Are you tired? We have a place for you to rest. You’ll catch a cold if you sleep here.”","“Oh...” Fang Qi rubbed his eyes and said, “I’m fine. You can go and do your work.”","Then, he touched the fried chicken bites on the table and found that it was still warm. Also, the iced tea beside the chicken was still cold. It was a long time in the dream but was only one instant in the mortal world.","“Hu...” Mr. Fang wiped off the cold sweat from his forehead and thought, The immortals in this world are indeed horrifying. With one immortal already this powerful, one group of them would be unthinkable!","It would be deadly...@","Even though he had summoned Fei Peng, it was a narrow escape.","Meanwhile, he felt that the Green Sky Immortal’s combat strength was completely beyond any opponents whom he had encountered before.","His previous opponents’ battle skills were still weak and in the stage of recovery, and their spiritual spells and sword techniques were average as well. That was why Fang Qi could defeat them with ease.","But this Green Sky Immortal was totally different.","Even though Fei Peng had to protect him and thus couldn’t unleash his full force, the Green Sky Immortal saw through it in one glance and forced Fei Peng to stay around him, which meant that she had extremely sharp eyes and immense battle experience.","The most important thing was that she showed no sign of being at a disadvantage when she battled with Fei Peng, at least in the few moves that they exchanged.","“System? The enemy seems too powerful for me...? Should we surrender... and hand the internet café to them? And I’ll go and cultivate with this old woman for 3,000 years?”","[System upgrading...]"]},{"number":794,"title":"Chapter 794 - Square Jungler and Triangle Mid Laner","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“System upgrading?!”","Can’t you upgrade earlier?! Do you have to upgrade after I was beaten senseless?!","Mr. Fang glanced around and checked the messages in QQ with his communication jade.","Then, he wiped the sweat off his forehead guiltily.","It was fortunate that no one saw that embarrassing fight. Otherwise, the haters would have forced him out of the various groups.","[Hey! Say something!]","The System replied, [System upgrading...]","“F**k!”","[System upgrading...]","“...” Mr. Fang looked frustrated.","...","Not long after Mr. Fang opened his shops, many people had begun to study the things in the shop that they didn’t have to fill the gaps.","Even in the new shop, a group of dwarves and mages were studying the blacksmith and enchantment techniques in World of Warcraft, let alone the Wuwei Daoist Alliance which was the first group of people who embarked on this journey.","With Mr. Fang as a shareholder, they had the most complete research infrastructure to study the scientific and magic artifacts in the gaming worlds. They even had distinct divisions of work among them.","Some of them focused on the artifact-making techniques in the Legend of Sword and Fairy and Shu Mountain; some were learning dissembly, enchantment, puppet-making, and item-making with recipes; some focused on the study of runewords in Diablo; and some even ventured deep into high-tech areas.","This might be the frontline of research and development of this world.","Not every research project could make money, so Mr. Fang had gradually turned from an average shareholder to a big investor of these projects.","After all, the assets of the Wuwei Daoist Alliance couldn’t support the ever-growing huge group of cultivator-researchers.","In some areas, this group had surpassed the East Continent and the West Continent long ago.","Right now, the Wuwei Daoist Alliance had a complete production line of new communication jades, and they also produced special weapons for the classes such as mechanics and launchers.","While looking at the objects that were as perfect as spiritual artifacts being produced, one would have the illusion that it was another world.","Of course, most of the items were still in the research phase and hadn’t been produced yet.","For example, the Animus machine which could recover ancestors’ memories in Assassin’s Creed was still being studied.","This research project was led by Jun Yanzi of the Wuwei Daoist Alliance and his disciple Li Haoran.","In Grand Theft Auto 5, which had a super high degree of freedom, one could even see cultivators who read books diligently like students preparing for post-graduate or doctorate entrance exams. In Dungeon Fighter Online, one could see cultivators tinkering with machines and a bunch of computer stereotypes which were the ‘super evolved communication jades’.","Obviously, they were still in the preparation stage.","At this moment, Mr. Fang suddenly received a message.","Li Haoran asked, [Sir, in my preparation for the upcoming exams, I find that some problems are hard to understand. Can you explain them to me?]","Then, he sent another message. [In the process of mutation, what is the result when an extra nucleotide is inserted in a DNA?]","[Option a: ...]","[Option b: ...]","“???” Mr. Fang was dizzy.","Mr. Fang replied. [Read a book one hundred times, and its meaning will present itself to you. If not, go and memorize the Periodic Table of Elements.]","[Okay...]","Damn it... Mr. Fang looked sulky as he thought, Who had traveled through time and space? Me or you?","At this moment, Fang Qi stood on the bank of Red Maple Lake outside the Canglan City Shop with an ordinary bronze sword in his hand. He lit up a cigarette from himself and murmured, “Life... one must have an aim.]","Perhaps that special dream alarmed him, or he owed it to that spellcaster.","As for his wish, the dream had shown it to him.","It contained all his memories and glories on the journey from being mocked and looked down upon to being admired by many people. It wasn’t something that he could easily put behind him.","Thinking of that, Fang Qi felt like he owed it to that despicable system. This time, the System found its conscience and issued a task that corresponds to the dream at the bottom of my heart.","The number of players right now wasn’t too big nor too small. It was just enough to hold a worldwide E-Sports tournament.","“Hu...” A faint circle of smoke floated out of his mouth, seeming to echo his sentiment.","While extinguishing the butt of the cigarette, his face cleared. After realizing the only dream that I have, I’ll put the shops in the hands of my staff and tour the world, enjoying the great views of this world which is totally different from my old world.","Suddenly, he remembered a meme he had heard before he traveled through space and time. “In the end, you will still realize that games are more fun after quitting it and doing other things.”","“...”","Anyway, he brandished the sword on the bank of the lake as a silent protest to the idle system which even denied him access to the cultivation room while it was in the process of upgrading.","At this moment, Mr. Fang suddenly saw a group of elves walking up on the bank of the lake.","Sala blinked her eyes in a cute way and said, “Sir, what are you doing here?!”","“Huh...?”","You’re an elf; why are you acting so cute? Do you think that you’re Xiaoyue? You learned nothing useful and picked up these useless tricks.","Therefore, Mr. Fang looked at her in bafflement. “???”","“Sir, have you eaten today? We bought delicious fried chicken bites and iced red tea and are planning to have a picnic here. Would you like to join us?” Sia acted cute and nice.","“Ha-!?”","Mr. Fang’s face turned confused.","Can’t you let me practice sword techniques in peace?!","“You must have a scheme under the sudden show of hospitality!” Mr. Fang became cautious. “Tell me your scheme!”","“What scheme are you talking about?!” Sala said with a pout, “You’re so kind as to give us discounts and even free games in the shop. Can’t we show you our appreciation with some food?”","“You’re so nice?”","The elves looked sincere. “Yes! Of course, if you can teach us some skills in playing LOL, it would be better!”","[TL Note: We will be using LOL as the abbreviation for League of Legends.]","“Here’s your true intention.” Mr. Fang had a funny expression on his face. “You were tortured by others in LOL, right?”","“Humph!” Standing beside them with arms crossed before her chest, Rowling said, “Xuexue always calls us noobs. It’s infuriating!”","“We must become sharp!” Sala encouraged herself. “We must learn the high-level skills that can make us sharp!”","“Sir, do you have such skills?”","“What positions do you usually play?” Mr. Fang thought for a moment and asked.","“I take mid lane!”","“I take jungle!”","Mr. Fang scratched his head. “Then, I’ll teach you Square Jungler and Triangle Mid Laner today.”"]},{"number":795,"title":"Chapter 795 - Catching a Smirking Face Emoji with Square Jungling","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Triangle Mid Laner?”","“Square Jungler?”","The elves looked at Mr. Fang in puzzlement, and they thought, We are playing LOL, not learning middle school physics and high school geometry like the artifact masters in the Jiuhua City Shop do.","How come there are triangle and square?","“Are you serious?” The elves looked at Mr. Fang in bafflement.","“Of course!”","“Okay. We’ll learn this triangle and square after eating!” Then, they handed a box of delicacies to Mr. Fang. “This is for you!”","Although they didn’t know what Mr. Fang was going to teach them, they knew... as he said, everything he did was of top quality.","“Xuexue said that we can believe whatever the shop owner says blindly.”","Sala thought for a while and convinced herself. Eh... it must be true.","...","– In the new shop at Canglan City –","Both the active and passive players stood around the shop owner.","“The shop owner is going to do a tutorial on League of Legends?” As a saint-level master, Kellybel didn’t have time to come to the shop each day, which was why she often made confusing plays in the games despite her high combat force.","Immediately, she brought a stool over and sat down.","The other saint-level masters also sat down in the lounge area.","In the other shops such as the Jiuhua City Shop and the Yuanyang City Shop, large groups of people were sitting in the lounge area. They watched Mr. Fang’s livestream while eating snacks.","Casually, Su Tianji opened a bottle of Coke and asked, “What’s the shop owner going to livestream today?”","Nalan Hongwu said, “League of Legends, I guess.”","“Grandpa, you came to watch it too?” Beside them, Xiao Yulv, with a heavy bandage around his neck over the Bone Ointment, was sitting on a couch with his neck in a stiff position and a plate of dried fruits in his hands.","Next to him sat an old white-bearded man holding a dragon-headed walking cane made of 3,000-year-old agarwood. Dressed in an elder’s robe, he was Xiao Yulv’s grandfather, Tiangang Elder Xiao Changlong, who had come out of seclusion cultivation.","“You haven’t recovered yet?” Nalan Hongwu looked at Xiao Yulv and froze. “Don’t we have holy light healing spells?”","“What holy light healing spells?” Xiao Changlong’s mustache bristled as he said with glaring eyes, “Our faction had top quality Bone Ointment; we don’t need spells outside our faction.”","With his palms that were as big as fans, he patted Xiao Yulv on the shoulder and said, “I assure you that this kid... will be up and healthy in one month! It will be a speedy recovery!”","“Auch–!”","“Hehehe! Yeah! Yeah! Yeah! This Bone Ointment is indeed good,” Nalan Hongwu cupped his hands and said.","“Sir...” With a frustrated expression, Xiao Yulv secretly sent a text message to Mr. Fang. [Can you secretly arrange a priest who can use holy light healing spells to heal me?]","[I’m doing a livestream. Talk to me later.]","“...” Xiao Yulv looked as if he was going to cry.","...","– At this moment, in Mr. Fang’s livestream room –","“Let’s first do the Square Jungle. We’ll choose this mantis (the Voidreaver). We’d better choose a champion with powerful fighting ability to do the Square Jungling.”","“Since our teammates are still choosing champions, we can play a round of Fight the Landlord.” Mr. Fang glanced at his teammates and saw that they were still choosing characters, so he decided to play a round of Fight the Landlord. “Since we’re confident with this champion, we save lots of time.”","[TL Note: In China, all the popular streamers like to play Fight the Landlord card game while waiting to play LOL.]","Meanwhile, the six major disciples of the Heavenly Faction led by Elder Senior Sister Yu Yin and Elder Senior Brother Zhuge Qinlong were all sitting sedately on the couches.","Around them were a large group of core disciples.","On both sides of them were the white-robed and black-robed elders who solemnly supervised them. “Do you see that? The graceful manner of a supreme master? The calmness before danger?”","“Learn it with all your heart! Watch how Senior Fang plays it. At the end of the year, the faction will allocate more resources to the disciples who learned the most and have the deepest understanding!”","“Hiss-!” The disciples quickly watched with concentration as Mr. Fang played Fight the Landlord.","Meanwhile, they thought to themselves, We will also quickly choose champions and then play Fight the Landlord! It will show off the grand calm presence of our Heavenly Faction, a famous grand faction!","Then, they heard yells such as ‘a pair of threes’, ‘a pair of sixes’, ‘a pair of kings’, ‘bomb’ from the screen.","...","“It begins! It begins!”","With Coke or potato chips in their hands, the viewers watched while eating snacks.","Mr. Fang bought the Hunter’s Machete with great familiarity and set out.","– Meanwhile, in the Half City Shop –","Demonic Woman Ning Bi was also sitting on a couch and watching Mr. Fang’s livestream while eating potato chips.","She glanced at the ID of the jungler who was playing against Mr. Fang – Almighty Demonic God?","With the bag of potato chips in her hands, she looked around and saw a familiar figure busy playing in a corner.","She glanced at the win rate: seven-win-streak.","“Ahahaha! I’m unrivaled! If you like my stream, please clic.k ‘Follow’!” Obviously, it was still on the livestream. Anyway, Black Demon and other cultivators in Half City loved to watch its livestream.","Then, it took a large gulp of Immortal’s Happy Nectar with great enjoyment while it thought in pleasure, Old Demon Fang! Even though I can’t absorb spiritual essence, I’m living as happy as an immortal!","“The game has started. The other jungler is the mantis. This champion is easy to fight, and I’ve crushed most of them. They can’t even farm the jungle camps.”","While drinking Immortal Happy Nectar that it bought with money that it had earned through its livestream, it felt like its body had become fatter than before.","Mr. Fang switched out and glanced at his personal chats in QQ.","[Sir, your opponent is the Smirk Face Emoji!]","“Ugh?” Mr. Fang glanced at the ID of the opposing jungler. “This style... indeed looks like it?”","The viewers of the livestream saw this scene.","[Hahaha! Let’s see how Mr. Fang catches the Smirk Face Emoji!]","[Go! Master Ball!]","[Catching the Smirk Face Emoji with Square Strategy!]","...","Mr. Fang was calm and steady.","Mr. Fang’s blue side had Fiora the Grand Duelist as the top laner, Xerath the Magus Ascendant as the middle laner, and Zyra the Rise of Thorns and Caitlyn the Sheriff of Piltover as bot laners.","The opposing mid laner was Varus, the jungler was the Blind Monk, and Vayne and Nami the Tidecaller were the bot laners.","“Now, I explain to you why this is called Square Jungling.” Mr. Fang controlled Kha’Zix to circle around the Lizard Elder (Red Buff) sleeping in the forest while he explained, “This method might have fewer confrontations, but there will still be some fights.”","“But it focuses on a sense of strategy. It’s a strategy that you must use your brain to do.”","“You have to make good strategies and see the big picture from small details.","“Ugh. You just watch how I do it.”","“League of Legends needs strategies and calculations?” Sala watched in surprise. “I thought it is just fighting to win and stealing kills to buy items?”","At this moment, the cultivators from the Xiaoyao Cave Abode watched it too. “Ugh...? We fought together as five in the mid lane; how come they fight this way?”","At this moment, Mr. Fang had come to his blue buff.","Meanwhile, in the Half City Shop, the Smirk Face Emoji played as Lee Sin and called its mid laner over to stealthily move toward Mr. Fang’s blue buff together."]},{"number":796,"title":"Chapter 796 - What Did We Find? a Smirk Face Emoji That Is All Alone","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","At this moment, Mr. Fang was dueling the Ancient Golem (Blue Buff) and explaining to the viewers what Square Jungling was.","Mr. Fang controlled the mantis with the magic mini-map showing his eyes. The map also appeared in the bottom-right corner of the screen. “We’ve connected our top and bottom jungle areas with our enemy’s top and bottom jungle areas. You can see, it’s a perfect square, and this is the jungling path that we’ll take.”","“Ugh...? So simple?” The large group of viewers in the lounge areas stared at the big screens intently, and the others were watching it on their communication jades.","In a group of elves, Sala asked curiously, “Then, we’ll have a fixed route? What if someone ambushes us?”","Mr. Fang continued to explain, “Some of you might ask, ‘Mr. Fang, you’ll have a fixed jungling path, right? What if someone ambushes you?’ I can tell you that it’s impossible.”","“There is a saying ‘Know yourself and know your enemy, and you’ll never be defeated.’” Mr. Fang said, “We must use this strategy in the game. For example, we know that the opposing jungler is a Blind Monk who has a high win rate, thus a good player.”","Mr. Fang lured the Ancient Golem to a remoter spot while still dealing with it.","“This champion, the Blind Monk, controlled by a good player can certainly kill monsters more easily than us.” He kept an eye on the magic map as he said, “So, he must have killed the wight camp in the jungle by now and will invade us.","“Right now, he should be in this place.” The Ancient Golem was easy for Mr. Fang to deal with, so he had the time to draw a circle on the map.","At this moment, Demonic Woman Ning Bi glanced at the spot in one corner of the Half City Shop. Sure enough, the black cloud was sneaking from the bush where Mr. Fang had circled toward the position of the blue buff while sending signals to the mid laner wildly.","Cheerfully, it found the location of the blue buff in the jungle.","However, it saw nothing.","“Pu-!” Seeing this scene, Ning Bi almost spat out her Coke. “The scummy shop owner is cheating!”","Sala and the other viewers saw the Blind Monk sneaking out from the jungle right after Mr. Fang defeated the Blue Buff. The Blind Monk wandered in the location of the blue buff like a headless fly.","“Where’s the Blue Buff?!” In another livestream room, the Blind Monk with the ID ‘Almighty Demonic God’ was circling in the jungle frantically. “It’s a big one! Is there a bug in the game?!”","“F*ck...!” Sala and the other elves were stupefied by the scene, and so were the other viewers.","“How could he predict this?!”","“This is called strategy.” Mr. Fang continued to explain, “Of course, this is the most basic. As a jungler, you must know it.”","The newbies sitting in the lounge area in the new shop at the East Continent stared at the screen dumbfoundedly. “Such an awesome strategy is the most basic one...”","“Hohahahaha-!” The Heavenly Faction’s black-robed Elder Dugu Xiao, who was supervising the disciples as they learned, laughed and said, “This is the difference between a supreme jungler and you guys. Do you see the difference?”","The disciples’ eyes almost popped out. “Supreme Master Fang’s jungling is way better than ours!”","It must be noted that different from the original game, the monsters such as the Red Buff and the Blue Buffs had energy fields around them despite their slow movements. Therefore, when the players fought the monsters, they would receive some damage even if they dodged all the attacks. The smaller jungle monsters also had different settings to achieve the same result.","Clearly, it was designed to make players in the game have a more equal footing since no players could use skills to kill monsters without taking damage. After all, the competitive games focused on the competition between players instead of with the jungle monsters.","This way, the players wouldn’t spend all their time on farming monsters and getting gold due to the easiness of killing jungle monsters, being very passive. Meanwhile, the players also wouldn’t forsake fights with other players to challenge the jungle monsters which might be too difficult for them to defeat with their own skills.","Therefore, at this moment, Mr. Fang’s HP wasn’t high.","After killing the monster in the top half of the jungle, Mr. Fang went to the location of the last camp in the bottom half of the jungle.","Meanwhile, the Blind Monk didn’t find the enemy jungler after invading the jungle. With no monsters to farm, he chose to gank the top lane.","“At this moment, we can just ignore him. We’ll just ping the teammates and tell them that the Blind Monk is close to the top lane. That’s enough for now,” Mr. Fang said, “Then, we’ll continue killing monsters including the last camp on the opposite side. We know that the Blind Monk is in the top lane, which means that we’re safe in his jungle areas even though our HP is low.","“Then, we will go home and buy a Tiamat. The game will be over.”","“Ha-?!” Sala and the other elves froze for a moment and then ran to Mr. Fang’s computer. “Sir, the game just started, right? How come it’s over?”","“Because now, we can draw the square.”","“Draw the square?” Sala said in surprise, “Sir, didn’t you say that you are going to take all the jungle camps on both your side and your enemy’s side?”","“How can it be? The mantis can’t defeat the Blind Monk in the early game, right? Don’t try to fool me!”","“I’m not fooling you.” Mr. Fang set off and killed a wave of monsters before crossing the river and walking into the jungle. At this moment, the Blind Monk walked past the small path in the jungle before him carelessly.","The viewers were surprised, “Huh-?!”","At this moment, Demonic Woman Ning Bi was standing behind the Smirk Face Emoji player and staring at its screen with widened eyes. “Ha-!?”","The elves and the players in Half City Shop and Jiuhua City Shop entered the Smirk Face Emoji’s livestream room and watched this Blind Monk closely. “Yeah-!?”","“Hush...” Mr. Fang whispered, “Look what I found. A Smirk Face Emoji that is all alone. Now, let’s try to capture it.”","“But this Smirk Face Emoji isn’t easy to handle, so we must get close from behind stealthily and silently.”","In the Almighty Demonic God’s livestream room, the Smirk Face Emoji was also staring at its livestream room. “Huh...?”","“How come I feel like my viewers increased?”","“They are all here to watch me play Lee Sin? Everyone knows that the mantis can’t defeat the blind monk, so...”","The moment it said that, it turned around abruptly and saw a mantis lunging at it from behind!","“First Blood!” The announcement instantly sounded.","“Ahhh-!” A shrill scream sounded as if a pig was being butchered.","In the livestream room, the startled black cloud that was wearing the virtual reality headset fell under the desk and almost threw out its headset.","A black head stuck out from under the desk and said, What the heck was that?!"]},{"number":797,"title":"Chapter 797 - The Godly Court","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Instant kill on landing!” Mr. Fang instantly killed the Blind Monk on landing and then leaped away like a dragonfly skipping on water. Caught off guard by this strike, the Smirk Face Emoji took its hands off the keyboard but saw no one when it snapped back. The result was quite fun.","The bullet comments appeared on the screen in the live show room.","[This is called ‘a mantis capturing a ball, instant kill on landing!’]","[Hahaha!]","[I was watching the livestream of the other jungler. It was so startled that it threw away its virtual reality headset. Hilarious!]","[Huh? The other jungler is also livestreaming? I’ll check it out...]","“...”","Bullet comments flooded the screen.","At this moment, Mr. Fang asked in his jungling tutorial livestream, “Can anyone tell me why I instantly killed Lee Sin on landing? The person with the correct answer will get a bag of potato chips from the shop!”","“Potato chips?!” Sitting among the Heavenly Faction disciples as an exchange disciple, Jiang Xiaoyue froze and then sent a bullet comment with her quick answer, “Me! Me! Me! I know the answer! This must be Mr. Fang’s new skill with the mantis!”","“Wrong answer. Xiaoyue, please sit down.”","“How come it’s wrong?!” Jiang Xiaoyue returned to her seat in a huff, sulky that she lost her chance with the prize of free potato chips.","At this moment, the observant viewers saw some clues. “Did you notice? Mr. Fang’s mantis has reached level 5 while the enemy Blind Monk is only level 3!”","“My goodness... I didn’t notice until you mentioned it... Besides, the enemy Blind Monk only bought a longsword after going back to base, but Mr. Fang has a Tiamat!”","“How come the gap is so big?” In the Jiuhua City Shop, Song Qingfeng watched the game on a couch and asked in surprise.","“Do you remember how the Blind Monk invaded the shop owner’s jungle and then went to the top lane?” Nalan Mingxue analyzed.","“This invasion produced no result and cost him more than 10 seconds.”","“The shop owner told the Grand Duelist to back off and guard the tower, so the Blind Monk wasted another 30 seconds at the top lane with no gain.”","“During this time, Mr. Fang killed a camp of monsters in the enemy’s jungle and another camp in his own jungle. After he bought Tiamat, he set out and killed one more camp of monsters, reaching level 5.”","“Meanwhile, the enemy Blind Monk is still at level 3 without items.”","“That’s true...” Song Qingfeng said in surprise.","At this moment, Nalan Mingxue saw a loli’s avatar jumping up and down in QQ.","Jiang Xiao asked, [Do you have the answer to Mr. Fang’s question?]","Obviously, this little girl was eager to get Mr. Fang’s prize of potato chips.","Nalan Mingxue replied, [Xiaoyue, call me Big Sister 😏]","[Oh! Big Sister Xue’er is smart, witty, and beautiful. You are the best!] Jiang Xiaoyue said with exaggerated admiration on her face.","“Hahahaha...” In the lounge area in the Jiuhua City Shop, someone laughed convulsively. “Noob Xiaoyue, actually using this one on me!”","“Here’s the correct answer.”","“Oh! So, this is the right answer?” Jiang Xiaoyue had little stars in her eyes.","Mr. Fang announced the answer. “Congratulations to Xiaoyue for the right answer. Now, you can go to the counter and get a bag of potato chips!”","“Now, I will explain the combo to instantly kill someone on landing that can be used in a fight.” At this moment, Mr. Fang had finished farming all the monsters in his top half of the jungle and reached level 6. Then, he began to invade the enemy jungle.","“Did you discover? The Enemy’s top and bottom jungles as well as our bottom and top jungles... our square is forming!”","When Fang Qi came to the enemy’s top jungle, he saw that the enemy Blind Monk had just finished killing the Wight.","“When we attack, please remember that we’re the Voidreaver who has a unique battle style. We only need to make use of it perfectly.”","Then, a streak of sharp spikes shot out with chilly lights.","Almost at the same time, the wings flapped, and Kha’Zix shot out with the sharp spikes, defying the laws of physics!","The mantis slash out with Tiamat in the left hand while its right hand turned into an extremely sharp blade.","Fang Qi launched three attacks separately, but they perfectly fell at the same time from three different directions.","In this instant, the Blind Monk felt as if he was attacked by three people!","In the Half City Shop, Ning Bi watched as the Smirk Face Emoji player screamed, “Wayaa-!”","Flash! Flash!","This was so horrifying! Its scalp tingled in fear!","When it snapped back to its senses, the Blind Monk was on the verge of death.","“This... Tiamat and Taste Their Fear (Q) can be used in mid-air at the same time,” Mr. Fang explained, “With swiftness, accuracy, the three attacks launching at one target in synchronization, it is impossible to block or escape! Instant kill at landing!”","As an assassin champion, Kha’Zix would either fail or succeed in one strike.","“So powerful...” Exclamations rose in the shops.","“Then, can we borrow the idea when we use mechanical hidden weapons...?” Tang Yu was inspired and started to think. As a young man in an era of battle skills recovery, he was obviously absorbing such combat experience continuously.","He thought for a while and realized that despite the simple appearance of this strike, to achieve the best result, one must have perfect control in many things including timing and angle. After all, in the system version of the game, the players could do all kinds of fancy moves such as dodging and parrying.","The system version of League of Legends that was played in the complete virtual reality mode had perfectly simulated the battle in the real world.","If the three attacks all missed, then the assassin was virtually dead.","“This is the basic combo in Square Jungling. Many champions have their own corresponding high-level techniques.”","“This is only the basics?” In the new shop at the East Continent, the Heavenly Faction disciples who were learning earnestly stared at the screen and gasped.","At this moment, refusing to admit defeat, the Blind Monk took some potions to recover his HP and then returned with his mid laner, Varus, to surround Mr. Fang.","“My goodness...”","“The shop owner is in danger...”","“The mid laner is level 6 as well!”","Controlling the Voidreaper, Mr. Fang stepped into the jungle again. “Now, let’s begin the tutorial – Flying Mantis.”","“Oh-!?”","“F*ck!”","“Apart from instant kill on landing, there’s also flying mantis?!”","“Then, do the other champions also have super powerful high-level techniques?!”","The viewers were excited while they watched.","...","Meanwhile, in the distant Innumerable-Immortal Sea beyond the sky.","The so-called Innumerable-Immortal Sea wasn’t a real ocean but a vast ocean of clouds.","Here, countless immortal birds soared in the ocean of clouds like fish, and the immortal isles floated on top of the clouds like a forest. Every miraculous sight and view could be seen here. This was the Immortal Realm.","Standing opposite to the Godly Palace that was sitting in the ultimate west, this was said to be the place where immortals had lived for generations.","Above this place was the Godly Court, the official ruler of immortals and gods and the loftiest palace in the universe.","In the immortal isles, there was a place where rich immortal spiritual essence gathered.","With abundant spiritual essence filling the space, even breathing felt different than that in the mortal world.","A blue-clothed woman had a cold face, with eyes as chilly as ancient ice.","Sitting across from her was a weird-looking Daoist in a white-and-black Daoist robe with two strands of hair dangling from his temples.","Before her, a pot of immortal tea was boiling on the fire that was as glassy white as those in the battle with Fang Qi.","When the water was boiling, white mist floated up like colorful clouds; it was a vivid immortal sight.","There was a tiny crack on the tea pot.","“It’s a pity that this fine 10,000-year-old Purple Cloud Pot is damaged,” the old Daoist said in a chuckle.","“I thought that I could end the whole thing before the Godly Court gets involved,” the cold-looking woman said, “Now, the Godly Court must be making a move, right?”","“We’ll know it tomorrow at the morning meeting in Godly Court. I wonder whom they will send.”"]},{"number":798,"title":"Chapter 798 - A Commemorative Album of Youth","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Only the truly great existences had the right to enter the Godly Court.","This was the place where truly orthodox and core existences lived.","Undoubtedly, the existences who could enter the threshold of the Godly Court had ultimate immortal divinity and was way beyond the level of mortals. If mortals were the earth, then these existences were the heavens. They couldn’t be compared.","They had endless life span to study anything in the world. For them, the small antics and tricks of mortals were lower than dust.","It was because some of them could do much better than mortals with only one thought.","No mortal dared to measure the strength of such existences regardless if the latter was strong or weak. For these existences, mortals were like particles of dust which they could send flying for 108,000 kilometers with one breath.","At least, it was the case before these mortals could ascend and become true immortals.","Perhaps only after the mortals had ascended could they see the tip of the entire iceberg regarding this world beyond the sky.","As for the mortals...","They were just as the Green Sky Immortal said, “They are just dust. In my years that I supervised the Innumerable-Immortal Sea, I’ve discovered few and received fewer who truly have the potential to ascend. Today, I saw one, but he didn’t appreciate my help. Therefore, his case will be handled by the Godly Court...”","“I planned to help this ignorant mortal and give him a great fortune.” A trace of anger seemed to flash across her cold face. “He was so arrogant! If I see him again, I’ll show this mortal my true power!”","“Maybe you were too aggressive, Immortal?” The old Daoist chuckled.","“Huh?” Her almond-shaped eyes glared with vicious light. “Do you mean that I have to plead to these mortals with a begging tone?”","The atmosphere calmed down a bit.","Looking at the teacup before her, she seemed to be trying to see the other world through the mirror-like water in the cup. “Regardless of which god is behind you, regardless of how many people are involved in it...”","“They will be wiped out!","“For the reckless and ignorant ants...” she signed indifferently, “It will be a huge catastrophe!”","“No one will be able to escape from it!”","“But...” The old Daoist said with a grim expression, “Is it necessary to deal with a group of mortals this way?”","“Old Daoist,” the Green Sky Immortal said, “Have you forgotten why the Martial Arts Ban was issued?”","“It’s a pity that they happened to stand on that path,” the Green Sky Immortal said, “So, they were ground to dust together.”","“...” The old Daoist fell silent with regret on his face.","“That kind of existence can easily destroy the world and create a new one like flipping over the palm.” Green Sky Immortal’s eyes looked mild as if she was telling an absolute truth. “They are extremely stupid. When the time comes, even the god behind you is in danger, and what methods would a mortal like you have to battle with us with?”","...","– Meanwhile, in Origins Internet Club –","Mr. Fang had just got off the livestream.","However, the bullet comments were still flooding the screen.","The elves sitting on the couches couldn’t stop giggling.","[Hahaha! It was so funny to watch the shop owner capture the Smirk Face Emoji!]","“Mischievous!” Rowling mimicked the shop owner’s play when he instantly killed his enemy on landing. “I’ll see how mischievous you can be!”","“Hehehehe! I felt like it almost turned into a real ball during the process.”","“Sir,” a group of people walked up and said, “How come you stopped the livestream; do some more, please.”","“Yeah.” Sala held Mr. Fang’s arm and wouldn’t let him go. “Didn’t you say that there’s a Triangle Mid Laner? I want to learn it too...”","“I agree!” Kellybel stood out and said in a huff, “You told us that you’d show Triangle Mid Laner! How come you stopped!?”","Hey-?! Beside her, the Elf Clan’s First Elder Hyru widened his eyes. Are you the queen or not?!","You even want to watch Triangle Mid Laning?","While holding a bag of potato chips, a bottle of iced red tea, and a box of spicy sticks which were obviously prizes granted by Mr. Fang, Jiang Xiaoyue posted a message in a group chat in QQ, [Sir, why did you stop the livestream... do some more...]","“That’s all for today. Tomorrow, I’ll livestream how the Grand Duelist can attack five times in a second.”","“Wow-! Great!” The elves who were the first to hear the news had glints of excitement in their eyes. The previous instant kill on landing was already a big challenge to players’ overall control ability, and it was a powerful technique. They wondered, What advanced skill is this attack five times in a second?","In the Jiuhua City Shop, Nalan Mingxue obviously had also received the news, and her lips curved as she walked out of the shop.","“Ms. Nalan,” Lan Yan snickered beside her. “You seem to be smiling more and more often recently.”","“Do I?","“Perhaps.” Maybe only at this moment could she show her sincere smiles. “After all, only in this place can I forget the trivial business and schemes in the family.”","This rare moment of peace was a great enjoyment for her each day.","Holding the newly published official novel of Dungeon Fighter Online, she sighed lightly. “I wish we could live like this every day.”","“What are you talking about, My Lady?” Lan Yan said with a chuckle, “We have so many people with us. Besides, there is the dumb alliance army in Half City and the sedate-looking old Daoists in Yuanyang City. Also, we encounter dumb and cute newbies each day. With us visiting the shops each day, do you think that the shop owner has the heart to shut them down?”","“You’re right...” Nalan Mingxue sighed, “Before we notice it, several years have passed. How time flies.”","“Yeah...” Lan Yan mumbled, “I wonder why the shop owner hasn’t organized any activities in the past two years. Before that, we had annual parties and all kinds of small prizes. Now, there’s nothing...”","“I don’t know...” Nalan Mingxue said, “After the business expanded, he must have been very busy.”","She showed her understanding. “He has to livestream for us. Besides, seeing the high-level strength of the people in the West Continent, the shop owner must be working hard to increase his strength.”","“You’re right...”","“Oh-!” Lan Yan’s eyes lit up as she said, “Should... we can organize an activity ourselves!”","“We can prepare prizes ourselves even if we have to!”","“This idea sounds good.” Nalan Mingxue and the Nalan Family were shareholders of the research institute of the Wuwei Daoist Alliance, and she knew that there were some newly developed items, such as the weapons made according to the recipes from Dungeon Fighter Online, runewords made according to Diablo, and even some mimic items of previous prizes.","“Then, we can do a trailer too!” Lan Yan suggested, “Oh, Ms. Nalan, have you saved the gaming pictures when we played Diablo, the Legend of Mir 2, and the Legend of Sword and Fairy?”","“I’ll have a look when I’m back.”","“Let’s name the video... Commemorative Album of Youth! What do you think?”"]},{"number":799,"title":"Chapter 799 - Recovery","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Commemorative Album of Youth...” Nalan Mingxue froze for a moment. “Okay. Let’s go and do it. We’ll show it to the shop owner and see what he says.”","“Okay!”","...","At this moment, Fang Qi was standing in the Red Maple Forest outside the Canglan City Shop with an ancient sword engraved with pine patterns. He had never looked so serious before.","Perhaps... as time went by, his youthful clumsiness and recklessness had gradually faded while a mature and steady presence appeared in his eyes.","The sunlight pierced the dense leaves of the forest and shined on the blade of the ancient-looking sword which reflected a beautiful sword aura.","The blade lifted with an invisible essence attached on it, and the entire sword blade lit up with a soul-absorbing chilly light as if it had become alive.","Level 8 wasn’t a high cultivation strength.","However, he didn’t mind the low level of his cultivation strength.","Right now, cultivation strength was the basic. But obviously, if he relied purely on his own cultivation strength to fight the battles that he faced, he wouldn’t be able to do it even after cultivating for thousands of years.","His blade slowly drew an elegant and strange arc as if he was mimicking the path of a sword technique with great care.","One slash, another slash, again...","He moved from slow to fast to even faster.","Finally, when he struck out, he seemed to overlap with another person’s shadow in that instant.","It seemed like he had achieved Complete Synchronization in the moment when he used the sword technique.","The sword blade cut through the huge boulder before him. In the next instant, the shadow that overlapped with Fang Qi suddenly vanished.","At this moment, Fang Qi’s expression changed abruptly.","A streak of horrifying energy far more powerful than level 8 cultivation strength, which seemed to be the residual power of that sword technique, instantly sent him flying like a cannon ball!","Boom!","Instantly, he smashed onto countless ancient trees and destroyed them before he could stop.","“Cough! Cough! Cough...” Fang Qi climbed out of the ruined trees and debris with a pale face. “I still can’t do it.”","He tried to instantly reach Complete Synchronization with a master far more powerful than him. In fact, sometimes it was even a godly master. After attacking, he would immediately remove Complete Synchronization so that he could extend the synchronization time. But obviously, an average mortal would look like a child brandishing a huge hammer far heavier than himself when he tried to control the godly level strength. It was difficult to lift the huge hammer as a child, let alone lifting it as if it weighed nothing.","It was absolutely not an easy task.","...","– Meanwhile, in the Innumerable-Immortal Sea –","“According to the information that we have right now, this mortal has never engaged in a prolonged battle despite his godly-level combat strength.” As an immortal who had lived countless years, the Green Sky Immortal was far more insightful than mortals, and she analyzed, “In each fight, he would wait for his opponents to make the move first, and then he would end the battle as fast as possible.”","“Immortal, you mean...” the old Daoist said, “This person doesn’t excel in prolonged battle?”","“It’s against nature for mortals to be in possession of godly strength,” the Green Sky Immortal said, “It’s inevitable that he can’t battle for long.”","“When I tested him, that immortal general had the chance to obtain the upper hand but still chose to leave with him... it proved my point.”","“Obviously, the god behind him is afraid of the Godly Court and doesn’t want to show his or her face, which was why only a projected image was used and they avoided engaging in a prolonged battle.”","“Indeed. It’s not worth it to reveal one’s true form just to obtain the upper hand,” the old Daoist said with a sigh, “But... if we were able to figure it out, I’m afraid that the Godly Court would have made the discovery long ago.”","With a frown, he lifted his teacup and sipped. “He lost his only trump card, and there is no longer a need for concern...”","“It’s already a taboo that a mortal has control over godly power...”","...","A drop of sweat fell on the sword blade as Fang Qi continued to swing the sword.","It was no longer enough to rely only on reflexes and control ability; he must make his body memorize this feeling through muscle memories.","His body in the real world must memorize the feeling of making each move with perfection in the game and engraved it in his bones.","Then, he returned to the shop.","He continued to battle with Chong Lou in the Legend of Sword and Fairy 3.","But different from the previous battles, Fang Qi had nothing, no items or equipment, but a sword with him.","He tried to perfect his skills.","...","Meanwhile, Nalan Hongwu was playing as the Wuju Bladesman in his livestream. “This mantis has instant kill on landing and other techniques such as the flying mantis. The Grand Duelist has the so-called attacking five times in a second. I wonder if other champions have advanced techniques too?”","Different from the new players, the veteran players had been engaging in all kinds of high-level battles in the shop and had much more advanced skills compared to the new players.","Meanwhile, some players who were semi-new and had extremely high talents were also studying and mastering these techniques.","As a player with a high win rate, Nalan Hongwu would encounter opponents who had high win rates as well.","There were no weak players on this level.","At this moment, Nalan Hongwu’s enemies had pushed to the inhibitor tower on his blue side.","The enemy top laner was Zed controlled by a saint-level master in the new shop at the Canglan City.","At this moment, both sides gathered inside and outside of the inhibitor towers.","At this moment, a gloomy figure abruptly flew from the shadows on one side into the base. In the blink of an eye, it used Razor Shuriken and Shadow Slash together, stealthily appearing beside Nalan Hongwu’s ADC. The Razor Shuriken and Shadow Slash slowed down and hit the target, and then the whole shadow solidified!","In this moment, everyone reacted swiftly and cast control spells and attacks toward this Zed like a storm.","The support stepped up and planned to use Exhaust after getting in range.","But at this moment, they heard a cold sneer from Zed.","Death Mark! The solidified figure instantly merged into the shadows and dodged all the attacks with great precision.","In the next moment, he appeared again.","The ADC flashed, but the Zed almost flashed at the same time.","After the auto attacks triggered Zed’s innate ability, Contempt for the Weak, he left intact as if he had changed positions with his shadows.","The series of plays were finished in one breath. The viewers felt dizzy as they watched the Zed take the enemy’s head with great ease among the enemy troop. When it was finished, some viewers still didn’t understand what had happened!","Without the ADC, the blue side was instantly at a big disadvantage.","The other teammates were dragged into the disadvantage as well.","“They are going to lose...” The viewers watching Nalan Hongwu’s livestream held their breaths subconsciously.","At this moment, they saw Nalan Hongwu’s Wuju Bladesman charging forward.","The moment the attack arrived, his blade swiftly flew across the battleground like a light beam.","Immediately, he landed beside a figure on the enemy side with great precision, and he slashed out with his sword while turning around.","Then, everyone saw what happened.","Alpha Strike, first hit!","Alpha Strike, second hit!","Alpha Strike, third hit!","Alpha Strike, fourth hit!","Quadra kill!","..","“My goodness!”","All the viewers stood up from their seats.","...","Like sponges, they continued to absorb all kinds of knowledge. At this moment, something seemed to... recover and wake up in their bodies."]},{"number":800,"title":"Chapter 800 - Becoming Gods Through E-Sports? Get to Know It","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“What? Commemorative Album of Youth?” While wiping the sweat off his forehead, Mr. Fang walked into the shop as he read the message on his communication jade and saw Nalan Mingxue’s invitation to enter a new group chat. [You guys plan to organize an internet party, and you want to make a new promotional video?]","[Yeah! Yeah!] At this moment, many other people besides Nalan Mingxue were in this group.","[That’s a good idea! Why didn’t I think of that?] Having just entered the group, Su Tianji looked surprised.","Mr. Fang commented, [At your great age, you still want to talk about youth...]","“...”","Su Tianji said, [😠 I’m 17!]","Mr. Fang replied, [😅Awesome!]","Lan Yan changed the subject in a hurry. [Since the shop owner is here, we need some materials from the early years. Sir, do you have them?]","[I should...?] Mr. Fang thought for a moment since quite a few years had passed.","[Dig into your files and find them...] Lan Yan said impatiently, [We have the new stuff but not the old material.]","[Okay...]","...","“Here’s the thing.” In Jiuhua City, many people gathered in the lounge area of the shop. There were people like students such as Song Qingfeng and Xu Zixin, the old customers of the shop such as An Huwei and Su Tianji, and even the earliest customers such as Fatty Wang Tai and Liang Shi, who had gone their own ways due to different reasons in the real world but still were in touch with Mr. Fang.","They were the first group of players in the shop.","Ye Xiaoye of Cloud Ocean Faction asked, “Xuexue, have you fixed the date of our activity?”","“Well... I’ve decided on the date.” Nalan Mingxue turned her eyes. “How about March 28th?”","“March 28th?” The others looked at her curiously. “Does this date have a special meaning?”","After glancing around, Nalan Mingxue waved at them and signaled them to lean toward her.","Then, she said in a tiny voice as weak as the buzzing of a mosquito, “To celebrate the birthday...”","“Ah...?”","“Whose birthday...?”","“Is it... the shop owner’s birthday...?” Ye Xiaoye almost exclaimed, but someone covered her mouth. After a while, she said in a low voice, “How come I never heard the shop owner mention it?”","Although Dajin didn’t have the custom of celebrating a birthday for young people, this date was indeed a special day.","After all, it was a party, and it would be better if it was held on a special day.","“I don’t think even the shop owner remembers his birthday,” Xu Zixin said in bafflement, “Xuexue, how did you find out...”","Nalan Mingxue looked a bit embarrassed. “Don’t ask.”","When she did the investigation on Fang Qi at the very beginning, she didn’t imagine that she would use this information on this occasion.","Of course, she probably didn’t know that Mr. Fang probably had forgotten the exact date of his birthday already. Now that he was in this world alone, he had no one to ask about it.","“That’s settled then!” Xu Zixin said, “But we must promise not to leak the secret!”","“Oh! I have an idea!” Ye Xiaoye suggested in excitement, “Let’s make a big cake! Just like the ones in... Grand Theft Auto 5! I’m sure that the shop owner has never eaten such a novel thing in the real world!”","“Hahaha! Good idea!”","They got happier with their plan as they continued the discussion. “I’m sure that the shop owner will be greatly surprised!”","...","While these people were laughing in the Jiuhua City Shop, things were happening in the new shop at the East Continent.","Mist and light drizzle engulfed the Dongxuan Cave Abode.","Disciples of the Heavenly Faction came out from the shop and opened their umbrellas without thinking.","This raining weather had no effect on cultivators, and pedestrians were still walking on the streets paved with green stones.","No one used the cultivation strength to block the rain for them. The whole city, at least for now, looked no different from the cities in the world where Fang Qi traveled from through space and time.","As usual, the Xiaoyao Ancestral Master led the cultivators of the Xiaoyao Cave Abode to walk out of the Dongxuan Cave Abode.","At this moment, his steps suddenly paused.","He stopped without a warning.","“Ancestral Master?” Lingxu Zi looked at Xiaoyao Ancestral Master in surprise.","The thronging crowd before them seemed to feel nothing unusual.","He followed the Ancestral Master’s gaze and saw an invisible sword essence. It transformed into a vague white streak of rain and shot toward him through the mist and drizzle.","The sword essence was nimble and ethereal as if it was a godly sword slash from outer space. It was absolutely not a sword strike from someone in the current time. Even Lingxu Zi behind Xiaoyao Ancestral Master felt a sense of helplessness when he saw it.","However, Xiaoyao Ancestral Master closed his two fingers and lightly pointed at the sword essence.","“Pop!”","With a strange explosive, raindrops splashed outward. Alarmed, the walking cultivators scrambled to dodge.","At this moment, they saw a middle-aged man wearing a plain grey robe standing in the crowd with hands clasped behind his back.","“Dugu...” Xiaoyao Ancestral Master squinted his eyes slightly. “It’s you...?”","“It’s me.”","At this moment, urgent footsteps sounded from nearby streets while groups of cultivators from different factions walked toward Xiaoyao Ancestral Master from the streets before him and behind him with uniformed steps. Shoulder to shoulder, they came over with robes flapping in the wind.","“This is...?” Lingxu Zi’s face instantly turned dark since he knew all of them. “The Three factions, four sects, and six cave abodes on the Continent of Immortal Village...?!”","Except for the Heavenly Faction, they were all here!","“What... do you want?” Lingxu Zi said in a deep voice.","“Cough! Cough!” At this moment, light coughs sounded from a nearby alley. A pale-faced man dressed in a black scholar’s robe walked out. “Nothing. We just happened to find the information we need coincidentally.”","“Shang Jiuwen?!” Xiaoyao Ancestral Master’s expression turned darker.","“Daoist Brother Xiaoyao, how have you been since we parted?” Meanwhile, an immortal-looking young man wearing a silver immortal robe and a jade dragon headpiece floated down from the sky.","When he landed, the people from different sections, even the Ascendance Realm masters and faction master, retreated several steps as if they had seen a viper.","Raindrops turned into a transparent pure white lotus flower under his feet, supporting him in the air; it was a miraculous and weird scene.","“Li Wuchen...” Xiaoyao Ancestral Master’s face turned chillier.","“Brother Xiaoyao is a bit selfish.” At this moment, the silver-robed young man said, “It has been a while since we understood the Great Dao together. How come Daoist Xiaoyao wants to take the Dao Fruit alone?”","“In my opinion, it would be better if Daoist Brother Xiaoyao shares it with us.”","“What Dao Fruit?” Xiaoyao Ancestral Master looked baffled.","“Daoist Xiaoyao, you mean that you don’t know about the opportunity to make the further step?” Li Wuchen’s face turned cold. Existences like them had no regard for anything but this one...","They would never miss this opportunity!","“You mean that...?” Xiaoyao Ancestral Master froze for a moment and waved his hand before saying, “Come with me.”","“Huh?!” Everyone stared at Xiaoyao Ancestral Master.","It’s so simple?!","They exchanged a look and followed him.","After coming before a great palace with the sign of [Origins], Xiaoyao Ancestral Master pushed open the gate and entered.","He said to the counter, “Add two more hours to my account today.”","After all, he could borrow playtime from tomorrow.","Then, he sat down before a computer.","“What are you doing?!” a group of people watched from behind.","“Didn’t you know?” Xiaoyao Ancestral Master asked.","“Know what?”","“It’s a new era now.” Xiaoyao Ancestral Master pointed at League of Legends on the screen and said, “The rules have changed.”","“The rules have... changed?!”","We are fighting for the qualification to ascend; this rule had changed?!","Who could make new rules?!","Xiaoyao Ancestral Master opened the rank system that he had just activated. On it was written, [Bronze, Silver, Gold, Platinum, Diamond, Master, and Challenger.]","[TL Note: In Chinese LOL, the ranks had adjectives before them. The direct translations are Brave Bronze, Unyielding Silver, Glorious Gold, Luxurious Platinum, Radiant Diamond, Supreme Master, and Unrivaled Challenger.]","Then, he pointed at the announcement on the blackboard that the shop owner had just put on.","[Do you want to become a real god-like figure?! The enrollment for League of Legends World Championship Series Qualifier begins today!]","[Participants need to at least reach Diamond and form a team of at least five people.]","“Become a god-like figure? Can we really become gods this way?” this group of people stared at the small blackboard intently.","“Diamond?!”","“Challenger?!”"]}]);
